window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4201,"title":"Chapter 4201: North Heavenly Realm Buddha Son","paragraphs":["Chapter 4201: North Heavenly Realm Buddha Son","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Venerate Tier elites had arrived, so they were naturally treated with the highest level of respect. They were respectfully invited to stay in the highest level Divine Temple here.","Ling Han and Wide Clouds Heaven naturally moved in as well. Sandalwood was lit here, and it was made from the highest grade material. It could interact with heaven and earth, allowing one to more easily sense Regulations of heaven and earth.","After staying here for two days, the North and South Heavenly Realm’s Buddha Sons and Holy Daughters had all arrived, and the spar officially began.","On the surface, this was a sparring match, but in truth, it was a ranking competition for the branches of the Buddhist Race of the four great Heavenly Realms. And like the overall strength of the four great Heavenly Realms, it has always been the South Heavenly Realm that ranked first, while the North Heavenly Realm ranked last.","Ling Han and Wide Clouds Heaven were invited to the venue of the tournament. Meanwhile, Yunshu Bodhisattva did not go with them, but he probably would still watch the tournament.","Not long after, Buddha Sons and Holy Daughters from the four Heavenly Realms all gathered together.","Among these three men and three women, Ling Han only recognized one person, and that was Prosperous Heaven, the Holy Daughter of North Heavenly Realm.","A woman’s instincts were really sensitive. Though Ling Han’s appearance had changed greatly, and even the fluctuation in his soul was completely different, Prosperous Heaven still looked at him a few times, a hint of confusion in her eyes.","Ling Han feigned ignorance, and turned his attention to the other three men and two women.","The newly promoted Buddha Son of the North Heavenly Realm was a young man with dishevelled black hair, with a slightly sloppy aura. It was clear that his flame of life was raging fiercely, and he was extremely young, but there was a hint of age in his eyes, which formed a strong contrast.","Ling Han took another look at this person, and for some reason, a powerful feeling rose up in his heart. It could not be said whether it was animosity or appreciation for his talent.","He was bestowed the name of Shi Tianyun.","Tianyun?","Hehe, the North Heavenly Realm had high hopes for him1.","Looking again at the East Heavenly Realm, the Buddha Son and the Holy Daughter were still the same. The Buddha Son was Shi Tianwen, and the Holy Daughter was Building Heaven. Finally, the strongest was the South Heavenly Realm. Their Buddha Son was Shi Moka and their Holy Daughter was Black Sand Heaven.","Unlike Buddha Son, who was bestowed a name, Holy Daughter’s name was inherited. For example, if a misfortune befell Prosperous Heaven, the succeeding Holy Daughter would also be known as Prosperous Heaven.","“Hehe, what a joke. The weakest North Heavenly Realm dares to restart the ranking battle!” Shi Moka said calmly, his tone filled with disdain for North Heavenly Realm.","Who didn’t know that among the four Heavenly Realms, North Heavenly Realm was the weakest, whether it was in terms of overall strength or high-end battle prowess, they were at the bottom of the barrel. In the previous sparring tournament, the Buddha Son of the North Heavenly Realm had even been crippled by Shi Yongming.","Now that a new Buddha Son had appeared, did he think he could overturn the heavens?","What a joke.","Shi Tianyun smiled at him, “When we draw lots later, I hope you can draw me!”","Hiss, this was a blatant provocation.","Shi Moka’s expression darkened. This new Buddha Son from the North Heavenly Realm was a little arrogant.","“Humph, no matter who becomes my opponent, it would be the same!” he said indifferently, showing a strong confidence, “The only path for all of you would be defeat!”","Shi Tianyun merely smiled, revealing two rows of snow-white teeth.","“Draw lots!” A monk walked out, allowing the eight of them to draw lots to decide their battles.","According to the previous rankings, the West Heavenly Realm would draw first. The result was Shi Tianyun drew Jia, and Prosperous Heaven drew Zi.","Then, it was West Heavenly Realm. Ling Han drew Yi, and West Heavenly Realm drew Chou.","Then, it was the East Heavenly Realm. Shi Tianwen drew Yi, and Building Heaven drew Zi.","The result was already decided. There was no need to draw lots for South Heavenly Realm.","The battles were as follows: Ling Han against Shi Tianwen, Shi Tianyun against Shi Moka, Wide Clouds Heaven against Black Sand Heaven, Prosperous Heaven against Building Heaven.","“Not bad, not bad.” Shi Tianyun revealed a smile, “Momo, prepare to be pressed onto the ground by me!”","Shi Moka was naturally enraged. How could this brat from the North Heavenly Realm be so cheeky?","“Humph, your predecessor has just been crippled by Shi Yongming, and you want to follow in his footsteps so quickly?” he said balefully.","“Wrong, wrong, wrong. This time, I have come to sweep aside all of you,” Shi Tianyun said, smiling.","“I am very expectant,” Shi Moka said word by word. He naturally was not anticipating a battle with Shi Tianyun, but rather wanted to cripple his opponent.","The first match began, and it was precisely Shi Moka against Shi Tianyun.","“And now, you have gotten your wish,” Shi Moka said calmly, but his killing intent could not be concealed.","The competition between the four divisions of the Buddhist Race was actually more or less the same as the competition among the four great Heavenly Realms. They would fight together when facing outsiders, but when they were not facing outsiders, they were also competitors.","Shi Tianyun crooked a finger, “Come, see how I will beat you up!”","Shi Moka humphed, and charged out.","Boom, he channelled out a Saint Technique. As he shot out a punch, it turned into a golden tiger that pounced towards Shi Tianyun.","“I forgot to tell you. Last time, the Buddha Son of your North Heavenly Realm was defeated with a single strike from me,” Shi Moka said disdainfully.","The golden tiger charged over, opening its bloody mouth. Its canines were sharp, and they were formed from Regulations, so their destructive power was naturally extremely terrifying.","Shi Tianyun did not speak, and merely shot out a punch, aimed at the golden tiger.","Peng!","With a single punch, this golden tiger was instantly blasted into smithereens.","What!","Everyone was stunned. No one had expected that Shi Tianyun would actually be so powerful.","F***, was this really a cultivator from the North Heavenly Realm?","Shi Tianyun stood proudly, high-level energy still burning on his right fist, bestowing on him the incomparably terrifying might of that attack just now.","This was too inconceivable. Whether it was Shi Moka or Shi Tianyun, both of them were in the early stage of the True Self Tier. Logically speaking, this was a battle between equals, so how could Shi Tianyun be so strong?","“I am different from the previous idiot.” Shi Tianyun broke into a grin, possessing an indescribable coquettishness.","“Humph, you have only blocked a single blow from me, what is there to be so proud of!” Shi Moka felt slightly embarrassed. He had just spoken so confidently, yet the attack he had delivered was easily dispersed.","“I said I would press you to the ground and rub you against it. As a person, you cannot go back on your word!” Shi Tianyun laughed loudly, and leaped up high, charging towards Shi Moka.","Boom!","His whole body was enshrouded in Regulations, while his hands were burning with high-level energy, as if he was a god of war.","“Do you think I’m afraid of you!” Shi Moka stepped forwards.","Peng!","Shi Tianyun shot out a punch, and Shi Moka was actually no match for him. He was forcefully blasted down from the skies, and crashed heavily into the ground. Instantly, with him as the centre, the ground directly caved in.","F***, what was going on?","Everyone was dumbfounded. Just how powerful was Shi Moka? He had crushed the Buddha Sons of the other three Heavenly Realms. This was proven through successive victories.","But now? He had actually been knocked down with a single punch?","This!","It was definitely not that Shi Moka was weak, but rather that Shi Tianyun was too strong.","Hiss, where had the North Heavenly Realm found such a freak?","If it was not for the fact that this person’s appearance was too different from Ling Han’s, and the fluctuation of his soul was completely different, they would really wonder if this was Ling Han himself under diguise. It seemed like only this guy could be as powerful as this.","Even Ling Han’s eyes narrowed slightly. He had not thought that in this competition for the ranking of the four divisions, his greatest opponent was actually not Shi Moka of the South Heavenly Realm, but rather the newly promoted Buddha Son of the North Heavenly Realm.","It was clear that he was just like him, someone who had been found on the spot. He definitely wasn’t someone who had been nurtured by the Buddhist Race since childhood—this was clear from his tone.","This was what shocked Ling Han the most. He wasn’t from the Imperial Clan, yet he was still this powerful?"]},{"number":4202,"title":"Chapter 4202: Exceeding expectations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4202: Exceeding expectations","Shi Moka got back to his feet. There was a trace of blood at the corner of his lips, while his face was filled with an expression of disbelief.","It wasn’t just him; almost everyone else had the same expression.","Who did not know that Shi Moka had always been number one in the competition of Buddha Sons in the four Heavenly Realms? It had not changed for more than a hundred years, but now? He was actually no match for a single punch from Shi Tianyun!","“Good! Good! Good!” he said through gritted teeth. Boom! The aura in his body boiled, and formed multiple mushroom clouds that subsequently exploded, appearing extremely terrifying.","He was truly angered now, and wanted to kill someone to vent his anger.","Meanwhile, Shi Tianyun was laidback, looking like he did not take it to heart at all.","“Die!” Shi Moka summoned his personal Spirit Tool. This was a sword, and as the sword swept out, endless Regulations condensed, turning into multiple golden swords. In that one instant, there were as many as thirty thousand swords.","“Imperial Technique, Myriad Sword Technique!” All the big shots exclaimed in shock, looking stunned.","This Imperial Technique was extremely difficult to cultivate, because it was completely the use of the Regulations of heaven and earth. At least, one had to reach the True Self Tier to be able to cultivate this Imperial Technique, but there were really not many people that could grasp it at this cultivation level in history.","As expected of Shi Moka, who had actually cultivated the Myriad Sword Technique!","Hiss, if he had not been knocked down with a single punch from Shi Tianyun, he probably would not have channelled this Imperial Technique either, right?","The limit of this Imperial Technique was condensing into 330,000 swords of Regulations, symbolizing the thirty three Heavens, possessing boundless might. It was created by Ah Han in his later years to suppress Yin soul, so its destructive power was especially terrifying. “Hehe!” Shi Tianyun merely smiled faintly, his whole body burning with high-level energy. His fists wrapped with Regulations, and directly charged into the myriad of swords.","Peng, peng, peng! He charged madly, destroying all the tens of thousands of swords. Then, with a flash, he had already appeared in front of Shi Moka.","What!","Shi Moka’s eyes widened, and his mouth also gaped widely, as if he was silently expressing his surprise. How could this opponent be strong to this extent? He had used the Imperial Technique.","He wanted to dodge and parry, but while the Imperial Technique was powerful, it was also the weakest moment after the strongest attack. The present Shi Moka was at the weakest point of his battle prowess, so how could he possibly block Shi Tianyun’s counterattack?","Peng!","It was still just a single strike, and Shi Moka was sent flying.","Pa, he sprawled out on the ground. This time, he could not get back to his feet. This?","In just two punches, Shi Moka was completely sprawled out on the ground.","That was the Buddha Son of the South Heavenly Realm. At one time, he was a symbol of invincibility, and became the nightmare of the other three Buddha Sons. Who would have thought that he would be dealt with so easily?","It was as if this was a dream.","But that was the truth. There were many pairs of eyes watching, and it was an absolute fact.","“Interesting,” Ling Han murmured, his eyes gradually lighting up.","He could easily thrash the Imperial Son. Thus, no matter how awesome Shi Moka was, he would only be a piece of cake in front of him. However, Shi Tianyun was different. He was very strong, and had even surpassed the majority of Imperial Sons.","Judging from the battle prowess he displayed, he was at least on the same level as Chi Menghan and the Imperial Son of Golden Silk Moth Clan.","Perhaps, he was even stronger, because just now, it may not have been all his abilities.","The whole area was silent. Up until now, everyone had not come back to their senses from the shock of Shi Moka’s defeat. After another while, someone finally announced Shi Tianyun’s victory, and at this moment, a round of exclamations rang out in the surroundings.","This was inconceivable. This was too inconceivable. The weakest North Heavenly Realm had actually risen up?","‘F*ck! Is this because of Ling Han? He’s inspiring the younger generation of the North Heavenly Realm.","“The next battle begins!”","Next, it was the battle between the Holy Daughters. However, even though the Buddha Son was on the same level as the Holy Daughter, it was only in name. No matter how strong the Holy Daughter was, it was useless. In the Buddhist Tribe, men were extremely favored over women, and all important positions were held by men. In fact, the Holy Daughter was unable to cultivate the highest level of techniques.","Even if they learnt an Imperial Technique like the Six Characters Bright King Curse, it was only a neutered version.","Thus, though the battle between the Holy Daughters was also very exciting, no one paid much attention to it. They just treated it as entertainment. In any case, the result would not have","any effect.","After this match, it would be the highlight again.","West Heavenly Realm Buddha Son versus East Heavenly Realm Buddha Son.","Because this was the territory of the East Heavenly Realm, when Shi Tianwen stepped forward, cheers instantly erupted in the area, cheering him on.","In everyone’s eyes, although the West Heavenly Realm had also changed their Buddha Son, the overall level of cultivation in the East Heavenly Realm had always been superior to the West Heavenly Realm so it was believed that even if it was another Buddha Son, it would be impossible to change this result.","Thus, as long as Shi Tianwen won, then even if he lost to Shi Tianyun, he could still maintain his position as second place.","“Admit defeat!” Shi Tianwen stated calmly. He wanted to conserve his power, so he could","also last a few more moves against Shi Tianyun.","-He knew himself very well. There was absolutely no way that he could be a match for Shi Tianyun, because he couldn’t even defeat Shi Moka.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “How much benefits are you giving me?”","In any case, he was only here to gather cultivation resources and Imperial Techniques. If there","were enough benefits, it was fine even if he had to give up the first place.","When these words fell, everyone’s expressions became strange.","How could anyone ask for benefits in public like this? How could anyone cheat in public like","this?","Shi Tianwen had told Ling Han to admit defeat. That was a display of confidence, but after Ling Han’s words, it had become two people bribing each other in private, deliberately manipulating the competition.","“Pei, if our Buddha Son wanted to defeat you, would we still need to bribe you?”","“Don’t be too conceited!”","“You are absolutely no match for our Buddha Son. Hurry up and admit defeat!”","“That’s right, don’t waste time!”","The Buddhist Race elites from the East Heavenly Realm called out angrily. Don’t even think of dragging our Buddha Son down with you.","Ling Han shrugged, and said, “Since the price can’t be settled, we can only fight for real.”","‘F*ck! Who’s faking a fight?!’","Shi Tianwen’s face twisted in anger. How could there be such an infuriating Buddha Son?","He hurriedly recited the Six Characters Bright King Curse in his mind to calm himself down. This was the Imperial Technique, which allowed one to see through one’s heart and mind, and immediately return to normal. However, Shi Tianwen also revealed a baleful killing intent, feeling that Ling Han was too detestable. Even if he didn’t kill him, he would have to cripple him.","“To speak glibly in front of me, this is extremely unwise,” he stated calmly.","Xiu!","Ling Han had already charged over, throwing a punch.","Just how powerful was he? Even if he had not used the Imperial Technique, his terrifying","power exploded, and he was still overwhelmingly powerful.","Shi Tianwen did not have the time to react at all, when he saw a dark fist had already shot","towards him.","How could it be so fast?","This was his only reaction. Then, before he could even raise his hand, he was sent flying with a","punch from Ling Han.","Pu, he spat out a mouthful of blood, and directly collapsed onto the ground.","All of a sudden, there was complete silence, but soon after, the Buddhist Race from the East","Heavenly Realm were angered.","“You actually launched a sneak attack!”","“How despicable and shameless!”","“This doesn’t count!”","“Disqualify him from participating!”","They called out one after another, and requested permission from the Bodhisattvas that were","seated on the high platform.","However, these Venerate Tier elites all looked at each other, their faces filled with surprise.","They could see very clearly that though Ling Han’s punch was indeed suspected to have","caught Shi Tianwen off guard, it could not conceal his strength. Even if it was another time, Shi Tianwen would definitely be outmatched. The only question was how many moves he","could last."]},{"number":4203,"title":"Chapter 4203: Strongest Opponent","paragraphs":["Chapter 4203: Strongest Opponent","What else was there to say?","The Bodhisattvas signaled that this result would be the final verdict.","This caused public indignation. The Buddhist Race from the East Heavenly Realm glared at Ling Han. This guy had successfully won through a sneak attack, which was an insult to the status of Buddhist Race!","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. You guys can glare all you want, but what does it have to do with him?","Next, it was another battle between Holy Daughters, giving Ling Han time to recover, so that he could proceed with the final battle.","The Buddha Son battle this time had ended too quickly, so the battle that was supposed to last for two to three days was resolved with two to three punches. It was completely different from previous years.","Similarly, no one paid any attention to the Holy Daughter battle in the second round. Thus, the two Holy Daughters didn’t use their full strength either. In any case, no one cared about the result of the battle.","Thus, after two hours, this battle ended.","The tournament authorities sought the opinions of Ling Han and Shi Tianyun, and both sides agreed to immediately begin, and there was no need to drag it out until tomorrow.","The battle immediately began.","“Shi Tianyun!”","“Kill that guy!”","“We support you!”","Once the two sides took the field, the Buddhist Race of the East Heavenly Realm cheered Shi Tianyun on.","It was very simple. Ling Han had defeated their Buddha Son, and he had even used a “shady move”, which made all of them furious. Naturally, they were leaning in favor Ling Han’s opponent.","Shi Tianyun picked his ears, and said to Ling Han, “You don’t seem to be very popular.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Those who are not envied by others are idiots. This is proof of my excellence.”","“Your skin is very thick,” Shi Tianyun said, smiling.","“Same to you,” Ling Han said.","Shi Tianyun was not in a rush to make a move, and said, “I still prefer to use my real name... Ding Shu!”","Ding Shu?","He had never heard of it before.","Yet Ling Han did not dare underestimate him in the slightest. This was a guy that was stronger than even the majority of Imperial Sons.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded, but had no intention of announcing his real name. Otherwise, it would really be fun.","“You give me a very strange feeling.” Ding Shu crossed his arms behind his back, and slowly began to pace around, “You are obviously very young, but your eyes are very aged. That is not because you have encountered some unforeseen event, that allowed you to see through the fickleness of the world overnight, but rather that you have really experienced countless years.”","“This is very strange!”","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind, and he said deeply, “I also saw the same thing in your eyes.”","At this moment, neither of them spoke another word, nor did they make a move. They just stood there, looking at each other.","“Let’s fight!”","“Why aren’t you fighting?”","“Shi Tianyun, are you afraid?”","“Exert your previous strength, and defeat that despicable person!”","Everyone called out one after another, really unable to bear the procrastination of these two people.","However, Ling Han and Ding Shu were unmoved. After a long while, Ling Han finally said, “Then, let’s spar for a while.”","“Sure!” Ding Shu nodded.","“Please.”","“Please.”","The two of them both gestured for the other to begin. Then, the atmosphere immediately became tense.","Initially, the two of them were very casual, but now, their gazes were like blades,","indescribably sharp.","Hu, there was no wind in the environment, but multiple cyclones formed around the two of them, turning rapidly.","Pa! Pa! Pa!","These cyclones collided, and exploded one after another. Seals actually exploded, and Regulations floated.","F***!","Seeing this scene, everyone was so shocked that their scalps went numb.","These two people... just how strong were they?","Xiu, Ling Han and Ding Shu took a step forwards at the same time, and charged towards each other.","So fast!","This thought flashed through everyone’s minds. They could not grasp the trajectory of these two people at all, and saw that they had already closed in on each other, throwing punches.","Peng, peng, peng! In that short instant, the two of them had already exchanged several hundred blows.","Boom, a terrifying force surged out, turning into multiple mushroom clouds. Multiple seals exploded, terrifying without bounds.","“Heavens!”","Everyone was grabbing their heads and exclaiming in shock. What kind of strength was this?","Now, they finally understood why the Bodhisattvas hadn’t judged Ling Han as a “sneak attack”. This was because Ling Han was far too powerful, and he was no weaker than Shi Tianyun. Thus, a fair battle would have the same result.","Then what was the point of wasting time?","“The two of them... are both only in the early stage of the True Self Tier!”","“This is the first time I know that the early stage of the True Self Tier can be this strong!”","“Er, I am in the peak stage of my fourth form of True Self Tier, but I definitely do not have this","kind of battle prowess.”","“Two freaks!”","“Even if the Imperial Son himself came, would he be a match for these two?”","“If there wasn’t two of them, I would have suspected that it was Ling Han in disguise.”","“Our tribe is going to prosper. These two people are definitely on the level of the strongest Imperial Son. In fact, they can even be unafraid of Ling Han.”","“That’s right. Ling Han’s strength can only be reflected below the True Self Tier, but after entering into the True Self Tier, the Imperial Technique can truly show its might. Ling Han has already been swept out of the Nine Suns Holy Land. Even if he learns a few Saint Techniques, it would still be difficult for him to make a mark.”","Everyone said one after another. They were also filled with excitement and joy for the Buddhist Race. In the future... they could finally hold their heads high in front of the Imperial","Clans.","On the high platform, the Bodhisattvas all looked stunned. They had long since known that Ling Han and Ding Shu were extraordinary, but right until these two people showed their full might, only then did they realize that they had still underestimated these two people.","“You’ve cultivated the Imperial Scroll!” As Ling Han fought, he communicated through divine sense, “Your original power is only at the Tenth Heaven, but the Imperial Techniquehas boosted your battle prowess by nine Heavens!”","Ding Shu did not deny it, but rather said, “You have cultivated Body Art at the same time.","Thus, your original power is as high as 13 Heavens, and when you cast the Body Art, you too have battle prowess of 19 Heavens!”","The eyes of these two people were burning, easily seeing through the background of their","opponent.","After this simple conversation, the two of them fell silent at the same time, and simply","attacked with their heads lowered.","This was far too remarkable!","One had actually cultivated the Imperial Scroll, so could it be that he was the Imperial Son?","The other had also cultivated Body Art, and this was a treatment that only the Golden","Generation could enjoy.","“Who exactly are you?” These were the unspoken words hidden in their minds.","The two of them suspected that their opponent was some Imperial Son of the Imperial Clan,","who had used the chance of selecting Buddha Sons to sneak into the Buddhist Race. But the problem was, what was the other’s motive?","As the Imperial Son, was he short of cultivation resources? Was he short of Imperial","Techniques?","This was the first time that Ling Han had encountered an opponent that could truly battle against him at the same cultivation level. Of course, he had not truly cultivated to the peak stage of the first form of the True Self Tier yet. Otherwise, he should have two powers of ten Heavnens, which could reach 14 to 15 Heavens altogether, and in the case of the other, he had obviously reached the end of the first form.","However, Ding Shu could also cultivate Body Art, and by then, the comparison of strength between the two sides would be reversed.","Of course, Ling Han also had room for improvement, and that was Imperial Scroll.","For the moment, their abilities were equal, and it was hard to decide who was stronger","between them.","Everyone was watching in a daze. This was a battle of the highest grade. It did not mean that Ling Han and Ding Shu’s cultivation levels were top-notch, but rather that they were both the strongest prodigies of this cultivation level, and every move was perfect.","After several hundred moves, Ling Han’s technique suddenly changed. He delivered a palm strike, and like an antelope hanging on its horns, this was an ingenious move."]},{"number":4204,"title":"Chapter 4204: Similarly shocked","paragraphs":["Chapter 4204: Similarly shocked","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ding Shu couldn’t help but pale.","Ling Han’s celestial technique clearly hadn’t changed much, and his original power was still 13 Heavens, but his battle prowess had forcibly increased a bit.","It wasn’t too much, but they were already tied in the first place. As long as either side was just a little bit stronger, it would be enough to affect the tilt of the scales.","How was this possible?","On the basis that power and celestial techniques remained unchanged, battle prowess could actually increase?","He observed attentively, and saw that every move and style from Ling Han was extremely simple, and extremely natural.","“Return to simplicity!” he exclaimed in shock.","Where did cultivation come from?","It all originated from the use of the Regulations of heaven and earth, so ultimately, Dao was natural, and was the foundation.","Ling Han presently had the momentum of “returning to one”. Though he was still very, very far away, and had only grasped a superficial part of it, it was as if he had grasped the general principles of the world’s martial arts. Whatever celestial technique would be able to increase its might by a small amount in his hands.","Hiss!","Ding Shu inhaled sharply, “You have already created your own path!”","Why were the Great Emperors able to achieve dao?","They had all walked their own paths, and reached the peak, and the so-called path of their own was the exploration of the Regulations of heaven and earth. All techniques were different, yet came from the same source. In the end, they would all return to one.","Ling Han smiled to himself. He had obtained this by chance when he had encountered the Saint-level woodcutter, and had not used it all this while, because no one could force him to this extent.","However, Ding Shu had succeeded.","Merely from this aspect, he had surpassed all the Imperial Sons.","“Come battle!” Ding Shu’s eyes lit up. He did not lose his confidence just because Ling Han was strong. Instead, his fighting spirit was ignited.","From this aspect, he and Ling Han were really the same kind of person.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them clashed, both of them going all out, unleashing their own brilliance to their heart’s content.","In truth, Ling Han had still hidden a few ultimate techniques, such as... the barrage of murderous aura. Now, it could be considered his signature move. If he used it, it would definitely draw suspicion.","“Haha, take this!” Ding Shu laughed loudly, and charged over aggressively.","Yi?","Ling Han was shocked, because a small black figure had suddenly appeared in his mind, and was just about to wreak havoc.","‘Holy f*ck!’","The murderous aura charged towards him!","Ling Han was slightly dazed. Ding Shu could also use murderous aura?","This was really too shocking. It should be known that this was something he had cultivated at the mortal level, and as his cultivation level increased, not only did its might not decrease, it became more and more powerful.","This was his ultimate move, and also his signature move.","But now, this kind of signature ultimate move had actually appeared on another person, so how could Ling Han not be surprised?","This was a Mystical Power that even the Imperial Son hadn’t mastered!","Ling Han naturally knew just how terrifying the barrage of this murderous aura was. Hurriedly, he also condensed his divine sense, which blasted towards this tiny black figure.","Peng!","A direct clash occurred between their divine senses, and the tiny black figure was instantly annihilated. However, Ling Han was also unable to launch a counterattack.","It was a draw again!","Why was this guy’s divine sense also so powerful?","Ling Han murmured internally. Though he was in the True Self Tier, the strength of his soul had reached the Spiritual Transformation Tier. This was something that even the Imperial Son could not compare to. He had not thought that Ding Shu was not the slightest bit inferior to him.","Shouldn’t a freak like him be unique?","He was stunned. Ding Shu was not much better off either.","The murderous aura attack was actually ineffective?","Imperial Son? So there was a treasure left behind by the Ancestral King that could resolve all negative effects?","No, he immediately shook his head. Ling Han had clearly used his divine sense as a blade to clash head-on with him.","This did not depend on the power of the treasure, but rather on one’s own abilities.","The murderous aura barraged him; it similarly was a barrage of murderous aura.","Hiss, this was the first time he had encountered such a freak.","The two of them became even more serious. Their opponent had actually grasped their ultimate technique, causing their hearts to throb.","The question in their minds grew larger and larger, and that was: “Who exactly are you?”","Boom!","Though they were becoming more and more careful, their battle did not become less intense because of this. They were still clashing aggressively, and Ling Han had already roughly created his own path, so he was slightly stronger than Ding Shu.","This gap was actually not very big, but in a battle that was evenly matched, this continuous accumulation would be terrifying.","Ding Shu gradually fell into a disadvantage.","“Hahaha, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, you are the first to force me into a disadvantage!” Ding Shu laughed loudly, “However, I will definitely not lose!”","“Because I am Ding Shu!” he declared proudly.","F***, what a show-off!","Ling Han also wanted to roar. ‘I won’t lose either, because I’m Ling Han!’","But now that he had disguised himself, he could only keep his mouth shut.","“Come!” Ding Shu communicated with high-level energy, and further escalated the battle.","“Do you think I’m afraid of you?” Ling Han was unafraid. He didn’t use the Heavenly Dao Flames, which had already become the symbol of “Ling Han”. Instead, he used the Black Moon Energy. In any case, this was also nine-star high-level energy. In fact, it was even stronger than the incomplete Heavenly Dao Flames.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Yet Ding Shu had stimulated high-level energy of Fire Element, which was definitely nine stars, and was not inferior at all in a head-on clash with the Black Moon Energy.","‘F*ck! Another tie!’","Seeing the divine might of these two people, the spectators were already rendered speechless.","Too strong, they were really too strong. What kind of prodigy was this?","Imperial Son?","To hell with it. In front of these two people, they were completely trash.","The Buddhist Race was fortunate to have two supreme prodigies appear at the same time.","—Even if the Buddha Son from the thirty three Heavens came, he would still be outmatched in a battle of equal cultivation levels with them, right?","Ding Shu gritted his teeth. Even nine stars of high-level energy was unable to suppress Ling Han?","This opponent was really hard to deal with.","“Haha, try out this move!” Ding Shu became more and more frivolous, his eyes completely black. Boom, a ball of black energy suddenly burned on his right fist. It was even darker than darkness itself, and filled with destructive power.","This!","Ling Han was truly stunned. Destructive Energy, this was Destructive Energy!","How was this possible?","He had once attempted to teach the empress, the large black dog, and the others the method to communicate with Destructive Energy, but the problem was that even if he revealed his memories, the empress and the others would not be able to understand. It was like this was a heavenly book that could not be understood.","Furthermore, how had Ling Han cultivated it?","It wasn’t that his comprehension ability was high enough, but rather the Power of Dimension in his body.","In other words, the Power of Dimension was the key to cultivating Destructive Energy.","And now, in Ding Shu’s hands, Destructive Energy actually appeared as well?","What did this mean?","Hong, Ling Han’s right hand also shook, and Destructive Energy was ignited.","At first, Ding Shu was about to raise his fist to attack, but the instant he saw the Destructive Energy, he immediately stopped. There was also an indescribable shock on his face.","The two of them withdrew their fighting spirit at the same time. At this moment, they only had endless questions.","Fight my a*s!","Yi, why did you guys stop fighting?","But the spectators were completely confused. They were presently battling fiercely, so why had they suddenly stopped?","“Let’s fight, why aren’t we fighting anymore?”","“Who will win and who will lose in this manner?”","The spectators called out one after another.","Ding Shu smiled faintly, and raised his hands, “I forfeit.”","He was very carefree. He turned around and left. Then, he sent a message through divine sense, “When you’re done, come to the Jia Lan Divine Temple for a chat.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded."]},{"number":4205,"title":"Chapter 4205: The same kind of person","paragraphs":["Chapter 4205: The same kind of person","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was a battle that was worthy of being recorded in the history books of the Buddhist Race.","Originally, it was just the Buddha Son Ranking Battle of the Four Heavenly Realms, and who knew how many times it had been held, but this time, both sides were too awesome, freakishly strong.","If only one of them was so domineering, then perhaps the Bodhisattvas would suspect that it was Ling Han who was here under disguise.","But both of them were so awesome?","The Bodhisattvas did not have the slightest bit of doubt, and thought that it was possible that the cultivation world had welcomed a Golden Generation again. How could they allow Ling Han to be ahead of them? And now, two more monsters had appeared.","Moreover, these two people were the disciples of the Buddhist Race!","Very good, very good. They had to be nurtured well. Who knows, it might be like how it had been in the past, one to become Emperor, and the other becoming a Pseudo-Emperor.","Of course, this time, they definitely could not allow the one who had not become the Emperor to become a demon.","Now that he won first place, Ling Han would definitely be very busy. However, he tried his best to reject the invitations. He walked quietly, and arrived at the Jia Lan Divine Temple.","This Divine Temple originally belonged to a Buddha, but this great elite had died over twenty thousand years ago. This place had always been empty, and had not found a new owner.","Thus, if they conversed here, their privacy would definitely be guaranteed.","“You’ve come.” Ding Shu’s figure appeared behind a stone pillar.","Ling Han was slightly surprised, because before this, he had not discovered the presence of Ding Shu.","This was a concealment technique, and it was extremely brilliant. If it wasn’t for the fact that Ling Han had mastered the Strange Shadow Steps, he would have suspected that he had also been in the Battle God Palace before.","“I’m a little busy, so I’m late,” Ling Han replied with a nod.","“It’s all right. This little bit of time, hoho, is not much.” Ding Shu stated calmly, an expression of vicissitudes appearing once more in his eyes.","Even if they had to wait for a day, it was nothing to cultivators. They would go into seclusion for a few years or even hundreds of years at the drop of a hat.","However, Ling Han saw more than this. The vicissitudes in Ding Shu’s eyes could be counted in tens of thousands or hundreds of millions of years.","But clearly... his flame of life had only been burning for a few dozen years, at most.","These two keywords, Destructive Energy and Power of Dimension, skipped over in Ling Han’s mind. He had already made his judgement.","“Where have you come from?” he asked.","“North Heavenly Realm,” Ding Shu said with a smile.","“Where in the North Heavenly Realm?” Ling Han continued to ask, “To be more exact, your original world!”","Hearing these words, Ding Shu’s eyes suddenly burst with iridescent light. It was as if he had become a completely different person, exuding an indescribable might, as if he was not a True Self Tier, but rather a supreme Great Emperor!","“Hehe, to be able to ask such a question, it means that we are the same kind of person.” However, he quickly returned to normal, and once again became sloppy.","“The same kind of person!” Ling Han nodded, his heart incredibly stunned.","Just like him, who had come from the Genesis World... there was actually another one!","Of course, Ding Shu definitely hadn’t come from his Genesis World. Instead, he had come from another Genesis World Genesis World, or a similar world.","Ding Shu stretched out a hand towards Ling Han, and Ling Han thought for a moment before stretching out his hand as well. The two of them shook hands.","“I have a suggestion. How about we exchange Spirit Diagrams?” Ding Shu said.","“Sure,” Ling Han said with a nod.","Neither of them said what Spirit Diagram it was, but both of them knew very well that it must be Destructive Energy. However, Ding Shu may not have called it Destructive Energy.","The two of them took out a Spirit Diagram at the same time and handed it over to the other.","Ling Han accepted it and looked at it. This was indeed a corner of the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy. Ding Shu had not lied to him, and he naturally had not lied to him either. This was meaningless.","The two of them knew each other’s origins, and this kind of origin could not be announced to the public.","They both had something on each other, so when they cooperated, there was much less scheming.","The two of them immediately started to comprehend it, each sitting in a corner of the Divine Temple.","A day later, the two of them walked towards each other, and traded the Spirit Diagram back.","As expected of the strongest existence in the Genesis World. This comprehension ability was too shocking.","Ling Han thought internally, and this should also be Ding Shu’s thoughts.","“Do you still have Spirit Diagrams to trade?” Ling Han asked.","Ding Shu paused, and countered with a question of his own, “Could it be that you still have Spirit Diagrams?”","“Heh, even if I don’t have it now, it doesn’t mean that I won’t be able to obtain it in the future,” Ling Han said with a smile. “If I do, I might as well inform you. If I obtain other Spirit Diagrams, I’ll exchange them with you.”","“All right,” Ding Shu nodded.","Ling Han guessed that Ding Shu had only obtained a corner of the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy. Otherwise, when he channeled the Destructive Energy, it wouldn’t have just wrapped around his right fist.","Of course, Ling Han had deliberately concealed his strength and didn’t unleash all of his Destructive Energy.","“That’s right, are you Ling Han?” Ding Shu suddenly asked.","Ling Han hesitated slightly, then nodded, “That’s right.”","“Ha, I knew it was you!” Ding Shu laughed loudly, “How could there be so many monsters in this world!”","Er, he had also placed himself in the category of monsters.","Ling Han walked forwards, and said, “I think you won’t be staying too long in the Buddhist Race, right?”","“Same to you.” Ding Shu went in the opposite direction. After walking far away, he spoke again, “I anticipate a real battle with you.”","“All right!” Ling Han nodded. Previously, in full public, they had all held back.","After returning, Yunshu Bodhisattva brought Ling Han back to the West Heavenly Realm. The Buddhist Race there had already gotten the news, and gave Ling Han an incredibly warm welcome.","Who would have thought that Ling Han would actually be able to obtain the first place for them?","After celebrating for a while, Ling Han pulled the large black dog aside and talked about Ding Shu.","“What!” The large black dog jumped up, “There is someone like you, the Genesis World’s leader?”","Ling Han nodded slowly, his expression very serious.","“I now suspect that Origin, Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing may all have the same origins as us.” He communicated through divine sense, “In fact, Ding Shu is one of these three people.”","“Goodness!” The large black dog inhaled sharply, “If that is really the case, that would be too terrifying!”","A large part of Ling Han’s strength came from the Power of Dimension in his body, but since that was the case, it meant that Ding Shu could also possess the majority of Ling Han’s abilities.","“This is a powerful opponent!” the large black dog said.","That’s right. Though the battle for the Buddha Son had ended with Ding Shu taking the initiative to admit defeat, this was not Ding Shu’s true strength. If he really went all out, who knew how many powerful moves Ding Shu had grasped.","In terms of luck alone, Ding Shu had even cultivated the Imperial Scroll. In this aspect, he was superior to Ling Han. Of course, he had not obtained the Body Arts, nor perhaps had he obtained the Origin Gold. This was their opportunity after they had left the Genesis World.","“The most important thing now is to get my hands on the Imperial Scroll!” Ling Han said. For someone like Ding Shu, who had great opportunities, cultivating Body Arts at the same time was not difficult. At least, before Venerate Tier, the resources needed to accumulate for a Body Arts cultivator was not too terrifying in amount.","Thus, if he couldn’t obtain the Imperial Scroll, then when Ding Shu had cultivated Body Art, and the two of them battled again, Ling Han would definitely lose.","“I’m going to find Shi Changtian. No matter what, I have to get something out of him.”"]},{"number":4206,"title":"Chapter 4206: Imperial Technique obtained","paragraphs":["Chapter 4206: Imperial Technique obtained","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Hey, what are you two whispering about?” The little azure dragon approached, its expression filled with suspicion.","“Shoo, shoo, shoo, what are kids doing here!” The large black dog immediately pushed the little azure dragon aside.","“Hiss, you guys must be up to something!” The little azure dragon stomped its feet.","However, Ling Han didn’t plan to tell any outsider the secret of the Genesis World. It was fine as long as they, the residents of the Genesis World, knew.","Thus, no matter how much the little azure dragon threatened and bribed, Ling Han and the large black dog kept their mouths shut, not revealing the slightest bit.","After Ling Han replied with a few words, he ran off to find Shi Changtian.","He had already made a deal with this guy. As long as he got first place, the latter would apply and have the higher-ups agree to teach him the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","At the time, Shi Changtian had only been perfunctory with Ling Han, and had not thought that Ling Han would really succeed. However, this was indeed a great merit, allowing the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm to hold their heads high. Thus, he did not mind making this trip, to ask instructions from the three Bodhisattvas.","Only after two days, the three Bodhisattvas agreed to have Ling Han be taught the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","Ling Han entered the secret room alone. Then, Shi Changtian took out a jade-like bone.","“This was left behind by a Buddha after he passed away in meditation. The profound meaning of the Six Characters Bright King Curse is hidden in his bone, so you can comprehend it on your own.”","Ling Han hurriedly caught the bone. This was a Saint’s bone, but its murderous aura had been refined, and its essence had been extracted. Otherwise, if the slightest bit of aura was released, it was guaranteed that he would immediately be crushed into a mush of blood.","Shi Changtian left, and Ling Han began to comprehend.","He inserted his divine sense into the bone, and instantly, it was as if he had entered into another world. In a pitch-black galaxy, an old man in monk robes walked out in a cross-legged position. He suddenly opened his mouth, and shouted the roar of a lion.","“An... Ma... Ni... Ba... Mi... Gu...”","The Buddhist chants were vast and mighty, each character taking form, and were completely formed from Regulations.","Only after a while, the old monk shouted loudly again. It was still the Six Characters Bright King Curse again and again.","At the same time, the old monk was also explaining how he was going to extract the heaven and earth’s energy, how he was going to infuse Regulations into it, and how he was going to clear his mind to see his true character.","Though he explained very carefully, if one wanted to truly grasp it, it all depended on one’s own comprehension ability.","Ling Han had already learnt the word “An”. Although it wasn’t very authentic, he had still established his foundations, after all. Thus, he was able to learn it very quickly. In just two days, he had already laid down the bone of the Saint, and from the stage of learning, advanced into the stage of comprehension.","This time, he went into seclusion for a whole nine days, and Ling Han finally opened his eyes.","“An!” he shouted lightly, and Regulations appeared, turning into a golden “An”.","A satisfied smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. The might of the “An” character had increased by at least threefold compared to before. The effects of using it to suppress Yin souls and dispel internal demons would naturally be greatly increased.","He continued to comprehend. Half a month later, he had already mastered the entire Six Characters Bright King Curse.","“Without the Imperial Scroll of the Buddhist Race, this Six Words Bright King Curse will ultimately not be able to unleash its full might.” Ling Han felt slightly regretful, but the Imperial Scroll was the foundation of an Imperial Clan. Even Venerate Tier elites such as the Black Cloud Bodhisattva probably wouldn’t be qualified to cultivate the Imperial Scroll, let alone him.","But to sneak into the 33 Heavens? That was too difficult.","That was the true base camp of the Buddhist Race. If one wanted to enter, they would definitely have to investigate all eighteen generations of his ancestors. He wanted to bluff his way through?","It was practically impossible.","Sigh, why wasn’t he as lucky as Ding Shu?","However, upon further thought, the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique was actually also an Imperial Scroll, and was incredibly unique. It was Body Arts. Throughout the generations of Ancestral Kings, only the True Dragon had reached Great Accomplishment in Body Arts, and was one of a kind.","It was not that the True Dragon was awesome, and had surpassed all other Great Emperors, but that this had been bestowed upon it by the heavens.","Ling Han ended his seclusion and returned the Saint’s bone. This naturally stunned the higher-ups of the West Heavenly Realm. He had grasped the Six Characters Bright King Curse in such a short period of time; his natural talent was chillingly strong.","He was warned that the Six Characters Bright King Curse was the precious treasure of the Buddhist Race and definitely couldn’t be taught to outsiders.","Ling Han agreed on the surface, then passed it on to the little azure dragon and the large black dog. This was their purpose for sneaking in.","However, after learning the Six Characters Bright King Curse, he wouldn’t be able to cultivate a second Imperial Technique for the time being. Thus, after some discussion, the “three brothers” decided to go out for a walk.","Now that they had a new identity as cover, they naturally did not have to worry about being hunted down. Furthermore, Ling Han was also the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm. Aside from the Imperial Clans, who would dare trifle with him?","The three of them left the Stainless Planet and roamed around.","They went to many planets to search for opportunities, but while there were indeed small opportunities and occasionally, an ancient site would open, but they were all Spiritual Transformation Tier, and Minor Advanced Tier-level, and were not of much help to them.","Seven months later, they arrived at the Frost Majestic Planet.","This was a large planet, and was also a well-known trading market.","Though transactions could be done on the Galaxy Network, firstly, the Chang Clan would have to collect service charges, and secondly, they were not face-to-face, after all. There was no way to directly appraise a treasure like this. Thus, the most popular method among cultivators was still trading face-to-face.","The Frost Majestic Planet was the West Heavenly Realm’s most famous trading planet. Ling Han and the others were naturally here because of his fame.","There were a total of 18 trading cities on this planet, and the smaller trading cities numbered in the tens of thousands. Practically the moment they left the inn, they would be able to see the stalls on both sides of the streets.","After walking around for a few days, they had a small harvest, but it was only a small harvest. They did not encounter anything that could be called precious treasures.","On this day, Ling Han finished cultivating the clay fetus of True Self. He had already completely cultivated the ninth clay fetus of True Self. Now, his Body Art and mystical power had both reached ten Heavens. When their might was unleashed together, he could unleash a terrifying power that was close to 15 Heavens.","At first, he had wanted to continue his efforts, and rush up to the second form of the True Self in a single go, but after a few attempts, he had failed.","It couldn’t be helped. Starting from the True Self Tier, it was about comprehending the Dao of heaven and earth, and without enough accumulation, no matter how prodigious you were, it was useless.","Ling Han decided to simply walk around. He didn’t have a purpose, so he walked around casually.","The streets were extremely lively. There were too many people from other planets. Some were sellers, some were buyers, and some were people hired to drum up the sales. There were all kinds of people.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly felt a strange feeling, but after taking a few steps, this feeling disappeared.","He stopped, then walked forwards again, but after taking a few steps, he stopped again, and began to retreat.","At this moment, that strange feeling came again.","What exactly was it?","Ling Han thought for a while, but couldn’t figure out where this strange feeling came from.","“Get lost, don’t stand here like a block of wood!” At this moment, a voice sounded from behind him, and then a hand pushed over.","Ling Han casually grabbed and waved his hand, and a person was picked up and tossed into the air. However, he didn’t even turn around.","“How dare you!” Behind him, several voices rang out at the same time.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind. He reached into his robes, and touched something hard. It was this thing that was exuding heat, though it was negligible.","That tortoise shell from the Netherworld!"]},{"number":4207,"title":"Chapter 4207: Strange change of the tortoise shell","paragraphs":["Chapter 4207: Strange change of the tortoise shell","Editor: Henyee Translations","This tortoise shell was a little amazing, because it could not be stored into a Spatial Tool.","But aside from that, this thing could not be any more ordinary.","And now, it was actually heating up?","‘What? Are you showing off now?’","Ling Han pulled open his clothes a little. He discovered that the tortoise shell wasn’t just hot, but the patterns on the back of the tortoise shell were also glowing slightly, but very weakly, like fireflies.","These patterns weren’t all that amazing, and they were secretly aligned with the Dao of heaven and earth and the like. If it weren’t for the fact that it couldn’t be stored into a Spatial Spirit Tool, this thing would definitely have been thrown away immediately.","Why did the tortoise shell glow and heat up? Was there no reason, or... had it been triggered by something?","Ling Han’s eyes swept over the place, but there were stalls everywhere, filled with a dazzling array of items. If it was triggered by one of the items here, the range of choice was still quite wide.","“Hey, have you gone stupid?” Behind him, someone rebuked harshly.","Ling Han turned around to take a look. There were four young people here, and they were two men and two women respectively. He smiled faintly, “What do you want?”","“You threw our Senior Brother Liu out, so could it be that you want to pretend that nothing happened?” one of the young girls rebuked. She had a ponytail, and was dressed in a long green dress. Her skin was very fair.","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, and asked, “The guy that smacked me with his hand just now?”","F***, you are still playing the fool at a time like this?","“Brat, we are the Holy Land of Qingxuan!” A man interrupted. He was dressed in a tight-fitting suit of blue, his expression arrogant.","Ling Han smiled faintly. These four people were only in the Core Formation Tier, and in his eyes, they weren’t even worthy of being his opponents. “That was just a misunderstanding. Someone patted my shoulder, and I naturally reacted.”","“All right, we believe that this is a misunderstanding. Pay compensation!” the man in blue said.","“Senior Brother Ma!” The remaining three turned to look at the man in blue at the same time, disagreement written all over their faces.","How could this be resolved with money?","The man in the tight-fitting blue suit pressed down his hand. They were all in the Core Formation Tier, while Ling Han was in the True Self Tier. They could only use the might of the Holy Land to intimidate him. It was already good enough for him to pay some compensation. How could it be that they could give him a good beating?","Ling Han smiled, took out a few Dao Stones and handed them over. He was not in the mood to tangle with these people now.","He didn’t care if the other party was satisfied or not. In any case, he was doing as he pleased. If they continued to pester him, he wouldn’t mind using force to resolve the problem.","The man in blue looked at the five Dao Stones in his hands, his expression slightly dark.","‘That’s all? Are you dismissing a beggar?’","“Stay here and keep an eye on him. Report his whereabouts at any time. I’ll go back and ask Uncle Zhou for help,” he transmitted a message through divine sense to his Junior Brother and Junior Sisters.","The three of them were slightly hesitant. This was only a small matter; was there any need to alert the others in the sect?","“He’s at the True Self Tier, and we’re no match for him,” the man in blue said. “Keep an eye on him!”","After saying this, he picked up Senior Brother Liu, who was at the side of the road, and strode off.","There was nothing else that could be done, so the three people with the ponytails could only do as he said.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He was someone who had a halo of trouble, and would actually still cause trouble in this kind of situation. Yi, didn’t he still have the True Dragon of Fortune? Had it been eaten by a dog?","(The large black dog: “...”)","He didn’t care. After walking back and forth a few times and confirming that something here had triggered the tortoise shell, he began to search the various stalls.","Found it.","It was too obvious, because he had discovered another tortoise shell.","This was an incomplete tortoise shell, and judging from the damaged edges, the two should be a complete piece.","What a coincidence. A tortoise shell that he had obtained in the Netherworld, and he had actually pieced it together here.","Was this the effect of his luck?","He stretched out a hand to grab the tortoise shell, then asked, “Boss, how much is this?”","He did not go in a roundabout manner, and deliberately chose other things, then very casually bought the tortoise shell as well.","With his current strength and status as a Buddha Son, there was already no need for him to do so.","“This?” The stall keeper faltered for a moment. He had picked this thing up, but looking at the interesting veined patterns on the tortoise shell, it had also become part of his collection, but he had not been able to sell it all this while.","It could not be helped. There was really nothing special about this at all. Whoever bought it would be an idiot.","However, why did this tortoise shell seem to be glowing now?","“100 Dao Stones.” He placed a high bid. It was rare for someone to ask, so he naturally had to take advantage of the opening to make a killing.","Ling Han smiled, took out a hundred Dao Stones and tossed them over, “Here, take them.”","Seeing how straightforward Ling Han was, the stall keeper was naturally filled with extreme regret. Obviously, Ling Han very much wanted this tortoise shell, and he was completely capable of offering a higher price.","Ling Han was overjoyed. Previously, he had stowed away the tortoise shell on a whim. Though he could not store it into a Spatial Spirit Tool, it was no trouble to bring it with him. Of course, he still had a sliver of hope in his heart. One day, he would be able to discover the true use of the tortoise shell.","After all, it was all. Being unable to store it into a Spatial Spirit Tool could also be considered a peculiarity.","He had not thought that he would be able to piece the tortoise shell back together so quickly. Perhaps, he would be able to immediately discover its peculiarity — it was also possible that after this piece was pieced back together, it would still be an ordinary tortoise shell.","Let’s go back.","He walked back, yet discovered that the three people with ponytails were actually following him. He revealed a smil. They were keeping an eye on him; had they not given up yet?","Fine, I’m in a good mood, so I’ll play with you guys.","Ling Han was completely capable of using the Star Step to flee, instantly traveling millions and millions of miles away, but now, he was neither too fast nor too slow.","After walking for a while, he had already arrived at the inn where he was resting. He turned around, and asked, “Why haven’t your people come yet? I’ve already arrived at my destination?”","The three people with the ponytails were all very embarrassed, and none of them spoke.","However, a look of delight immediately appeared on their faces, “Uncle Zhou and Senior Brother Ma are here!”","Oh, he had brought out reinforcements?","Ling Han stood with his hands crossed behind his back, waiting quietly.","In a short while, two figures flew over.","Yi?","When he saw one of them, Ling Han instantly revealed a strange expression.","Xiu, xiu! The two of them descended, and the man in blue immediately pointed at Ling Han and said, “Uncle Zhou, it was this guy who beat Senior Brother Liu to the point that he’s still unconscious!”","Uncle Zhou immediately stepped out, heading towards Ling Han.","The man in blue sneered. Though this Uncle Zhou had entered the sect later than him, his natural talent in martial arts was too shocking. He had practically broken through to the True Self Tier with an overwhelming speed, and even the Dao Child of the present generation was dumbfounded.","By now, the higher-ups of the Holy Land of Qingxuan had already thought of switching to another Dao Child. However, this involved a very complicated internal power struggle, and was not something that could be decided in a short while.","And in order to ensure the safety of this Uncle Zhou, the Holy Land finally sent him out, to prevent him from being plotted against by the people supporting the original Dao Child.","If he could develop a good relationship with this Uncle Zhou, who knows, he may be able to achieve meteoric success in future.","Just as he was pondering, Uncle Zhou had already walked in front of Ling Han.","Beat, beat him to death!","Uncle Zhou spread open his arms. Yi, what kind of technique was this? Among the celestial techniques of the Holy Land, there wasn’t a celestial technique with such a gesture.","‘F*ck!’","The eyes of the man in blue immediately widened. That was because Uncle Zhou had not spread out his arms to attack, but was rather embracing Ling Han.","“Senior Zhou!” Ling Han laughed loudly. This Uncle Zhou was Zhou Heng."]},{"number":4208,"title":"Chapter 4208: The location of Needless Mountains is","paragraphs":["Chapter 4208: The location of Needless Mountains is","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han’s cultivation and battle prowess had already surpassed Zhou Heng when he had been in the Genesis World. However, what he respected was Zhou Heng, just like how he had always respected Lin Luo.","Thus, in his heart, Zhou Heng would always be “Senior Zhou”, regardless of whether Zhou Heng’s cultivation level was higher or lower than his.","Zhou Heng didn’t say anything. He simply patted Ling Han’s shoulder.","Although he didn’t recognize Ling Han’s current appearance, Ling Han had already informed him of his identity through divine sense. Thus, he was also filled with excitement. It had been several years since they last met, and even though he maintained contact with Ling Han on the Galaxy Network, it had already been a long time since they had met face-to-face.","The two of them let go, and talked about some old matters. They were both happy.","The man in the blue tight-fitting outfit looked awkward. He only felt that he was just asking for punishment. He had clearly gone to ask for reinforcements, yet in the end, he had invited Ling Han’s good friend — though he had heard Ling Han address Zhou Heng as Senior Heng, but looking at the way the two of them were interacting, they were clearly good friends, so there was no such thing as seniority.","Oh no, he was in deep trouble now.","“Ma Jun!” Zhou Heng turned around and shouted at the man in blue.","“Uncle Zhou, I was wrong.” Ma Jun hurriedly knelt down. It was useless to say anything now, so he had best quickly apologize.","Zhou Heng naturally gave him a reprimand. Then, he ordered the four of them to return. He had a lot to say to Ling Han.","After they left, Ling Han talked about some secret matters, including Ding Shu’s origins.","“What!” Zhou Heng was shocked. “There are actually other Genesis Worlds?”","Ling Han nodded and said, “The so-called Genesis World is actually a rock that contains a small world. What I’m curious about now is how many more of these rocks there are.”","It would be fun if there were too many, because the body of the Genesis World’s master contained millions and millions of Power of Dimensions. When cultivating, he could easily break through the limits of martial arts and cultivate various Mystical Powers.","Then, the prodigies in the universe would really be overthrown.","“I’m sure that this is extremely limited. It’s possible that it’s just the two of you,” Zhou Heng said. To say nothing of Master of the Genesis World, which of those who had come from the Genesis World wasn’t a top-notch prodigy?","If there were a few more such small worlds, the entire cultivation world would probably be in chaos.","“If you need help with anything, feel free to ask,” Zhou Heng said. “Especially when you counterattack against the nine great Imperial Clans. Remember to invite me.”","Obviously, he also knew that Ling Han had been forced by the nine great Imperial Clans. As Ling Han’s good friend, he must also be filled with anger.","In the past, he had also been one of the strongest Heavenly Venerable Tier elites of Genesis World. Who had he been afraid of?","“All right!” Ling Han nodded earnestly, “Everyone work hard on cultivation, and this day will come!”","Zhou Heng nodded in understanding. He had obtained the complete Ancient Sun Divine Scroll from Lin Luo, as well as several Saint Techniques. If it weren’t for the fact that he still needed the cultivation resources of the Holy Land of Qingxuan, he would have been able to wander the world.","“Be careful,” he said.","“I will.” Ling Han nodded, “You too. If there are any difficulties, I can also help you.”","He knew that Zhou Heng was presently contesting for the position of Dao Child, and there was still some danger.","“Haha, you’re now the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm. Your words do indeed have some weight.” Zhou Heng laughed loudly.","The two of them bade farewell. They were both proud and arrogant people, and had their own paths to walk.","After seeing Zhou Heng off, Ling Han shut himself in his room and began to study the two tortoise shells.","These two things continued to glow and heat up. Ling Han placed them on the ground, and a strange thing happened. They were like magnets, and attracted each other. They trembled slightly, and then slowly approached each other.","Ling Han didn’t stop this. A single tortoise shell was completely useless, and it was unknown what would happen after they fused into one.","Pa, the two tortoise shells came closer and closer, and finally joined back together.","Then, there was no ‘then’.","“F***, it’s over just like that?” Ling Han was greatly disappointed. Shouldn’t it have opened up a mysterious space, where he could take out a large number of treasures, or turn into a divine tortoise shell that could not be penetrated by anything?","What was this?","If he had known this earlier, he should have given Ma Jun a good thrashing. Now, he had nowhere to vent his depression.","Ling Han picked up the tortoise shell, and looked it up and down. He was defiant.","However, aside from the fact that he still couldn’t store it into his Spatial Tool, there was still nothing special about it.","“A complete tortoise shell, could it be that I have to crawl into it?” Ling Han mumbled to himself. When he finished saying these words, he was startled.","It can’t really be like this, right?","This, wearing a tortoise shell on his body, no matter how he thought about it, it was a little awkward.","“Nothing ventured, nothing gained!” Ling Han encouraged himself.","He pulled the tortoise shell over his head, and a strange scene appeared. This tortoise shell was actually only about the size of a palm. Thus, this hole was naturally very small, but when Ling Han’s head approached, he easily wormed in.","Then, with a ‘xiu’, his whole person disappeared.","This was... the inside of the tortoise shell?","Ling Han’s eyes widened in shock. This was a pitch-black galaxy, yet there were stars flickering in the distance. Some were especially bright, some were relatively dim, some were extraordinarily large, and some were slightly smaller.","This was a microcosm of the universe!","With a thought, Ling Han immediately left the millions and millions of stars behind him. In this place, he could traverse boundless distances in a single bound.","In that case, he would go to the edge of the universe to take a look.","Ling Han remembered that the Ancestral King Lingtian and the Battle Saint Emperor had all gone to the edge of the universe in search of the path to immortality. From then onwards, there was no further news. Then, would he be able to see them here?","Unfortunately, though he had come to the end of this “universe”, he had not discovered anything special.","That was because this was not a real universe, but rather a simulation.","Weng, a figure appeared, standing in the universe, indescribably tall.","However, Ling Han discovered that this person’s back was slightly hunched.","No, it wasn’t that this person was hunchbacked, but that he was carrying a tortoise shell on his back.","This was a tortoise in human form, and it still retained a sliver of its original characteristics?","“My entire life has been spent in battle, pacifying the darkness. However, my power is limited, and even if I spent my entire life, I could only suppress the darkness, but could not completely pacify it! Future generations, what I have learnt in this lifetime is buried in Needless Mountains. If you obtain it, you have to shoulder my unfinished mission and continue to eradicate the darkness.”","This tortoiseback person declared loudly, bringing with him an endless air of dominance. Even the heavens were trembling, and the stars were flickering simultaneously.","A lifetime of battle, pacifying the darkness, and Needless Mountains?","‘F*ck! This is the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor!","Heavens, this Holy Emperor was actually from the Tortoise Tribe!","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. He hadn’t imagined that the Great Emperor, who could claim to be the most powerful being in history, was actually a member of the Tortoise Tribe.","Moreover, he hadn’t been able to obtain the secret of the Needless Mountains from the Mountain Sea Heaven. Instead, he had unexpectedly obtained it here.","Actually, it wasn’t wrong. The secret of the Needless Mountains was indeed in the Mountain Sea Heaven — a tortoise shell from Mountain Sea Heaven.","Perhaps, this tortoise shell had been shed from the body of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.","Just as he was complaining, stars flashed, and he saw that seven stars were aligned and twinkling together.","“So this is where Needless Mountains is?”"]},{"number":4209,"title":"Chapter 4209: High Fiery Galaxy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4209: High Fiery Galaxy","“I recognize this place. Seven stars in a row, those are seven suns!”","In the universe, it was not uncommon for twin suns to appear, but it was extremely rare for three or even more suns to appear in a galaxy.","Thus, the seven suns formed a straight line. This place was naturally rare, and could be recognized with a single glance.","“In the High Fiery Galaxy,” Ling Han answered.","He immediately went to call the little azure dragon and the large black dog. When the two of them found out that Ling Han had found the location of Needless Mountains, they were both surprised and delighted.","Who would have thought that this would actually come so easily?","“Haha, Imperial Scroll, Grandpa Dog is here!” The large black dog rubbed its paws together in excitement.","The little azure dragon also cried out. The True Dragon only passed down the Body Arts, but did not have the Imperial Scroll of cultivation level. Thus, it was also very depressed. It had grasped so many Imperial Techniques for nothing, yet could not unleash their full might.","“Let’s go.”","Ling Han set up formations, and they began to traverse the universe.","“I say, Little Han, we’re in a rush to get the Imperial Scroll, so don’t play around anymore.” The large black dog was slightly apprehensive, because they had once encountered an accident, and the Transfer Formation had actually exploded. Thankfully, they had not entered yet. Otherwise, it would be much more fun.","“Hehe, if I don’t make the best use of my time to learn now, could it be that O would have to learn at the last moment?” Ling Han said with a smile.","Every time he arrived on a planet, he would comprehend the Transfer Formation there. On his way here, he had memorized who knew how many Transfer Formations.","“Moreover, the Needless Mountains can’t run, and it hasn’t been found for so many years. How could it be that it would be discovered by others just because we delayed it for a while?”","Er, that was true.","And just like that, Ling Han learnt all the way, and the three of them quickly headed towards the High Fiery Galaxy.","This was in the East Heavenly Realm, and Ling Han felt rueful about this. If he had known, when he had come here for the sparring tournament, he would not have returned to the West Heavenly Realm.","After spending a total of two months, they finally arrived at the High Fiery Galaxy.","They walked out of the Transfer Formation and immediately felt the scorching heat.","In the High Fiery Galaxy, because there were seven suns hanging high in the skies at all times, the temperature here was astonishingly high. Ordinary living beings would not be able to survive at all.","However, for cultivators who cultivated fire-element cultivation techniques, this was a good place. The Source Power of Fire boiled, and was easier to comprehend.","Hence, there were cultivators on this planet, and a Transfer Formation was deliberately built. Every day, a considerable number would come. Of course, there were also a considerable number that left, because the seven suns shone at the same time, and their might was too terrifying. If one stayed here for too long, they would be poisoned by fire.","“Little Han, we’ve arrived at the High Fiery Galaxy, but where is the Needless Mountains?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han was also a little dazed. That was because he was in the tortoise shell universe, and had only seen seven stars aligned. He had confirmed that Needless Mountains was in the High Fiery Galaxy, but now that he was here, how was he supposed to find Needless Mountains? This was a problem.","“I don’t know either.” He spread out his hands. Needless Mountains definitely wouldn’t stand upright in the galaxy like that. Otherwise, after so many years, they would have long since been found. Thus, the key was still on the tortoise shell.","He took out the tortoise shell. Weng, the veined patterns on the tortoise shell all lit up, and then became incredibly bright, shooting towards the skies. Even the brilliance of the seven suns could not conceal it.","“Yi, a treasure!”","“A treasure has appeared!”","Though Ling Han and the others had deliberately found a place where there was no one, the light emitted by the tortoise shell was too dazzling, and had also covered the glory of the suns, so how could it not attract the attention of others?","Instantly, those who were cultivating nearby all followed the tracks, and those in the distance also discovered it, and were also rapidly rushing over.","“F***, stupid tortoise, why are you so high-profile?” The large black dog was so infuriated that he almost threw the tortoise shell. However, the location of Needless Mountains was still","on it, so no matter how angry he was, he had to endure it.","“Hand over the treasure!” At this moment, the person closest to them had already arrived.","“Scram!” the large black dog turned around and chided.","“Humph, what an arrogant tone!” That person immediately charged over.","They were fighting over a treasure, after all, so why was there so much blabbering?","The large black dog humphed, and with a wave of his paw, pa, that person was immediately sent flying. He was no match at all.","This was natural. That person was only in the Core Formation Tier, and he didn’t even take a closer look at the cultivation levels of both sides before rashly charging forward. Wasn’t that just courting death?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! More people flew over, but with a precedent, none of them made another move. Instead, they chose to wait. When there were more people, they would battle again. This was also a good choice.","“What’s wrong? This is our family’s treasure, so are you guys planning to snatch it by force?” the large black dog shouted.","“Hehe, young man, when you’re out in the world, remember not to show off your wealth. Otherwise, who else would one rob if not you?” an elder said. His upper body was bare, and there were veined patterns on his skin. They were crimson red in colour, and were still squirming, as if they were flowing with lava.","The large black dog chuckled, and said, “Since that’s the case, I’m relieved. Come, let’s rob","them!”","“Robbery!” the little azure dragon howled. This was something he loved the most.","Everyone was stunned. Yi, what was going on here?","Shouldn’t they be robbing these three people? Why was it that the tables were turned now?","“Let’s go!”","The large black dog and little azure dragon immediately charged out, unleashing their battle prowess as they mercilessly defeated their enemies.","Most of the people here were at the Core Formation Tier. There were True Self Tier elites, but there were only four of them. Even if three of them were at the fourth form of the True Self","Tier, in front of the little azure dragon and the large black dog, they were still defeated one-","sidedly.","In just a few minutes, these people had collapsed all over the ground.","“I’ve been poor recently,” the large black dog mused ruefully as he ransacked the others.","“I have to earn some extra income.” The little azure dragon nodded in agreement. This made the people lying on the ground feel so depressed that they wanted to vomit blood. ‘You guys have gone too far. You’ve already won and snatched, yet you’re still saying such","words to anger them.’","Weng!","Right at this moment, an indescribable aura appeared. The seven suns in the sky seemed to be controlled by an invisible force, forcefully deviating from their original positions. If they were connected with a brush stroke, it was actually a human figure!","The three suns were in a straight line, forming the head and body, while the other four suns had to be distributed farther away. These were the limbs.","Boom, the seven suns all spewed out flames, then instantly cooled down and disappeared. A massive human figure appeared, lying in the galaxy. It was indescribably huge. One eye was","even larger than the sun.","The present galaxy had become dark, but in the next instant, multiple streaks of divine light bloomed, and multiple flowers bloomed furiously. Every single flower was as large as a star. Upon a closer look, those divine clouds and flowers were actually formed from Regulations, representing the order of heaven and earth.","Hiss, this was too shocking!","Pa, pa, pa! Everyone knelt down, involuntarily, unable to control themselves at all.","“Descending Heaven, Holy Emperor!” Only Ling Han did not kneel. Though his Primal Chaos Celestial Core had long since turned into alchemic fluid, and had now become the flesh and blood of the True Self, the abilities that he should possess had not disappeared. Instead, it had fused into Ling Han’s body, and became even more stable.","He mumbled to himself. This indescribably colossal body was none other than the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s corpse!"]},{"number":4210,"title":"Chapter 4210: Startling the Universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 4210: Startling the Universe","Editor: Henyee Translations","Who would have thought that the so-called saying of Needless Mountains contained the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor, but it was practically the burial ground of the Holy Emperor!","The remains of this Holy Emperor had always been here, but they had never manifested. It was as if they were transparent, and it was only when they were stimulated by the tortoise shell that he finally reappeared in the world.","The body of a Great Emperor!","Ling Han had seen the skin of a Pseudo-Emperor before. It was already world-shakingly powerful, and now... this was the skeletal remains of a true Great Emperor. Just how terrifying would it be?","Even though he had already been dead for countless years, the power of the Great Emperor was superior to the Regulations. Who knew what other tricks he could use after death.","Right at this moment, the tortoise shell suddenly dimmed, and then lit up again. However, this time, it was not soaring into the skies, but rather curled up, wrapping around Ling Han.","Ling Han immediately discovered that there was a force pulling him towards the skies.","“Old Black, Four-Legged Snake!” He hurriedly stimulated the ley lines and grabbed the little azure dragon and the large black dog.","Wrapped in light, xiu, the three of them soared into the sky.","“Ah—”","The large black dog and little azure dragon let out cries at the same time. This speed was too fast, making them feel extremely uncomfortable.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was fine. He was wrapped in that light, and did not feel anything strange at all.","Xiu, they instantly became a small dot, and then disappeared without a trace.","At this moment, the might of the Great Emperor’s aura finally disappeared as well. Everyone scrambled to their feet, their faces still pale. They had not recovered from their shock.","“A body of millions and millions of meters tall, this is a Saint!” A figure from the older generation exclaimed in a trembling voice.","What? The remains of a Saint had appeared?","The others were all astounded. What kind of concept was the corpse of a Saint?","The Saint could be said to be the embodiment of the Regulations, and the fact that it could become millions and millions of meters tall was due to the support of Regulations. It could be claimed that even if a single hair fell from the Saint’s body, that would still be a supreme precious treasure. Not only could it be used to comprehend Dao, it could even be used as a Spirit Tool.","Now that a complete Saint had appeared, just how valuable was this?","Moreover, there might even be Saint Techniques and Saint Tools!","After a moment of shock, everyone started to post a piece of news on the Galaxy Network. They said that a Saint’s corpse had appeared in the High Fiery Galaxy.","It had to be admitted that some people were indeed very despicable.","They themselves didn’t have the ability to fight for the treasures left behind by the “Saint”, so they simply exposed it to the Galaxy Network, letting everyone know. They didn’t want Ling Han and the others to enjoy it alone.","“The corpse of a Saint has appeared?”","This immediately caused a commotion on the Galaxy Network. At the beginning, this was only limited to Venerate Tier-level forces. In fact, even many Holy Lands were not moved. After all, the Holy Lands themselves had Saint-level inheritances, and unless it was confirmed that they could obtain the inheritances of the Saint, there was absolutely no need for them to be rash.","However, when the nearest Venerate Tier elites rushed over, the situation was completely out of control.","‘Holy f*ck! This isn’t the corpse of a Saint! Which idiot has such poor eyesight?’","“Great Emperor’s corpse, Great Emperor’s corpse!”","With these words, the whole universe shook. Not only did the members of the Holy Lands all move out, even the Imperial Clans were completely unable to sit by and watch.","The Great Emperor was an overlord that could only appear once in every era, and was synonymous with invincibility. Just look at how the Imperial Clan that had been left behind after the death of the Great Emperor was still the strongest force in the world, no matter how many years had passed. It was clear just how powerful the Great Emperor was.","And now, the corpse of a Great Emperor had actually appeared in the universe?","In just half a day, several Saints had already arrived. However, even though the Great Emperor had already died, and even though countless years had already passed, the might that he exuded was still extremely terrifying. They were not allowed to approach him at all. Otherwise, even Saints would explode and die.","Another day later, the Saints that were further away also arrived, one after another. When it came to traversing through the Void, Saints surpassed Venerate Tiers by who knew how many times.","However, no matter how many Saints there were, it was useless. In front of Imperial Might, even Saints were as helpless as weeds.","“What? Three people have already entered?”","“They were enveloped by the light that was released from a tortoise shell, and that was why they flew towards the Great Emperor’s corpse. They did not shatter.”","“Those three people... are suspected to be the new Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm, as well as his two brothers, who are collectively known as the Three Milk Tea Brothers?”","“Milk, Three Milk Tea Brothers!”","Hearing the combination name of Ling Han and the others, even the Saint was stunned for a moment.","On the third day, another Saint arrived. However, he was even more powerful than all of the Saints gathered together—not himself, but rather the Imperial Weapon that he had brought with him!","The Ziwei Imperial Clan’s Divine Fluid Saint.","“Greetings, friend!” The other Saints all greeted him.","The Divine Fluid Saint was slightly arrogant. His strength was already incredibly powerful, and he more so possessed the Imperial Weapon, a weapon that could easily kill even Saints. Thus, he simply nodded casually before turning his attention to the corpse of the Great Emperor in the universe.","Another while later, an incredibly powerful Saint also arrived.","The Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan’s Rainbow Saint.","“Brother Divine Fluid, did you discover anything?” the Rainbow Light Saint asked.","The Divine Fluid Saint’s expression was arrogant toward the other Saints, but when he faced the Rainbow Light Saint, who was also from the Imperial Clan, he withdrew this attitude, and said slowly, “From appearance, this looks very much like that legendary person.”","“Who?”","“The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor!”","Hiss!","Instantly, there was a sharp intake of breath. Ordinary Saints lacked understanding of Great Emperors, but the Imperial Clans had deep roots, and had not fallen for millions and millions of years, so they naturally had astonishing information.","The Imperial Clans all knew that the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor wasn’t the Great Emperor of the Human Race, but rather the Demon Race. It was an ordinary tortoise, and it had only become a Great Emperor that had suppressed an era after experiencing thousands of tribulations.","Thus, the Divine Fluid Saint came to this conclusion when he saw the tortoise shell on the back of the Great Emperor’s corpse.","“A few days ago, the Mountain Sea Heaven opened, and now, the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s remains have suddenly appeared. There is definitely a link between the two,” the Rainbow Light Saint immediately said.","“M-hm,” the Divine Fluid Saint replied with a nod.","“Why don’t we join forces?” the Rainbow Light Saint suggested.","The Divine Fluid Saint immediately looked tempted. If the entire body of a Saint could be considered a treasure, or a Saintly medicine, then the Great Emperor was even more so. His blood could even allow a Saint to live a second life!","Saints were divided into a total of nine minor levels of cultivation level. Right now, he was only standing on the fourth level. Theoretically speaking, there was already no possibility for him to advance any further. However, if he could obtain the Great Emperor’s blood, then it was possible for him to advance a step further, or even a few steps in fact.","“The problem is, will just the two Imperial Weapons work?” he asked darkly.","The might of the Imperial Weapon was equivalent to an Ancestral King coming back to life. Of course, it could resist the might of the Great Emperor’s corpse, but if it was activated by a Saint, how long could it last?","At that time, the Imperial Weapon would suddenly become ineffective. At that time, Imperial Might would sweep over them, and even Saints would be crushed into mush.","“Indeed, two Imperial Weapons aren’t enough insurance,” the Rainbow Light Saint said with a nod. “Three is enough. We’ll take turns activating it, and it’ll be enough to keep the Imperial Weapons in a semi-resuscitating state.”","—It was enough to resist the Imperial Might, and there was no need for the Imperial Weapon to fully awaken. Semi-resuscitation would be enough. This would greatly reduce the pressure on the Saint.","They waited, and after a while, the third Imperial Clan Saint arrived.","The Fire Cloud Imperial Clan’s Fire Leaving Saint."]},{"number":4211,"title":"Chapter 4211: Inner World","paragraphs":["Chapter 4211: Inner World","Editor: Henyee Translations","The three Saints agreed immediately, and immediately brought their clansmen with them, heading towards the stars.","Weng! The Divine Fluid Saint unleashed his Imperial Weapon first. It was only a semi-resuscitated weapon, and it would be fine as long as it could withstand Imperial Might.","The Imperial Weapon protected them, resisting the aura of the Great Emperor as they continued to advance.","They had already arrived in front of the Great Emperor’s corpse. However, this Great Emperor corpse was spread out across a few galaxies, and was incredibly huge. In front of this kind of existence, the distance of 30 meters could be considered close, and 300,000 meters could also be considered close.","“The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor battled his whole life, and has strength that shakes the heaven and earth. The Imperial Weapon he wields is the Black Permanence Sword. It is forged from Eternity Origin Gold, and this material can be ranked in the top ten of all ultimate materials,” the Divine Fluid Saint said, his eyes filled with greed.","The ultimate ingredients that could be used to forge an Imperial Weapon, and to be ranked in the top ten among those, just how valuable was that?","Because there were too few clashes between Imperial Weapons, it was impossible to truly rank them. Thus, there was no difference in ranking among the top ten. The Eternity Origin Gold was completely possible to be the strongest ultimate material.","The Rainbow Light Saint nodded as well. Though he too held an Imperial Weapon in his hands, this belonged to the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan. It did not belong to him alone. Even if he could be invincible with the Imperial Weapon, if he betrayed the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan, the Imperial Weapon would automatically awaken and fly back to the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan.","However, it would be a completely different story if he could obtain the Imperial Weapon that belonged to the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.","The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor had long since died, and he hadn’t left behind any descendants or bloodline. Thus, as long as one obtained his Imperial Weapon, they would become the true owner of the Imperial Weapon.","Of course, he still needed to obtain the Imperial Scroll of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to activate the Imperial Weapon.","The problem was, with how big the Emperor’s corpse was, how were they supposed to find the Imperial Weapon, the Imperial Scroll and how were they supposed to take the Emperor’s corpse away?","They had to hurry. If the other Saints from the Imperial Clans also arrived here, the competition would become incredibly intense.","“There!” They circled around, and the Fire Leaving Saint pointed at the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s right pinky.","To the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor, this was only a finger, but to the outside world, it was even larger than a planet. However, the tip of his finger turned into a mass of Primal Chaos, as if it could be passed through.","“The three people from before must have entered from here,” the Rainbow Light Saint deduced.","“They probably obtained the token of the Holy Emperor, and that’s why the remains of the Holy Emperor directly absorbed them in,” the Divine Fluid Saint speculated.","“Let’s go in quickly,” the Fire Leaving Saint said.","They flew toward the little finger. However, the Imperial Might might became even more terrifying here, and even the semi-resuscitated Imperial Weapon couldn’t withstand it. The Divine Fluid Saint was forced to completely resuscitate the Imperial Weapon.","However, even though a Saint was controlling the Imperial Weapon, it was still extremely straining. It could only last for about five minutes. After the three Saints brought the juniors for a certain distance, the Fire Leaving Saint took over the job and activated the Jade Water Sword.","After travelling for a while longer, they felt that it was impossible for them to pass through this area in the remaining time, so they could only retreat.","“No, we still need more Imperial Weapons.” There was nothing else they could do. They could only continue to wait.","...","On Ling Han’s side, the three of them were picked up by the tortoise shell, and entered into the galaxy at an incredibly fast speed, directly entering through the little finger of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. Then, the tortoise shell quickly dimmed.","“Wa!” The little azure dragon and the large black dog, the two brothers in distress, immediately sprawled out on the sidelines and vomited madly. Previously, they were being carried away at speeds that exceeded their limits, and had no protection at all. It was as if their internal organs were about to run out on their own.","Meanwhile, Ling Han stood up and observed his surroundings.","He could clearly see that he had entered into the body of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. His position was on the little finger of his right hand, but now?","This was an ordinary forest, where the sun shone brightly.","However, Ling Han could tell with a single glance that this was one of the seven suns of the High Fiery Galaxy. It had a unique purple-coloured brilliance shining.","A world had evolved inside the corpse of a Great Emperor?","Ling Han took a deep breath. No matter how strange it was, this was the best chance for him to obtain the Imperial Scroll. Otherwise, which Imperial Clan could he go to steal something that was the ultimate treasure of the clan?","“The two of you... are you done throwing up?” He turned around and asked the little azure dragon and the large black dog.","“That’s about it,” the large black dog said weakly. He had just stood up, and after taking two steps, he sprawled out on one side and started to vomit again, “Let Grandpa Dog vomit for a while longer.”","Finally, the dog and dragon rested for half a day’s time, and only then did they feel slightly better. They could walk, but when they walked, their bodies were swaying, as if they had suffered a serious illness, and were incredibly weak.","“If I can’t obtain the Imperial Scroll this time, then Grandpa Dog will definitely curse this Descending Heaven Holy Emperor to death!” The large black dog gritted his teeth. He had really lost half his life.","“I’ve never suffered like this in my life!” the little azure dragon also moaned repeatedly.","“All right, hurry up and follow,” Ling Han said, leading the way ahead.","This was the inside of a Great Emperor’s body, but because it had developed a world, it no longer had a terrifying pressure. Otherwise, if they were so close to a Holy Emperor’s body, it was guaranteed that eveb Saints would explode.","“This can’t be considered a world, because the Emperor’s corpse is too colossal. It can only be said to be a space inside him.” Ling Han thought for a moment, and felt that this kind of explanation was more appropriate.","“Who cares if it’s a world or an internal space? Let’s hurry up and get the Imperial Scroll,” the large black dog said.","“However, where should we go?” Ling Han flew into the sky. The Regulations here were no different from the outside world, and there was no terrifying gravity suppression, so he could fly freely.","He looked around, but could not see anything unusual.","‘Oh, right.’","He took out the tortoise shell. It was no longer blindingly bright, but every veined pattern was still glowing slightly, interweaving into incredibly complex patterns.","“Er, no way?”","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and once again slipped into the tortoise shell, but this time, he did not see anything.","It was obviously not to be used like this.","This tortoise shell had led them here, and had also led them into the corpse of the Holy Emperor. Then, it should continue to guide them step by step, to find the inheritance of the Holy Emperor.","“How should I use it?” Ling Han mumbled.","“Dripping blood,” the little azure dragon suggested.","“That’s right.” Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He could give it a try.","“Hey, hey, hey, why are you staring at Grandpa Dragon?” The little azure dragon was a little hairy.","“You are a descendant of the True Dragon, and your bloodline is pure. The effects of your blood should be extremely good,” Ling Han said.","“Come, Four-Legged Snake. Don’t be stingy, donate some,” the large black dog said from the side.","The little azure dragon hurriedly fled. “Get lost, whose blood isn’t blood! Grandpa Dragon’s blood is extremely precious, and when Grandpa Dragon becomes a Saint, it’ll be able to revive the dead. How can it be wasted like this?”","“Precisely because the effects are good, I have to use yours!” Ling Han chased after him.","“Little Han, this is a good chance for a battle. Whoever loses will donate their blood,” the little azure dragon howled. It wasn’t afraid of Ling Han.","The man and dragon began to fight fiercely, and the little azure dragon also returned to its original form. He was still suited to battle in dragon form, as it could allow him to unleash his strongest battle prowess.","“F*ck! The murderous aura attacks, the battle prowess suppression, the black light of illusion...” the little azure dragon screamed in agony. Ling Han unleashed his ultimate moves, suppressing it in the shortest amount of time.","“Little Han, you are too despicable!”","He was forced to bleed."]},{"number":4212,"title":"Chapter 4212: Zhu Dongkui","paragraphs":["Chapter 4212: Zhu Dongkui","Editor: Henyee Translations","The little azure dragon watched from the sidelines, its eyes plaintive.","His blood had been rubbed on the shell of the tortoise, and it was a pool of red.","Weng, the tortoise shell actually began to spin, and then a streak of light shot out, shooting into the distance.","“You two, why are you letting me bleed so much? Just a little bit is enough.” When the little azure dragon saw this, it immediately complained.","“Er, who knows, you might have to rub it again in the future. Thus, it’s better to have a short-term pain than a long-term pain. I’ll do it all in one go, to prevent you from tormenting you a few more times,” the large black dog said seriously.","“Then I’ll have to thank you,” the little azure dragon said through gritted teeth.","The large black dog felt a little guilty. Previously, it was him who had shouted that it was not enough, and he had to release more.","“Let’s go, let’s go. The Imperial Scroll is waiting for us.” It tried to change the topic.","“Old Black, this isn’t over!” The little azure dragon’s resentment was very strong.","The three of them set off, heading in the direction indicated by the pillar of light.","This place was incredibly vast, and furthermore, it was the inside of the corpse of a Great Emperor, so it naturally could not be measured with common sense. There were green mountains and clear waters along the way. After travelling for three days, they took out their tortoise shell and were once again pointed in a direction.","“Yi, we’re close!”","They discovered that this tortoise shell was pointing directly at a valley ahead of them.","The three of them descended, and entered into the valley, but very carefully.","“Hahaha!” The large black dog suddenly laughed.","“Ol’ Black, what’s wrong with you!” the little azure dragon hurriedly rebuked. ‘You’re too scary, laughing so suddenly. Don’t you know that you can scare people to death in this kind of situation?’","The large black dog hurriedly covered his mouth, cocked his head, and said, “Strange, Grandpa Dog suddenly felt like laughing, and couldn’t control himself from laughing out loud.”","“Idiot!” The little azure dragon shook its head, then burst into laughter as well.","“What’s so funny?” The large black dog jumped up.","“I just find it funny!” The little azure dragon was still laughing.","Ling Han moved, and held down the dog and dragon. He frowned slightly, and said, “There seems to be something off about the situation.”","“What’s not right?” The little azure dragon bared its teeth in a grin.","“That’s right. What’s off about it?” The large black dog’s mouth was also crooked, and he was all smiles.","“Something’s very wrong,” Ling Han said. This was because he also felt an urge to laugh. However, in this situation, there should be nothing that could trigger his laughter.","Thus, there was something off about this valley.","However, precisely because of this, it meant that the tortoise shell had not pointed blindly. The outside world was too ordinary. Only when there was a disparity, would it mean that they were closer to the Imperial Scroll.","With Ling Han’s reminder, the little azure dragon and the large black dog both became serious, but the smile at the corners of their mouths couldn’t be suppressed no matter what. Their expressions appeared very funny, both cautious and wanting to grin widely.","They continued to walk, and they hadn’t walked too far when they saw a figure appear before them. This person’s back was facing them.","What? There was actually another person here?","Furthermore, looking at his slightly trembling body, it seemed like he was speaking.","“... Hahaha, isn’t it funny?”","They walked closer, and finally heard what that person was saying.","However, right at this moment, this person suddenly turned around, facing the three of them.","Ya, and a handsome man at that. He had an imposing, intimidating appearance.","“Who are you?” the little azure dragon shouted.","“Now that you have entered into my, Zhu Dongkui’s territory, shouldn’t you take the initiative to announce your name?” That handsome man said. The moment the words left his mouth, he couldn’t help but hold his chin, “Aiya, I seem to have spoken my own name!”","“Hahaha, another slip of the tongue!” However, he immediately laughed loudly, filled with the spirit of self-amusement.","“Crazy!” the little azure dragon said in a low voice to Ling Han and the large black dog.","“Hey, hey, hey. Four-Legged Snake, what are you babbling about?” Zhu Dongkui immediately shouted.","“I’m a True Dragon, and you’re the Four-Legged Snake. Your entire family are Four-Legged Snakes!” The little azure dragon was enraged, and it raised its claws in rebuke.","“True Dragon?” Zhu Dongkui scratched his head, “In the past, I have indeed raised a descendant of the Dragon Race. His bloodline is quite pure, and he has cultivated to Saint Tier. Unfortunately, he died of old age a very long time ago.”","‘Holy f*ck! Is this real?!’","Ling Han and the others exchanged looks, all thinking that this man was boasting. Raising a Saint-level beast pet? Did he think he was a Great Emperor!","No, this was the corpse of a Great Emperor. This person couldn’t be the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor, a sliver of his divine sense that had yet to dissipate, right?","That was possible.","“Senior, do you have anything for us?” The large black dog rubbed his paws together, an expectant expression on his face.","“Looking at how sneaky you are, I can tell at a glance that you are not a good person,” Zhu Dongkui said, then laughed loudly, “This is a good analogy!”","Good your head!","“Senior, why are you here?” Ling Han asked.","“Oh, waiting for someone to issue a challenge.” Zhu Dongkui counted, “How many years have I been waiting here? 100 million years? One billion years? Sigh, I can’t remember.”","“Hahahaha, I actually can’t remember clearly. What a joke.”","Ling Han felt apprehensive. This Zhu Dongkui loved to laugh so much, was it because of the environmental influence of this place, or was it that he loved to laugh in the first place, which had affected the environment?","If it was the latter, then this guy’s strength was too inconceivable.","“Which one of you is going to challenge me?” Zhu Dongkui asked, all smiles. It was as if he maintained a cheerful mentality at all times.","“Him.” The little azure dragon and the large black dog pointed at Ling Han at the same time.","Since this Zhu Dongkui had been placed here by the Holy Emperor, his abilities were definitely powerful to the extreme. It must be Ling Han. They did not want to be beaten.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “Senior’s martial arts skills are unparalleled, so I’m definitely no match for you.”","“Hahaha, how could I, Zhu Dongkui, possibly bully a junior? Don’t worry, I will suppress my cultivation level to the same level as you!” Zhu Dongkui laughed loudly.","“All right!”","Ling Han nodded, and immediately charged over.","“F***!” Zhu Dongkui humphed lowly. This brat was really too direct.","However, he was extremely powerful, so he naturally wouldn’t be wounded. He immediately humphed lowly and suppressed his cultivation level. Then, he delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Zhu Dongkui immediately let out a surprised exclamation. His figure was forced into continuous retreat.","“Brat, you actually cultivated Body Art at the same time!” he said.","“Hehe.” Ling Han merely chuckled.","Zhu Dongkui shouted lightly, and counterattacked, delivering another palm strike.","Ling Han was naturally happy to clash head-on with him. Power was his strength in the first place, and within the same cultivation level, it could be claimed that he was peerless.","Peng!","In this exchange, both Ling Han and Zhu Dongkui retreated at the same time, though Zhu Dongkui retreated slightly further than Ling Han.","Ling Han was astonished to discover that his opponent’s power had increased by a significant amount. It was as if he had also fused these two powers together.","“Senior, you’re shameless!” he immediately said.","“Hahaha, what shamelessness!” Zhu Dongkui shook his head, as he continued to attack, “I have cultivated Body Arts in the first place, but I had not channelled it previously.”","Ling Han only protested slightly, and did not take it to heart too much. That was because though Zhu Dongkui had also cultivated Body Art, he was clearly inferior to him. He should have only reached Ninth Heaven. Thus, when the two powers were fused, he was still slightly weaker than him.","Let’s battle!"]},{"number":4213,"title":"Chapter 4213: Seven Saints Arrive","paragraphs":["Chapter 4213: Seven Saints Arrive","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han and Zhu Dongkui clashed fiercely.","After Ding Shu, Ling Han encountered another opponent that could be considered troublesome.","Zhu Dongkui was extremely strong, and his power was only slightly inferior to Ling Han’s. However, he had grasped the Imperial Technique, as well as the Imperial Scroll. This was enough to increase his battle prowess by nine Heavens!","As for Ling Han?","Even if he channelled the Imperial Technique, it could only increase his battle prowess by seven Heavens.","With this addition and decrease, it was shockingly Zhu Dongkui’s battle prowess that was slightly over one Heaven stronger than Ling Han.","Ling Han was instantly suppressed.","What!","The little azure dragon and the large black dog both paled. This was the first time they had seen Ling Han being suppressed in a battle of equals.","What kind of existence had this Zhu Dongkui been all those years ago? He was really too strong, wasn’t he?","—This was definitely not a real person. Even the Ancestral King only had a lifespan of 10 million years. Even if he lived a second life, it would only be 20 million years, at most, which was still a long way off 100 million years.","Thus, this Zhu Dongkui should have been transformed from the thought of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.","Yi, could it be that he was an opponent on the Holy Emperor’s Imperial Path from long ago?","With this in mind, the little azure dragon and the large black dog inhaled sharply at the same time. At that time, this Great Emperor’s journey was really too bumpy, wasn’t it? Even his opponent was so powerful.","If even the Holy Emperor’s opponent from all those years ago couldn’t be razed to the ground, then what right did he have to obtain the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor?","F***, this was too freakish.","Yet Ling Han’s fighting spirit soared. This opponent was strong enough, so he should be able to unleash his full potential and temper himself.","Weng! The murderous aura surged forth.","However, this was completely ineffective.","Ling Han finally understood. His opponent wasn’t a real person, and he was only formed from a sliver of intent from the Ancestral King. Thus, he naturally wouldn’t be struck by the murderous aura. He already had this guess, and unleashing the murderous aura attack was only to prove it.","Similarly, he could not weaken his opponent’s battle prowess either, for the same reason.","However, his ability to neutralize attacks would not be affected, because this originated from himself, and would not change based on whether his opponent was human or otherwise.","Thus, though Zhu Dongkui’s battle prowess was over one Heaven stronger than him, he could only suppress him for a while, but could not wound him at all.","Both sides were still evenly matched.","“Yi, you actually cultivated this kind of Mystical Power!” Zhu Dongkui showed a hint of surprise, “Hahaha, you really gave me a shock!”","Ling Han’s attacks changed drastically. It was clear that his techniques were unchanged, but there was a natural charm to them. Every move and every form was filled with ethereality.","“Haha, a pleasant surprise, this is really a pleasant surprise!” Zhu Dongkui laughed loudly, “You have already begun to walk your own path, which is something to be happy about! However, this path is long, and filled with deviations, so it is not easy to walk.”","Ling Han smiled. This was natural. If they had a peaceful journey, how could there only be one Great Emperor in an era?","“Let me experience the might of a descendant like you.” Zhu Dongkui’s aura also changed.","Previously, though he was strong, his moves were actually a little stiff. It was as if he had only brought the powerful Imperial Technique here, and his own comprehension was not included in it. But now, he seemed to have walked his own path just like Ling Han.","Every move and action was filled with intelligence.","His battle prowess had increased inconceivably.","How many?","Three Heavens!","Hiss!","In his hands, the Imperial Technique could actually increase might by twelve Heavens.","This was practically inconceivable. It was as if this Imperial Technique was created by him, so it could unleash its strongest might.","No way?","A deduction rose up in Ling Han’s heart, but his fighting spirit did not weaken in the slightest. Instead, it became even higher.","Defeating this kind of opponent would be more interesting.","Furthermore, even if Zhu Dongkui’s battle prowess had increased further by three Heavens, he was still within the range of Ling Han’s abilities. He could not be wounded at all, and was only being suppressed even more thoroughly.","“The Primal Chaos Regulations is indeed powerful!” Zhu Dong Kui exclaimed ruefully. “But it’s really strange. Without becoming an Ancestral King, how did you manage to grasp this kind of supreme Regulations?”","He appeared slightly puzzled.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, “Senior, my ability to disperse attacks is Primal Chaos Regulations?”","“That’s right. This is the strongest path of defense in the world.” Zhu Dongkui nodded, and couldn’t help but grin widely and laugh loudly, “Strange, strange, really strange. What kind of freak are you, brat?”","The two of them continued to battle. However, one had the advantage in battle prowess, while the other had an invincible defense. In a battle at the same cultivation level, it was truly too difficult to determine the victor.","Of course, this was unless one side was completely exhausted.","Ling Han used all his ultimate moves, one after another, but even the Imperial Technique was like child’s play in front of Zhu Dongkui. He could easily unravel it, and it was completely ineffective.","“Haha, found it!” There was a loud laugh, and seven Saints appeared at the same time, floating in midair. The Regulations all turned into golden lotuses, auspicious clouds, fortune clouds, and the like, supporting them.","Aside from the seven Saints, there was also a large group of their juniors.","“Come over here!” The Fire Leaving Saint was the first to move, grabbing out at Ling Han.","“Hahaha, to dare make a move in front of me, Zhu Dongkui, are you tired of living?” Zhu Dongkui cast Ling Han aside, and stepped forwards to greet the Fire Leaving Saint.","Pa! He lashed out with his palm, instantly blocking the Fire Leaving Saint’s attack. In fact, the strike still had some energy left, and continued to attack the Fire Leaving Saint.","The Fire Leaving Saint unleashed another strike, and only then did the might of this strike completely dissipate.","He couldn’t help but feel astonished. This person was actually a Saint?","But you are a great Saint, so what the heck do you mean by exchanging blows with a True Self Tier?","“Friend, may I ask how should I address you?” the Fire Leaving Saint asked.","“Are you stupid!” Zhu Dongkui rebuked. He had introduced himself right off the bat.","The Fire Leaving Saint naturally knew that his opponent was called Zhu Dongkui. However, he didn’t have any recollection of this name, so he asked Zhu Dongkui how he should be addressed. This question was about the title of a Saint.","His expression changed drastically. As a Saint, he had actually been insulted?","Moreover, he was a Saint of the Imperial Clan!","“Friend, you’ve gone too far!” he said balefully.","Zhu Dongkui laughed loudly, “I am responsible for standing guard here. Whoever comes, I will treat them the same. If they can take a hundred moves from me, they would be able to pass.”","Ling Han was instantly speechless, “Senior, didn’t you say that I would only be able to pass if I defeated you?”","“Oh, that was just teasing you,” Zhu Dongkui said casually.","What the heck!","Ling Han felt like he was about to go crazy. Was this very fun? Very fun!","“All right, then let this Saint experience a few moves from my friend,” the Fire Leaving Saint said calmly. He pressed down with his palm again, and lotus flowers bloomed all over the sky. The Regulations of heaven and earth appeared, turning into tens of thousands of divine chains that descended down on Zhu Dongkui.","“Too weak!” Zhu Dongkui humphed, and with a casual wave of his hand, the heaven and earth immediately regained its clarity.","Hiss!","The seven Saints inhaled sharply at the same time, a stunned expression on their faces.","They were both Four-Star Saints, but Zhu Dongkui’s grasp of Regulations was forcibly much higher than the Fire Leaving Saint.","“Humph!” The Fire Leaving Saint made another move. This time, he was serious.","Hong, a fire dragon appeared, completely made up of Regulations of Fire, roaring towards Zhu Dongkui.","Ling Han was stunned. The might of this fire dragon was only slightly inferior to the complete Heavenly Dao Flames. It could burn even Saints to death."]},{"number":4214,"title":"Chapter 4214: Suppressing Saints","paragraphs":["Chapter 4214: Suppressing Saints","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhu Dongkui strode forwards, and greeted the fire dragon. He grabbed hold of the fire dragon in a single move, then exerted force with both hands. Pa, this fire dragon was forcibly torn apart by him.","F***, this was too violent, wasn’t it?","Ling Han felt his head go numb from watching. Just how strong was this Zhu Dongkui?","No, no, no, this Zhu Dongkui should have been formed from a sliver of intent from the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. Even a sliver of intent was so powerful. It was really unimaginable just how powerful this Holy Emperor had once been.","Zhu Dongkui threw away the fire dragon, and continued to charge towards the Fire Leaving Saint. Brandishing his palms, endless Regulations turned into swords that shot towards the Fire Leaving Saint.","Just how strong was he?","In the case of True Self Tier, the Imperial Technique could unleash a battle prowess of 12 Heavens in his hands. In the case of Saint Tier, this similarly far surpassed the standard battle prowess.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","In just a few moves, the Fire Leaving Saint was suppressed. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, Zhu Dongkui was unbelievably strong.","It was only seventeen moves, and Zhu Dongkui shot out a kick, and the Fire Leaving Saint was sent flying.","The Fire Leaving Saint steadied himself. There was a trace of blood at the corner of his lips, and there was a footprint on his chest. Compared to the holy image of a lotus blooming beneath his feet, and auspicious red clouds entwined all over his body, this was incredibly obvious.","“Next,” Zhu Dongkui said calmly.","The Fire Leaving Saint had been defeated, and he had only used 17 moves.","No wonder Zhu Dongkui dared to say that as long as one could last a hundred moves from him, he would be able to pass. Just how difficult was that?","It should be known that those that could become Saints, which one of them was not a prodigy among prodigies?","The remaining six Saints remained silent. Their battle prowess was not much different from the Fire Leaving Saint. Whether they were stronger or weaker, the difference was extremely small. Thus, the Fire Leaving Saint had lost in 17 moves. If it was them, the result would also be similar.","Then what need was there to seek his own humiliation?","However, the inheritance of the Great Emperor was given up just like that?","“Humph, I haven’t lost yet!” The Fire Leaving Saint summoned his Imperial Weapon. ‘F*ck! I’m a member of the Imperial Clan. With the Imperial Weapon in my hands, I’m the strongest in the world, so why do I have to abide by your rules?’","Zhu Dongkui swept an eye over it, and said, “Imperial Weapon!”","“That’s right!” the Fire Leaving Saint said coldly. “Hand over the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being ruthless!”","“Hahahaha!” Zhu Dongkui laughed loudly, as if there was no one else present. It was as if he did not take the Fire Leaving Saint seriously at all.","This caused the Fire Leaving Saint to feel even more furious. He was wielding the Imperial Weapon, and in an era when there were no Emperor in the world, he could be considered the strongest.","You dare to look down on me?","Weng, the Imperial Weapon immediately revived, emitting an Imperial Might that was indescribably terrifying.","The Great Emperor was invincible in the world.","“I’ll ask you again. Where is the inheritance of the Holy Emperor?”","Zhu Dongkui bared his teeth in a grin, and actually took the initiative to charge out. His palms struck out rapidly, blasting towards the Fire Leaving Saint.","This was his answer.","“You’re seeking death!” the Fire Leaving Saint said with a cold chuckle. He brandished the Jade Water Sword, unleashing an incredibly bright slash. It was as if it could even illuminate the darkest corner of the universe.","The Imperial Weapon unleashed its might, slashing towards a Saint. What suspense was there left in this?","The Rainbow Light Saint and the others all shook their heads. They felt that Zhu Dongkui was truly unreasonably arrogant, yet the result was him seeking his own demise.","Guang!","A sound rang out, like the beginning of the universe, resounding throughout the world.","What!","Everyone couldn’t help but feel numb, because they saw an inconceivable scene.","—Zhu Dongkui stretched out his right hand, and blocked the Jade Water Sword.","‘F*ck! That’s an Imperial Weapon! A genuine Imperial Weapon isn’t a replica!’","This strike from the Imperial Weapon was equivalent to the attack of a Great Emperor. Which Saint could withstand it?","Everyone could clearly see that there were Regulations floating on Zhu Dongkui’s right hand, and there was also a dark yellow high-level energy. It was the compounding of these two powers that had blocked the Imperial Weapon.","It should be known that why was the Imperial Weapon so powerful that it could kill Saints?","That was because after the Imperial Weapon had been refined by the Great Emperor, it could stimulate the Regulations of the highest level, and suppress any opponent with Regulations. Whether you are a Saint or not, you would only be turned into dust!","However, Zhu Dongkui was actually able to stimulate the highest level Regulations. This naturally gave him the ability to oppose the Imperial Weapon, and the nine-star high-level energy cancelled out the destructive power of the Imperial Weapon itself, reaching a perfect balance.","All of a sudden, all the Saints were trembling.","To parry an Imperial Weapon with his bare hands, what kind of freak was this?","Only an Ancestral King could do this!","—They actually took the initiative to provoke an Ancestral King. Wasn’t that just seeking their own death?","At that time, Buddha Doga was only a Pseudo-Emperor, and he had practically slaughtered all the Saints in the world. If an Ancestral King appeared, Saints? Even if all the Saints of all the Imperial Clans came with their Imperial Weapons, they would only be defeated by the Ancestral King, one after another.","The fact that a Great Emperor was invincible was definitely not just empty words.","However, how could a Great Emperor appear from within the corpse of a Holy Emperor?","Hiss!","All of a sudden, the Saints understood.","“This is the manifestation of the Holy Emperor’s divine sense!”","No wonder he was overwhelmingly powerful. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, even the Saint had been defeated by him in seventeen moves. It should be known that the Imperial Son was synonymous with being invincible among his peers, then what about the true Great Emperor?","“Greetings, Lord Holy Emperor!” The seven Saints bowed at the same time, and those juniors of the Imperial Clans all knelt down.","The Great Emperor stood high above the Nine Heavens, and the rest were mediocre. No one could stand on equal footing with them.","“Hahaha, what Holy Emperor? I am Zhu Dongkui !” Zhu Dongkui casually shook his hand, and the Jade Water Sword bounced back. He stood, arms crossed behind his back, his expression enchanting.","Unfortunately, everyone knew that this was only formed from a sliver of divine sense of the Holy Emperor. Following the appearance of the Holy Emperor’s corpse, this sliver of divine sense would most likely begin to dissipate as well. It definitely wouldn’t last long.","The power of heaven and earth naturally had its own channeling rhythm. When a person died, their Dao would disappear. This was something that even the Great Emperor’s power could not change.","“If you want to pass, you only need to block a hundred moves from me.” Zhu Dongkui laughed loudly. Actually, there was clearly nothing funny about this, but he just liked to laugh.","The Saints were still fine, but those juniors were all grinning. Because they knew that they could not laugh, fearing that they would anger the embodiment of this Holy Emperor, they were holding back very hard, even tearing up.","“Senior, what about us?” Ling Han asked.","“Oh, you guys have passed.” With a casual wave of Zhu Dongkuii’s hand, shua, Ling Han and the others were swept up by him, turning into a ball of light. Xiu, they flew off to who knows where.","The seven Saints didn’t dare to stop him. The Holy Emperor was right in front of them, so even if this was just a sliver of divine sense, who would dare to mess around?","They did indeed have the Imperial Weapons in their possession, but at most, it was only for self-protection. They wanted to suppress a Holy Emperor?","You’ve got to be joking, right?","“We definitely can’t block a hundred moves from a Holy Emperor.”","“Go and call the Golden Generation over. They all have the potential to become Emepror, so they should be able to stop him.”","“Agreed!”","The seven Saints all nodded. If the Golden Generation could not even block a hundred moves from the Holy Emperor, then what right would they have to attempt the Imperial Path?","They first exited the corpse of the Holy Emperor. This place had completely blocked the Galaxy Network’s signal, so they definitely had to leave first.","“Quick, those three juniors are already aheadof us.”","“Is the Buddhist Race so lucky this time? They actually found such an outstanding talent!”","“Should we suppress them?”","“The waters of the Buddhist Race are very deep, but as long as we don’t trifle with the Buddhist Race from outside the 33 Heavens, it’s fine. As for the Buddhist Race from the four Heavenly Realms, it’s fine to suppress them for a bit.”"]},{"number":4215,"title":"Chapter 4215: Longing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4215: Longing","Ling Han and the others were enveloped by a streak of light, and began to traverse at an extremely fast speed.","They could see very clearly that the three of them had passed through the right arm of the corpse of the Holy Emperor and arrived in the left arm.","Then, they discovered that this was another scene of lush mountains and clear waters.","It was ordinary and unremarkable, just like before.","“Come, continue scouting the way with your tortoise shell,” the large black dog said.","Their speed was far inferior to that of Saints. Thus, if they wanted to explore this place once, they would need at least ten days to half a month, and in the case of Saints, they probably wouldn’t even need half a day’s time.","Thus, the tortoise shell’s guidance was extremely crucial to them.","Weng, after rubbing on the blood, the tortoise shell began to glow again.","“Look, your blood hasn’t gone to waste, right?” the large black dog said to the little azure dragon as he pointed at the tortoise shell.","“Get lost!” The little azure dragon’s expression was dark. He actually dared to talk about this with him.","They followed the light, and after another three days, they finally arrived at the finishing line. This time, the light was pointing at the summit.","They left, and had not taken a few steps, when a strong longing surged up in his heart. Ling Han couldn’t help but think of the empress, Hu Niu and the other beautiful wives, as well as Ling Jianxue, Ling Xi, and his other children.","“Flower underpants, white underpants, black underpants...” Meanwhile, the large black dog’s eyes were hazy, and it felt like it was about to cry.","“Father!” The little azure dragon’s face was also filled with longing.","F***, he had been affected again!","“An... Ma... Ni... Ba... Mi... Gu...!” Ling Han immediately shouted out the Six Characters Bright King Curse loudly, which was thought-provoking, directly penetrating into the depths of the mind.","The three of them were startled at the same time, and the longing that lingered in their hearts instantly dispersed.","“It made people laugh before, but this place makes people involuntarily miss the treasures in their hearts,” Ling Han said with a frown.","“Haha, Old Black, so the most precious thing in your heart is actually your underpants!” The little azure dragon laughed loudly.","Yet the large black dog was unconcerned, and swayed his behind, “Otherwise, what do you think?”","The little azure dragon hurriedly used its claws to block in front of its face, saying, “Stop swaying. Grandpa Dragon doesn’t have a dog’s eyes, so I’m going to go blind!” It was also rendered speechless. At first, it had thought that it had grasped a sore point of the large black dog. Unexpectedly, the large black dog was completely shameless, and this couldn’t do anything to it at all.","The three of them all recited the six words of the ‘Six Characters Bright King Curse’ in their minds, and then headed up the mountain.","It wasn’t long before they arrived at the summit.","There was a person seated here. Her hair was extremely long, and her back was slender. It should be a woman.","“Senior.” Ling Han spoke up.","This person stood up, her figure graceful, her figure enchanting, but when she turned around, Ling Han, Ling Han and the others were all gaping widely.","That was because this was not a woman, but rather a man.","However, he was really handsome, and was filled with a feminine air. Thus, from the back, one would completely misunderstand his gender.","“Sigh, long-lasting yearning, short-lasting yearning, yearning brings calamity,” this effeminate man said slowly. Even his voice was very neutral. Without looking at his face, it was completely impossible to distinguish whether he was male or female.","“Greetings, Senior,” Ling Han clasped his hands and said. This should also be a manifestation of a sliver of divine sense from the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.","“Block a hundred moves from me. If you succeed, you will pass, but if you fail, you will die,” the feminine man said.","Alright, though he was a little feminine, he was at least more honest, and was much better than Zhu Dongkui.","Ling Han stepped forward and said, “Please provide guidance, Senior.”","“Humph, I’ll choose!” the feminine man said. He then pointed at the large black dog, and said, “You go first.”","“Ah?” The large black dog gritted his teeth. He was the first?","It was slightly anxious. This was manifested from a sliver of thought of the Holy Emperor. Though his personality was completely different from the previous Zhu Dongkui, it was sure that his abilities would not be much different.","Furthermore, this guy was too vicious. He would die if he could not block hundred moves from him. That was too dangerous, wasn’t it?","“Can Little Black choose not to fight?” the large black dog asked cautiously.","“Those who I call out will be killed,” the feminine man stated calmly, his face filled with longing again.","Helpless, the large black dog had no choice but to step forward and say, “Senior, you have to be gentle. Little Black can’t withstand any damage!”","Ling Han and the little azure dragon felt like throwing up. This large black dog was far too","shameless.","The feminine man did not speak further, and immediately charged over.","The large black dog let out a strange cry, and brandished his paws to parry.","It was actually not weak. For better or worse, it was a Nine Cauldrons Fusion Cauldron. Furthermore, it had also cultivated Body Art and Imperial Technique, so its battle prowess was stronger than even a great many Imperial Sons.","Thus, even though the feminine man was incredibly powerful, it was still extremely difficult for him to defeat the large black dog in 100 moves at the same cultivation level.","The large black dog was riddled with wounds, yet he finally managed to withstand 100 strikes. “Scram!” The feminine man kicked the large black dog, sending him flying.","“Next, you.” The feminine man pointed at the little azure dragon.","“Come!” Though the little azure dragon had a bad mouth, it was only verbal. It was still very headstrong, and immediately charged towards the effeminate man.","He didn’t launch a long-distance attack. Instead, he directly rammed into him, making full use of Body Arts’s advantage.","“En?” The feminine man appeared slightly surprised, but as he delivered a palm strike, the power of his strike instantly increased further.","F***, fighting with the people here, Body Arts did not actually have an advantage, because if you used the power of Body Arts, your opponent would also use it, or not use it at all.","Boom!","In terms of power, the little azure dragon was evenly matched with its opponent, but when it came to Imperial Technique, the little azure dragon was far inferior.","Thankfully, there was only a gap of two Heavens.","The little azure dragon’s physique was sturdy, and it could withstand blows. The gap of two Heavens of battle prowess could only suppress him, but couldn’t cause serious injury.","Of course, this was only because the effeminate man hadn’t truly become serious yet. Otherwise, if the Imperial Technique unleashed might of 12 Heavens, the little azure dragon would probably be severely wounded in an instant. After all, he didn’t have the ability to","disperse attacks.","Very quickly, a hundred moves had passed, and the little azure dragon had also withstood it. “You.” The feminine man finally pointed at Ling Han.","Ling Han gave a soft shout, and unleashed his full battle prowess as he charged towards his","opponent.","The feminine man gave another ‘yi’. He had not thought that these every single person from these three “people” would actually be stronger than the last. At this time, he instead showed a smile, and waved his hands. His battle prowess had suddenly increased greatly. Sure enough, the stronger one was, the stronger he would be.","This should also be formed from a sliver of intent from the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. However, his battle style was completely different from Zhu Dongkui’s. He was more skilled in close-quarter combat. His arms, elbows, and knees had all become his weapons, and if one was hit, it would be like being hit by the Origin Gold, so the destructive power was practically","off the charts.","Even if Ling Han’s physique was tough, and he could still dissolve the power, he still felt extremely pained after being elbowed and bumped a few times like this.","Most importantly, in his hands, the Imperial Technique could unleash a might that surpassed","100%.","Perhaps, this was the true might of the Imperial Technique.","Ling Han thought internally. The Imperial Technique had been created by the Great Emperor,","and only the Great Emperor could truly unleash its full might, because that was a path that the Great Emperor had personally created.","Without this kind of comprehension, how could the Imperial Technique unleash its pinnacle","might?","Boom, the feminine man was incredibly aggressive. As his figure rose into the air, four streaks of light shot out from his body, turning into Dragon, Tiger, Vermillion Bird, Black Tortoise, and charged towards Ling Han."]},{"number":4216,"title":"Chapter 4216: Imperial Son Xuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4216: Imperial Son Xuan","Editor: Henyee Translations","No matter how one looked at it, this effeminate man had cultivated the First Form of the True Self Tier to perfection. If there was anything lacking, it was that his Body Art was slightly inferior to Ling Han, and his mystical power was also slightly inferior, but with the boost of the Imperial Technique, his battle prowess completely overwhelmed Ling Han.","Boom, the Divine Beasts, the Azure Dragon, the White Tiger, the Vermillion Bird, the Black Tortoise were all formed from Regulations as their bones, with high-level energy as their bodies. Their divine might was awe-inspiring, and they possessed incredibly terrifying destructive power.","If it was the little azure dragon or the large black dog, they would probably have been defeated long ago. Even if the little azure dragon’s physique was extremely tough, it wouldn’t be able to withstand it. After all, the gap between their battle prowess was too wide.","However, Ling Han could disperse all attacks within a gap of six Heavens. This kind of attack could only cause him light injury, but could not cause him serious injury.","The battle was incredibly intense, but in truth, it was difficult to decide the victor.","Ling Han used this feminine man as a whetstone, and continued to walk his own path.","Previously, he had also considered Zhu Dongkui as a qualified rival, but it was a pity that he had been interrupted by the seven Saints while he was still fighting. He hoped that he could improve further this time round.","Not long after, the hundred moves were completed, but Ling Han didn’t stop. The feminine man also didn’t stop, and the two of them were still fighting extremely intensely.","Ling Han was filled with enlightenment. He was no longer limited to the Imperial Techniques, Saint Techniques and Venerate Tier Techniques. He could use whatever he wanted, as he willed it, but his battle prowess was steadily improving.","Why were Zhu Dongkui and the feminine man so strong?","Because they had all walked their own paths, and that was why the celestial technique used from their hands was able to be so powerful.","As expected, what truly belonged to one would be the very strongest.","Of course, the truly powerful ones weren’t Zhu Dongkui and the feminine man, but rather the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. All of this was formed from his divine sense.","Ling Han had only taken a small step on this path, but compared with countless prodigies, he was already far, far ahead.","—Most prodigies would never be able to take this step in their entire lifetime.","It should be known that taking the first step was actually the most difficult.","Ling Han already had a clear plan. He would first merge various techniques, then take advantage of their strengths to make up for their weaknesses, and refine the celestial technique that truly belonged to him.","Actually, he had already walked this kind of path before, when he was in the Genesis World. However, the two were completely different systems of power, with different Regulations of heaven and earth. There was not much reference value.","However, since he had a successful experience, would this still be difficult for Ling Han?","At this moment, he couldn’t help but think, ‘What about Ding Shu?’","The other party should also be like him, the overlord of a Genesis World. Then, he must have also walked his own path, and reached the peak of the world.","Thus, though Ding Shu had yet to walk his own path in this world, he was sure that this would not trouble him for too long.","Moreover, he also possessed the Imperial Scroll!","Ling Han felt pressured, but this caused his fighting spirit to soar, filled with motivation.","He felt that he had made some progress again, but just how difficult was the Imperial Path? Furthermore, he was only a True Self Tier cultivator. Thus, this progress was extremely negligible.","Yet Ling Han was satisfied. The difficulty of the Imperial Path was so great that even top grade Saints would find it difficult to make the slightest progress. Looking at the whole world, it was clear from just how few Pseudo-Emperors there were, that even if the heaven and earth did not allow the appearance of a new Ancestral King, it was still difficult for top grade Saints to become Pseudo-Emperors.","Weng, a powerful aura suddenly appeared.","Ling Han was shocked, and suddenly stopped.","When he stopped, the feminine man also stopped, and turned his head to look.","A man in a golden robe appeared in the sky above the mountain peak. He looked to be in his early twenties, and his features were sharp and angular.","Sect Master level!","Ling Han used his eye technique to scan over him, and couldn’t help but feel shocked.","He was too young!","Though it was a piece of cake for cultivators to change their appearance at will and make themselves young, under normal circumstances, who would do that?","The most important thing for cultivators was their abilities, and their cultivation level, not their looks.","Looking around the world, what Sect Master wasn’t a white-haired and white-bearded elite?","This man now looked to be only in his early twenties, which meant that he was at the peak of his life, and was at the prime of his vitality. In future, he would still be able to shine for quite a long time.","This astonished Ling Han. He was too young.","Moreover, there were dragons and phoenixes intertwined on this man’s shoulders, and there was also divine springs surging beneath his feet. Ling Han had never seen such a strange phenomenon before.","“Oh, his Regulations is close to perfection!” The effeminate man showed a hint of admiration, but it was only for an instant. He was filled with melancholy again, exuding a strong longing.","The golden-robed man did not even cast a second look at Ling Han. That was a kind of disdain that came from deep within his bones. He was like a True Dragon that could move unhindered in the Nine Heavens. Would he even cast a second look at an ant on the ground?","“Senior, this junior is Lin Xuan. Please provide guidance,” he said to the feminine man. He bowed slightly, and put on a respectful attitude.","—This was the divine sense of a Great Emperor.","Lin Xuan!","Ling Han was shocked. This guy was Imperial Son, the strongest Imperial Son of the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan, one of the Golden Generation.","He thought of the gentle man’s evaluation of Lin Xuan: Regulations was close to perfection!","Hiss, from the True Self Tier onwards, one would start cultivating Regulations. This guy had cultivated Regulations to near perfection, so his battle prowess was naturally terrifying.","Ling Han had seen a member of the Golden Generation before, but he had never fought him before. The True Dragon Abyss did not allow it, so Ling Han had no way to judge the overall strength of the Golden Generation, but the words “Regulations was close to perfection” was enough to show the freakish talent of the Golden Generation.","Moreover, the Golden Generation didn’t have any shortcomings, and they were nurtured with the power of their entire clan. Not only were they skilled in cultivation, but they were also extremely powerful in Body Art.","Ling Han had killed Lin Lang. If the latter knew his true identity, this guy would probably make a move.","—After the seven Saints entered, the little azure dragon and the large black dog had changed their appearances again.","The feminine man nodded, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han and the others first. Xiu, the three of them were wrapped in a streak of light, and began to traverse at extreme speed.","Then, he charged towards Lin Xuan.","Xiu, Ling Han and the others traversed through the Great Emperor’s corpse at an extremely fast speed. This time, they travelled from his left arm to his left leg.","The environment here was different. It was foggy, and visibility was extremely low.","“I wonder what’s going on with the people standing guard here,” the large black dog mumbled. “One moment, they’re laughing, and the next, they’re filled with melancholy. They’re all freaks.”","Ling Han had been walking, yet he suddenly stopped in his tracks. “Old Black, what did you say just then?”","“They’re all freaks?”","“No, the first line.”","“One moment you’re smiling, and the next moment you’re filled with melancholy?” The large black dog was slightly confused. ‘Why are you asking this?’","Ling Han pondered for a moment. After a while, he asked, “Don’t you guys find this strange?”","“Strange, of course it’s strange.” The little azure dragon immediately said, “We’re inside the body of a Holy Emperor, so don’t you think it’s strange?”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Although the two people who guarded the entrance were both very strong, and were in fact so strong that no one could defeat them, it was precisely because of this that the problem arose.”","“What problem?”","“Their battle prowess is practically equal, then what is the difference between passing a stage and passing a few stages?”"]},{"number":4217,"title":"Chapter 4217: Seven Emotions","paragraphs":["Chapter 4217: Seven Emotions","Editor: Henyee Translations","The large black dog scratched his head, “Little Han, what do you want to say? Why doesn’t Grandpa Dog understand?”","“According to my estimation, there are seven suns here, and that probably corresponds to seven places, all of which are guarded,” Ling Han said. “If the abilities tested on every stage are different, then it would be meaningful.”","“The problem is, though the person guarding the stage is extremely strong, and has practically reached the strongest level in a single cultivation level, the test is still to block a hundred moves. Then what is the significance of passing seven stages and passing the first stage?”","“Eh?” The little azure dragon and the large black dog exchanged a look, both feeling a little strange.","That’s right, what was the meaning of this?","If one could pass the first stage, they would definitely be able to pass the second and third stages. Then, to say nothing of seven stages, even seven hundred stages would be the same.","“Furthermore, we have also fallen into a misconception.” Ling Han continued, “We have obtained the tortoise shell, and this is the key to opening Needless Mountains. Thus, we naturally think that the treasure should belong to us, and we should also be in the lead.”","“Isn’t it?” The large black dog was confused.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “We can only say that we were lucky to obtain these two tortoise shells. However, the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor is looking for a successor, so how can it be that his successor only needs to be lucky enough?”","Hearing his words, the little azure dragon and the large black dog were both unsure.","If the only requirement was just luck, the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor would have been able to pick an heir when he was still alive. He could simply toss the Imperial Scroll and Imperial Technique over. In any case, there was no need for him to teach them.","“Little Han, you are almost driving Grandpa Dog crazy. What’s your focus?” the large black dog sighed.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “I’ll give you guys a hint. First, it’s happiness, followed by longing, and then there are a total of seven stages.”","“Pei, that was clearly Grandpa Dog’s words,” the large black dog called out. Previously, Ling Han had a flash of inspiration, and that was precisely because he had heard his muttering.","An idea came to the little azure dragon, and it said, “Could it be that the emotions of anger, sorrow, grief and others would follow?”","“Probably.” Ling Han nodded.","“Seven Emotions and Six Desires!” The large black dog also came to a realization1.","“That’s right,” Ling Han said darkly. “Zhu Dongkui represents joy, and the second man represents longing, which is two of the seven emotions. I believe that the remaining five should be next.”","“Even so, what does that mean?” the large black dog asked.","Weng! Right at this moment, a powerful divine sense suddenly swept over.","Without another word, Ling Han directly grabbed the little azure dragon and the large black dog, using the Imminent Skyline to cover a distance. Then, he drew out the Void Beast hide, enshrouding all three of them.","Xiu, a figure appeared. It was Lin Xuan.","He stood with his arms crossed behind his back. Dragons and phoenixes intertwined, and an underground spring gushed out. The phenomenon was astonishing, but his handsome face was emotionless, only filled with endless coldness. He swept his gaze around, and his eyes actually shot out golden light.","As the golden light swept over them, the Regulations of heaven and earth were actually outlined, displaying their profoundness.","This was far too astonishing. Even Saints would covet such a Mystical Power.","“Not here?” Lin Xuan murmured. He clearly sensed that there were three living beings here, but he rushed over at the first instant, yet actually didn’t find anyone.","He frowned slightly, but immediately stretched out his brow again. With a single step, he was already boundlessly far away.","“You guys are lucky.” Only the lingering sound echoed.","In the distance, Ling Han and the others appeared.","“F***, this old brat wants to kill us?” The large black dog jumped up. Just now, Lin Xuan was filled with killing intent.","“Naturally,” Ling Han said with a nod. “Right now, we’re fighting over the Imperial Scroll. If we’re killed, he’ll have three fewer competitors.”","“We are members of the Buddhist Tribe, and he dares to make a move?” The large black dog was still slightly disbelieving.","“He naturally wouldn’t dare to touch the real Buddha Son.” Ling Han shook his head, and said, “However, the Buddha Sons of the East, South, West and North Heavenly Realms... Heh, strictly speaking, they’re not much different from the Holy Lands.”","“Moreover, this can also be considered a Mystery Realm. As long as he doesn’t say anything, who would dare to say that he is the murderer?”","The large black dog slapped his thigh, “F***, this old brat is too despicable. We didn’t steal his sister’s underpants, did he have to be so ruthless?”","Ling Han did not speak. The Golden Generation was aiming to become Emperor, and no matter how stunningly talented you were, only one Ancestral King would appear in each generation. Whoever managed to snatch this great fortune of heaven and earth, the others could only withdraw dejectedly.","Thus, when Lin Xuan thought that Ling Han and the others had a chance of competing for the throne, he decided to eliminate the three of them in advance.","“Imperial Clan Clan! Imperial Clan! F*ck, when Grandpa Dog becomes an Emperor, I’ll erase all of them!” the large black dog said in displeasure. “The world is so chaotic, and just because of the existence of these Imperial Clans, they think they’re superior to others, causing the world to be unjust.”","Ling Han nodded. However, as long as one was a human, they would have their own selfish motives. Even if this generation completely suppressed the Imperial Clans, what about the future?","There was no Great Emperor that could eternally rule the world. Thus, after the dynasty changed, the new Great Emperor would naturally still leave behind a new Imperial Clan, beginning a new cycle.","“Forget it, let’s not discuss this.” He waved his hand, “If we continue fighting like this, we probably won’t get any results. Instead, it will increase the danger.”","“Brat, what you mean is that the main focus of the Imperial Scroll inheritance is on the issue that we had previously discussed?” the large black dog asked doubtfully.","“I think so. Of course, it is also possible that after passing seven stages, you would be able to obtain the Imperial Scroll.” Ling Han said with a smile.","The large black dog almost went crazy. “Brat, can you say something for certain?”","Ling Han shrugged and said, “I’m not the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor, so how can I give you a guarantee?”","“All right. Even if we know that the seven stages represent seven different emotions, so what?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, “Whether it’s Zhu Dongkui or the man from the second stage, they’re all manifestations of a sliver of divine sense from the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. Does this mean that the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor severed the thought that represented his seven emotions?”","“Oh my goodness, without emotions, what meaning would there be?” The large black dog immediately stuck out his tongue.","“Every Great Emperor has walked their own path. Who knows, this Holy Emperor may be the one to sever his emotions and become an Emperor?” Ling Han said with a smile.","“So you’re saying that we also have to sever our seven emotions to be able to obtain the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor?” the little azure dragon interrupted.","“Not necessarily.” Ling Han shook his head.","“F***, if you continue to talk nonsense, do you believe that Grandpa Dog will bite you?” The large black dog was about to go crazy.","“You guys wait for a while.”","Ling Han retrieved his tortoise shell and pulled it over his head.","Yi, what are you doing?","“Little Han, do you want to pretend to be Celestial Turtle?” the little azure dragon immediately said with a smile.","Ling Han ignored him. He had already entered into the space inside the tortoise shell, and that familiar galaxy appeared once more.","He began to accumulate his emotions, and imagined how Zhu Dongkui would look like. Then, he laughed loudly, his whole person surrounded by joyful emotions.","At the beginning, he had done it on purpose, but after releasing his emotions, he was really laughing out loud. It was purely natural.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Instantly, several streaks of light shot over and landed on him."]},{"number":4218,"title":"Chapter 4218: Getting a feel for the way","paragraphs":["Chapter 4218: Getting a feel for the way","It was effective!","Ling Han stopped, and he went back to thinking about the feminine man’s appearance. Instantly, feelings of longing enveloped Ling Han like rain.","He missed the empress, Hu Niu, as well as his family and friends that were still in the Genesis World inside his body. There was not the slightest bit of falsehood.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Another few streaks of light shot over.","Ling Han wanted to continue, and follow up with grief.","He thought about how his family and friends had still died from old age and illness along the way. He thought about how a dimension in the Genesis World had been devoured by Hysteria, and millions and millions of living beings had suffered. He was both furious and sorrowful.","However, this did not stimulate the light.","“Could it be that we definitely have to pass through those few stages?” Ling Han murmured. In the next instant, Ling Han retreated out of the world inside the tortoise shell.","“Little Han, what did you do?” the large black dog shouted. “Just now, several streaks of light shot into your body, and it was two times at that.”","“En, the second ray of light entered through your a**,” the little azure dragon interrupted. Peng, the consequence of having a bad mouth was being stomped flat.","“Little Han, Grandpa Dragon isn’t playing around with you!” he screamed.","Ling Han chuckled. This Four-Legged Snake had never learnt its lesson, and he had to teach him a lesson from time to time.","“Come, let’s continue,” he said.","“Yi, you still want to continue?” The large black dog felt that it was strange. Weren’t you the one who said that the multiple stages were meaningless?","“The situation has changed,” Ling Han said.","The three of them continued onwards. With the tortoise shell to guide them, they soon arrived at the banks of a lake. An intense battle was presently taking place here.","However, before they had even come close, a feeling of fury rose up in them, and they wanted nothing more than to blast a hole into the heaven and earth.","Fury!","Ling Han experienced this kind of fury, as he looked towards that fierce battle.","The two battling parties were an incredibly rough-looking man and a lanky man in his twenties, respectively, and it could be determined with a single glance that the rough- looking man was the guard here.","That was because his face was filled with fury, and every move he made seemed as if he wanted to take someone down with him.","The guards here were all incredibly emotional.","“Who’s that guy?” The little azure dragon pointed at the slender man.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I don’t know him. However, with a cultivation level at Sect Master-level, and with how young he is, he must be one of the members of the Golden Generation.”","“This is too shameless. Those old b@stards couldn’t compete with us, so they sent out the Golden Generation, whose cultivation level is so much higher than ours!” the large black dog said in displeasure.","As he spoke, the battle between the gruff man and the slender man had also ended. Clearly, the hundred moves were over.","The gruff man waved his hand, and the slender man was immediately swept by a ray of light, which rapidly disappeared.","“Should we wait?” The large black dog said, “Who knows, this old brat might be guarding us from the other side.”","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, “The chances of that are not very high, because Lin Xuan is already at the forefront. What this person is thinking now should be to catch up to Lin Xuan as soon as possible, and not come to snipe the three of us ‘minor characters’.”","Although this sounded extremely uncomfortable, it was very much in line with the truth. In fact, it was also beneficial to them.","“All right, let’s go.”","The three of them rushed up to fight. The little azure dragon and the large black dog went first, while Ling Han went last.","Similar to before, others would pass in 100 moves, but Ling Han didn’t have any restrictions on his techniques. As long as he wanted to, he could continue fighting.","This was possibly because he had obtained the tortoise shell.","Ling Han didn’t waste such an opportunity either. He would use this kind of elite to temper himself.","The battle continued until he was riddled with wounds, and only then did Ling Han call a halt. Then, he was sent to the next location.","Though he was sure that Imperial Son would not be guarding them here, but just to be safe, Ling Han still summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Worse come to worst, he would release the Heavenly Dao Flames. Who cares if you are Imperial Son or not, I will burn you to death one by one.","But thankfully, his prediction had not been wrong. There was no one standing guard here for them.","The three of them left a little, and then Ling Han entered into the world of the tortoise shell, fully burning with anger.","In the area of fury, there was really no need to build up feelings. In an instant, he had entered into a state of fury, because he had encountered too much injustice.","-In the Genesis World, he had reached the peak, sweeping aside all enemies, but in this world, his cultivation level could not be considered very strong at all. Even if he was invincible among his peers, so what? Whether it was Spirit Transformation True Lord, Sect Master-","level, or Venerate Tier-level, they could easily defeat him.","Moreover, there was also the noble Imperial Clans, which caused him to leave the Nine Suns Holy Land, and he was forced to separate from his beautiful wives.","Xiu, several streaks of light entered his body. He had succeeded.","Ling Han retreated out of the tortoise shell world. He had an enlightenment. His previous judgement had been wrong. The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor hadn’t severed his seven emotions, but rather refined his emotions, building his emotions to the pinnacle, so his path","was based on pinnacle emotions.","This was also a kind of path to dao.","Realization dawned on him. The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor had reached the extreme both in emotion and Dao. The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor should be an extremely loyal and emotional person, and such people could only watch as their comrades aged one by one in their lifetime of battle. Yet, he still had to continue fighting. What kind of grief was this? However, the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor had spent his whole life suppressing the darkness, and this impressed Ling Han greatly. This was a great love for heaven and earth.","“Come, let’s go to the next location.”","They continued to set out, and when they were heading towards the fourth location, they sensed that a powerful aura would occasionally sweep by in the skies.","“Golden Generation!”","Ling Han and the others were all certain that it was definitely the Golden Generation that had come. Only they could withstand a hundred moves from the thought manifestations of the Holy Emperor. Otherwise, there would only be Chi Menghan, the Imperial Son from the Golden Silk Moth Clan and a few other prodigies.","Now, Ling Han and the others were already too far behind. Thus, the Golden Generation didn’t even bother with them. They were in a rush to catch up to Lin Xuan, who was at the forefront. They definitely couldn’t allow the inheritance of the Holy Emperor to fall out of their hands. If one could simultaneously cultivate two Imperial Scrolls, just how strong would he become?","It should be known that no matter how many Imperial Techniques you cultivated, the Imperial Technique would only be able to unleash its full might when boosted by the corresponding Imperial Scroll. Thus, the benefits of cultivating an additional Imperial Scroll","were obvious.","Moreover, for prodigies that were worthy of becoming Emperor, reading the Imperial Scroll was equivalent to revisiting the path that a Great Emperor had walked. Though it could not be copied, one could still obtain a great amount of experience, and the significance of reference","was too great.","This was good too. Ling Han and the others could secretly make a fortune.","A few days later, they finally found the fourth place.","This was... fear.","The moment they arrived, fear rose up from the bottoms of their hearts, as if they were about","to face an unknown prehistoric monster.","A Great Emperor could also feel fear?","This was natural. As long as they were human, how could they be unafraid?","Ling Han also felt fear. This wasn’t a humiliation. On the other hand, being ignorant and","fearless was the most fatal thing. It was possible that he wouldn’t even know how he had died.","However, people like him could overcome fear, and not be influenced by fear.","Fighting under such emotions, Ling Han and the others were slightly detained, but they","finally defeated these negative emotions, and passed the test.","At this moment, they were teleported to the lower abdomen of the corpse of the Holy","Emperor.","Ling Han entered the tortoise shell world at the first instant. He unleashed his fear, not hiding it at all, but he still overcame his fear, successfully stimulating a few more streaks of light."]},{"number":4219,"title":"Chapter 4219: Lotus Platform, Needless Mountains","paragraphs":["Chapter 4219: Lotus Platform, Needless Mountains","At this time, there was already no more Imperial Sons rushing over from behind.","The members of the Golden Generation either chose not to come here at all, or had already arrived in front of them.","Ling Han and the others were also happy to relax. There was no need for them to hide.","This fifth emotion was worry.","It was not difficult to pass, but the difficulty lay in how to express such emotions.","Whether it was positive or negative emotions, people shouldn’t be influenced.","Ling Han was naturally worried. With so many Imperial Clan elites working together to hunt him down, as well as the Battle God Palace in hot pursuit, how could he not be worried at all? However, he turned his worries into motivation.","Ling Han already understood the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s intentions. In this way, he told those who came later that people couldn’t be influenced by emotions, and they had to become the masters of their emotions.","The pinnacle lay in emotiton, and was not to be trapped in emotions.","This Holy Emperor had great intelligence.","Thinking of this, Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. What Emperor would not have great intelligence?","Fine, let’s go to the sixth stage.","The sixth stage was the chest of the Holy Emperor’s corpse, then going by that deduction, the final stage was the head of the Holy Emperor’s corpse.","Did the Holy Emperor’s Scroll exist in his mind?","Ling Han and the others were all filled with anticipation. Using the tortoise shell as a guide, they found their destination a few days later.","This was grief.","On the path of martial arts, who hadn’t sent off their family, friends, and even lovers?","To Ling Han, the emotion of grief was much weaker. Thus, he spent a very long time to capture this kind of emotion, and finally managed to stimulate the resonance of the tortoise shell.","All right, there was only the last stage left.","They arrived at the head of the Holy Emperor’s corpse. This was the seventh stage.","The moment they arrived, the three of them discovered that this was a vast ocean.","Was this the mind of the Holy Emperor?","But it should be known that once a person died, the mind would dry up, and even the Great Emperor would not be an exception. Thus, this was far from the mind of the Holy Emperor when he had been alive, but had already degenerated countless times over.","Hiss, countless years later, the mind could still be so majestic. As expected of an overlord that had suppressed an era.","Ling Han and the others were all rueful. Only Spiritual Transformation Tier elites could materialize their consciousness. If they died now, their mind would immediately die, and couldn’t be entered at all.","With the guidance of the tortoise shell, they flew on the surface of the sea. This took a few more days, and an island appeared ahead of them.","“This island is so special,” the little azure dragon said. “Why does it look a little like a lotus flower?”","“It’s a lotus flower!” Ling Han said with certainty.","This was a massive lotus flower, but now, it had lost all signs of life. Its petals had lost all luster, and had become pitch-black. From afar, it looked both like an island and a mountain.","Hiss, this couldn’t be the Needless Mountains, right?","They landed, and a small seedpod had already formed in the centre of the lotus flower, turning into a massive platform. At this time, there were a great many people on the platform, and they were all youngsters that looked to be in their twenties. There were men and women among them, handsome and energetic, their auras captivating.","“Golden Generation!”","Ling Han saw Lin Xuan, as well as Imperial Son Kui. As for the other Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters, his eyes narrowed. He didn’t recognize any of them.","Seeing Ling Han and the others walk over, these Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all swept a cold glance over them, completely unmoved.","As they saw it, even if Ling Han and the others had outstanding natural talent, their cultivation level was still too far off, so they were not qualified to even look at them.","Lin Xuan, on the other hand, cast an extra glance at Ling Han. For some reason, he would feel killing intent whenever he saw Ling Han. This was a kind of hatred that came out of nowhere and was completely unreasonable. However, when one had reached the height that Lin Xuan had, he believed that there must be heaven’s will in the unseen world. Thus, he did not mind killing Ling Han either.","However, he didn’t make a move, because there was still a sliver of divine sense of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor here. If this thought didn’t disappear, then even if a Saint brought the Imperial Weapon over, they would have to bow their heads, not daring to fight.","The Great Emperor was invincible in the world.","The final test was the shock of seven different emotions.","In this place, everyone was extremely nervous, as if something colossal was about to happen, making them uneasy. Even if it was the Golden Generation, so what? The gap in cultivation level was too wide, so they would still be deeply affected.","Meanwhile, Ling Han and the others were confused. Why were these people all here?","“Little Han, looks like you have guessed correctly. Even if you pass seven stages, you would not be able to obtain the inheritance of the Holy Emperor.” The large black dog communicated through divine sense.","It was clear that it would be extremely easy for the Golden Generation to pass this level. However, they were all here. What did this signify?","After passing this stage, there was nowhere else to go. They could only stare blankly here.","However, the Needless Mountains had already appeared, and it should be this lotus platform. The inheritance was here, so how could they be willing to leave empty-handed?","Thus, they stayed here to see if there would be any changes.","Ling Han stepped forwards to issue a challenge. The guard of this stage was a young man that looked to be sixteen or seventeen years old. He looked very worried, but once they started fighting, his battle prowess was astonishingly strong.","Because there were many people here, Ling Han didn’t want to expose his strength, so he naturally hid it. This made him appear extremely disheveled, and he only managed to block","100 strikes with all his might.","However, after the battle, the young man cowardly ran to the side, not even letting out a fart.","Seeing that Ling Han’s strength was only so-so, those members of the Golden Generation merely glanced at him twice at the beginning of the battle, and afterwards, were disdainful,","thinking that it was a waste of time.","Only Lin Xuan felt an instinctive urge to kill Ling Han.","Ling Han retreated to the side. By now, he had completely comprehended the seven emotions. Next, he should enter into the tortoise shell space to perform them.","However, there were so many Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters here, so how could he","enter boldly?","“So you’re the new Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm?” an Imperial Son began to ask","Ling Han.","Ling Han’s mind whirred, and he nodded, “That’s right.”","When the Holy Emperor’s corpse appeared, the scene of him, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon being sucked into the galaxy was witnessed by a great many people.","Obviously, this could not be concealed.","After such a long time, his origins must have been completely dug out.","“So you obtained the token then?” the Imperial Son continued to ask.","Ling Han frowned, “So what if I have? So what if I have not?”","“Heh, hand over the token,” the Imperial Son said calmly. “If it falls into your hands, it’ll","only be like a pearl covered in dust. I’ll decipher its secrets. If I obtain the inheritance of the","Holy Emperor, I’ll bestow you with an Imperial Technique.”","‘F*ck! Are you trying to be charitable?’","Ling Han and the others didn’t have a good impression of the Imperial Clans in the first place,","and hearing their words, they all felt anger rise up in their hearts.","“Not interested,” Ling Han directly retorted. “That is not up to you!” The Imperial Son humphed, and immediately moved.","He was at the level of Sect Master. When he stretched out his hand, there was no need for him","to channel any kind of celestial technique. The Regulations manifested themselves, as if they were boosted by the power of heaven and earth.","Shua, a cold light swept past, and this Imperial Son was sent backwards.","The cowardly youth stood up, and said, “Don’t make a move here!” After saying this, he","looked like he had been shocked again, and stepped to the side.","That Imperial Son was dissatisfied, but he definitely did not dare make a move in front of the","divine sense of the Holy Emperor. He could only glare harshly at Ling Han.","He would remember this ant.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “How should I address you?”","“What is it? Are you still unconvinced?” That Imperial Son smirked coldly, “Ant, remember","this. I am Imperial Son Yuan.”"]},{"number":4220,"title":"Chapter 4220: The Imperial Scroll appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4220: The Imperial Scroll appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Imperial Clan was arrogant. They were the descendants of Great Emperors, and they also had the Imperial Weapon keeping watch. Basically, there were also Saints in their clan. This was the basis for their pride.","Meanwhile, the Imperial Son was especially proud. If nothing unexpected happened, they had a very high chance of becoming Saints. In an era when there was no Emperor in the world, Saints were the representatives of the strongest battle prowess.","The Golden Generation, one of the strongest among the Imperial Sons, or possibly the strongest generation in history. They looked down on everyone, including the Imperial Sons that came after them.","Thus, what was Ling Han, the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm, worth in the eyes of the Golden Generation?","An ant!","Ling Han, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon looked at each other. They all hid their anger deeply. There was too much of a gap between their cultivation levels, so what did it matter if they were angered?","“These b@stards, just wait and see. Grandpa Dog will eventually make all of you kneel down and proclaim your conquest,” the large black dog communicated through divine sense.","Ling Han and the little azure dragon didn’t speak, but in their hearts, they obviously said the same thing.","All the Imperial Sons did not speak further. Some were impatient, and flew out of the lotus platform, to search once more in the vast sea. Some chatted with that terrified young man, trying to get some information, while others continued to sit cross-legged, appearing to be in no hurry at all.","After Ling Han and the others waited for two days, they left quietly. Then, they immediately used the Void Beast hide to cover themselves.","Xiu, xiu! Immediately, three figures followed them.","Imperial Son Yuan, Imperial Son Yuan and another that Ling Han and the others did not recognize, but he was naturally another member of the Golden Generation.","“They have treasures that can hide their tracks,” Lin Xuan said calmly. Previously, he had wanted to kill Ling Han and the others, but when he arrived, he had lost track of those three people.","“Let me take a look,” the unknown Imperial Son said. His forehead split open, and a slit eye appeared. It suddenly exploded with divine light that shot out in all directions.","“Brother Ming’s Void Eye can see through all falsehoods, and is comparable to Saint Tier. I am sure that in front of you, those three ants would have nowhere to hide.” Imperial Son Yuan clapped his hands, smiling.","The Imperial Son smiled faintly, appearing to be completely unconcerned, but there was an expression of pride on his face.","However, after scanning the surroundings, he didn’t discover anything.","This was a little awkward.","Killing intent instantly rose up in the Imperial Son Ming’s heart. At first, he was completely unconcerned about taking the lives of three ants. He had only chased after them for the sake of obtaining the token of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. However, when he swept his gaze over the surroundings, he did not find Ling Han and the others. This caused him to fly into a humiliated rage. Naturally, killing intent overflowed from him.","A mere ant actually dared to embarrass him?","However, where were they?","The Imperial Son Ming looked towards the depths of the great ocean again, but with this look, he gave a muffled humph, and the light that had shot out from his slitted eye instantly dimmed.","“Brother Ming!” Imperial Son Xuan and Imperial Son Yuan both called out at the same time. They were not really concerned about Imperial Son Ming, but rather that Imperial Son Ming was the best candidate to find Ling Han and the others.","The Imperial Son shook his head, saying, “The Holy Emperor’s mind can’t be offended. My soul light was almost destroyed!”","When these words fell, both Imperial Son Xuan and Imperial Son Yuan were solemn. They were inside the corpse of a Great Emperor, so who cared if they were members of the Golden Generation or not? In front of Imperial Might, they were like ants.","They were unwilling to give up, and after searching a few more times, they could only reluctantly return.","At this moment, Ling Han and the others were in the sea.","They did not dive into the deep sea, and merely allowed the ocean waters to submerge them.","“As expected, the seawater can conceal our tracks,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“The Great Emperor’s mind has great power even after death!” The large black dog nodded as well. Then, he suddenly said, “Little Han, that mysterious sea of blood that contains the corpses of countless Saints... could it also be the Great Emperor’s mind?”","Ling Han pondered for a moment. That was an unsolved mystery. Even if the Saint brought the Imperial Weapon with him, he wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","Could it be the Great Emperor’s mind?","But what Great Emperor would be so bloodthirsty, and have killed so many Saints? Furthermore, it was definitely impossible that there would be so many Saints in a single era. It should be the accumulation of several dozen generations.","The problem was, could even a Great Emperor be able to live for such a long time?","Thus, no one could solve this mystery, unless a new Emperor appeared, and he could charge in alone. Only then would he be able to understand its secrets.","Ling Han did not speak further. He entered into the world of the tortoise shell, and began to play out the last emotion of the Seven Emotions.","Shock.","To him, panicking was an extremely rare thing. Thus, he mulled over it for a very, very long time before he finally found the feeling.","Instantly, several pillars of light attacked.","Pa, Ling Han instantly fell out of the world of the tortoise shell. Then, he suddenly discovered that this tortoise shell was moving on its own. Multiple patterns were changing, as if it was relating some supremely mysterious principle.","The little azure dragon and the large black dog approached at the same time, staring at each other closely.","“Imperial Scroll!”","After a long while, they called out at the same time.","As it turned out, the Imperial Scroll was actually with them all this while, but the divine item kept itself hidden, and would not manifest at all. Only when the Emperor’s corpse appeared, and they played out the seven emotions, did the Imperial Scroll finally appear.","It was also possible that the Imperial Scroll should be inside the Great Emperor’s corpse. The tortoise shell was only a vessel, and one had to pass seven stages before it would appear through the tortoise shell.","En, the latter deduction should be more logical.","Ling Han thought to himself. Then, he hurriedly suppressed these distracting thoughts, focusing his full attention on the Imperial Scroll.","The Imperial Scroll was the true effort of a Great Emperor, and was a summary of the path that he had taken. Thus, if one cultivated the Imperial Scroll, the chances of becoming a Saint was much higher than cultivating the cultivation technique of a Saint.","However, if one was completely immersed in the Imperial Scroll, they definitely could not possibly become an Emperor.","—If one had walked before them, that would only be an imitation. The heaven and earth would not favour this kind of imitator.","Thus, for those who had ambitions to become Emperor, Imperial Scrolls could only be used as reference.","Ling Han only used the Imperial Scroll as a means to stimulate the Imperial Technique, and it was only for the sake of increasing his battle prowess.","Obtaining the Imperial Scroll would make up for the last shortcoming in his battle prowess.","After a whole three days, the tortoise shell finally managed to fully perform the Imperial Scroll. Next, it began to perform something new.","This time, it was the Imperial Technique.","The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor had suppressed the darkness all those years ago, and his battle prowess was publicly acknowledged as one of the top three or even the strongest in history. Just how powerful was the Imperial Technique that he had created?","“Ice Moon Saber!”","This was the first Imperial Technique Technique, but it wasn’t a saber technique. After reaching the cultivation level of Great Emperor, one no longer needed to rely on external items. They themselves were the strongest.","Thus, this Ice Moon Saber was a technique that could be displayed through fist techniques, palm techniques, and so on. When it was delivered, it would turn into a divine saber that could destroy everything.","After the Ice Moon Saber, the tortoise shell began to evolve into the Imperial Scroll again.","“You only have one Imperial Technique?” the large black dog asked in slight defiance.","Ling Han smiled, “If it is considered an ultimate move, one would be enough.”","“Haha, let’s see who can grasp the Imperial Scroll first,” the little azure dragon immediately said.","“All right!”","The three of them sat down in cross-legged positions, and began to comprehend.","However, the Imperial Scroll was really too hard to understand. This was the Imperial Scroll in which a Great Emperor had condensed the path he had walked, and used a method of simplification to teach this kind of comprehension to others."]},{"number":4221,"title":"Chapter 4221: Re-cultivating the four cultivation levels","paragraphs":["Chapter 4221: Re-cultivating the four cultivation levels","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han suddenly felt appreciation. Why couldn’t he become an Ancestral King by copying the Imperial Scroll?","Because the Imperial Scroll would not allow one to fully comprehend the Dao of the Ancestral King, there were some mysteries that could not be explained through words or even in the form of seals, and could only be comprehended by oneself.","Thus, the Great Emperors had all walked out on their own, and not one of them had been taught.","He suppressed these thoughts, and fully comprehended the profoundness of the Imperial Scroll.","The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor was a descendant of the Tortoise Race, so logically speaking, the Black Tortoise being aligned with Earth, he should have been more skilled in the Regulations of Earth. However, in reality, the Holy Emperor had comprehended the Regulations of Water, reaching the pinnacle through the Regulations of Water.","However, Saints could use Regulations, but in the case of Great Emperors, they had already reached the extent of crushing Regulations. Thus, when one had reached the cultivation level of Great Emperors, they could easily use whatever Regulations they wanted, so what difference did it make?","The Imperial Scroll was the path that the Great Emperor had walked, and not the comprehension that the Great Emperor had experienced when he had been at his peak.","Ling Han sat as still as a rock. In the first two months, he did not have the slightest idea. The Imperial Scroll was like a heavenly book, and he did not know where to start at all.","“This really is like a tortoise. No matter how strong you are, you won’t know where to exert your strength.”","Ling Han mocked, then swept away all kinds of negative emotions. Using the Six Characters Bright King Curse to clear his mind, he began from the beginning again.","In the blink of an eye, another three months had passed.","Ling Han finally had some comprehension. Then, with endless enlightenment, he finally had a preliminary grasp of this Imperial Scroll.","He started from the Foundation Building Tier and started from the beginning again, determined to sweep aside all imperfections on the path of cultivation.","This step was naturally very fast. In a mere three days, he had completed the cultivation of the Foundation Building Tier, and advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier.","The Cauldron Forging Tier took Ling Han nine days. Then, he stepped into the Core Formation Tier.","This took a long time. After spending one and a half months’ time, he finally reached the True Self Tier again. Spending another month’s time, he reached the end of the first form of the True Self Tier.","This time, he had already cultivated all the cultivation levels above Celestial Path, using the Imperial Scroll to re-cultivate.","“In terms of feeling... the total amount of mystical power has decreased by a whopping half!” Ling Han sensed for a moment, “However, mystical power has become more condensed, while my battle prowess has become slightly stronger.”","For Ling Han, he did not have to worry that his mystical power would be exhausted. Thus, he was naturally very pleased to use the total amount in exchange for quality.","As expected of Imperial Scroll.","Ling Han nodded. It should be known that he had previously used the Saint Tier cultivation technique to temper his mystical power, but after he switched to cultivating the Imperial Technique, he could improve only so much, which meant that the Great Emperor Tier surpassed the Saint Tier by not just a little bit.","“However, there are only a total of eight chapters in the Imperial Scroll, and the highest scroll is the Saint Tier chapter, but there is no corresponding Great Emperor Tier chapter.”","“That’s true. No one can reach Emperor Tier after cultivating the Imperial Scroll. Then, what’s the point of leaving behind the Great Emperor Tier chapter?”","“Let’s cultivate the Ice Moon Saber.”","Ling Han retrieved his tortoise shell. He had been studying the Imperial Scroll before, so he had already forgotten about the Ice Moon Saber. He needed to start over.","He took a look. The little azure dragon and the large black dog were still thinking hard. Obviously, he had already won in this comprehension contest.","The tortoise shell channeled, but it was still performing the Imperial Scroll. Ling Han couldn’t stimulate it, so he could only wait patiently.","Not too long after, he began the comprehension of the Ice Moon Saber.","The Imperial Technique was an application of the Imperial Scroll. Thus, if one had grasped the Imperial Scroll, it was equivalent to having grasped the fundamentals, and it would become simple to develop the Imperial Technique.","It had only been nine days, and Ling Han had already made some progress.","Shua, he delivered a palm strike, and a heavenly saber appeared, slashing forwards.","Peng, this saber strike slashed into the great ocean, tearing a large hole in the great ocean, as if that was not water, but rather a piece of tofu, and the ocean waters on either side were immediately frozen. It could be seen that Regulations were rippling.","What terrifying destructive power. It should be known that this was the mind of a Great Emperor!","In just an instant, the ice crumbled, and the sea calmed down. Everything returned to normal.","But in the next instant, the tortoise shell lit up, releasing a light that wrapped around Ling Han.","This scene was very familiar.","Ling Han hurriedly stretched out a hand to grab the little azure dragon and the large black dog. Sure enough, xiu, the tortoise shell brought him through the galaxy at an extremely fast speed, just like how he had been brought into the galaxy.","“Ah—” The little azure dragon and the large black dog were still comprehending the Imperial Scroll when they were awoken by such high-speed movements. They once again opened their mouths wide and released terrible screams.","‘F*ck! Again!’","Xiu, in just an instant, they had already flown out of the Holy Emperor’s corpse, and landed on the planet. Then, Ling Han only felt his grip loosen, and the tortoise shell flew out, once again shooting towards the Holy Emperor’s corpse.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! One after another, figures were sent flying. They were the Imperial Sons and the others that were still in the corpse of the Holy Emperor.","Next, everyone could see that the corpse of the Holy Emperor in the skies was rapidly shrinking in size, so small that they could no longer see it with their naked eyes.","Only the Venerate Tier and Saint Tier elites could see that the corpse of the Holy Emperor had already shrunk to the size of a normal person. He was holding a tortoise shell in his arms, and then his entire body glowed. Xiu! Space split apart, and he directly entered. Then, the spatial fissure closed, and everything returned to normal.","Instantly, the Imperial Might that had been permeating the air all this while instantly disappeared.","Ling Han understood. The Descending Heaven Holy Emperor had already completed his final obsession and passed on his cultivation technique. Thus, he buried himself in the Void.","“Wa!” The little azure dragon and the large black dog both vomited madly. This was f****** again; they couldn’t take it.","“Let’s go!” Ling Han grabbed the two of them and activated his Star Steps. He arrived at the Transfer Formation and immediately left.","With the threat of the Holy Emperor gone, he was sure that those Imperial Sons would definitely come to make trouble for him.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! After they had continuously travelled through a few galaxies, Ling Han finally stopped.","On this trip, they had obtained the Imperial Scroll, as well as an Imperial Technique. It could be considered a perfect ending — aside from the fact that the little azure dragon and the large black dog had puked twice.","“Little Han, where are we going now?”","“Return to the Buddhist Race?”","The large black dog and little azure dragon asked one after another.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, “Let’s go back to the Buddhist Race to take a look. We’ve left for a long time, so we should return to collect cultivation resources.”","“Hehe.” The little azure dragon and the large black dog both snickered. If the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm found out about their true identities one day, who knew what their expressions would be.","“However, the matter of us obtaining the Holy Emperor’s token has already been exposed. If we return to the Buddhist Race, will we be targeted?” the large black dog immediately said.","Ling Han nodded and said, “We can’t rule out that possibility. After all, the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm is not all that powerful, and those Imperial Clans dare to exert pressure on us. However, we only obtained the token of the Holy Emperor. Who can claim that we would definitely obtain the Imperial Scroll?”","“That’s right. We didn’t obtain the Imperial Scroll, and those Imperial Sons were all ahead of us. Even Sect Masters didn’t gain anything, what more us.” The little azure dragon spread its hands.","“Come, let’s go back.”","They began to travel through the galaxy, and after spending close to two months’ time, they finally returned to the Stainless Planet.","In this period of time, they would also occasionally connect to the Galaxy Network, paying attention to the changes in the situation, but the various great Imperial Clans remained silent, and did not speak."]},{"number":4222,"title":"Chapter 4222: Invitation from the Imperial Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4222: Invitation from the Imperial Clan","Editor: Henyee Translations","After Ling Han returned to the Stainless Planet, the first thing he did was naturally to collect his cultivation resources.","After such a long time, he had also stabilized his foundations, and could now break through to the Second Form. These cultivation resources were just in time to support him in taking this step.","After returning to his room, Ling Han began to cultivate in seclusion, attempting to break through to the second form of the True Self Tier.","The first form was clay fetus, and the second form was stone fetus.","This was a transformation of the soul.","Ling Han was surrounded by cultivation resources. There were Dao Stones, natural treasures, and so on. He took a deep breath, and the Dao Stones instantly dimmed. The natural treasures also paled in an instant. He had absorbed more than half of the essence.","“Forming Stone Fetus!”","Ling Han humphed lowly. The True Self of Destruction was the first one again, and from the clay fetus onwards, he advanced towards the stone fetus.","Weng, around him, multiple Regulations descended.","Creating the clay fetus was a process of “self-consciousness”. One only had to brand Regulations as their bones, and the waters of the alchemy pool as their blood and flesh, and this did not involve the outside world. However, True Self Tier was the beginning of comprehending heaven and earth, so how could they possibly stay in their own world all the time?","Thus, it was necessary to use the Regulations of heaven and earth to construct the Stone Fetus.","Ling Han’s eyes were tightly shut, but his hands were continuously channelling, grabbing Regulations after Regulations and pressing them into his body, becoming nourishment for the clay fetus.","This was a spiritual body that fed on Regulations.","When he had grabbed enough Regulations, the clay fetus shone brightly, and underwent a qualitative change.","—It was advancing towards the Stone Fetus.","Boom, the power of heaven and earth surged over, condensing towards the True Self of Destruction, boosting the process of transformation.","A whole three days passed, and this process finally stopped. The True Self of Destruction had already turned into a Stone Fetus.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel that it was a pity. Only when he had just broken through to the second form would he be able to have such high speed. The next eight clay fetuses would have to slowly evolve over a long period of time to become stone fetuses.","Of course, with the supply of natural treasures, the time needed for this process would be greatly shortened.","Thus, cultivators were extremely eager to obtain natural treasures. With a large amount of resources, even a pig could become a prodigy. And for those that didn’t, even prodigies would also disappear among the masses.","Ling Han came out of seclusion. He came to the mountains to test his current strength.","“With this breakthrough, Body Art and mystical power have both leaped to Fifteenth Heaven. With the combined effort of the two, my base power has easily reached 20 Heavens.”","Ling Han revealed a smile. He tapped out a finger, and weng, the True Self of Destruction in his mind immediately responded, grabbing the Regulations of heaven and earth and fusing them into this attack.","Peng!","A mountain peak was instantly obliterated, and the broken mountain peak was directly annihilated, not leaving the slightest bit behind.","This was Destructive Energy!","Ling Han nodded. Only when one came to the second form of the True Self Tier would the uniqueness of the True Self Tier truly be reflected.","He delivered a casual strike, and the stone fetus of True Self Tier stood up to respond. It grabbed the heaven and earth Regulations to boost its power, as well as high-level energy, greatly increasing its battle prowess.","“Just what level has my battle prowess now reached?”","Ling Han was curious. He channelled the Imperial Scroll, then used the Ice Moon Saber, boosting it with high-level energy of ice. The True Self of Destruction also grabbed the Regulations and combined them together. Boom, he punched out explosively, and the heavenly saber appeared, slashing forwards.","Boom, the heavenly saber swept past, and a great mountain ahead of him was directly split open, forming an extremely long canyon.","“Hiss!”","Even Ling Han himself was given a scare. It should be known that the mountain rocks here had all been reinforced by the Buddhist Race. Even if it was not an important place of the Buddhist Race, it was still the Stainless Planet, after all.","“The power of this attack... has reached the level of 31 Heavens!”","Ordinarily, even if he had cultivated the Imperial Scroll, and cast the Imperial Technique, the Imperial Scroll could boost his battle prowess by nine Heavens, so with base power of twenty Heavens, the ultimate battle prowess should only be 29 Heavens.","Now, however, his battle prowess had already reached 31 Heavens.","“This is the result of the participation of the True Self of Destruction.”","“No wonder, starting from the True Self Tier, power is still very important, but its weight in battle prowess is decreasing.”","Ling Han nodded. Even if he did not cultivate Body Art, that would only decrease his battle prowess by a mere five Heavens, which was far inferior to an Imperial Technique.","He returned, only to see a young monk waiting for him.","“Lord Buddha Son.” When the little monk saw him, he hurriedly said, “Lord Changtian invites you over.”","Ling Han nodded, and followed him to see Shi Changtian.","“What is it?” Ling Han asked. Though his cultivation level was lower, the status of Buddha Son was transcendent, and was only beneath the three Bodhisattvas. Thus, there was no need for him to act like a junior in front of Shi Changtian.","—Even if he wanted to, he could not. This was the rule of the Buddhist Race, and Shi Changtian would not allow it either.","“Hehe, a few Imperial Clans have hosted an auction, inviting you to attend,” Shi Changtian said smilingly, taking out an invitation and handing it over.","Ling Han caught it, and couldn’t help but grit his teeth, “What extravagance.”","This piece of paper was made from pulp that had been kneaded from Saintly Tree bark, and the ink used to write the invitation was the blood of a Venerate Tier-level elite. There was a powerful pressure, and if an ordinary True Self Tier cultivator suddenly accepted it, they would probably be suppressed to the point of directly kneeling down.","He swept an eye over it, and sure enough, this was an invitation. Four great Imperial Clans had jointly hosted an auction, and were widely inviting the Dao Child and Imperial Sons of the world to attend.","“It just has to be at this time, interesting,” Ling Han murmured. When he had obtained the Imperial Scroll, no one had witnessed it, but in the hearts of Lin Xuan and the other Imperial Sons, they were probably all wondering if he had obtained the Imperial Scroll.","Even if it was just suspicion, with how important the Imperial Scroll was, they were willing to test it out.","Although the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm wasn’t as important as the Imperial Clans, they were still a branch of the Buddhist Race, after all. He was sure that the other Imperial Clans wouldn’t dare to act recklessly. At the very least, they would have to have reason and evidence to be able to make things difficult for him.","All right, let’s go and take a look.","Ling Han was presently in desperate need of natural treasures to increase his cultivation level. Since it was an auction hosted by the Imperial Clans, there should be a considerable amount of good stuff.","He put away the invitation, signalled his departure to Shi Changtian, and returned to his quarters.","He had initially planned to bring along the little azure dragon and the large black dog. However, Ling Han didn’t interrupt them as they were at a crucial moment of comprehending the Imperial Scroll. Instead, he set off on his own.","This was a grand event on the level of Imperial Son. The Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm also placed considerable importance on this event. Accompanied by the Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva, space was directly torn open, and he brought Ling Han towards the Liangsen Planet.","Liangsen Planet, this was the home planet of the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan. The auction this time would be held here.","Ling Han soon saw a familiar face—Cheng Qing, the Imperial Son of the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan. However, this Imperial Son didn’t retain the memories of the True Dragon Abyss. His eyes merely swept over Ling Han, before retracting.","—Even if he retained them, it was useless. Now, even Ling Han’s appearance and spiritual wave had changed. It would be strange if he could recognize him.","There was also Chi Menghan, Chi Mengshan, the sisters, and Chi Dao, this internally showy guy. Most importantly, he saw something even more familiar in Chi Mengshan’s arms.","Pervert pig!","This lecherous pig was being embraced by the little loli, and looked to be incomparably comfortable. Occasionally, it would even nudge the little loli’s chest.","Fortunately, the little loli hadn’t developed yet. Otherwise, this would be extremely serious harassment.","F***, why was the pervert pig here?"]},{"number":4223,"title":"Chapter 4223: Might of Ding Shu","paragraphs":["Chapter 4223: Might of Ding Shu","Editor: Henyee Translations","The origins of the pervert pig was also very mysterious.","It clearly did not have the slightest bit of battle prowess, yet could not be harmed at all. It was unbelievably amazing.","This guy had also followed Ling Han to the Nine Suns Holy Land, but from some unknown day on, it had suddenly disappeared. Right until this moment, it was actually being embraced by Chi Mengshan, which naturally surprised Ling Han.","Right at this moment, the little pervert pig also looked over, and stared at Ling Han. He actually showed an expression of understanding, as if he was saying, ‘Little guy, even if you change your appearance, I will still recognize you.’","Ling Han didn’t want to expose his identity, so he turned around.","As he turned around, he saw another familiar face.","The Buddha Son of the North Heavenly Realm, Shi Tianyun. Of course, his true identity was the overlord of another Genesis World, Ding Shu.","When he saw Ling Han, Ding Shu immediately bared his teeth, waved his hand, and said, “Ling Han!”","‘Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han really wanted to strangle him to death. ‘Are you doing this on purpose? Are you?’","Hearing the words ‘Ling Han’, the people in the surroundings immediately began to search everywhere.","“Ling Han?”","“Ling Han actually dares to appear again?”","Naturally, it was impossible for them to find Ling Han.","Ding Shu instantly became the target of everyone’s attention. Countless people looked at him, and all of them wore unfriendly expressions, demanding an explanation from him.","“Oh, I was just randomly calling out,” Ding Shu said lazily.","“Don’t you know that this evil thief is the public enemy of the Imperial Clans?” Shi Yuanzhen immediately said. He had almost been killed by Ling Han, so he naturally hated Ling Han to the core.","“Hey, hey, hey. Since when can you represent all the Imperial Clans?” The silver-haired little lolita immediately objected, “At least, Donglin Imperial Clan doesn’t think that Ling Han is an enemy. On the contrary, he is also my sister’s future husband!”","“Aiyo!”","The little loli had spoken too quickly, and was immediately suppressed. Chi Menghan gave her a heavy knock on the head.","“Chi Menghan, don’t keep knocking on my head, I’ll become stupid!” the little loli protested. Then, she spread out her hands, “Brother-in-law, where are you? Come and take in this fierce woman.”","Everyone was speechless. Looks like this little girl was a professional at screwing over her sister.","“Shut up!” Chi Menghan’s pretty face flushed slightly, and she began to suppress this girl who was an expert at screwing over her sister.","Shi Yuanzhen turned his attention back to Ding Shu. “Apologize!”","“Ha, apologize?” Ding Shu picked his ears, “Who do you think you are?”","Hiss!","Everyone was surprised. Ling Han was unruly and disrespectful towards the Imperial Clans, and that was why he had ended up in exile at the ends of the world. You, a mere Buddha Son of the North Heavenly Realm, could it be that you want to make the same mistake?","The Buddhist Race was indeed awesome. No Imperial Clan was willing to trifle with them, but if it was just the North Heavenly Realm branch, who would take it seriously?","“Looks like the North Heavenly Realm is expert at producing stubborn people,” Xu Jie said coldly.","“It’s not that I’m looking down on you guys, but in my eyes, you’re all trash!” Ding Shuwas truly outrageously bold. He began to mock them, “If you have the ability, go and defeat Ling Han on your own, but using the force behind you to suppress others? Hehe.”","This caused all the Imperial Sons to frown in anger. However, at that time, Ling Han was indeed like a demon king, causing them to all develop a strong psychological trauma.","“Humph, that evil thief is only slightly superior because he has cultivated Body Arts, and that is why he has a slight advantage in Core Formation Tier. However, this is the era of the True Self Tier, so the advantage of Body Arts is no longer there,” Guan Yuanming said calmly, his words filled with disdain towards Ling Han.","All the Imperial Sons nodded. They had already advanced into True Self Tier, and could actively channel Regulations to boost their battle prowess. Furthermore, Imperial Techniques could only truly unleash its might from True Self Tier onwards.","If they encountered Ling Han again, they would have a definite chance of winning.","Ding Shu chuckled and said, “Ling Han has been forced to wander the world by you people, and it’s impossible for him to appear again. Naturally, you people can say whatever you like.”","“What is it? Are you still not convinced?” Shi Yuanzhen asked balefully.","“In my eyes, you’re all just trash. What’s there to complain about?” Ding Shu shook his head and smiled at Shi Yuanzhen. “I specialize in dealing with all kinds of dissatisfaction. Come, I’ll beat you into submission!”","If it was not for the fact that this person did not look much like Ling Han, whether it was his appearance or the undulations of his soul, everyone would think that he was Ling Han in disguise. Otherwise, what idiot would take the risk of offending the great Imperial Clans to speak up for Ling Han?","Ling Han was also slightly surprised, because Ding Shu was aware of his identity, yet still wanted to step out. What did this guy want to do?","Shi Yuanzhen was extremely furious. In the hearts of all the Imperial Clans, the Buddha Sons of the four Heavenly Realms were not worthy of being their equal at all. At most, they were just a little bit stronger than the Dao Child of the Holy Land.","And now, Ding Shu actually dared to publicly challenge him?","“You really don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!” he said balefully, and strode out.","Ling Han was already a thing of the past, yet there was actually someone summoning him back into presence. How preposterous. What was even more infuriating was that this person actually dared to provoke him.","If he didn’t teach him a lesson, how would he be able to vent his anger?","Ding Shu, meanwhile, was still laidback, as if he did not take an Imperial Son to heart.","In everyone’s eyes, this was too arrogant. Shi Yuanzhen was the Imperial Son, and if it was anyone else, they would feel like they were facing a great enemy.","Did he think that he was the Golden Generation?","Only Ling Han knew that Ding Shu definitely had that kind of strength. He was not the Golden Generation, but it was possible that he was even stronger than the Golden Generation.","This was both an affirmation of Ding Shu, as well as a recognition of himself, because in Ling Han’s eyes, he was too similar to Ding Shu.","“Soon, you will kneel on the ground and repent,” Shi Yuanzhen said balefully. He finally made his move.","Boom, he shot out a palm strike, which turned into a blood-coloured giant hammer, that smashed towards Ding Shu.","He had also advanced into the second form of the True Self Tier. This blood hammer was completely formed from Regulations, and naturally came with a high-level energy, possessing terrifying might.","Ding Shu shook his head, and mumbled, “Really f****** weak!”","Peng, he delivered a palm strike, and Shi Yuanzhen was sent flying.","F***!","When he mumbled, everyone thought that he was showing off, but when they saw that Shi Yuanzhen was actually sent flying with a single strike, everyone felt a chill run down their backs.","Heavens, what kind of monster was this?","As the Imperial Son, he had actually been sent flying with a single strike?","Was it because this guy’s cultivation level was too high?","No, no, no. Everyone shook their heads. Ding Shu was clearly the second form of the True Self Tier.","This was the most terrifying part.","Being able to instantly defeat the Imperial Son at the same cultivation level, hiss, this guy was chillingly strong!","“Ling Han!” Several Imperial Sons exclaimed in astonishment.","If it wasn’t Ling Han, would there be a second such terrifying guy in this world?","However, whether it was appearance or soul fluctuation, this guy was completely different from Ling Han. Furthermore, why would Ling Han be so outrageously bold? He was clearly wanted by the Imperial Clans, yet still dared to come over in such a grand manner?","Hiss, there was actually a freak in this world that could match Ling Han?","All the Imperial Sons were extremely depressed. They had finally made it into the True Self Tier with much difficulty, and finally managed to kick Ling Han out of the tournament. This generation should belong to Imperial Sons like them, but just how much time had passed, and yet another super freakish prodigy had appeared.","“Ah!” In the distance, Shi Yuanzhen charged back. He was extremely furious.","Peng!","He had not even charged over, when he was sent flying with a kick.","Ling Han made his move."]},{"number":4224,"title":"Chapter 4224: Two freaks","paragraphs":["Chapter 4224: Two freaks","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone was dumbfounded.","What was going on?","Why had Shi Yuanzhen been sent flying again? Furthermore, he had not been sent flying by the same person.","As the Imperial Son, was he really that weak?","It was not just the Imperial Clans here. There were also a great many Dao Child and Holy Daughters. After seeing this scene, they all had a thought in their minds — they must have encountered a false Imperial Son.","Otherwise, how could he possibly be so weak?","The Imperial Son was equivalent to being invincible among his peers, but now in a battle of equals, the Imperial Son was sent flying back and forth like a blade of grass. Heh, wasn’t this the biggest joke in the world?","“Buddha Son of West Heavenly Realm!” Someone recognized Ling Han. After all, the reason why Ling Han had been invited was because the Imperial Clans wanted to obtain something from him, or rather find out something, so they would naturally pay more attention to him.","Hearing these words, even more people exclaimed in shock, their expressions extremely strange.","What was going on?","The two people that had dealt with Shi Yuanzhen like he was their grandson were actually both from the Buddhist Race?","F***, was it the Imperial Son that was too weak, or was it the Buddhist Race that was more heaven-defying!","“Shi Xinming, why did you attack?” an Imperial Son shouted. He was Tao Wenbin of the Red Lotus Imperial Clan.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “The Buddhist Race of the four Heavenly Realms are a family, so of course we’re brothers in arms!”","Hearing these words, everyone’s expressions became even stranger.","That’s right. The Buddhist Race of the four Heavenly Realms were indeed of the same origin, and were a family, but the problem was that Ding Shu was already completely on the upper hand, and had thrashed Shi Yuanzhen as if he was just playing around. Did he still need Ling Han’s help?","‘You’re clearly showing off!’","However, what was going on with the Buddhist Race? They were so freakish that even the two Buddha Sons were freakishly powerful.","If it was claimed that they had come from the Buddhist Race from the Thirty Three Heavens, that would still be acceptable. The Buddhist Race was also an Imperial Clan, and they were a colossal force at that. Who knew how deep their roots were.","However, even the Buddhist Race branch of the four Heavenly Realms was this awesome?","How could this be believed?","That was because the Buddhist Race of the four Heavenly Realms was only equivalent to the existence of the Holy Land. At most, there would only be a few more Imperial Techniques, but without the boost of the Imperial Scroll, the Imperial Techniqueswould not be able to show their full might.","Ling Han naturally had his own considerations for making a move.","Did he hate Shi Yuanzhen? Of course he did. Then, if Ding Shu alone displayed heaven-defying strength, he would definitely draw suspicion. Whether he was Ling Han in disguise or not, after all, the possibility of this was still there, no matter how small it was.","However, the appearance of two heaven-defying freaks naturally erased this kind of possibility.","This was helping Ding Shu, and also helping Ling Han himself.","“The Buddhist Race’s dignity does not allow for blasphemy!” Ling Han said calmly, taking the moral high ground.","—The reason why I have moved was to safeguard the dignity of the Buddhist Race, not for personal gain.","Ding Shu, meanwhile, laughed loudly. He was naturally aware of Ling Han’s identity. He was clearly venting his personal anger, yet still appeared so open and aboveboard, which he could not help but laugh. In any case, he had always acted as he pleased.","Shi Yuanzhen got back to his feet again. There was a trace of blood at the corner of his lips, and his expression was so furious that he wanted to devour someone.","Two times, two consecutive times, and he had been instantly defeated by two people respectively. How could he endure this?","If he could not get his pride back, how would he be able to survive in the Imperial Son circle in future?","“You guys, are you courting death?” he said balefully. Boom, a terrifying aura was suddenly released from his body, which solidified and boiled, interweaving into blazing flames. His body was also rapidly expanding, turning into a giant that was three hundred meters tall.","He ignited his Imperial Bloodline.","“It’s really strange, people like you. How can there be so much Imperial Blood to burn?” Ding Shu mumbled. Then, he turned to Ling Han and asked, “Do you want to do it, or should I?”","“Whatever.” Ling Han spread his hands, appearing to be completely unconcerned.","“None of you will be able to escape!” Shi Yuanzhen charged over. His left hand delivered a palm strike at Ling Han, while his right hand attacked Ding Shu. As his hands descended, it was as if heaven and earth were collapsing, and endless meteors were falling, as if doomsday was coming.","It was as if these meteors had eyes of their own. Half of them shot towards Ling Han, while the other half shot towards Ding Shu.","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, and was in no rush to make a move. Meanwhile, Ding Shu looked laidback, and even stretched out his hand yo dig around in his ear.","This?","Just how much do you guys look down on Shi Yuanzhen?","That’s right. Previously, you all had indeed defeated Shi Yuanzhen in an instant, but now, he had burnt his Imperial Bloodline, which was equivalent to a Great Emperor in his youth.","Would a Great Emperor... lose to someone at the same cultivation level?","The meteors were the first to crash down, and like a violent storm, they shot towards Ling Han and Ding Shu.","Peng, peng, peng! A massive sound of impact was continuously heard, and even the ground was trembling. However, it was incredibly tenaciously holding on, and did not collapse.","This was the home planet of the Imperial Clan, and it had been strengthened by the Ancestral King in the past. To say nothing of them, even if it was a battle between Saints, it would be impossible to destroy this planet without battling for dozens or even hundreds of years.","Hence, this was completely capable of allowing True Self Tiers to go all out in battle.","After the meteor shower was over, Shi Yuanzhen’s two giant hands finally came crashing down. This was a finishing blow. Even if Ling Han and Ding Shu had survived the meteor shower, this blow would still be able to smash the two of them into a pancake.","Shua, right at this moment, a fist suddenly shot into the skies, accompanied by multiple flowers blooming. It was domineering, yet did not have the slightest bit of fire in it. At the same time, a massive palm had also struck towards the skies, marked with dense seals, Buddhist might spreading out.","“Wu!” Shi Yuanzhen gave a muffled humph, and his whole person was pushed backwards. Then, he retreated continuously.","He was shocked. Not only had this attack of his been neutralized, he himself had also been sent backwards.","These two opponents... were freakishly strong!","This was natural. Even if he ignited his Imperial Bloodline, which of Ling Han and Ding Shu was weaker than him? It was hard to predict the outcome of a one-on-one battle, and he still wanted to fight one against two. Then, would it still be reasonable for him to be undefeated?","“Thousand Flower Fists!”","“Divine Kasyapa Palm!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. These two celestial techniques originated from the Buddhist Race, so it wasn’t strange for them to be recognized. However, what was strange was that these two celestial techniques were only Venerate Tier-level.","Hiss, they had only used a Venerate Tier celestial technique to send Shi Yuanzhen, who was burning Imperial Blood, backwards. This, this, this, this was like a dream.","At this point, everyone no longer had any doubts. It was not that Shi Yuanzhen was weak, but rather that Ling Han and Ding Shu were too strong, strong to the point of surpassing common sense, capable of challenging the Golden Generation.","Shi Yuanzhen had already steadied his footing, and his face alternated between green and white. He had never imagined that even after combusting his Imperial Blood, he would still be unable to win.","Was he going to sustain this slap to his pride?","“Heh, everyone was invited here, so there’s no need to ruin the peace,” an Imperial Son stepped forward to mediate the situation.","“Yes, yes.”","Even more people joined in, one after another, trying to mediate the fight.","Ling Han also knew that there was no way he could kill Shi Yuanzhen here. However, after causing him such great humiliation and bringing such humiliation, this guy’s future days would definitely not be easy.","Thus, Ling Han merely smiled, and went with the flow.","Ding Shu was even more casual. Furthermore, he had just mocked all the Imperial Sons as trash, and now, he was completely unscathed. This was already a great victory.","The two of them exchanged a smile before striding forward."]},{"number":4225,"title":"Chapter 4225: Divine Beast Hide","paragraphs":["Chapter 4225: Divine Beast Hide","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han and Ding Shu left, but the shock that they had caused remained. It was still brewing and spreading, causing even more people to be stunned.","As it turned out, there were actually so many freaks in this world.","Ling Han was really a thing of the past. Even if he had come out of some unknown corner, could his cultivation level still keep up with the current strongest generation?","The Imperial Clans were also stunned. Unfortunately, these two people were both from the Buddhist Race, and there was no possibility of recruiting them at all, which made them sigh in disappointment.","Though the Buddhist Race of the four Heavenly Realms was not very strong, they were a branch of the Buddhist Race, after all. It was fine to suppress them appropriately, but to publicly get rid of a top-notch heir of their clan, the Buddhist Race of the Thirty-Three Heavens would probably fly into a thunderous rage.","—The waters of the Buddhist Race were too deep. Up until now, no one had been able to determine the true strength of the Buddhist Race. For example, how many Saints were there?","“Damn it, could it be that the two of them would monopolize the limelight?” An Imperial Son was indignant.","“In a battle of equal cultivation levels, probably no one would be able to suppress them.”","“Golden Silk Moth and Chi Menghan may be able to put up a fight, but it’s also difficult for them to win.”","“One can only rely on their cultivation level to suppress them.”","All the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters had a short exchange of words, and their expressions were all gloomy. They had always been synonymous with being invincible among their peers, and now, they could only look up at two people of the same age, which made them feel very displeased.","Thankfully, at least Ling Han and Ding Shu could be considered Imperial Sons, and did not bring shame to the whole circle of Imperial Sons.","The main focus this time was the auction. When more or less everyone had arrived, the auction segment began.","The auction items were mostly suitable for cultivators below the Spiritual Transformation Tier, but occasionally, Venerate Tier-level treasures would appear, and many Venerate Tiers would fight over them, calling out astronomical bids.","However, a treasure of this level was not something that could be paid for with Dao Stones. It was basically a barter, depending on what type of treasure the auctioneer wanted. It was either a Great Herb, a cultivation technique, a secret technique, or a top grade Divine Metal.","The auction would continue for a total of 10 days, and treasures of the climax level would appear every day. Some of them were so valuable that even Ling Han was envious. Unfortunately, there was no way he could win over Venerate Tier elites.","He also took out alchemical pills for auction. With his current alchemy abilities, he naturally concocted quite a number of extremely precious alchemical pills, which caused a fight.","Especially when it was a few Venerate Tier-level alchemical pills that had been auctioned off for an astronomical price, which made Ling Han overflow with profit.","That’s right. He could attend more of this kind of auction.","Because all the Imperial Clans didn’t connect to the Galaxy Network, Ling Han naturally could avoid exposing the weakness in his identity with his “Ling Han” account.","In the blink of an eye, nine days had passed, and the auction had entered into the last day.","Though there had been climax-level treasures appearing a few days ago, everyone knew that the items being auctioned today would definitely be even more precious. There would be climax-level treasures appearing.","Ling Han also had a large amount of spare cash in his hands, and was waiting to throw it around like crazy.","Sure enough, the first item being auctioned was a Venerate Tier-level treasured medicine that could extend the lifespan of even Venerate Tier elites by 3000 years.","Venerate Tier elites could theoretically live for 100,000 years, and 3,000 years was equivalent to an ordinary person’s lifespan of three years. This was naturally extremely precious.","In truth, this treasure was also completely suitable for True Self Tier, Core Formation Tier, and so on. It could increase the life force of cultivators, and in martial arts, they would naturally be able to advance even further.","However, with Venerable Tier elites participating, especially a few old Venerate Tiers whose lifespans were already close to drying up, who would dare compete with them?","What they were fighting over was not treasures, but rather their lives!","Thus, none of the younger generation tactfully participated in the contest, and allowed the senior Venerate Tier elites to argue with flushed faces.","“Qi Buyan, you’re clearly only 80,000 years old. You’re still far from death. Why are you fighting with me?”","“Pei, I suffered internal injuries when I was young, and in recent years, I’ve always had a resonance with the heavens. I realized that my lifespan is about to end, and you took good care of yourself. Now, you’re only 90,000 years old. At least, you can still live for a few thousand years. What’s the point of competing with me!”","“All of you shut up. Just look at all of you. Your vitality is still boiling, but as for me? I have already entered a period of deterioration of my vitality, and my lifespan is less than a hundred years.”","“Humph, who doesn’t have a limited lifespan? There’s nothing much to say. The one who makes the highest bid wins.”","At this time, those Venerate Tier elites were completely shameless. With their own lives at stake, any kind of friendship was useless. They all increased the bid fiercely. In any case, if they died, so what if they had a pile of treasures?","Finally, this Great Herb was bought by the Sea Spirit Venerate. Not only did he take out a Venerate Tier precious tool, he also added a great many Dao Stones, and promised to help the seller three times.","When the Great Herb was delivered into his hands, the Sea Spirit Venerate swallowed it without a second word. His life essence immediately became much more vigorous, and the other senior Venerates were all extremely envious.","However, the Great Herb had already been consumed. They could only hope that this kind of treasured medicine that could extend lifespan would appear again in the future.","Unfortunately, this kind of treasured medicine was really too rare. If it was not for the fact that its medicinal effects were not enough, it could only extend the lifespan of Saints by two to three years, at most, even Saints would probably take part in the competition. In that case, all Venerate Tiers would have to step aside.","To snatch the life of a Saint, the Great Herb was equivalent to poison.","Ling Han himself was not interested in this kind of Great Herb, but he very much wanted to make a move, because the Nine Mountains Venerate was also running out of lifespan.","‘I have to find a chance to return to the Nine Suns Holy Land, and teach the Imperial Scroll to the old man as well as Luan Xing, and the others,’ he murmured inwardly. If he had the Imperial Scroll’s help, would the old man be able to take another step further, and break through to become a Saint?","If Nine Mountains became a Saint, then he would be able to gain another nine hundred thousand years of lifespan, which was equivalent to having nine more lifetimes. Furthermore, he would also be able to become Ling Han’s incredibly solid backer.","Saint-level beings were beings that even the Imperial Clans would have to be wary of.","That’s right. The Imperial Weapon was capable of killing Saints, but what Saint would foolishly take on the Imperial Weapon head-on? If a Saint went all out to play dirty with you, just see which Imperial Clan would not have a massive headache. They could only hide in their Imperial Clans.","The Battle God Palace was proof of this. Their Killing Saint was completely shameless, hiding in the shadows and ambushing his enemies. Whether it was Saints, Venerate Tiers, or even Foundation Building Tiers, they would kill anyone they encountered. Thus, even the Imperial Clans were unwilling to provoke such an enemy.","The logic was the same. If elites no longer worried about the future, and shamelessly played dirty, even the Imperial Clans would not be able to bear it.","“Next, it’s a piece of beast hide.” After a few more treasures were auctioned off, the auctioneer waved his hand, and a female attendant brought out a brocade plate. There was a pitch-black beast hide laid out on it, but one could clearly see that it was not complete.","In that instant, Ling Han’s heart beat wildly.","Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy!","It must be. That texture, that incomplete sense of familiarity.","The auctioneer was also a Venerate Tier elite. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to suppress the situation at all. He smiled faintly, and said, “According to the appraisal of my clan, this is a piece of beast hide that originated from the Primitive Age. It can even be traced back to when heaven and earth first began, and belongs to the most ancient Divine Beast.”","Everyone’s interest was piqued upon hearing this.","“However, the seals on it... are far from being as old as this. After careful appraisal by my clan, they should be about ten million years old. There would be some errors, but at most, it would only be one to two million years of difference,” the auctioneer continued."]},{"number":4226,"title":"Chapter 4226: Exchange","paragraphs":["Chapter 4226: Exchange","Editor: Henyee Translations","About ten million years ago?","Everyone flipped through history. However, a considerable number of people looked confused.","“That’s right. That is a lapse in history.” The auctioneer nodded, “It is rumored that there was a Great Emperor in that era, but there was also a storm of darkness, which caused a great catastrophe. In fact, in the North Heavenly Realm...”","He didn’t continue, but everyone knew that it was at that time that the North Heavenly Realm damaged their fortune, causing the overall overall level of cultivation of an entire Heavenly Realm to drop drastically. From then onwards, the North Heavenly Realm had become the weakest of all four Heavenly Realms.","Something that could affect a Heavenly Realm, and the effects had continued for so many years, what kind of great event had happened all those years ago?","There were great elites who had been studying historical records, and there were even people who were tracing back time, but up until now, this was still a great mystery.","Then, could this piece of beast hide possibly expose this lapse in history?","Ling Han knew very well that this was definitely not a historical record, but the fifth corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram!","“I have to clarify first. Though this beast hide originates from the Divine Beast, the divine essence within has long since been refined. If you want to refine it into a Spirit Tool, hoho, that would be absolutely impossible,” the auctioneer said with a smile.","This caused some Venerate Tier elites to be disappointed. They indeed wanted to move, and obtain the hide to refine it into a tool, or use it to comprehend the Heavenly Dao. Because a Divine Beast was born by nature, it was naturally the closest to Dao.","However, it had already lost its divine essence, so what use was it?","“Now, this beast hide only has the characteristic of being sturdy. If it is wrapped around one’s body, it would be difficult for sharp weapons to cause harm,” the auctioneer said.","This caused all the Venerates to shake their heads. For cultivation levels like theirs, aside from Venerate Tier precious tools that could increase battle prowess, their attacks stimulated the Regulations of heaven and earth, so how could they allow a sharp weapon to strike them?","Thus, this effect of the beast hide was equivalent to nothing.","Good!","Meanwhile, Ling Han was cheering internally. He hoped that the auctioneer would lower the value of this piece of beast hide as much as possible. In that way, there would be no need for him to worry that it would be fought over by those Venerate Tier elites.","“However, no matter what, this is still the skin of a Divine Beast. Furthermore, the seals are incredibly mysterious. Who knows, it may contain an earth-shattering secret.” The auctioneer changed the topic. He could not keep talking about shortcomings.","However, many of the people here were the Venerate Tier elites of Imperial Clans. If he deliberately didn’t speak of its shortcomings, he would also attract great trouble in the future.","“Alright, the starting bid is 1,000,000 Dao Stones,” the auctioneer said.","A million Dao Stones was not a small sum, but if it was used to buy a piece of Divine Beast hide, it was not a loss either.","“1,000,000.” A Venerate Tier elite said with a smile, then said, “I’m buying it for collection. It’s at least a Divine Beast hide.”","This caused all the Venerate Tier elites to laugh as well, but no one placed a bid. Without divine essence, what use was a Divine Beast hide other than for show?","Oh, that’s right. Make some clothes out of this beast hide for his grandson, so he could use it to protect himself?","F***, then it might as well be a Substitution Seal. What need was there for a million Dao Stones? Do you think that Venerate Tiers could easily obtain a large number of Dao Stones?","“1,100,000.” Someone raised the bid.","It was not Ling Han, but Ding Shu.","Ling Han’s heart clenched. How could he have forgotten about this guy?","Others might not be able to tell how valuable this hide was, but Ding Shu had cultivated Destructive Energy, so how could he not know the use of this hide?","That Venerate Tier whose bid had been increased was startled. He had not thought that there would be a junior competing with him. He thought for a moment, and couldn’t help but smile in spite of himself. In any case, it was just playing around, so there was no need for him to lower himself to the level of a junior.","He did not speak, and gave up the competition.","“It’s already 1,100,000. Is there anyone else bidding?” The auctioneer swept his gaze over the masses, slightly displeased. For better or worse, this was still a Divine Beast hide.","Fine then.","“1.2 million,” Ling Han said.","“1,300,000.” There was no need for the auctioneer to start the bidding, and Ding Shu immediately increased the bid, appearing to be determined to win.","“1.4 million.”","“1.5 million.”","Ling Han opened his mouth, and Ding Shu immediately increased the bid again, aggressively.","Yi, wasn’t it said that the Buddhist Race of the four Heavenly Realms were a family, and would love and support each other?","Everyone was watching the show. They had not thought that this piece of Divine Beast hide would actually be the most fiercely contested between the two Buddha Sons of the Buddhist Race.","Yi, was this really some kind of treasure? Otherwise, why would they be fighting so fiercely over it?","However, even the great elites of the Imperial Clans didn’t notice anything off. Otherwise, how could they possibly put it up for auction? From this aspect, it didn’t seem to have any value to be contested over in the auction.","“2,900,000.” Shi Yuanzhen spoke up, becoming the third competitor.","What was going on?","Everyone faltered for a moment before coming to a realization.","Shi Yuanzhen had been horribly defeated by Ling Han and Ding Shu, and his reputation had been ruined. He could not get his revenge in terms of battle prowess, so he had to come at this time to disgust the two of them.","“3,000,000.” Ding Shu was completely unconcerned, showing his wealth.","“3.5 million.” Shi Yuanzhen began to increase the bid greatly.","“Four million.” Ding Shu immediately followed, not giving Ling Han the chance to speak.","“4.5 million!”","...","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. What need was there for him to compete with Ding Shu? He had cultivated a total of four corners of Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, and one of the corners was used for the exchange with Ding Shu, while the other was what he had gotten from Ding Shu in exchange. Thus, he still had two corners of Spirit Diagram that he could use for another trade.","Thus, so what if this corner of the Spirit Diagram was given to Ding Shu? He could completely trade for it.","In this way, it was a win-win situation.","Good.","Ling Han didn’t say anything else. If Ding Shu couldn’t compete with Shi Yuanzhen, it wouldn’t be too late for him to place another bid.","Shi Yuanzhen increased the bid a few times, pushing the price of the Divine Beast hide up to six million Dao Stones. He did not dare to continue playing, fearing that Ding Shu would suddenly give in. Then, he would be compelled to pay for this piece of beast hide.","“Six million once.”","“Six million twice.”","“Six million, going thrice.”","“Deal.”","The auctioneer made the final bid. If it was six million, it just barely met his expectations.","Afterward, a few more treasures were placed on the stage. However, Ling Han wasn’t interested in any of them. Those were only celestial techniques. He no longer lacked them. Unless he was given the Imperial Scroll, even an Imperial Technique would find it very difficult to attract his interest.","After all, he had already obtained quite a number of Imperial Techniques, so it was already enough.","If it was the Imperial Scroll, the more it was, the better. This was a path that a Great Emperor had walked before, and had great reference value. Unfortunately, the Imperial Scroll was the foundation of an Imperial Clan. Who would put it up for auction?","‘Sigh, I can only look for other people like the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor,’ Ling Han thought.","The auction this time round had ended successfully, and Ling Han immediately went to find Ding Shu.","“There is indeed more than one corner of Spirit Diagram you possess!” Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, Ding Shu spoke first.","Otherwise, Ling Han wouldn’t have given up so easily. Now, he was definitely here to trade.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “You’re so smart, so there’s no need for me to say anything else. Let’s trade.”","“I haven’t learnt it yet!” Ding Shu emphasized.","“It’s all right. You haven’t learnt mine either,” Ling Han said with a smile. “We can trade back when I’m done. Isn’t that the same?”","“Your words make a lot of sense. I actually can’t refute them.” Ding Shu sighed. He kept feeling that something was off.","Yi, wasn’t it he who had bought this Spirit Diagram? Why was it Ling Han who would learn it first?","However, he couldn’t refuse the temptation of exchanging Spirit Diagrams with Ling Han, so he could only nod in agreement."]},{"number":4227,"title":"Chapter 4227: Slander","paragraphs":["Chapter 4227: Slander","Editor: Henyee Translations","After Ling Han obtained the fifth corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, he immediately began to cultivate.","He was already accustomed to this. Merely a day later, he had completed his cultivation.","By this time, he could already clearly deduce that there were a total of nine parts of the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy.","He had already obtained five, and was still missing four portions.","Because they were at Liangsen Planet, Ling Han didn’t test out the new might of Destructive Energy. Instead, he went to find Ding Shu, and traded for the original Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy.","In fact, if he didn’t trade, he would definitely have a greater advantage. It would be equivalent to obtaining a Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy for nothing, but this wasn’t Ling Han’s character.","Ding Shu also sighed ruefully, and said, “Though we are destined to become competitors in future, that would not hinder our personal relations, right?”","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded.","“All right.” Ding Shu stretched out his hand, and shook Ling Han’s hand. They exchanged a smile.","Ling Han returned to his room, only to see that a guest had already arrived.","This was a young man with an imposing aura. He looked to be in his mid-twenties, and was dressed in a blue warrior suit. His nose was clear and his eyes were bright, and he was overwhelmingly handsome.","His hair was jet-black, but upon closer look, every single strand of hair was glowing. They were actually multiple seals!","What a terrifying guy!","Ling Han immediately made his judgement. This was a True Self Tier elite, but had reached the fourth form, and his abilities were temporarily unknown.","“Let me introduce myself. My name is Lin Yun,” the young man said with a faint smile.","‘Lin Yun?’","The Imperial Son of the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan, ranked second, and first was naturally Lin Xuan, a member of the Golden Generation. Although Lin Yun wasn’t as freakish as Lin Xuan, he was still considerably stronger than Lin Lang’s generation, and could be called the Silver Generation.","Ling Han did not have a good impression of the Lin Clan. However, he was presently Shi Xinming, and had no animosity with the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan. Of course, he could not possibly show animosity for no reason.","“Hello.” Ling Han nodded.","‘F*ck! That’s it?’","Lin Yun felt a little awkward. ‘I can be considered your senior, at least. Now that I’ve humbled myself to come here, you didn’t even say please sit down or serve me a cup of tea. Aren’t you being too arrogant?’","How arrogant.","He calmed himself down and said, “I want to know if you obtained the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.”","‘Here it comes.’","Ling Han thought internally. He knew that the Imperial Clan elites definitely hadn’t invited him over purely for the sake of the auction. Instead, they were obsessing over the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.","However, he was a Buddha Son, after all, and they weren’t sure whether he had obtained the inheritance of the Holy Emperor or not. Thus, they could only use this method to probe him. Otherwise, they might directly kidnap him and search through his divine sense.","“So what if I did? So what if I didn’t?” he asked calmly. “What does it have to do with Brother Lin?”","He showed an obvious hostility, because this involved his privacy, so he had every reason to express his displeasure.","Lin Yun laughed loudly, pressed his hands down, and said, “Brother Shi, don’t be nervous. I have no malicious intent! Name your price. As long as you are willing to hand over the Imperial Scroll, my Lin Clan can teach you three Imperial Techniques!”","Imperial Technique!","This was too alluring. Even if Ling Han was the Buddha Son of West Heavenly Realm, obtaining an Imperial Technique was still extremely difficult.","Three Imperial Techniques... was probably enough to make a Dao Child betray the Holy Land.","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. The Imperial Technique was only a manifestation of the Imperial Scroll. How could it compare to the Imperial Scroll?","Furthermore, did he still lack Imperial Techniques?","It was given for free, and he did not mind learning it, but to use the Imperial Scroll in exchange for it was really too funny.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Brother Lin, do you think that I have the upper hand in this deal?”","“Of course,” Lin Yun nodded proudly.","“Alright,” Ling Han said with a smile. This made Lin Yun feel delighted, but his next words almost made Lin Yun’s nose twist in anger, “Then how about I give Brother Lin three Imperial Techniques, and Brother Lin let me see the Imperial Scroll of the Lin Clan?”","Why don’t you just f****** go to the heavens?","Just how valuable was the Imperial Scroll of the Lin Clan? That was the foundation of the Lin Clan, and even among the Lin Clan, the number of people that could cultivate the Imperial Scroll of the Lin Clan could be counted on one hand.","Even for him, not only could he only obtain the part of the Imperial Scroll that corresponded to a certain cultivation level, the Saints of the clan had also placed a restriction in his mind. If any external force touched the memories of the Imperial Scroll, his mind would immediately explode.","“Humph, you’ve gone too far!” he immediately said.","Ling Han spread his hands and said, “So strange. It’s my advantage that you gave me three Imperial Techniques to trade for the Imperial Scroll, but I have gone too far for giving you three Imperial Techniques to take a look at the Lin Clan’s Imperial Scroll?”","“Are you an idiot or are you an idiot?”","Lin Yun was enraged. ‘You dare to insult me right in front of me?’","“Shi Xinming, don’t be ungrateful!” he said balefully.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I’m truly sorry. I didn’t obtain the inheritance of the Holy Emperor. Those members of your Golden Generation have all arrived before me, so obtaining the inheritance of the Holy Emperor should also be you people from the Imperial Clans. What does it have to do with me?”","Lin Yun looked at Ling Han balefully, and after a long while, he nodded, “Since you insist on going your own way, fine, bear the consequences.”","He strode off.","Ling Han smiled eerily. No matter what, he would not hand over the Imperial Scroll, and would definitely not compromise.","So what if he had offended the Imperial Clans? It was not as if he had not offended them before. Worse come to worst, he could just change his identity again.","Only after a while, someone came to find Ling Han again.","An Imperial Son of the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan, but not Cheng Qing.","He was very polite, and had Ling Han name his own price. As long as he was willing to share the inheritance of the Holy Emperor, anything was negotiable.","Meanwhile, Ling Han wore a troubled expression, and said, “I’m truly sorry. I’ve already reached an agreement with the Lin Clan just then, and I’ve already received many benefits from them. I’ve already handed over all of my gains from the corpse of the Holy Emperor.”","The Imperial Son nodded, and said, “All right, I understand.”","He turned around and left. It was obvious that he had gone to report to the higher-ups of the clan. This was a serious matter.","After another while, the third Imperial Clan member arrived.","This time, it was the Imperial Daughter, who had come. She was as beautiful as a fairy, but her abilities were also astonishingly strong. She belonged to the Silver Generation, and was a generation older than Baili Che and the others. However, in terms of age, she was only about fifty years older than them.","For cultivators, especially those with higher cultivation levels, to say nothing of fifty years, even a hundred years would be like the snap of a finger. Thus, strictly speaking, whether it was the Golden Generation, the Silver Generation, or Baili Che’s generation, they were all from the same generation.","However, the Golden Generation was too freakish, and they had to separate them out, which was why they were called the Golden Generation and the Silver Generation.","Though this person was an Imperial Daughter, her purpose for coming was the same. She wanted Ling Han to share the Imperial Scroll with him.","In any case, Ling Han had already slandered the Lin Clan, so he naturally didn’t mind throwing some more slander at them. Thus, he used the same excuse to refuse—he had made a deal with the Lin Clan, and handed over all his gains without leaving anything behind.","Two clans, three clans, and very soon, all the Imperial Clans found out. The Lin Clan had beaten them to it, and obtained the inheritance of the Holy Emperor.","In truth, the Imperial Clans did not mind sharing this Imperial Scroll. In any case, it was only for reference purposes, as long as the Imperial Scroll was not taught to outsiders, that was fine. But you, the Lin Clan, actually want to keep it all for yourself? That could not be allowed!","All of a sudden, the Lin Clan became the target of all."]},{"number":4228,"title":"Chapter 4228: Forced","paragraphs":["Chapter 4228: Forced","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was naturally slander.","No matter how the members of the Lin Clan tried to explain, it was useless. When it involved the Imperial Scroll, anyone would rather believe it to be true than not.","Finally, the Venerate Tier elite from the Lin Clan Clan personally stepped out, demanding that Ling Han give an explanation in public.","Ling Han stepped out, and said with a smile, “Apologies, I was just joking with everyone. I did not gain anything from the corpse of the Holy Emperor.”","‘F*ck! Is this a joke?’","The Fire Cloud Imperial Clan was almost angered to death. ‘You’ve troubled the Lin Clan so badly, and you want to remove yourself from this matter by saying this was just a joke?’","But what could they do about it? Though Ling Han had screwed them over, he still acted in the position of a junior. He said that it was a joke, and the Lin Clan had not lost anything because of this. Could it be that they wanted to beat Ling Han to death because of a joke?","Don’t think that the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm was not the Buddhist Race. After all, Ling Han still had the title of Buddha Son. If they went too far, that would be looking down on the Buddhist Race.","No Imperial Clan would be willing to shoulder this responsibility.","Added with the fact that the Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva had stepped out to apologize to the great Imperial Clans on Ling Han’s behalf, acting like an elder that was protecting his junior, so what could the Lin Clan do about it?","And just like that, the farce disappeared without a trace.","But just the night before Ling Han was about to leave with the Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva, an uninvited guest paid Ling Han a visit.","This was called an uninvited guest because he had barged in without Ling Han’s permission.","Lin Xuan was the most outstanding member of the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan. His natural talent in cultivation was also the strongest in history, and he was a member of the Golden Generation.","“I’ll give you one last chance. Hand over the Imperial Scroll,” Lin Xuan said calmly. His expression was gentle, but coupled with the intertwining of dragons and phoenixes on his body and the strange phenomenon of Spiritual Springs appearing beneath his feet, it formed a great pressure.","Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, he continued, “I am destined to become Emperor, and becoming my enemy is an unwise move! I can easily kill you. Furthermore, at most, a few days later, I may not even remember your name after killing you.”","“Your natural talent in cultivation is not too bad, but in my eyes, you are like an ant. The gap is as wide as the sky!”","“Your only value is to hand over the Imperial Scroll, and when I become Emperor in the future, even if it is just this little bit of kindness, it would be enough to allow you to run rampant in the world, and no one would dare touch you!”","“Moreover, the Imperial Scroll is only worth studying for me. Even if I don’t have it, it can’t stop me from achieving Dao!”","“Thus, to become my enemy, or have me owe you a favor... If you can still be considered smart, you should know what choice you have to make.”","Lin Xuan stood proudly in front of Ling Han, like an emperor giving alms to Ling Han.","Ling Han was furious. This guy was too conceited.","“Hehe, so what if you’re the Golden Generation?” He revealed a disdainful smile, “You were only born about a hundred years earlier than me. If we had the same cultivation time, I would be able to beat you up with one hand. Do you believe me?”","Lin Xuan wasn’t angered, and he said, “Your self-deceiving words are completely meaningless, and it’s also impossible for you to anger me. I’ve already said that you’re only an ant on the ground, while I’m the True Dragon from the Nine Heavens. Do you think that the True Dragon will become angry just because an ant on the ground is baring its fangs and brandishing its claws at him?”","“Unworthy, you’re not worthy!”","He spoke matter-of-factly, as if he was merely stating a fact.","Indeed, he had the right to be proud. The Golden Generation was comparable to the Great Emperors of the past. Furthermore, he was a whole two major cultivation levels higher than Ling Han. This was an absolutely one-sided suppression, and a world of difference.","Ling Han remained silent, a faint smile on his face.","Everything was up to the future.","At present, he was indeed no match for Lin Xuan, but the gap between the two of them would only continue to shrink. One day, he would beat up this bastard.","Just wait and see.","“Imperial Scroll!” Lin Xuan shouted lightly. Weng, this exploded in Ling Han’s mind.","Ling Han couldn’t help but tremble, blood gushing from all his apertures.","Lin Xuan was too strong. He was Sect Master-level, and was already qualified to be called a great elite. This kind of elite only had to give out a light shout, and it would be enough to kill a True Self Tier.","Ling Han’s body was as straight as a spear. His strength was indeed inferior, but in terms of willpower, he was definitely not the slightest bit inferior.","“Humph, pointless resistance!” Lin Xuan sneered. Boom, there was no need for him to make a move at all. His divine sense was like a mountain, pressing down on Ling Han.","Even if Ling Han’s physique was astonishing, under the pressure of the Sect Master-level divine sense, every bone in his body was still trembling.","Lin Xuan hadn’t used his full power yet. Otherwise, he could kill Ling Han with a single thought.","“Kneel!” Lin Xuan said balefully. ‘Aren’t you arrogant? Then I’ll make you lose all face and leave behind a humiliation that will never be erased.’","“Imperial Son Xuan, you have gone too far!” The Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva’s voice rang out. He had come with Ling Han in the first place with the intention of protecting him, so how could he just sit by and watch?","Lin Xuan was slightly startled, but was completely unconcerned, “So it is Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva.”","“You can leave now,” the Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva said calmly.","“What if I say no?” Lin Xuan said with a smile. He was actually unafraid of even Venerate Tier elites.","The Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva couldn’t help but feel angry. It’s true that you’re the Imperial Son, and the Golden Generation is indeed awesome, but I’m a Venerate Tier, after all, and a three-star one at that. There’s a gap of a major tier between us, so what right do you have to act arrogant in front of me?","“Don’t force me to make a move,” he said. Though his tone was still relatively calm, there was already a hint of anger in his tone.","Lin Xuan finally smiled, “I was just joking. How could I dare to disobey a Venerate Tier’s command?”","He waved his hand, turned and left.","Ling Han stared at his receding back, his fury surging.","Lin Xuandared to act so wantonly because he was from the Imperial Clan and that he himself was a Sect Master. Thus, he could trample all over Ling Han as he pleased. He didn’t even care about Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva.","Good! Good! Good!","Ling Han took a deep breath, turning his fury into motivation. When he became a Sect Master, that would be the day that Lin Xuan would die.","Now, he had to swallow this anger.","After a day, the Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva brought Ling Han back to the Stainless Planet.","Good news came. The little azure dragon and the large black dog came out of seclusion in a few days. They had already grasped the Imperial Scroll, and were beginning to recultivate their cultivation levels with the Imperial Scroll This obviously wouldn’t take too long.","Ling Han was overjoyed, and decided to return to Nine Suns Holy Land.","He pretended to be cultivating in seclusion, then built a Transfer Formation for himself. He left the Stainless Planet, then changed his appearance, and headed all the way to the Nine Suns Planet.","Two months later, he had already returned to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","He first contacted the empress, and asked her to bring him into the Holy Land. Then, he found the Nine Mountains Venerate. After roughly explaining his experiences, he recited the Imperial Scroll.","This was very difficult, because the Imperial Scroll was a deduction of the Dao of heaven and earth, and could not be formulated into words or pictures. Ling Han could only outline it in the form of seals, and play out its changes.","Thankfully, the old man was a Venerate Tier elite, after all. To him, this was not a heavenly book, that could not be read at all.","However, it still took the Nine Mountains Venerate three months to finally memorize the Imperial Scroll. As for when he would be able to comprehend it, he didn’t know.","The task of teaching the empress and Hu Niu would be delegated to Nine Mountains Venerate. Ling Han would return to Stainless Planet. He was the Buddha Son, so he couldn’t disappear for too long."]},{"number":4229,"title":"Chapter 4229: Old Black is Wounded","paragraphs":["Chapter 4229: Old Black is Wounded","Editor: Henyee Translations","Towards Ling Han, this disciple of his, the Nine Mountains Venerate felt both admiration and gratitude.","Actually, there were quite a few disciples that garnered his admiration. It was fine as long as their natural talent was good, but Ling Han wasn’t only one-sided asking for favors from him. He was also helping him back. For example, the special crystal he had obtained at the Blood Sea contained a sliver of the Dao of a Great Emperor.","Ling Han gave it to him without the slightest hesitation. Though it did not help him advance into Saint Tier, it allowed him to rush up from Seven Star Venerate Tier to Nine Stars in a single go.","And now, it was an Imperial Scroll!","Imperial Scroll, what kind of concept was that?","Whoever possessed the Imperial Scroll would be able to create a Pseudo Imperial Clan. Compared to the true Imperial Clan, they were only lacking an Imperial Weapon.","However, given enough time, Ling Han might be able to find the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s Imperial Weapon. As long as he cultivated the Imperial Scroll, what need would he have to worry about not being able to grasp the corresponding Imperial Weapon?","However, it was alsothis precious Imperial Scroll that Ling Han had given it to him without hesitation. He had even traveled millions and millions of kilometers, taking the risk of being discovered by the Imperial Clans.","How could the Nine Mountains Venerable not be touched?","If it could be said that he had previously purely admired Ling Han’s natural talent, then now, the relationship between the two of them was a little like Master and disciple, father and son.","“Good child!” The Nine Mountains Venerate didn’t say anything to express his gratitude. He simply patted Ling Han’s shoulder and said this.","Ling Han only smiled, and immediately moved to leave.","He didn’t have the Nine Mountains Venerate send him off. Perhaps the elites of the Imperial Clans were monitoring the old man, and this would expose his whereabouts.","Thus, another two months later, Ling Han finally returned to Stainless Planet.","On the Galaxy Network, discussions about him and Ding Shu were extremely heated.","The two Buddha Sons were too awesome!","The Imperial Son, Shi Yuanzhen, was instantly defeated. Even after burning Imperial Blood, he was no match. What did this mean?","This generationof Imperial Sons had already been trampled under the feet of Ling Han and Ding Shu. If one wanted to stand against them at the same cultivation level, the only one who could do so would have to be the Golden Generation.","“No, no, no. You guys are exaggerating too much about Shi Xinming and Shi Tianyun’s strength. They are indeed strong, but they are definitely no match for the Golden Generation.”","“That’s right. Putting aside the fact that there is no absolute fairness in the cultivation world, with a gap of two major tiers, it is possible that they would never be able to catch up to the Golden Generation in terms of cultivation level in this lifetime. Against them, the only result would be death.”","“That’s right. It’s extremely likely that when they have just advanced into Saint Tier, the competition among the Golden Generation geniuses would already be concluded, and a new Emperor would already be born.”","“Although natural talent is important on the path to becoming Emperor, it’s the same for time. There’s almost a hundred years between them. Just what kind of colossal gap is this?”","“Hehe, to say nothing of the Golden Generation, they should first sweep aside the Silver Generation first.”","“Haha!”","However, there were also a great many people who were not optimistic about Ling Han and Ding Shu, and thought that with the Golden Generation having long since achieved Sect Master-level, and even those weaker members were Spirit Transformation Tier, that was why Ling Han and Ding Shu seemed invincible.","There was a voice now, and that was hoping that some Imperial Son of the Silver Generation could make a move, and test out the strength of Ling Han and Ding Shu. Who knows, he might be able to burst the bubble with a single poke.","It could not be helped. Though Ling Han and Ding Shu were also Buddha Sons, they were not from the Buddhist Land. In the hearts of the world, the impression that the Imperial Son was invincible among his peers was unbreakable.","Ling Han was completely unconcerned. He merely focused on increasing his own cultivation level. On one hand, he was stimulating more clay fetuses to advance towards the level of stone fetus, and on the other, he was cultivating Body Art at the same time, trying to complete the True Self Tier chapter of the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique as soon as possible.","Large events happened all the time in the universe. There were awesome rookies that appeared out of nowhere, and there were also prodigies that had been renowned for a long time that died dejectedly. This was a tumultuous era, and the opening of the True Dragon Abyss was even more proof that heaven and earth were already prepared to welcome a new Emperor.","Only one Ancestral King could appear in each era, and this Ancestral King would rule over the entire universe for an incredibly long time. Thus, for all the prodigies, this was the only chance they would have in this lifetime.","In other words, this was the worst era, and also the best era.","Half a year’s time passed in the blink of an eye. Ling Han had only formed a new Stone Fetus, and this was under the condition that the Buddhist Race had supplied him with an ocean of resources. If he relied on himself alone, the time would be extended tenfold.","The higher one’s cultivation level, the more difficult it was to advance. This was an ironclad rule.","Even if he was the Buddha Son, and all the resources were freely supplied to him, the Buddhist Race still had to have so many cultivation resources that could bear his expense.","It had already been a month since Ling Han had received any more cultivation resources. It wasn’t that the Buddhist Race had turned hostile against him, but that they had depleted all of their cultivation resources.","Did he really think that natural treasures could be found anywhere?","The Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm had their own Herb Planet, but there was still four years until the earliest batch of Celestial medicines could be harvested. In the short term, he could not depend on this.","Ling Han looked at the ocean of Dao Stones in his Spatial Tool, and couldn’t help but have the thought of going out to play.","Wasn’t it a great waste not to use such a large number of Dao Stones?","He wasn’t a miser. Moreover, he could only obtain more Dao Stones if his strength improved. This was a very simple logic.","He left quietly. In any case, his formation skills was already at Great Accomplishment level, so it was too easy for him to go to other planets. Then, he would buy the connecting device, connect it to the Galaxy Network, and begin his search.","Were there any large-scale auctions? Were there any Saint-level historical sites that had opened?","However, the universe seemed to have become peaceful all of a sudden. There was actually no major event, which made Ling Han feel gloomy.","After roaming around for a few days, Ling Han returned to the Stainless Planet.","“Little Han, come fight me!” The little azure dragon ran over to ask for a beating again.","He was now cultivating the Imperial Scroll, and thought that he was in no way inferior to Ling Han in any aspect. Thus, he would frequently come to spar with Ling Han, determined to clear his name as the legitimate son of the True Dragon — invincible!","Unfortunately, faced with Ling Han, he was really at a disadvantage in all aspects. Even in the Body Arts domain that he was most proficient in, Ling Han was still slightly stronger than him, what more in other areas.","Peng, peng, peng! After fighting for a while, the little azure dragon collapsed onto the ground.","It was a complete defeat!","“Why? Why? Why?” The little azure dragon began to doubt himself. He was clearly the legitimate son of the True Dragon, which could be said that he simultaneously cultivated two Imperial Scrolls, so his battle prowess should be invincible in this world.","Why couldn’t he defeat Ling Han?","Ling Han patted his shoulder, and said, “It’s fine. You have a lot of time. Think about it slowly.”","The little azure dragon immediately gave him the middle finger.","En, being able to make such a move meant that the blow he had suffered was not too heavy. Next time, he could torture him even harder.","The two of them came back from the wilderness, and had not even entered the main doors of the Divine Temple, when they saw a young man dressed in a white monk’s robe sitting cross-legged at the foot of the steps. He had a bald head, which shone brightly.","“You guys have finally returned!” A voice rang out, filled with hatred.","Yi, this person was?","Peng!","Before Ling Han and the little azure dragon could speak, a figure flew over and crashed heavily onto the ground, raising a cloud of dust.","“Old Blackie!”","Ling Han and the little azure dragon called out at the same time. What had been thrown out was the large black dog. The human figure that he had taken form in was covered in blood, and it was obvious that he had been severely injured. He was currently in a coma.","Ling Han and the little azure dragon were instantly enraged."]},{"number":4230,"title":"Chapter 4230: Shi Mie","paragraphs":["Chapter 4230: Shi Mie","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Shi Yongyun!” Ling Han looked towards the top of the stairs. There was a young man standing there, looking down at him from above.","Shi Yongyun, and he came from the Buddhist Land of the thirty three Heavens. Previously, he had wanted to compete for the position of Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm. However, he was horribly defeated by Ling Han, causing him to leave with resentment. Unexpectedly, he made a comeback.","However, Ling Han did not believe that Shi Yongyun could defeat the large black dog. The large black dog that had simultaneously cultivated two Imperial Techniques was completely capable of suppressing the majority of Imperial Sons, and was definitely not someone that Shi Yongyun could match.","Thus... Ling Han turned to look at the white-robed monk who was seated not too far away.","“You were the one who did it?” he asked calmly.","“That’s me.” The white-robed monk’s eyes had initially been closed, but when he heard Ling Han’s words, he finally opened them. His eyes were as gentle as jade, and there was an indescribable power exuding from them. One would immediately feel at ease upon seeing them.","The Buddhist Race was most skilled at controlling souls.","Ling Han humphed. His willpower was as firm as iron, and he had also cultivated the Six Characters Bright King Curse, so how could he possibly be affected? He clenched his fists, and ka, ka, ka, his knuckles cracked loudly.","“No matter who you are, if you hurt my friend, there is only battle left.”","The white-robed monk recited a Buddhist chant, “I am Shi Mie, and have come to ask for guidance.”","Boom, he stood up, his aura beginning to boil.","In the beginning, though he was sitting there in a cross-legged position, it was as if he did not exist at all. There was not the slightest bit of aura leaking out, but now that he had stood up, his aura began to surge madly like a tsunami.","Weng, a Buddha Halo appeared behind his head, but it was not golden like the others, but rather as black as ink, and what formed the Buddha Halo was not pure light of energy, but rather a black snake that kept spinning.","‘F*ck! Is this really Buddhist Race? Why is he so eerie?’","“Little baldy, let me fight you!” The little azure dragon was the first to charge out. Although he usually bickered with the large black dog, they were actually on extremely good terms.","“Ignorance!” Shi Mie moved. He shot out a fist, which shot towards the little azure dragon.","Peng!","The little azure dragon took it head-on, but the moment it came into contact, it was sent flying.","The gap in battle prowess was too wide.","“Wa!” The little azure dragon spat out a mouthful of blood. Although his physique was tough, the power of the heaven and earth Regulations and high-level energy that was contained in the attack from Shi Mie was too much for his physique to withstand.","Thankfully, this could only be considered light injuries.","Ling Han couldn’t help but frown. He was naturally familiar with the little azure dragon’s strength. If he used an Imperial Technique, his ultimate battle prowess would be around 27 Heavens, but in the case of Shi Mie, the battle prowess of that punch just now was 31 Heavens, and the latter clearly hadn’t used the Imperial Technique.","“I’ll do it!” Seeing that the little azure dragon still wanted to charge out, Ling Han stretched out a hand to stop it.","The little azure dragon was furious, but he finally came back to his senses, and said to Ling Han, “Be careful, this guy is at the fourth form of True Self Tier. Moreover, he belongs to the prodigy category.”","An ordinary cultivator of the fourth form of the True Self Tier would only have the raw power of 12 Heavens, and would not be able to grasp the Imperial Techniques and Saint Techniques. His battle prowess would only be 15 heavens at most. However, Shi Mie came from the Buddhist Land, so he naturally could not be this kind of weakling.","Ling Han nodded, and walked forwards, “Just because you come Buddhist Land from the Thirty three Heavens, you can bully the weak with your superior strength, and do as you please?”","He wasn’t just saying this to Shi Mie and Shi Yongyun. He was also saying this to the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm.","The three of them were Buddha Sons and Pseudo Buddha Sons, but right at their own doorstep, they were blocked, and the large black dog was severely injured. What was going on here?","If the higher-ups of the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm did not allow this, would Shi Yongyun and Shi Mie still dare to do this?","This made Ling Han especially furious.","“Hahaha!” Shi Yongyun laughed loudly, “Idiot, do you know what Buddhist Land means? Fine, I’ll give you an analogy. In the mortal world, those that walk out from the Imperial Capital are higher up in status!”","“Furthermore, do you know who Brother Mie is?”","“Brother Mie’s grandfather is the Mysterious Heaven Buddha!”","The Buddha was a Saint, and the direct descendant of a Saint from the Imperial Clan was indeed awesome. No wonder even Black Cloud and the other Bodhisattvas didn’t appear, because how could they afford to offend a Buddha?","—The Bodhisattvas naturally had to listen to the Buddha, and the West Heavenly Realm Branch naturally had to listen to the Buddhist Land.","“Shi Xinming, bear with it for the moment and let this matter go.” At this moment, Ling Han heard Yunshu Bodhisattva’s divine sense transmission in his mind.","That’s right, Venerates were great elites, so even if they closed their eyes and meditated, how could they not sense what was happening at the foot of this mountain gate?","However, these Bodhisattvas did not stop them previously, and insisted on interfering at this time. Wasn’t it clear that they wanted Shi Yongyun and Shi Mie to commit the crime?","Bear with it?","Swallow his ange, and allow the large black dog to suffer this beating for nothing? Furthermore, Shi Yongyun had clearly come back for revenge this time round. Even if he was willing to swallow his anger, would he let the matter go?","That’s right. In front of the eyes of three Bodhisattvas, it was absolutely impossible that he would be severely injured. At most, he would only be humiliated.","However, for Ling Han, this was unacceptable.","He could be defeated, he could lose, but he would definitely not compromise.","This was his belief. If his belief collapsed, what was the point of talking about becoming a Saint?","Ling Han suddenly laughed madly, his laughter filled with fury.","The world was unjust? Then he would be the one to raze it to the ground.","With a battle cry, he charged towards Shi Mie.","“Ignorant!” Shi Mie humphed coldly, and stretched out his left hand, pressing forwards.","Weng! An indescribably pitch-black hand materialized in the air and swatted down at Ling Han.","“Scram!” Ling Han roared. The Ice Moon Saber slashed out, transforming into an ice-cold heavenly saber that slashed at the pitch-black giant hand.","Peng!","With a slash of the saber, that giant hand was immediately sliced open, as if the darkness had been split open, and light reappeared.","“Yi?” Shi Mie showed a hint of surprise, “I have underestimated you.”","He had only channeled the Saint Technique in that attack just now, but his battle prowess was still as high as 31 Heavens. He had not thought that it would still be broken by Ling Han.","It didn’t matter. He was from the Buddhist Land, and he also had an ancestor who was a Buddha.","Boom, he threw another punch, and an indescribable Buddhist might surged out, making people involuntarily want to kneel down and repent for their crimes.","The heavenly saber was immediately shattered, but when the attack landed, Ling Han had already used his movement technique to dodge.","After this strike, Ling Han had a complete understanding of Shi Mie’s strength.","—The original power was about twenty-five Heavens, and using the Saint Technique, he would have the battle prowess of thirty-one Heavens, while with Imperial Technique, he would be able to rush up to thirty-four Heavens.","To be honest, Shi Mie wasn’t all that outstanding. His basic power was still inferior to the level of the Holy Land’s Dao Child, but he was still five Heavens above Ling Han. It couldn’t be helped. He was the peak stage of the fourth form of the True Self Tier. He was superior to Ling Han by slightly more than two minor cultivation levels.","However, if Ling Han could unleash his full power, he was sure that defeating Shi Mie wouldn’t be too difficult. In fact, it wouldn’t be a problem for him to kill Shi Mie.","However, could he unleash his full power?","There were three Bodhisattvas standing guard here. He only had to use the black light of illusion or weaken Shi Mie’s battle prowess by three Heavens, and he was sure that the Black Cloud Bodhisattva and the others would immediately recognize his true identity.","If a Venerate Tier elite made a move, his only fate would be death."]},{"number":4231,"title":"Chapter 4231: Falling Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 4231: Falling Out","Editor: Henyee Translations","Thus, Ling Han had deep reservations.","He couldn’t use any techniques that would expose his identity, so it was naturally more difficult to defeat Shi Mie on this basis.","Boom!","Shi Mie wouldn’t be reserved with him. After gaining an advantage with a single strike, he immediately launched an offensive.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","His offensive was swift and fierce, wanting to suppress Ling Han in the shortest time possible.","“Good one, Big Brother Mie!” Shi Yongyun called out from the sidelines. However, in the depths of his heart, he was jealous of Shi Mie, and even looked down on him slightly.","—If he could obtain the same cultivation resources and cultivation techniques as Shi Mie, to say nothing of the fact that he would have long since advanced into Spiritual Transformation Tier, even if they were both in the Fourth Form of the True Self Tier, his battle prowess would still be stronger than him by three Heavens.","Humph, if it was not for the fact that he had a grandfather who was a Buddha, who does he think he is?","Ling Han’s figure was as slippery as a fish, and he was always able to escape between Shi Mie’s attacks.","His strategy was very simple. Shi Mie’s maximum battle prowess of 34 Heavens would have to depend on the use of Imperial Technique. Once it fell to the level of Saint Technique, Shi Mie would only be equivalent to him, and could the Imperial Technique be continuously used?","Thus, Ling Han wanted to exhaust Shi Mie’s use of Imperial Techniques. At that time, he would launch a powerful counterattack. With his endless reserves of mystical power, he would definitely be able to make Shi Mie cry.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","In order to ensure that Shi Mie continued to deliver high-intensity attacks, Ling Han would launch a powerful counterattack whenever his opponent’s attacks slacked off the slightest. Shi Mie didn’t dare to relax at all, and he channeled the Imperial Technique at all times.","After such a long time, he also realized that something was off.","Why was he still unable to apprehend Ling Han?","If this continued, his power would be greatly exhausted, and he would no longer be able to channel the Imperial Technique.","On the surface, he was still completely on the upper hand. As he shot out a punch, expanses of black clouds spread out. The divine chains of order were also as black as ink, traversing through the black clouds, possessing boundless destructive power.","However, Ling Han continued to twist and turn, and not a single divine chain of order could touch him. No matter how powerful your attacks were, so what?","Shi Mie’s eyes turned, and he suddenly pounced at the little azure dragon and the large black dog.","F***, f***!","Ling Han cursed internally, and hurriedly leaped out to intercept him.","Peng!","This time, he could no longer dodge Shi Mie’s attacks, and clashed head-on with him.","“Wa!” Ling Han spat out a mouthful of blood, his face pale.","In truth, he was the one who had had taken the initiative to spit out a mouthful of blood. He could disperse attacks within a gap of six Heavens. Even if the Imperial Technique was fierce and had terrifying destructive power, it would not be enough to make him throw up blood.","However, dispersing attacks was an ability that belonged to “Ling Han”, so he naturally couldn’t expose it.","Shi Mie finally gained a substantial advantage. He couldn’t help but reveal a cold smile, saying, “I heard that you obtained the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor.”","Ling Han instantly came to a realization.","No wonder Shi Mie had come. He had not just come to stand up for Shi Yongyun. His true motive was for the inheritance of the Holy Emperor, and standing up for him was only a pretext.","And why didn’t the three Bodhisattvas make a move?","Obviously, these three also had designs on the inheritance of the Holy Emperor. However, because of their status, it would not be proper for them to demand it from Ling Han. Thus, for them, this was also a chance. As long as Ling Han handed over the inheritance of the Holy Emperor, how could the three of them not be able to see it with their abilities?","Good! Very good!","Ling Han instantly understood, and killing intent instantly rose up in his eyes.","For the time being, he would no longer be able to get any cultivation resources in the Buddhist Race, and it was even more possible that the three Bodhisattvas would make things difficult for him because of this. If he did not hand over the inheritance of the Holy Emperor, they would not give him any cultivation resources.","Since that was the case, they would just have to become hostile.","Ling Han instantly felt like leaving. He couldn’t stay here any longer. However, he wouldn’t leave so easily.","He sent a divine sense message to the little azure dragon, telling it of his decision and telling it to prepare.","“F*ck, do you have to play so hard?” the little azure dragon grumbled. However, it still picked up the large black dog and prepared to flee at any moment.","“Shi Xinming, do you really think you are some Buddha Son?” Shi Mie sneered, “Wrong, very, very wrong. There is only one Buddha Son, and he is in the Buddhist Land of Thirty Three Heavens. Furthermore, let me tell you, in front of the real Buddha Son, you are not even worth a scallion!”","Boom!","As he attacked Ling Han, he continued to launch a flurry of attacks.","Ling Han roared loudly, clashing head-on with Shi Mie with every move. It was as if his anger had been stoked, and he had lost all reason.","“Don’t be defiant. In front of the Golden Generation, you are nothing but trash!” Shi Mie scoffed, and delivered another attack at Ling Han.","Ling Han approached. Weng, the murderous aura activated. Although Shi Mie had a grandfather who was a Buddha Son, he wasn’t a Buddha Son, so how could he possibly obtain a treasure that could dispel the negative effects? He was instantly hit.","However, before he could grab his head and scream, Ling Han’s series of attacks had already arrived, instantly reducing his battle prowess by three Heavens. Then, he brandished the Ice Moon Saber. At the same time that the heavenly saber shot out, the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning also shot out.","Underthe negative effects, just how much had Shi Mie’s battle prowess declined?","Shua! The heavenly saber slashed down, instantly splitting Shi Mie into two. Boundless ice energy surged over, and his two halves were instantly frozen. Peng! They were shattered by the subsequent impact, turning into millions and millions of particles.","Weng! Light surged, and it was as if time had been reversed. Shi Mie had actually come back to life.","Substitution Seal.","Peng! The Primal Chaos Divine Lightning followed behind, and with a single strike, Shi Mie’s head was instantly obliterated.","He died again.","However, his grandfather was a Saint. Even if he wasn’t a Buddha Son, the Substitution Seal could be effective more than once, and he had come back to life once more.","At this moment, the three Bodhisattvas finally came back to their senses and appeared one after another.","They had really not foreseen that Ling Han, who had been at a disadvantage all this while, would suddenly explode, and kill Shi Mie in an instant, and twice at that! Thankfully, Shi Mie had the Substitution Seal. Otherwise, they really did not know how they were supposed to explain this to the Mysterious Heaven Buddha.","“Stop!” they all shouted.","“I was just waiting for you guys!” Ling Han unhesitatingly summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames surged, rolling towards the three Bodhisattvas.","“Not good!” At this moment, the expressions of the three Bodhisattvas changed drastically. These were the highest grade Regulations of Fire, which could burn even Saints to death!","—In a moment of desperation, their judgement was also slightly off. This Heavenly Dao Flames had already been “diluted”. Saints would definitely not burn to death, but it would be enough to severely injure or even burn Venerate Tiers to death.","They wanted to flee, but in order to save Shi Mie, they had charged over with all their might to stop him. How were they supposed to flee?","It was too late to tear open space.","Boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames instantly swept over, surrounding the three Bodhisattvas.","Ling Han didn’t even cast a second look at them. Instead, he set his eyes on Shi Mie.","Shi Mie couldn’t help but feel a chill in his heart, from head to toe.","On the surface, it looked like he had died twice, but in truth, he had not died once. It was the Substitution Seal that had taken effect on his behalf. Otherwise, coming back from death would be a reversal of destiny, and even Saints could not possibly accomplish that.","Thus, he had witnessed his own death twice, though those two versions of himself had been manifested from the Substitution Seal.","Now, the three Venerate Tier elites were trapped, but this bringer of misfortune was targeting him again.","Who would save him?"]},{"number":4232,"title":"Chapter 4232: Buddha moves","paragraphs":["Chapter 4232: Buddha moves","Editor: Henyee Translations","Shi Mie shivered. Though his battle prowess was superior to Ling Han, he did not have the slightest bit of fighting spirit.","He had already died twice in a row, and he still hadn’t walked out of this kind of trauma. Moreover, even Venerate Tiers had been trapped and released terrifying screams, which caused him to lose all his confidence.","How could he possibly defeat such a demon?","Ling Han didn’t waste any time. He charged over again, and the barrage of murderous aura blasted out, making Shi Mie unable to form an effective resistance at all. He threw out an iron fist, and Regulations shone, like when heaven and earth had just been created.","Peng! Shi Mie was killed again.","He “revived” again, but his face was already extremely pale, because he knew that the Substitution Seal could only take effect a total of three times.","If he was killed again, he would really die.","“Don’t kill me, we can talk things over,” he said fearfully.","Ling Han completely ignored him. After a series of attacks, Shi Mie was once again killed. This time, he was unable to come back to life.","‘Huh? He’s dead?’","Ling Han was already prepared, and delivered another series of attacks. Unexpectedly, Shi Mie was already dead.","With a wave of his hand, he grabbed the Spatial Tool that had exploded from Shi Mie’s body. Then, he immediately tossed out the formation foundations, instantly forming the Transfer Formation.","“Let’s go!” He grabbed the little azure dragon, and the little azure dragon carried the large black dog. The formation immediately channeled, and as a flash of light swept past, they instantly disappeared.","Right at this moment, boom, a terrifying aura rippled over, and a large hand stretched out from who knows where. With a single press, the Heavenly Dao Flames were instantly extinguished. Though the three Venerate Tier elites were all riddled with wounds, none of them died.","The weakened version of the Heavenly Dao Flames could burn Venerate Tier elites to death, but definitely couldn’t insta-kill them.","And it should be known that from the moment Ling Han summoned the Heavenly Dao Flames, to the moment he killed Shi Mie, it may seem long, but in truth, it had only been two to three seconds.","Venerate Tier elites were Venerate Tier elites, after all, so how could they be killed so easily?","This large hand took advantage of the opening to grab out at Ling Han and the others, yet missed by a slight margin.","Xiu, a figure appeared out of thin air. It was a skinny old monk, his white beard reaching all the way to his lower abdomen. His whole face was covered with wrinkles, exuding an endless air of decay, as if he should have long since decayed.","However, it was this old monk that made the three Bodhisattvas show a respectful expression. Disregarding the fact that they were injured, they all knelt down, “Greetings, Lord Bright Sun!”","Bright Sun Buddha, a Saint-level being!","The old monk ignored him, and merely stared at the place where Ling Han had disappeared. His gaze was like a pillar, as if he had transmigrated through space.","“Lord, have you found that unfilial brat?” Yunshu Bodhisattva asked with a strong killing intent.","Even the three of them had almost been killed. If he wasn’t an unfilial brat, then what was he?","The old monk showed a hint of surprise, because he had captured Ling Han’s soul fluctuation. In an instant, he had jumped to the next planet, but all of a sudden, this soul fluctuation disappeared.","This was too strange.","That’s not right.","Realization dawned on the old monk. When he spoke, his voice was extremely hoarse, “This boy has cultivated the soul transformation technique, and can no longer be traced.”","“He is Ling Han!” Black Clouds Bodhisattva said. “In the last few moves, the technique he used was Ling Han’s signature ultimate technique.”","“You’re saying that Ling Han actually dared to fake his identity and become a Buddha Son in our race?” Yunshu Bodhisattva asked in disbelief. Just how outrageously bold was he to dare to do such a thing?","“This despicable brat!” The Dragon Elephant Bodhisattva was seething with rage—he didn’t shave his head, and he kept his hair that represented the ties to the mortal world. The three Venerate Tier elites were all tricked by this evil brat and severely wounded. If it weren’t for the Bright Sun Buddha, they could only wait for death.","The old monk humphed, and said, “You people have truly disappointed me. A True Self Tier cultivator almost overturned this place! Humph, the three of you are to personally set off in pursuit. If you don’t bring this brat’s corpse back, there’s no need for you to come back either!”","“Yes, milord!” The three Bodhisattvas bowed in respect. They couldn’t care less about their severe injuries, and immediately set off in pursuit.","Whether it was because of the command of the Buddha, or because they themselves had suffered great humiliation, they were determined to apprehend Ling Han.","The old monk’s eyes swept over, and paused slightly on Shi Yongyun. However, it was as if he had glanced at an ant. He had no intention of speaking at all. With a step, he had already disappeared from sight.","Shi Yongyun almost wet himself in fright. Just now, Ling Han had unleashed his might and killed Shi Mie, making him extremely terrified, fearing that Ling Han would kill him as well.","He didn’t have a Substitution Seal.","Thankfully, the Bright Sun Buddha appeared in the nick of time, scaring Ling Han away, and also saving the three Venerate Tier elites, which also allowed him to escape from danger.","After letting out a sigh of relief, Shi Yongyun wore a distressed expression again.","Shi Mie was the reinforcement that he had called out. Though the other had ulterior motives in the first place, he had died here, so how could he be exonerated?","His grandfather was a Buddha, so how could he withstand his thunderous fury?","What could he do? What could he do?","Only by killing Ling Han would he be able to offset some of his crime. At the very least, he would not have to pay with his life.","His eyes lit up. He was determined to kill Ling Han at all costs. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have a good life in the future.","...","After Ling Han and the others completed the teleportation, they immediately changed their appearance, including their soul fluctuations. Even the large black dog was awoken by Ling Han’s Six Characters Bright King Curse, to have him change his appearance first.","He did not see the Bright Sun Buddha, but sensed that indescribably vast aura, and it was not like he did not know that there was a Buddha there. Thus, it was naturally easy to guess the identity of this person.","Though there was already a planet separating them, if the Saint was to make a move, he would still be able to easily catch up to them. Thus, it was necessary for them to immediately change their appearance.","Right at this moment, an incredibly colossal face appeared in the skies. It was indescribably old, but its face was the size of a planet, exuding an incredibly terrifying aura.","“S-Saint!”","This planet had Venerate Tier elites, yet they were so terrified that they broke out in a cold sweat. Who wouldn’t be afraid of a Saint that had manifested his physical body with the fury of thunder?","If a Saint unleashed their might, they were capable of instantly shattering this planet into pieces. Aside from Venerate Tier elites, even Sect Master elites could only wait helplessly for death.","This face looked down on the planet, its eyes cold. It was as if all life were ants in its eyes. In this moment, everyone on the entire planet felt a chill run down their spines, feeling an indescribable fear.","When one had reached the height of Saint, they could really do as they pleased.","Thankfully, it was only a few seconds, and this face suddenly disappeared. Only then did everyone breathe a sigh of relief.","Ling Han also stared at the sky. Though he had never seen it before, he was certain that this was the Bright Sun Buddha.","“Let’s go!” He didn’t need to use the Transfer Formation on the planet at all, and he had already figured out its structure long ago. With a wave of his hands, formation foundations fell one after another. He, the little azure dragon, and the large black dog were instantly wrapped in white light, and began to traverse again.","After traversing over a dozen times in a single go, Ling Han finally stopped. By now, they were already far away from the Stainless Planet."]},{"number":4233,"title":"Chapter 4233: Island of the Sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 4233: Island of the Sky","After ingesting a large amount of treasured medicine, the large black dog’s recovery speed was extremely quick.","“F***, Grandpa Dog is displeased that I did not manage to kill that b@stard with my own hands!” When the large black dog found out that Shi Mie was dead, he felt slightly appeased, but also slightly depressed.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “It’s fine. There’s another person you can kill.”","“Shi Yongyun?” The large black dog’s eyes lit up.","“That’s right. I deliberately left him alive and didn’t kill him.” With Ling Han’s abilities, it was really easy for him to kill Shi Yongyun by following up with a single punch. However, he didn’t do that because he wanted the large black dog to personally vent his anger.","“All right. From today onwards, Grandpa Dog will properly cultivate, and beat up that b@stard in future.” The large black dog’s fighting spirit was reignited.","“I’ll heal my injuries first.”","Ling Han walked out of his room and casually sat in the courtyard. He raised his head to look at the sky, and began to ponder how he was going to go next.","He had never thought that his days as a spy in the Buddhist Race would end just like that.","“Looks like my acting skills are still not enough,” Ling Han mocked. However, if he could really tolerate this, then would he still be Ling Han?","“Little Han, how’s Old Black?” The little azure dragon returned. He had gone to investigate the situation.","“Much better.” Ling Han nodded, “How are things on your side?”","“He, too exciting!” The little azure dragon laughed loudly.","The Buddha Son defected, and this was naturally a huge scandal. The Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm wanted to hide this, but that battle previously had happened suddenly, and the Buddhist Race had not made any preparations at all. Hence, how could they possibly hide the matter as they wished?","Thus, the entire universe knew.","When everyone found out that the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm was Ling Han, they were all stunned.","F***, so it was this guy!","In the past, when Ling Han fled to the ends of the world, everyone thought that he would be withdrawing from the stage of the prodigy contest. Who would have thought that he would be able to do as he liked? Without a word, he had become the Buddha Son, and appeared grandly in front of the Imperial Clans.","Just look, Shi Yuanzhen had been taught a lesson by Ling Han, and who knew what kind of expression he would have when he found out the truth.","“Please tell me the extent of Shi Yuanzhen’s psychological trauma!” someone joked on the Galaxy Network. This actually caused a great many people to heckle him, and they even began to calculate obediently the extent of his trauma.","However, everyone now knew that Ling Han actually possessed such a profound art of disguise. Even Venerate Tier elites couldn’t tell anything was off.","With this lesson, if Ling Han still wanted to disguise himself and enter into the ranks of the Imperial Clans, that would be as difficult as ascending the heavens.","“Sigh, now that my background has been exposed, how would I be able to scheme in future er, how would I be able to survive?” Ling Han mused ruefully.","“In the future, it’ll be up to Grandpa Dragon,” the little azure dragon said without any sense of shame.","“Hehe.”","After a few days, the large black dog fully recovered, and Ling Han and the little azure dragon felt much more at ease.","At this time, they decided to leave, and went to buy a connection device. They planned to take a look at the current situation. In any case, they would run after connecting, and there was no need to worry about their whereabouts being leaked.","“Yi!”","“The Island of the Sky has opened.”","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. Right now, the only thing that was flooding the Galaxy Network was the words ‘Island of the Sky’.","What the hell was this?","After searching for a while, all the information about the Island of the Sky appeared.","The Island of the Sky was the private property of the Dongfang Clan, and the Dongfang Clan was a Venerate Tier-level force. In the universe, they could be considered a great force, but could not be considered top-notch. Above them, there was still the Holy Lands and the Imperial Clans.","The Dongfang Clan ruled over a galaxy, and in this galaxy, there was a planet that produced a unique Celestial medicine.","-Evolution Fruit.","What was the use?","It could help True Self Tier martial artists promote evolution, such as from Clay Fetus to Stone Fetus, Stone Fetus to Silver Fetus, Silver Fetus to Gold Fetus, and what was even more amazing was that after the fourth form of True Self Tier, the Evolution Fruit could also give martial artists a chance at the fifth transformation!","Everyone knew that the one could break through at the fourth form of True Self Tier, but after advancing into the Spirit Transformation Tier like this, one would lose the possibility of advancing further, and would not be able to advance into the level of Sect Master Tier.","If he wanted to become a Sect Master, he would at least have to reach the fifth form of the True Self Tier.","Thus, all martial artists who aspired to become Sect Masters would be filled with yearning for the Evolution Fruit, what more those who wanted to become Venerate Tiers, Saints, and there were even some who wanted to become Emperor.","In that case, he wouldn’t just need the fifth form. He might need the sixth, seventh, or even the eighth or ninth form.","No matter how prodigious you were, being able to complete the fifth form and sixth form with your own strength, wouldn’t it be even better with the help of the Evolution Fruit? Furthermore, it was possible that you could break through your limits or something of the","sort.","Thus, the significance of the Evolution Fruit could be imagined.","The problem was, how could such an important Celestial medicine be grasped by a Venerate","Tier force?","Hehe, in truth, this had indeed caused the Imperial Clans to fight over it. In fact, they had even caused such a commotion that they had almost started fighting over it with the Imperial Weapon in hand. After paying a great price, the Imperial Clans finally agreed to sit down and","negotiate peacefully.","Since no one could take it all for themselves, fine, they might as well just share it. It was better to leave it to the Dongfang Clan to manage. When the Evolution Fruit ripened, they would discuss how to divide it among themselves.","Gradually, the range of distribution also went from the Imperial Clans to Holy Lands, and then further to all True Self Tiers.","Because only True Self Tiers could stimulate the manifestation of the Evolution Fruit, those with higher cultivation levels wouldn’t be of much use at all. It was because of this that this had become a major gathering shared by the entire universe.","Of course, the majority of the Evolution Fruits would still fall into the hands of the Imperial","Clans. Firstly, the descendants of the Imperial Clans were stronger, and secondly, the pressure exerted by the Imperial Clans was there. If they started to buy them, how many people would","dare not to sell them?","“Little Han?” The large black dog looked over.","Ling Han nodded, “We naturally have to go for such a good thing.”","“Alright, we, the Three Milk Tea Brothers, are going to cause a reign of terror again!” the","large black dog shouted.","“Trash, tremble!” The little azure dragon was also very excited.","Because those above the True Self Tier would be useless even if they entered the Island of the","Sky, as they would not be able to obtain the Evolution Fruit at all. Furthermore, this would also cause an unjust contest. Thus, the great Imperial Clans had long since reached an agreement. In this kind of contest, only those at the True Self Tier would be able to enter.","Who would dare disobey the command of the Imperial Clans?","“Taking advantage of this opportunity, it’s time to kill some people!” Ling Han said calmly.","Imperial Sons like Shi Yuanzhen and Xu Jie were on his agenda. They had been jumping around for so long, and this time, he was going to kill all of them.","“All right!” The little azure dragon and the large black dog were also rubbing their fists, their","killing intent blazing.","They set out, and were teleported all the way. Very soon, they had arrived at the Sky Planet.","The Sky Planet, the territory of the Dongfang Clan, and also the location of the Island of the","Sky.","The Island of the Sky was an amazing place – if it was not amazing, how could it produce something as amazing as the Evolution Fruit? This island floated in the skies, and was incredibly huge. Furthermore, this island was constantly shrouded by Regulations of the highest level, and even Saints would not be able to barge in by force.","Of course, one could still enter with the help of an Imperial Weapon. However, this was meaningless, as the most valuable item on the island in the sky was the Evolution Fruit. When the Evolution Fruit ripened, the supreme Regulations would temporarily dissipate, and this would last for a period of time. Then, it would reappear. Thus, there was absolutely no need to forcefully enter."]},{"number":4234,"title":"Chapter 4234: Finding a team","paragraphs":["Chapter 4234: Finding a team","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Are we just going to swagger over like this?” the large black dog asked.","“So what? Whoever dares to stop us, we’ll kill them all!” the little azure dragon said with killing intent.","Pa, Ling Han slapped him, “Don’t spout nonsense.”","The secret that they could disguise themselves had already been exposed, so if the three of them left together, that would be too obvious.","“Old Black, take off your underpants!” Ling Han said to the large black dog first.","The large black dog’s legs trembled in fright, “Little Han, after so many years, are you finally going to make a move on Grandpa Dog?”","Ling Han’s expression darkened, and he said, “F*ck! You’re only wearing a pair of iron underwear. Even if I don’t know you, I’ll still recognize your perverted appearance, all right?”","“How is Grandpa Dog perverted?” the large black dog murmured to himself. As he took human form, he drew out his pants and put them on. His expression was filled with reluctance, “Grandpa Dog is by nature bold and unrestrained, and loves freedom.”","“That’s called perverted!” Ling Han and the little azure dragon shouted at the same time.","The large black dog was instantly rendered speechless. ‘You guys are really too coordinated.’","“And you, don’t become a child again.” Ling Han turned to the little azure dragon and said, “You’re only a five- or six-year-old toddler, yet your cultivation level has already reached the True Self Tier. Even the Golden Generation isn’t as awesome as you.”","“Can’t I? Grandpa Dragon is the descendant of a True Dragon!” The little azure dragon puffed its chest out proudly.","Pa, he suffered another slap.","“If you want to be captured by the Imperial Clans, then you can continue,” Ling Han said.","The little azure dragon was exasperated, so it could only enlarge its body slightly, becoming an elegant young man in his twenties. However, his face was still filled with childishness.","“Show off!” Ling Han and the large black dog said at the same time. This Four-Legged Snake had always disguised itself as a little boy. Wasn’t it trying to show that he was “young”?","He was so young, yet had such a high cultivation level. This was naturally shocking. Thus, he was the standard show-off.","“This is much better.” Ling Han nodded. These two guys were finally not so conspicuous. Otherwise, they would really be discovered in a crowd.","“Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go.” The large black dog and little azure dragon were both in high spirits. They were going to the Island of the Sky to beat up the Imperial Sons, and they were currently filled with anger.","“Wait,” Ling Han said.","“What is it now?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han sighed, “Just now, I only corrected a flaw that could be seen through with a single glance from you guys, but if the three of us are together, we are still too big a target.”","“Then should we split up?” the little azure dragon asked.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Sure. However, there’s another method that can make us smaller targets.”","“What way?” the little azure dragon and the large black dog asked at the same time.","“Infiltrate into another team,” Ling Han said.","“Che.” The little azure dragon and the large black dog waved their hands, and here they thought that Ling Han had some brilliant idea.","However, this was indeed feasible.","“Let’s go.”","They walked around, looking for teams that they could join.","This wasn’t difficult, because even though some clans were powerful, it didn’t mean that there were invincible elites in True Self Tier. Thus, they naturally needed external help.","They had not walked too far, when the three of them heard beckoning shouts.","They went over to take a look. The party that was recruiting was the Tang Clan, a Venerate Tier-level force. However, there was only one woman in this generation, and her name was Tang Rong. She was quite famous, because she was the seductive beauty ranked ninety-first on the Exquisite Leaderboard.","Don’t think that 91st was too low. Just how big was the universe? The hundred beauties that had been chosen naturally all had exquisite beauty.","Thus, there was actually no shortage of suitors and protectors by Tang Rong’s side, but it was also because of the problem of cultivation level that some people were unable to enter the Island of the Sky and could not help even if they wanted to.","The Tang Clan offered a very high reward. If they could obtain the Evolution Fruit, each person would be rewarded with a Venerate Tier-level technique, and even if they couldn’t obtain the Evolution Fruit, they would still be rewarded with thirty thousand Dao Stones.","Though this kind of reward was completely not taken seriously by Ling Han and the others, for the majority of True Self Tiers, it was a temptation that could not be resisted.","“I’ll choose this one,” Ling Han said. He only needed a disguise to cover himself.","“Yi, you found this Tang Rong as soon as you started searching. Furthermore, she is ranked on the Exquisite Leaderboard. Did you do it on purpose?” The large black dog’s eyes were filled with suspicion.","“It’s definitely deliberate!” the little azure dragon said with absolute certainty.","“Scram!” Ling Han naturally denied it.","No matter what, they had to register their personal information before applying for the position.","“Sister Rong, with me here, we don’t need these weaklings at all!” When Ling Han and the others were registering, a man’s voice was heard. Not only did they hear it, but the other applicants also heard it clearly.","Everyone instantly turned to look, only to see that the speaker was a handsome young man in embroidered robes. His eyes were especially bright, and there was a haughty expression on his face. When he saw everyone turn to look at him, not only did he not feel the slightest bit of guilt, but a smile instead curled up the corners of his lips.","“What is it? I called you weaklings, and you are still unconvinced?” He began to mock them.","“Yi Tianfeng, are you here to help or to undermine me?” There was a woman in red standing beside him. She was really as beautiful as peach blossoms, especially her peach blossom eyes. The moment she looked at someone, hearts would melt.","Though this woman was wearing a slightly looser red dress, her beautiful curves could not be concealed no matter what. A breeze blew over, and the dress stuck to her body, completely outlining her seductive figure.","She was Tang Rong, a seductive beauty on the Exquisite Leaderboard.","Everyone glanced at her, and couldn’t help but feel their hearts flutter. The anger that had just arisen instantly dissipated completely.","Yi Tianfeng smiled, and said, “Sister Rong, I’m not exaggerating in the slightest. As for these people, they are only there as a show of strength. If we really come to blows, even if they join forces, they won’t be a match for me alone.”","“Such an arrogant tone!” someone couldn’t help but say.","“What a familiar scene,” Ling Han murmured. This scene seemed familiar.","“Don’t spout nonsense!” Another person stepped out, pulling back the person who had spoken earlier, “That is Yi Tianfeng!”","“What Yi Tianfeng?”","“Yi Tianfeng, ranked in 8000s of True Self Tier on the Galaxy Network.”","“Hiss!”","When Galaxy Network’s ranking was brought up, everyone inhaled sharply.","Ordinary cultivators would not be able to touch the Imperial Son’s level at all. Thus, the Galaxy Network Ranking was the most authoritative ranking of battle prowess for them. In the whole universe, hewas ranked in the 8000s. Hiss, powerful!","Yi Tianfeng meanwhile was proud. As he saw it, everyone’s behaviour was too normal, and was completely within his expectations, “8231.” He emphasized.","8231st and 8999th were both in the 8000s, but there was a whole gap of over six hundred in ranking. How could they be the same?","“Pu!” The large black dog and little azure dragon laughed together. Just from this emphasis, it was clear just how strong Yi Tianfeng’s vanity was.","“What are you laughing at?” Yi Tianfeng looked over, his expression filled with disdain."]},{"number":4235,"title":"Chapter 4235: Entrance","paragraphs":["Chapter 4235: Entrance","The little azure dragon and the large black dog were both troublemakers, so how could they possibly cower? They immediately rolled up their sleeves and prepared to fight.","However, before they could step out, two large hands stretched out and pressed down on their shoulders respectively.","The two of them didn’t even need to turn around to know that it was definitely Ling Han who was stopping them.","-We have come to blend in with the team, not to fight.","With this in mind, the little azure dragon and the large black dog both deflated. Whatever, they’d think about it after entering the Island of the Sky.","“Humph!” Yi Tianfeng’s eyes swept over them coldly, naturally taking Ling Han and the others’ retreat for a natural reaction.","He was one of Galaxy Network’s top-ranked elites, so how awesome was he? If Ling Han and the others didn’t back down, that would really be strange.","“All right, hurry up and complete the registration. I have heard that the Island of the Sky would open in at most two days’ time,” Tang Rong said. She actually did not like Yi Tianfeng’s arrogance, but was also disdainful of the cowardice of others.","With that said, with a flutter of her sleeve, she turned and left.","Yi Tianfeng smirked coldly, swept an eye over everyone, and hurriedly followed.","Though everyone was displeased, with a Galaxy Network elite in the team, their chances of survival would also be greatly increased. For this reason, they tolerated it.","“This brat is really displeasing.” The large black dog sneered.","“That’s right. I really want to beat him up.” The little azure dragon nodded.","Meanwhile, Ling Han smiled. When one had reached a height that he had, he really couldn’t be bothered to lower himself to the level of a minor character like Yi Tianfeng. If he wanted to fight, it would be Lin Xuan and the other members of the Golden Generation. Those like Shi Yuanzhen were only qualified to be killed by him, and could no longer be considered his match.","However, most of the Silver Generation’s elites were still at the True Self Tier, and most of them were at the fourth form of the True Self Tier or even the fifth form of the True Self Tier. They looked forward to obtaining the Evolution Fruit to break through their limits. Thus, on this trip, the Silver Generation should be Ling Han’s strongest opponent.","“Compared to the Silver Generation, my weakness is my cultivation level. I haven’t even completely formed the Stone Fetus yet.”","In the first place, the Imperial Son was synonymous with being invincible among his peers. Then, the Imperial Sons had the advantage in cultivation level, and were members of the Silver Generation at that. How could it be easy to defeat them?","“I wonder if I can stimulate ley lines on the Island of the Sky. If I can, then I’ll have another trump card.”","Ling Han raised his head to look at the skies. From here, he could see the Island of the Sky. A colossal island that floated in midair, enshrouded by the Regulations of the highest level, turning into incredibly magnificent pillars of light and divine clouds, presenting an intoxicating sight.","However, while this scene was beautiful, it was also incredibly dangerous. If a Venerate Tier cultivator approached, they would be instantly killed, and even Saints would not be able to pass through.","Only when it truly opened, would the supreme Regulations dissipate, and an entrance would appear, which would be entered through a special passageway.","After Ling Han and the others registered their information, they rested nearby. It was expected that the Island of the Sky would open tomorrow or the day after tomorrow.","After a night, they looked at the skies again, and saw that the Regulations that enshrouded the Island of the Sky were like flowers in full bloom, blooming all at once.","The Island of the Sky had officially opened!","Everyone hurriedly went to the entrance, and queued up to enter.","The first to enter would definitely be the Imperial Clans. No one would be able to compete with them, and would not dare to compete at all.","After the Imperial Clans, it was the Holy Land’s troops, and after the Holy Land’s troops, it was the Venerate Tier forces’ turn. The hierarchy was strict, and no one dared to challenge this hierarchy.","There were elites keeping watch to remove any unqualified parties. The main purpose was not to find Ling Han and the others, but to see if any force had brought in cultivators that had surpassed the True Self Tier. That was definitely not allowed. Once it was found, then not a single member of this force would be able to enter into the Island of the Sky.","Thus, aside from those forces that wanted to try their luck at the beginning, no other force dared to do so afterwards.","After waiting for half a day, it was finally the Tang Clan’s turn.","Ling Han could see very clearly that there was someone at the entrance who was examining identities, and that was a Venerate Tier.","Why wasn’t it a Saint?","Hehe, to have a Saint do such a thing? Just ask which Saint would be so shameless!","In truth, Venerate Tier elites were already powerful enough. With a single glance, practically all kinds of disguises could be seen.","The Imperial Clans were still fine. Every Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter had the intention to be invincible. They practically did not bring their attendants with them, so it was especially easy to investigate their identities. However, when it came to the Holy Lands, especially the Venerate Tier forces, they brought even more people.","Tang Rong’s team, for example, had a total of 105 people. It was practically grand and","majestic.","Under such circumstances, it was impossible for that Venerate Tier elite to examine them in detail one by one. He could only sweep his gaze over them.","Ordinarily, this was already enough, but the Soul Forming Technique was also incredibly awesome, and a single glance from a Venerate Tier elite... could not see through it!","Shua, Ling Han and the others all felt a powerful consciousness sweep over their bodies. Even their minds trembled slightly, but this consciousness swept over them, and did not stop, nor did it come back to them.","That Venerate Tier waved a hand, indicating that everyone could leave.","Tang Rong took the lead, and walked into a Transfer Formation.","If one wanted to enter the Island of the Sky, this was the only path that corresponded to the entrance created by the retreat of the supreme Regulations.","Over a hundred people majestically entered into the Transfer Formation. Xiu, with a flash of white light, they immediately disappeared.","There was a blur in front of their eyes, and they had already arrived on a plain. There were tall trees all around them, and their branches were like the vines of a great snake, covering the sky","and sun.","This was the Island of the Sky.","Looking back, there was no Transfer Formation. This would only appear when the Island of","the Sky was about to close.","“Little Han, how is it?” The large black dog communicated through divine sense.","Ling Han nodded, “No problem. I have already memorized the structure of the formation. As long as the seal caused by the Regulations is unlocked, I can return to the Sky Planet at any","time.”","The little azure dragon and the large black dog instantly bared their mouths in a grin. Now, they had nothing to worry about.","“Let’s go.” With Tang Rong’s command, everyone advanced.","There were teams that had entered here first from all directions, but now, none of them had any intention of provoking each other. If there was no conflict of interest, what was the point","of fighting?","For the moment, Ling Han and the others had no intention of leaving the team. Every time the Island of the Sky opened, it would last for three years. After three years, the island would close, and the Evolution Fruits that had not been harvested in time would all wilt and fall.","Thus, there was a lot of time, so he might as well observe the situation first.","This island was very big. In fact, it could even be considered astonishingly huge. It was about a quarter of the size of the Sky Planet. Furthermore, there was suppression from the supreme Regulations here. Not only could they not fly, even their speed of movement had greatly","decreased.","Thus, even a True Self Tier cultivator would need at least one to two years to completely search the entire floating island.","On the way, Yi Tianfeng continuously courted Tang Rong’s favour, while Tang Rong ignored him, causing everyone to feel secretly pleased. Who asked you to look down on others? Now","you’ve suffered retribution.","Because the Island of the Sky was too big, though a great many people had entered, once they were spread out on the island, it still seemed vast and empty.","The group advanced, and after a few days, they finally had some gains.","Evolution Fruit!","There was a strange plant growing on the ground. It was only three feet tall, and only bore a","single fruit. It was vermilion-red in colour, and the size of a fist. There were golden streaks on the skin of the fruit, intertwining to form complex veined patterns.","“We’ve finally reaped some rewards!” Tang Rong said with a smile. It had only been five days,","yet they had already obtained their first Evolution Fruit. If they could maintain this rate for three years, just how great would their rewards be?","“Hehe, this is mine!” A man’s voice rang out from the sidelines."]},{"number":4236,"title":"Chapter 4236: Might of a Beauty","paragraphs":["Chapter 4236: Might of a Beauty","Shua, everyone simultaneously turned to look towards the left.","There was a young man standing there, his hands clasped behind his back. Merely from the way he was posing, he was already showing a bearing of high status.","“Scram!” Yi Tianfeng immediately humphed. He was an elite ranked in the 8000s in the Galaxy Network.","The young man smiled faintly, “Leave the Evolution Fruit and this woman behind. The others can get lost.”","Yi Tianfeng was furious. ‘I already told you to get lost, yet you’re still blabbering nonsense?’","He immediately wanted to make a move, but when he thought about it, if he made a move like this, how could he show how strong he was?","“You guys go,” he turned around and said to Ling Han and the others.","Everyone exchanged looks. Yi, why was it them again?","Fine, so be it. There were over a hundred of them, so how could it be that they could not kill a single person?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Immediately, thirteen people leaped out, pouncing towards that young man. “You overestimate yourself!” The young man sneered, and finally stopped standing with his hands behind his back. He stretched out his left hand, and pressed forwards lightly. Instantly, the Regulations of heaven and earth condensed, turning into a giant silver claw that grabbed out at the thirteen people.","The thirteen people all activated their Regulations, greeting the incoming attack with their strongest stance.","But it was really as that young man had said. They had overestimated their own abilities. Peng, under the barrage of the silver claw, those thirteen people all released terrible cries, and then were mercilessly crushed into a mush of blood.","Hiss!","Seeing this scene, those who had not stepped forwards all felt a chill run down their spines. Thirteen of them working together were actually no match for a single blow from this young man, and they were all insta-killed. Then what did it matter even if they stepped up?","It was just a matter of making a few more moves, and they would all die.","Though they had received money from the Tang Clan, and wanted to work for Tang Rong, there was absolutely no way they would insist on charging head-on when they clearly knew that they would definitely die.","Yi Tianfeng shuddered. Previously, he had already mocked Ling Han and the others as weaklings, and that was the truth as well. Though these people were all True Self Tiers, some of them were only in the First Form, and there were only a few in the Fourth Form. Even if they joined forces, they would not be a match for him.","However, could he insta-kill thirteen with a single strike?","He wasn’t sure, but his Galaxy Network ranking of 8000s still gave him great confidence that he would definitely win.","Yi Tianfeng stepped out, and asked, “Who exactly are you?”","“Block ten moves from me, and only then would you be qualified to know my name,” the young man declared proudly.","“How arrogant!” Yi Tianfeng shouted loudly, and charged towards his opponent. Boom!","The moment the two of them took over, they both unleashed their full power. Regulations turned into divine chains, and divine lightning. Light exploded madly, terrifying without bounds.","Everyone had no choice but to retreat. The battle prowess of both sides was too terrifying. Even a single shockwave was too much for them to bear.","All of a sudden, the battle stopped.","“You can actually block ten moves from me. Very well, you are qualified to know my name.” This young man declared proudly, “I am Bu Tianyi.”","“What, Bu Tianyi!” Suddenly, a commotion arose in the crowd.","“Bu Tianyi, ranked in the 6000s on the Galaxy Network!”","“Hiss!”","Yi Tianfeng’s expression also changed drastically. His greatest pride was in his Galaxy Network ranking. This was the source of his confidence, but the other man was ranked in the 6000s, which was about 2000 places higher than him.","Even if Galaxy Network ranking couldn’t represent full strength, there would be discrepancies within 500 ranks in actual battle, at most. If it was more than 500, then it would be impossible to make a comeback.","How could he be so unlucky? He had encountered such an elite right off the bat!","“All right, the Evolution Fruit is yours!” Yi Tianfeng was very decisive. There was absolutely no chance of winning against this kind of elite, and this was the Island of the Sky. It was sealed off by the supreme Regulations, and communication with the outside world was completely blocked. Thus, when it was time to cower, he had to be honest and admit defeat. Bu Tianyi laughed loudly, and said, “Is there something wrong with your ears? Like I said, the Evolution Fruit and this beauty have to stay!”","Yi Tianfeng humphed and said, “Although your Galaxy Network is ranked around 2000 places higher than me, you mightn’t necessarily win if we battle to the death. Even if you win, you’ll have to pay a huge price.”","With a shake of his right hand, a large black saber appeared in his hand. However, there were golden patterns on the saber’s blade, exuding a terrifying aura.","Bu Tianyi couldn’t help but narrow his eyes. This saber exerted a very strong pressure on him.","“I never thought that you would actually possess a high-quality Four Star Spirit Tool!” he said. He pondered slightly, then continued, “All right, leave the Evolution Fruit behind, and you guys can get lost!”","“Let’s go.” Yi Tianfeng waved a hand.","“Wait!” Tang Rong suddenly spoke up, “I will not hand over the Evolution Fruit.”","“Sister Rong, that is Bu Tianyi. We are no match for him!” Yi Tianfeng said. Even if he possessed the Night Demon Saber, and at most, a battle between him and Bu Tianyi would end up with both of them coming off seriously injured, but that was definitely not the result","he wanted.","Tang Rong ignored him. Instead, she took graceful steps, and headed towards Bu Tianyi, “You killed my followers, I want you to pay with your life.”","Bu Tianyiwas taken aback, then laughed loudly, “Actually, I don’t believe in the words that those with big breasts have no brains, but now that I have seen you, I believe it.”","Shua!","A silvery light flashed past, and Tang Rong had already begun her attack. A silver sword appeared in her hand, and as the sword swept out, its brilliance was boundless, as if it wanted to forcefully slice apart the heaven and earth.","What!","Bu Tianyi was shocked, and hurriedly summoned his own Spirit Tool to parry.","Boom, with a loud bang, he was forcefully sent backwards, his feet forcibly digging out a deep groove in the ground. His face was pale, and with a ‘wa’, he spat out blood.","F***, when they saw this scene, everyone was incredibly stunned. Who would have thought that this seductive beauty on the Exquisite Leaderboard was actually a hidden elite? And in terms of expressions, Yi Tianfeng was naturally the most expressive.","He had always considered himself as the top elite in the team, putting on airs and acting cool. Now, it was equivalent to having been slapped heavily in the face, causing his face to flush","red.","Tang Rong did not yield even though she had the upper hand. The silver sword slashed out, its brilliance soaring into the skies.","Bu Tianyi was completely outmatched, and was soon suppressed. Shua, blood sprayed out, and his right arm was forcefully severed.","He screamed in pain, no longer daring to continue fighting. Hurriedly, he turned around and","left.","However, he had only taken a few steps when his body trembled, and his eyes instantly lost","focus.","Tang Rong shot forwards like an arrow, and as the silver sword swept past, peng, a human","head shot into the skies.","She was taken aback. Why did Bu Tianyi not resist at all?","However, she did not notice anything off, and could only think that it was because Bu Tianyi was completely focused on fleeing, and had completely forgotten to parry.","She sheathed her sword, and stood proudly, her bearing captivating.","But this time, no one dared to have any more devious thoughts about her.","Strength!","Tang Rong had used her powerful abilities to prove that she was not just a pretty face, but rather a great elite that could slash one who was in the 6000s on the Galaxy Network.","To defeat Bu Tianyi, those ranked higher than him could do so, but to sever one of his arms in","such a short period of time, and then behead him with a single strike, the person definitely had to be ranked in the top thousand.","This kind of elite was more or less on the level of the Holy Land’s Dao Child, Holy Daughter, so naturally, no one dared to have any evil thoughts.","Yi Tianfeng was embarrassed. He had bragged for a long time, yet in the end, he had been slapped in the face. This was too embarrassing."]},{"number":4237,"title":"Chapter 4237: Fu Jingyuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4237: Fu Jingyuan","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Little Han, have you taken a fancy to this girl?” the large black dog communicated through divine sense.","“Hehe.” Ling Han merely chuckled.","“If you didn’t take a fancy to this girl, why did you come to help?” the large black dog asked. How could it be that it couldn’t tell? In the end, it was Ling Han who had unleashed the murderous aura, causing Bu Tianyi to be dazed, and beheaded by Tang Rong with a single strike?","“Those who commit murder should be killed,” Ling Han said calmly. He paused, then continued, “Also, can’t you tell that Tang Rong looks very much like someone?”","“Yi!” With such a reminder from him, the large black dog suddenly came to a realization, “The little girl, Tang Yun’er!”","“They’re most likely from the same clan,” Ling Han said with a nod. He had felt a sense of familiarity after witnessing Tang Rong’s attacks. Add to that the surname of Tang, and he was able to come up with this deduction.","“That’s right, we should give her a hand,” the large black dog said with a nod. Although Tang Yun’er was unreliable, she had helped them many times before. Of course, she had also received many benefits, such as the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll as well as many Saint Techniques.","“No wonder Grandpa Dog felt a sense of familiarity. As it turned out, what this little girl used just now was the Fallen Leaf Sword Technique!”","The Fallen Leaf Sword Technique was one of the four Saint Techniques that Ling Han had obtained after passing the final test set up by the Ancient Sun Saint. He taught it to the empress, Lin Luo, and the others without reservations. Even Tang Yun’er had a copy of it.","When he taught them, he did not impose any restrictions, saying that the Saint Technique could not be taught to outsiders. In his eyes, the one in charge in cultivation was the person, and not the technique.","—Even if everyone in the world cultivated the Imperial Scroll and Imperial Techniques, Ling Han believed that he was also the strongest.","Ling Han only felt that this world was really small. He had just randomly found a team to fool around with. He had not thought that he would actually encounter Tang Yun’er’s clansman.","Tang Rong accepted the Evolution Fruit, and led the team onwards.","Everyone was slightly embarrassed. ‘F*ck! You’re one of the top 1000 elites of the Galaxy Network, and you clearly have the ability to defeat the majority of people. Yet, you still insist on looking for bodyguards like us. If we encounter danger, we’ll be completely useless. How can we endure this?’","At this moment, even Yi Tianfeng had become silent, as if he had suffered a heavy blow. However, only a day later, he became lively again, fawning on Tang Rong at all times, incredibly cordial.","“Hehe, this guy has overcome his pride as a man. How shameless,” the large black dog said with a smile.","Ling Han nodded. Previously, when Yi Tianfeng had courted Tang Rong, he should have fallen for her beauty. Of course, Tang Rong’s Venerate Tier-level background would definitely add points to her as well, but now, Tang Rong could still become a good wife that could help him on the path of martial arts, or even be a backer for him, so she naturally had even more value to be courted.","“Little Han, when are we going to fly solo?” the large black dog asked. They couldn’t stay in the team forever, right?","“I haven’t completely grasped the ley lines here yet. Let’s wait a few more days,” Ling Han replied.","There were also ley lines on the Island of the Sky, but they were suppressed by the paramount Regulations, so it was extremely difficult to sense them. Thus, Ling Han was still in the process of familiarizing himself with them, and had not reached the point where he could stimulate them.","“Alright.” The little azure dragon and the large black dog both nodded.","This time, they had come with the intention of killing Imperial Sons, so they naturally had to increase their battle prowess as much as possible. Otherwise, what would they do if they encountered the Silver Generation?","The team continued to advance, searching for Evolution Fruits. However, though Evolution Fruits were a specialty of the Island of the Sky, they were not cabbages that could be found just anywhere on the streets, so how could they be easily obtained?","In the next few days, they found nothing.","Everyone was a little anxious. Entering a Mystery Realm represented danger, and this place was no exception. Aside from facing competitors, there were also native creatures on the island. They were all ferocious beasts that had not developed intelligence, and were extremely vicious.","In these few days, they had encountered a few. Thankfully, both Tang Rong and Yi Tianfeng were strong enough, allowing them to pass without any mishaps.","“Ang!”","A beastly roar rang out, and a colossal creature leaped out.","“Green-toothed Tiger!” everyone exclaimed in astonishment.","This was a fierce tiger. It was thirty meters long, and its two sharp fangs protruded from its lips. They were as long as five meters, and were green in colour. This was also where it got its name from as Green-toothed Tiger.","Ferocious beasts didn’t have intelligence, and they all acted based on their instincts. In the eyes of this ferocious beast, Ling Han and the others were its food.","Faced with food, they naturally had to attack.","Everyone hurriedly approached, but this fierce beast was extraordinarily strong. With a roar, everyone’s faces turned pale, and their legs almost went weak.","Shua, this fierce tiger suddenly flicked its tail, its tail like a steel whip. With a sweep, a considerable number of people were sent flying.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","After a chaotic battle, everyone was defeated. Even Tang Rong and Yi Tianfeng were no match.","“Retreat!” Tang Rong did not try to be stubborn. In any case, they were not fighting over the Evolution Fruit, so there was absolutely no need for her to put her life on the line.","They retreated, but this fierce beast was hot on their heels. This was food that was close at hand.","Ling Han turned around to take a look. Weng, a terrifying aura surged out.","Zhi!","This Green-toothed Tiger immediately stopped in its tracks. It instinctively sensed something fearful, and this overwhelmed its need to eat.","Though everyone felt it strange, why had this fierce beast given up on pursuing them? However, they were naturally more than happy to see such a result. How could they possibly care about the reason? Hurriedly, they exerted all their strength, fearing that this fierce beast would chase after them again.","Meanwhile, Tang Rong frowned slightly. This was too illogical, but no matter how smart she was, she could not guess the reason behind it.","After fleeing far enough, they rested for a while, then continued onwards.","Boom!","A powerful wave suddenly surged over from their left side, giving everyone a scare. Thankfully, when it reached near them, the power of the wave had already been exhausted, and did not have any effect on them.","“Who ambushed us?”","“How detestable!”","Everyone was angered. They were walking around peacefully, and furthermore, they were not fighting over the Evolution Fruit, so who had offended them?","They were so angry that they wanted to seek justice. This had gone too far.","Following the traces of the attack, they soon saw two groups of people engaged in an intense battle.","To be more precise, there were a dozen over people ganging up on a single person.","“Not good!” Immediately, someone exclaimed in shock. Pointing at the person that was being ganged up on, he exclaimed, “That, that is Fu Jingyuan!”","That was a young man dressed in black. His face was very thin, but his eyes were extraordinarily large, and the ratio was extremely unreasonable.","“Hiss, could it be Fu Jingyuan from the Black Demon Holy Land?”","“Heavens!”","This drew a sharp intake of breath, and a great many people’s faces turned pale.","The majority of Imperial Clans and Holy Lands were all very overbearing. It could not be helped. Their abilities were clear for all to see, but some forces were not only overbearing, they would also commit murder at the drop of a hat. It could be claimed that they were notorious.","This Black Demon Holy Land was one of them, and Fu Jingyuan was the current Dao Child of the Black Demon Holy Land. He had only debuted over a hundred years ago, but the number of lives he had taken was uncountable.","However, Fu Jingyuan was very smart. He killed people like they were nothing, yet never trifled with the Imperial Clans and other Holy Lands. Thus, he had always lived very comfortably.","“His Galaxy Network raning... is 62nd!”","“Let’s go!”","Everyone said. That was a murderous demon king, and definitely could not be trifled with. In fact, they could not even be seen by the other party, or they would be unlucky should Fu Jingyuan’s murderous nature kick in.","“Gaga, since you’re already here, why are you running?” Xiu, with a flash, Fu Jingyuan had already appeared in front of them, and the heads of the dozen over people that had ganged up on him previously had all exploded, and were presently throwing up blood madly from their severed necks and limbs."]},{"number":4238,"title":"Chapter 4238: Hope","paragraphs":["Chapter 4238: Hope","Editor: Henyee Translations","Fu Jingyuan stood there, his expression calm. It could not be seen at all that he had just coldly killed a dozen over people.","Everyone’s expressions were ashen. He was ranked 62nd on the Galaxy Network, so strong that they could only despair.","If this kind of elite wanted to kill them, how would they be able to stop him?","Even Tang Rong’s pretty face was pale. Firstly, her abilities were outmatched, and secondly, in terms of background, he had the Holy Land as his backer, so there was absolutely no need for him to take the Tang Clan to heart.","More importantly, this was the Island of the Sky. After entering, they had lost contact with the outside world. As long as they were silenced, there was no way others could find the murderer.","In this place, Fu Jingyuan was like a fish in water. He could fully display his murderous nature, and have no scruples.","“How do you want to die?” Fu Jingyuan asked. “In this aspect, I’m actually very amicable. I’m willing to satisfy you 100%. If the way you die is especially creative, I’ll even remember you.”","No one spoke. This was a lunatic, and a powerful lunatic at that, leaving them with only despair.","The Island of the Sky was so huge, so why had they encountered him?","“Hehe, Grandpa Dog wants to live until I die of old age. How about it?” the large black dog said.","Everyone looked over, their eyes filled with admiration. To be able to speak so frankly and confidently in front of Fu Jingyuan, this courage alone was enough to make others give him a thumbs up.","Meanwhile, Fu Jingyuan laughed loudly, then shook his head, “Apologies, this wish of yours is probably difficult to realize. I am not accustomed to waiting so long for one person.”","The large black dog sighed, “Looks like we can’t be friends happily.”","“Obviously not,” Fu Jingyuan nodded.","“Since we can’t be friends, then we can only meet again,” the large black dog said. Then, he beckoned everyone over, “Let’s go, let’s go.”","‘You can do that?’","Everyone thought. Hurriedly, they turned and left. If they could get rid of this murderous demon king like this, that would be great.","“Who told you to leave?” Fu Jingyuan immediately turned hostile, revealing a baleful killing intent.","“These legs are Grandpa Dog’s own legs. If I want to leave, do you think you can stop me?” the large black dog said.","Fu Jingyuan smiled, “Then there is nothing else I can do. I can only break your legs first.”","“Hahahaha, break your legs!” The little azure dragon suddenly burst into laughter.","This guy had an easily tickled sense of humor, and was easily amused by himself.","“Four-Legged Snake, do you want to die?” the large black dog said viciously.","“Hahahaha!” The little azure dragon merely roared with laughter.","Seeing that the two of them were actually arguing, Fu Jingyuan showed a hint of anger.","He enjoyed killing people, and he enjoyed even more admiring the terrified expressions on the faces of those who were killed before they died. However, these two people were actually laughing and joking?","‘Humph, are you people looking down on me?’","“You’re seeking death!” Fu Jingyuan moved. Shua, he delivered a palm strike, slashing towards the little azure dragon and the large black dog at the same time.","“Small snake flicks its tail!” The large black dog immediately turned around, and then shot out a kick.","Peng!","The kick landed on the palm strike, and this palm strike was immediately shattered.","Yi?","When everyone saw this, a sliver of hope rose up in them. Perhaps, perhaps, they still had a chance of survival.","Fu Jingyuan was also taken aback. He had not thought that his attack would actually be unsuccessful. However, he did not take it to heart. That attack just now was only a casual move, and had only unleashed less than one-tenth of his battle prowess.","“No wonder you dared to be insolent in front of me. As it turned out, you do have some abilities.” He said calmly, “However, I only used one-tenth of my power in that attack just now.”","“Grandpa Dog only used 1%,” the large black dog immediately said. F***, who didn’t know how to show off?","‘F*ck! Can you exaggerate any further?’","Fu Jingyuan humphed upon hearing this. He didn’t like bickering, and fighting was his forte.","He charged over, bringing with him boundless killing intent.","The large black dog approached. Peng! The two of them immediately engaged in an intense battle. However, the large black dog’s disadvantage was also immediately revealed. Its battle prowess was only at 25 Heavens, but Fu Jingyuan’s battle prowess was as high as 27 Heavens.","In just a few moves, the large black dog’s only option was to dodge. It didn’t dare to face Fu Jingyuan head-on.","However, this caused everyone’s eyes to widen in disbelief.","It should be known that the large black dog was only in the second form of the True Self Tier, but Fu Jingyuan was in the peak stage of the fourth form, leading by a whole two minor levels. Then, if the large black dog’s cultivation level could match his, would the outcome of the battle still be like this?","Fu Jingyuan naturally knew this as well. Involuntarily, his killing intent intensified. This enmity had naturally been formed, so he was even more determined to kill the large black dog, to prevent it from becoming a great threat to him in future.","‘Die!’","His attacks became even more rapid. In fact, he even activated the Saint Technique, allowing his battle prowess to rise to the peak battle prowess of 30 Heavens.","This caused the large black dog to be unable to even withstand a single blow. If he came into contact with such a violent attack, he would either be killed or injured.","“Little Han, save me!” The large black dog couldn’t hold on any longer, and he called out for Ling Han to save him.","He had never been a dog that cared about his pride.","Ling Han smiled, and strode off.","Peng!","He exchanged a blow with Fu Jingyuan. Teng, teng, teng! Fu Jingyuan immediately took a few steps back, while Ling Han merely swayed slightly.","Hiss!","Seeing this scene, everyone inhaled sharply.","Ling Han actually had the upper hand. Heavens!","Tang Rong’s eyes lit up. She couldn’t help but recall how they had encountered that Green-toothed Tiger previously. They had been outmatched and fled, but that ferocious beast had only chased a few steps before coming to an abrupt stop, as if it had been frightened by some existence.","And when Bu Tianyi was fleeing, he suddenly paused, and was easily killed by her.","From the look of things now, this must have been Ling Han’s secret move.","She was both stunned and curious. How could Ling Han’s strength be so strong that he could even force back a Dao Child? It should be known that this guy was only the second form of the True Self.","Fu Jingyuan was naturally even more astonished. He had already unleashed his full power, yet he had actually been sent flying by a single punch from Ling Han. This caused his heart to beat wildly, and a cold chill to rise up in his heart.","So strong.","He was a bloodthirsty person, yet he was also extremely afraid of death. When he realized that he was no match for Ling Han, he immediately turned around and fled with his movement technique.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Since you’re already here, why are you running?”","He stretched out a hand and pressed down. Boom, an Earth Dragon suddenly shot out of the ground, blocking Fu Jingyuan’s path.","In these few days, he was already able to communicate with the ley lines. At the moment, he was still unable to use the Star Steps, but summoning the Earth Dragon was no problem.","“Piss off!” Fu Jingyuan roared as he charged at the Earth Dragon.","Peng!","He exchanged blows with the Earth Dragon, but what was shocking was that he actually did not manage to shatter the Earth Dragon, and only managed a draw.","As Ling Han advanced into the True Self Tier, the Earth Dragon that he summoned also became more powerful.","Fu Jingyuan paled in shock. What kind of celestial technique was this? How could it possibly last for such a long time?","Ling Han clasped his hands behind his back, and slowly walked forwards. He asked with a smile, “The victor is yet to be decided, so why are you in such a rush to leave?”","Fu Jingyuan did not reply. He merely attacked madly, wanting to shatter the Earth Dragon as soon as possible, so that he could gain the chance to escape. However, the battle prowess of the Earth Dragon was as high as thirty Heavens, which was equivalent to his strongest battle prowess. How could he shatter it in a short while?"]},{"number":4239,"title":"Chapter 4239: Insta-killed with a single strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 4239: Insta-killed with a single strike","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone looked at how hard Fu Jingyuan was fighting, while Ling Han was walking with his hands clasped behind his back, looking very relaxed. They couldn’t help but feel a sense of absurdity.","Gods, this guy was too fierce, wasn’t he?","After much effort, Fu Jingyuan finally shattered the Earth Dragon. After all, this was only condensed from Earth Qi, and lacked flexibility. It could not possibly be as powerful as an actual cultivator.","However, Ling Han was already close at hand.","“Who are you?” he asked darkly. At this moment, he calmed down instead.","Being able to become the Dao Child of the Holy Land, his temperament naturally passed the test.","“We are—” the large black dog called out loudly.","“Three Milk Tea Brothers!” the little azure dragon continued.","Pu!","Quite a few people spluttered. ‘F*ck, can’t the two of you be more reasonable? The Three Milk Tea Brothers? That is really hilarious.’","However, Fu Jingyuan couldn’t laugh at all. Ordinary cultivators couldn’t possibly come into contact with the circle of the Imperial Clans. Although Fu Jingyuan was not capable of befriending Imperial Sons, with the strength of the Black Demon Holy Land, he could still learn some secrets.","The Three Milk Tea Brothers?","Hiss, weren’t these the three guys who had just caused a stir with the Buddhist Race in the West Heaven Realm? Furthermore, the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm was actually Ling Han under a false identity.","Ling Han!","Fu Jingyuan’s expression was slightly bitter, and he asked, “Are you Ling Han?”","What, Ling Han!","Though the Three Milk Tea Brothers were very impressive in the Imperial Son’s circle, but in the circle of the general public, it had not spread to the extent that it was deeply ingrained in the hearts of the people, but the words ‘Ling Han’... rang loudly in their ears.","Everyone was shocked. This guy was Ling Han?","That Ling Han that was wanted by the nine great Imperial Clans?","Meanwhile, Tang Rong showed a hint of understanding. No wonder Ling Han had helped her time and time again. As it turned out, he was Ling Han.","—She naturally found out about Ling Han from her younger sister.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “You guessed correctly. However, there’s no reward.”","Fu Jingyuan’s expression was very complicated. When Ling Han’s name rang throughout the universe, he was actually disdainful of it, because Ling Han had only been in the Core Formation Tier at the time, while he was already in the fourth form of the True Self Tier.","With such a large gap in cultivation level, did he need to take Ling Han seriously? No matter how prodigious he was, he would still be able to kill him with a single slap.","But just how many years had passed?","Ling Han had already become the second form of the True Self, and what was even more terrifying was the fact that this guy’s battle prowess was actually superior to his, though it was only slightly superior.","The legendary Ling Han was also proficient in formations. That’s right, the dragon-shaped attack just now was Earth Qi transforming into a dragon through formations.","“Brother Ling, please let me off the hook.” Fu Jingyuan lowered his stance, and took the initiative to admit defeat.","Meanwhile, Ling Han said calmly, “Those people who died by your hand, when they begged you for mercy, did you spare one of them?”","Fu Jingyuan was instantly rendered speechless.","Of course, he didn’t. If he did, would the legend of him being a murderous demon king still circulate?","He was just that cold-blooded and heartless!","With such a question, Fu Jingyuan also knew that this matter could not possibly be resolved peacefully. Silently, he drew out the Spirit Tool. It was a completely black flag, and there was a skull drawn on it, vivid and lifelike.","“Ling Han, compared to me, your battle prowess has only surpassed me by one Heaven. If you want to kill me, hoho, you may not be able to do as you wish!” Fu Jingyuan said, straightening his back once more.","Since things couldn’t be settled peacefully, the only option was to battle. Cultivators were all prepared for this.","“Is that so?” Ling Han smiled. He nodded, and said, “If I can’t kill you within three moves, I’ll let you go.”","Hearing these words, Fu Jingyuan’s eyes involuntarily lit up.","He didn’t have the confidence to defeat Ling Han, but he wasn’t willing to die willingly either. No matter what, he had to drag Ling Han along with him. However, if he only blocked three moves, hoho, his battle prowess was only inferior by one Heaven, so wouldn’t that be easy?","Realization dawned on him. Ling Han cared about his pride, and did not want to fight him to the point that neither side would win, and that was why he had done so.","Hehe, after all, he was all young and impetuous, and thought more highly of his pride than anything else.","He wasn’t the only one who thought this. Tang Rong and the others thought this as well.","Though this made them feel slightly uncomfortable, Ling Han had already saved their lives. If they still did not know how to be grateful, that would really be ungrateful.","“Come!” Fu Jingyuan called out loudly. He was already prepared.","Xiu, he was the first to move. Since there were only three moves, if he attacked first, it would naturally be even safer.","He waved the black flag in his hand, and instantly, the skull on it floated out. It rapidly enlarged, and was as tall as three meters. It opened its eerie mouth, and bit out at Ling Han.","Ling Han threw a punch. Peng! The skull was immediately shattered.","Fu Jingyuan was completely unconcerned. He only had to last three moves, and if Ling Han continued to tangle with the skull, how could he have the spare time to attack him?","Again!","Xiu, another skull appeared, and attacked Ling Han.","Ling Han threw another punch, which was easily dispersed.","But now, there was only one move left.","A single move was enough? No one believed it.","As expected, Ling Han didn’t want to risk his life, so he found an excuse to go easy on him.","Everyone thought this, but no one dared to show it. How could they simply gossip about an existence that could scare a murderous demon king into retreat?","Xiu, Ling Han finally moved.","When the murderous aura activated, Fu Jingyuan immediately grunted, appearing to be in extreme pain.","This was still because there wasn’t much of a gap between his strength and Ling Han’s. Otherwise, under the barrage of the murderous aura, his mind would have directly exploded.","But now, he was also having a hard time, because Ling Han had already charged over. As he shot out a punch, the heavenly saber appeared.","Imperial Technique!","Fu Jingyuan hurriedly parried, but under the barrage of murderous aura, how much of his battle prowess was left?","Boom!","The heavenly saber swept past, and Fu Jingyuan’s entire body was sliced into two. Meanwhile, his body was covered in ice. Peng! Then, it was shattered by the subsequent power.","He didn’t have a Substitution Seal to die in his place, so he instantly died on the spot.","Hiss, hu!","Everyone was dumbfounded. Wasn’t it agreed that there was not much difference in battle prowess? Wasn’t this just going through the motions?","Why had Fu Jingyuan died?","They looked at Ling Han, and felt their scalps go numb. This guy was too terrifying, wasn’t he?","As it turned out, someone could really be freakish to this extent.","They felt rueful. Previously, they had only heard of the legend of Ling Han on the Galaxy Network. Though they knew that he was strong, they only had a vague impression of him. Just like how they only knew that the Imperial Son was invincible, they had absolutely no idea exactly how strong the battle prowess of Ling Han was.","And now... they had finally witnessed it with their own eyes.","This was a supreme freak!","Ling Han clapped his hands, and said, “Old Black, Four-Legged Snake, we should leave.”","The large black dog was still showing off, and walked out with his arms crossed behind his back. He smiled domineeringly at everyone, “Don’t be infatuated with me, I’m only a legend! Three Milk Tea Brothers, let’s go!”","Everyone was completely stunned. The domineering image that Ling Han had painstakingly created just now instantly crumbled.","“Wait,” Tang Rong hurriedly called out.","“Beauty Tang, what do you want to do? Grandpa Dog can remind you that this brother of mine is already married. Furthermore, he has many children and grandchildren. You have to be prepared to become a stepmother.” The large black dog’s mouth was full of nonsense.","—"]},{"number":4240,"title":"Chapter 4240: Coincidence","paragraphs":["Chapter 4240: Coincidence","Editor: Henyee Translations","Tang Rong ignored the large black dog. She took out a jade box and handed it over to Ling Han.","Yi?","Ling Han knew that there were Evolution Fruits inside. Previously, when he had harvested them, he had seen Tang Rong place them into this jade box.","The others also knew, and they all looked envious, but not one of them dared to mess around.","F***, this guy was Ling Han!","“I think that you need the Evolution Fruit more than I do right now,” Tang Rong said. “Moreover, the Tang Clan owes you a huge favor!”","Saint Technique!","As long as the Tang Clan was given enough time, there would eventually come a day when they would become a Saint-level clan. Even though it had only improved by a single level, in the strictly hierarchical world of martial arts, this improvement was equivalent to a revolution.","Thus, the Tang Clan indeed owed Ling Han a huge favor — only Ling Han would teach the Saint Technique to them, so generous that it was unbelievable.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before accepting the jade box.","At present, he indeed needed the Evolution Fruit to rapidly increase his cultivation level. After all, he was only in the second form, so it was not difficult for him to crush a third-generation Imperial Son like Shi Yuanzhen. However, if he encountered the Silver Generation, he definitely would not be able to defeat them at this stage.","The fact that the Imperial Son was invincible among his peers was not just empty words.","“Let’s go.” Ling Han waved at the large black dog and little azure dragon, and they left the group, setting out on their own.","“Little Han, that woman is scheming!” The large black dog couldn’t help but start to gossip.","Ling Han didn’t reply. Faced with this kind of topic, it was best to ignore it. As the large black dog talked, he would feel bored.","“If it weren’t for that fruit-delivering action, we would have left without a second thought. At that time, we would naturally have nothing to do with each other anymore,” the large black dog began to analyze the situation. “But what about now? It seems like you owe her a favor, so you’ll think about her from time to time. That way, your impression of her will become deeper and deeper.”","“That makes sense!” The little azure dragon clapped its hands and nodded repeatedly.","Ling Han rolled his eyes, “Shouldn’t you guys be thinking about how to increase your cultivation level?”","“Hehe.” The large black dog and little azure dragon both laughed. They had hit the nail on the head.","“Next, let’s go our separate ways,” the little azure dragon said. “The three of us together can’t increase the chances of finding the Evolution Fruit, and each of us is especially good at fighting. It’s not worth it to put us together.”","“That’s right,” the large black dog nodded in agreement.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded as well, “Come, let’s share the Evolution Fruits. We will disband here, and when the Island of the Sky shows signs of closing, we will meet back here.”","“There’s no problem for us to meet up here, but as for this Evolution Fruit... hehe, it’s a token of goodwill from her, so I don’t want it.” The large black dog turned back into his original form. He waved his paw, and for once, he wasn’t greedy.","“Grandpa Dragon doesn’t want it either, it will feel hot in my hands,” the little azure dragon said.","With that said, these two guys ran off.","Ling Han shook his head. He opened the jade box, and there were a total of three Evolution Fruits inside. He took one out, and directly began chewing on it.","The fruit of the Evolution Fruit was very soft. With a single bite, it was completely juicy, and instantly filled his mouth. It was sweet, with a hint of sourness. It was extremely delicious.","In just a few bites, Ling Han had eaten all the Evolution Fruits. Instantly, he felt a warm feeling in his abdomen, and a surge of energy surged into his mind, stimulating the Regulations, stimulating a clay fetus to transform into a Stone Fetus.","Ling Han hurriedly channeled the cultivation technique to cooperate. When this energy was completely exhausted, the conversion of the clay fetus into the Stone Fetus was already one third complete.","Not bad.","Ling Han nodded. Merely this effect was enough to satisfy him.","He also felt a mysterious energy slumbering in his body. This should take effect after he reached the peak stage of the fourth form of the True Self Tier, helping him advance into the fifth form.","Ling Han was naturally very confident in breaking his limits, but if there was external help, he naturally wouldn’t mind.","He took out the second Evolution Fruit and continued to gnaw on it.","Only when natural treasures were used on oneself, would they be considered worth it.","After he digested the three Evolution Fruits, his third clay fetus also successfully advanced into the Stone Fetus.","“Hu, there are still six clay fetuses left.” Ling Han broke into a smile. “Going by that account, with another eighteen Evolution Fruits, I would be able to cultivate to the end of the second form.”","“Let’s go.”","He activated his movement technique and shuttled back and forth on this vast island, searching for the Evolution Fruit.","At the same time, he also continued to communicate with the ley lines. If he could succeed, not only would his speed increase greatly, but he would also be more efficient when he searched for Evolution Fruits.","However, the ley lines here were suppressed by the Regulations of the highest level, so it was really too difficult to communicate. Seven days passed in a row, and Ling Han did not manage to harvest a single Evolution Fruit, and his grasp of the ley lines had also improved very little.","Boom!","Sounds of battle suddenly traveled over from ahead of him Ling Han hesitated slightly, but still continued onwards.","In this kind of Mystery Realm, there was no need to meddle in other people’s business. That was because there were really too many people that had entered, and there was no way to manage them at all. However, since they were in front of him, there was no need for Ling Han to deliberately take a different path. If he did, he would be at a disadvantage.","After taking a few steps, he saw both sides of the battle.","On one side was a fierce beast, a Black Back Bear. There was a streak of golden brown fur on its back, as if it had been split into two, but in the midst of battle, this streak of golden brown fur shone, exuding a terrifying aura, boosting its astonishing battle prowess.","On the other side were people.","Yi?","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. He had really searched high and low for him, yet found him without much effort.","This person was Xu Jie, an the Imperial Son.","Among those people that had targeted Ling Han the most, Shi Yuanzhen, Xu Jie, and Guan Yuanming were the three people who jumped around the most happily. They were also the three people that Ling Han definitely had to kill. He had not thought that he would encounter one so soon.","Ling Han glanced at it. This Black Back Bear was very fierce, its battle prowess reaching as high as 30 Heavens, slightly stronger than even Xu Jie.","It could not be helped. Though Xu Jie was the Imperial Son, and had the aptitude to be invincible among his peers, Xu Jie had just advanced into the third form of the True Self Tier, after all. Even if he used the Imperial Technique, his battle prowess would only be limited to the battle prowess of twenty nine Heavens, which was slightly inferior to this fierce beast.","However, the Imperial Son would naturally not retreat so easily. So what if there was a gap of battle prowess of one Heaven? He was trying his best to turn the tables.","—There were too many accidents in battle, and it was not definite that the one with the highest battle prowess would win.","Seeing Xu Jie’s perilous situation, Ling Han decided to make a move.","How could Xu Jie be allowed to die in the hands of a vicious beast? Even with the Substitution Seal, he would still not allow it. This would deprive him of the joy of revenge.","Xiu, Ling Han charged out. His target was naturally the Black Back Bear.","He suppressed his battle prowess, and only unleashed the power of the 29 Heavens. However, with the addition of a powerful helper like him, Xu Jie’s situation instantly improved greatly.","This Imperial Son only glanced at Ling Han, and did not thank him.","The Imperial Clan was high and noble, and the Imperial Son was more so a dragon above the Nine Heavens. How could he express thanks so easily?","Obtaining a favor from the Imperial Clan, wasn’t that enough for you to brag about?","He didn’t recognize Ling Han, because Ling Han was still in disguise.","‘Die!’"]},{"number":4241,"title":"Chapter 4241: Beaten to burst","paragraphs":["Chapter 4241: Beaten to burst","Editor: Henyee Translations","The two of them worked together, and forced the Black Back Bear to retreat under great difficulty.","After all, wild beasts only didn’t have intelligence, but they weren’t really stupid. After spending so much effort, it still couldn’t kill its prey. Of course, it would go find other food.","Xu Jie’s expression was filled with pride. He glanced at Ling Han, and asked, “Which Holy Land are you from?”","Aside from the Holy Land’s Dao Child, even if the others reached the fourth form of the True Self Tier, they wouldn’t be able to possess battle prowess of 29 Heavens.","“Nine Suns Holy Land.” Ling Han smiled faintly.","Xu Jie’s heart involuntarily clenched. F***, why was it so coincidental?","“Your abilities are not too bad, so you are qualified to stay by my side,” he said calmly, his expression filled with pride.","In his eyes, this was naturally giving Ling Han enough face.","Even though their strength was now equal, he had just advanced into the Third Form of the True Self Tier, and still had a lot of room for improvement. Furthermore, he was also an Imperial Son!","The title of Imperial Son was already powerful enough, and could crush everything else.","“That won’t do.” Ling Han shook his head.","“En?” Xu Jie’s eyes widened in a glare, instantly revealing anger.","‘You actually dare to refuse my kindness?’","‘Don’t you know who I am?’","Right at this moment, shua, Ling Han threw a punch at Xu Jie.","He was a Body Arts practitioner, and throwing such a punch from close quarters was indescribably fast. Furthermore, Xu Jie would never have imagined that Ling Han would suddenly attack him.","—Otherwise, why did you help me just now? It doesn’t make sense, right?","At this moment, Xu Jie’s expression was extremely colourful. He was stunned, confused, angered and humiliated. He, a dignified Imperial Son, was actually going to be slapped in the face?","He wanted to parry, but he wasn’t a Body Arts user, so how could his speed be so fast? If he wanted to parry, it would definitely be too late. Thus, he could only stimulate the Regulations, turning it into a shield of Regulations in front of his face.","As he saw it, his battle prowess was on par with Ling Han’s. Even if he couldn’t use his full defense in a hurry, it shouldn’t be difficult for him to block this punch.","Peng!","The iron fist arrived, and the shield of Regulations blocked it. However, Xu Jie was horrified to discover that the shield of Regulations was instantly shattered. The iron fist continued to attack, ruthlessly smashing into his face.","It hurt!","This was Xu Jie’s first reaction. Then, he was sent flying.","He fell heavily onto the ground, and felt that his whole face had become numb, and he could not feel it at all.","Hiss, he inhaled sharply. Firstly, it was pain, and secondly, it was shock.","The shield of Regulations that he had set up was actually broken with a single punch from Ling Han? Was this something that a battle prowess of twenty nine Heavens could accomplish?","No, this battle prowess was at least higher than his by three Heavens.","However, Xu Jie flew into a thunderous rage.","He was the Imperial Son, so when had he ever suffered such humiliation, or been slapped in the face like this?","“You’ve gone mad!” He jumped up, humiliated and furious.","“Are you surprised? Are you shocked?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“You are seeking death!” Xu Jie gritted his teeth, his expression filled with hatred.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “This place has cut off communication. Who do you plan to ask for help from?”","Xu Jie’s expression changed drastically. He was not the only member of the Xu Clan to enter this place. The strongest was naturally Xu Youque of the Silver Generation, but if he was together with Xu Youque, how could the Evolution Fruit they obtained be shared with him?","Thus, he chose to act alone. With his battle prowess, identity, and the Substitution Seal, he was naturally filled with confidence. He didn’t think that he would encounter any trouble.","However, it hadn’t been long, and he had already been targeted for no reason.","“Who the hell are you?” He touched his face. F*ck, his chin had been knocked crooked, and he was in great pain.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Aren’t you despicable? You don’t even know who attacked you after being beaten.”","“Less nonsense. Hurry up and tell me your name,” Xu Jie shouted loudly.","This person was from the Nine Suns Holy Land. Could it be that he was here to stand up for Ling Han? Or was it that he had deliberately said this, so that the Nine Suns Holy Land would take the blame for this?","All of a sudden, his thoughts flew.","“Hehe, don’t think so hard!” Ling Han shot forwards like an arrow, and struck out with both fists.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Xu Jie hurriedly parried, but Ling Han’s battle prowess was as high as 31 Heavens, so how could he be a match?","He went all out, yet was completely unable to resist. The gap in battle prowess was too wide.","What a familiar battle style.","Xu Jie was taken aback, then realization dawned on him, “You are Ling Han!”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “That’s right. You’ve finally thought of it.”","Xu Jie couldn’t help but feel his scalp go numb. It was actually Ling Han!","When he had been in the Core Formation Tier, Ling Han had been able to thrash Imperial Sons like them, and after advancing into the True Self Tier, Ling Han’s advantage had not weakened in the slightest, and was completely maintained.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han was the strongest, followed by Imperial Sons like them. Even the Silver Generation was no match for him, so they could only depend on the Golden Generation.","And now, he had encountered this bringer of misfortune.","Without the advantage of a superior cultivation level, how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han?","“The Imperial Clan is very impressive, isn’t it? They can target whoever they like!” Ling Han’s iron fist blasted out madly. With a single punch, Xu Jie screamed repeatedly, “Isn’t it just a few Saints keeping watch, and an Imperial Weapon protecting the clan?”","“If we’re really talking about abilities, who the f*ck do you think you are?”","Ling Han was furious. He had been forced to leave the Nine Suns Holy Land, and in the Buddhist Race, he had also been bullied by the main branch from the Buddhist Land.","Why?","Just because of the words Imperial Clan.","“Ling Han, I’m warning you, don’t go too far!” Xu Jie said through gritted teeth, unwilling to weaken his stand.","“Too far?” Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh. “Do you guys have the right to say the word ‘too far’? When you guys were bullying others, why didn’t you think of the word ‘too far’? You’re really making me laugh my head off.”","“Do you really want to fight the Imperial Clan to the death?” Xu Jie shouted. He could feel Ling Han’s determination to kill him.","Ling Han chuckled and said, “The nine great Imperial Clans have joined forces to hunt me down. Do you think I still need to be grateful to you?”","“Humph, you don’t understand at all!” Xu Jie said. “If you kill me, it won’t be as simple as just hunting you down. Even the Saints of my clan will spare no expense to predict your whereabouts. No matter how big the universe is, there will be no place for you to hide!”","“Alright, I’ll wait.” Ling Han nodded, appearing to be completely unconcerned, as he continued to pummel him with his fists.","Xu Jie was still a little confused, “Then why did you help me previously?”","“Ya, you’re going to be severely injured or even killed by a fierce beast. Won’t that decrease the pleasure of my revenge?” Ling Han said with a smile.","‘F*ck you!’","Xu Jie felt an urge to curse. So that was the reason?","“Ling Han, don’t be too arrogant!” he roared. “To say nothing of the Golden Generation, the members of the Silver Generation are either in the fourth form or even in the fifth form of True Self Tier, or they have already advanced into Spirit Transformation Tier. Any single one of them would be able to kill you easily.”","“Unfortunately, you won’t be able to see it!” Ling Han’s killing intent was cold. Destructive Energy was activated, wrapped around his fist, and blasted towards Xu Jie.","Peng!","With a single punch, Xu Jie’s head exploded.","Ling Han waited. He would wait for Xu Jie to revive, and then kill him a few more times. Members of Imperial Clans were really troublesome. With the Substitution Seal, he would have to kill him a few times.","However, after waiting for a long time, he still didn’t see Xu Jie revive.","Yi?","Ling Han found this strange. Could it be that Xu Jie’s Substitution Seal had already been used up before this? Otherwise, he would have been revived long ago."]},{"number":4242,"title":"Chapter 4242: Silver Generation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4242: Silver Generation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han searched Xu Jie, and soon, aside from his Spatial Tool, he also found a Peach Tree Seal.","This was hanging from Xu Jie’s neck. There were mysterious veined patterns on the wooden seal, and there was also a Saint-level aura.","Substitution Seal.","Although Ling Han hadn’t obtained the Substitution Seal before, he could confirm with a single glance that this was the Substitution Seal.","However, the Substitution Seal was clearly hanging on Xu Jie’s neck, so why didn’t it take effect?","“The Substitution Seal isn’t truly capable of actual revival. Instead, it’s used to deceive heaven and earth, using a fake body to withstand a fatal strike,” Ling Han murmured. “This kind of technique can only be mastered by the Imperial Clan. It’s not something that can be done just by reaching the Saint Tier. It might involve the Imperial Weapon.”","“Of course, the Saint’s blood essence is the most powerful. It’s said that some of the Saint’s blood essence has to be expended in its creation.”","“There shouldn’t be any mistake with the Substitution Seal, so the reason should be me.”","“Destructive Energy?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Destructive Energy was incredibly domineering, and its level could possibly reach 10 stars. It was something that all the Great Emperors had never touched before. Thus, Destructive Energy had blasted over, and even Substitution Seal was ineffective?","Was that possible?","“In the past, have I used Destructive Energy to kill the Imperial Son before?”","Ling Han couldn’t remember clearly. After all, he hadn’t paid much attention to it at that time.","“It’s also possible that it’s because the Destructive Energy that I’ve grasped is becoming stronger and stronger, and that’s why it’s extraordinarily effective.”","“Looks like I’ll have to kill a few more Imperial Sons to find out.”","Ling Han was even more curious about the Destructive Energy. Merely the quality of 10 stars made Destructive Energy extremely mysterious, and previously, it had already been proven that the Destructive Energy had an extremely outstanding effect on killing Yin souls, allowing Ling Han to battle even with a disadvantage of a major tier.","Now, even the Substitution Seal was ineffective?","If that was really the case, then it was incredibly awesome.","“Right now, there’s still a Ding Shu that possesses Destructive Energy.”","“He and I are both rulers of the Genesis World, and it was also because of this that I managed to grasp Destructive Energy. I’m sure that Ding Shu is the same.”","“What’s the relationship between the two?”","Ling Han wracked his brains, but without more clues, what was the point even if he wracked his brains?","Forget it, he would continue to look for the Evolution Fruit.","Ling Han didn’t think that he was invincible. To say nothing of the Silver Generation, even the majority of Dao Child from Holy Lands had battle prowess that was above his. However, a Dao Child didn’t have a Great Emperor-level treasure that could resist his murderous aura and his ability of weakening battle prowess, so he could still defeat them easily.","But it was a different story for the Silver Generation. They were Imperial Sons, and had a great many treasures.","As Ling Han searched for the Evolution Fruit, he flipped through Xu Jie’s Spatial Tool. Hiss, as expected of the Imperial Son. He really had a lot of good stuff on him.","Unfortunately, there was no Evolution Fruit.","Ling Han searched everywhere on the Island of the Sky. In these three months, he had harvested another two Evolution Fruits, but did not encounter any other Imperial Sons.","“It’s done!”","He suddenly smiled, showing an expression of delight.","—At this point, he had finally completely grasped the ley lines in this place. He could use the Star Steps, and could also use the ley lines as tentacles to scout in all directions.","“Evolution Fruit, Evolution Fruit, Evolution Fruit, I got it!”","Ling Han’s figure flashed, and he had already disappeared from where he was standing. When he reappeared, he was already 1500km away.","In the outside world, the distance of 1500 kilometers was only a few steps away for the True Self Tier. However, there was the supreme Regulations suppressing them here, so while everyone’s speed couldn’t be said to be crawling, it really wasn’t that fast.","Thus, Ling Han’s speed was practically heaven-defying.","In front of him, there was a short plant that was gently swaying in the breeze. There was an Evolution Fruit hanging from the tree.","Ling Han reached over and plucked the Evolution Fruit. Now, he could also push the fourth clay fetus to the level of Stone Fetus.","“Hmm?”","A figure rapidly swept over. It was a young man with a lanky figure. His forehead was very protruding, like a bird’s beak.","However, he definitely couldn’t be underestimated just because of his appearance. Seals continuously exploded around this person, creating an astonishing scene.","“Leave the Evolution Fruit behind and sever your own arm. Then, get lost!” the young man said calmly, as if he were merely talking about an extremely ordinary matter.","Ling Han bared his teeth in a grin, “What if I say no?”","“Then leave both your life and the Evolution Fruit behind,” the young man said with a calm expression. He didn’t take Ling Han seriously at all.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I want the Evolution Fruit, and I have no intention of handing over my life.”","Boom, the young man immediately moved. He was incredibly decisive, and shot out a palm strike. The Regulations formed into a fierce tiger that charged towards Ling Han.","‘So powerful!’","Ling Han immediately retreated. This person’s battle prowess was at least 40 Heavens, far above his own.","Boom!","The ferocious tiger arrived, smashing a massive deep pit into the ground. There were still Regulations rising from it, turning into sabers, swords, axes, and halberds. Its destructive power was still incredibly terrifying.","“Silver Generation?” Ling Han asked calmly, not showing any respect.","This young man was slightly surprised. He had actually failed with a single strike?","He humphed, and said, “I am Baili Yun.”","Baili? The Ziwei Imperial Clan.","“Oh, I’ll remember that,” Ling Han said with a nod.","Baili Yun couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “Could it be that you think you can still escape from me?”","“What’s so difficult about that?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“You don’t know what you’re talking about!” Baili Yun said coldly. He pressed out his right hand. Xiu, xiu, xiu! The Regulations turned into pillars that surrounded Ling Han. “You’re like a turtle in a jar, trapped with nowhere to go.”","Meanwhile, Ling Han laughed loudly, “Let me teach you a lesson. You have to know that there will always be someone stronger than you.”","He activated the Star Steps, and xiu, he instantly disappeared.","‘Hmm?’","Baili Yun faltered upon this. He hadn’t imagined that Ling Han would still be able to escape from his siege.","“Star Steps!” Realization immediately dawned on him. As a member of the Silver Generation, he was naturally knowledgeable. Then, he nodded, “So, you are Ling Han!”","He was still a little surprised, because there was a Venerate Tier elite investigating outside, and this still allowed Ling Han to sneak in. This brat’s art of disguise was really amazing. No wonder such a huge joke had happened in the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm, to actually take Ling Han into Buddhist Race as a Buddha Son.","“Alright, then I’ll get rid of you.” He took out a copper coin, and recited a chant. Then, he threw it into the sky, and after drawing an arc, it landed on the ground.","“There!” He picked up the copper coin and headed in a certain direction.","If Ling Han could discover the direction he was heading in, he would definitely be surprised, because he was presently in this direction, and the distance was not too far either.","In this place, though he could use the Star Step, he could not teleport too far either. 4000 km was his limit.","It could not be helped. The Regulations of the highest level was suppressing him.","Ling Han continued to gnaw on the Evolution Fruit as he calculated in his mind. The Silver Generation was indeed powerful. His battle prowess had already soared to 40 Heavens, and at this stage, he was completely capable of beating him up. In fact, the Silver Generation had the ability to kill him.","Thus, if he wanted to become stronger, and if he wanted to do so in a short amount of time, he would need a large amount of Evolution Fruits.","After ingesting this fruit, Ling Han began to transform the fourth clay fetus, advancing it to become a Stone Fetus."]},{"number":4243,"title":"Chapter 4243: Counter-Ambush","paragraphs":["Chapter 4243: Counter-Ambush","Editor: Henyee Translations","Just when Ling Han refined the medicinal effects of the Evolution Fruit, Baili Yun was also approaching.","However, 4000km could be considered a considerable distance for him at present, so his progress wasn’t fast.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly felt a sense of danger. Instinctively, he immediately used the Strange Shadow Steps and entered into the shadows.","This was the most impressive concealment technique of the Battle God Palace. Moreover, he could move slowly. The Strange Shadow Steps definitely had a part to play in the fact that the Battle God Palace had such a renowned vicious reputation.","Xiu, a figure streaked over, and Baili Yun’s figure appeared. He swept his gaze around, and frowned slightly. He had clearly sensed Ling Han’s aura here, so why had he suddenly disappeared?","Could it be that this brat just happened to leave?","So coincidental?","Ling Han saw this clearly, and was internally surprised. He had clearly used the Star Steps to arrive here, so how had Baili Yun managed to follow him here?","‘Alright, since you’re here.’","Ling Han approached Baili Yun from behind. He wanted to catch him off guard?","Hehe, I’ll let you have a taste of being ambushed.","Baili Yun took out a copper coin. Xiu, he threw it into the sky. He wanted to once again determine the location of Ling Han.","Pa, the copper coin fell to the ground. His eyes swept over it, and his expression instantly changed.","—The target was behind him, and it was very close at that!","Boom!","Right at this moment, Ling Han charged out, throwing out both fists. Destructive Energy boiled, and he instantly exploded with complete battle prowess.","In his haste, Baili Yun did not manage to organize a decent counterattack in time. He could only stimulate his divine sense, and lay out a shield of Regulations behind him.","Peng, there was a loud bang, and the energy exploded, turning into a mushroom cloud.","The shield of Regulations just barely managed to block Ling Han’s fists, but it itself had also been shattered. There was still a sliver of power that swept past, passing over Baili Yun’s scalp, and instantly, a great many strands of hair fell off.","Ling Han’s attack missed, and he didn’t linger in battle at all. Using the Star Steps, he instantly disappeared.","Baili Yun did not immediately give chase. Instead, he panted heavily with lingering fear.","Just now, if his strength had been slightly weaker, or if his reaction had been slightly slower, his mind would definitely have been obliterated.","He had the Substitution Seal, so he naturally couldn’t be killed with a single strike. However, just thinking about it made him break out in a cold sweat.","A majestic Imperial Son, a Silver Generation elite at that, was almost ambushed and killed!","It should be known that he had come to ambush Ling Han.","“This brat, what movement technique has he mastered that can actually hide his tracks under my senses?” He was extremely confused. How strong was his senses? Even a great many Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivators couldn’t escape his senses, so how could someone whose cultivation level was lower than his do it?","“Kill him! I definitely have to kill him!”","“He comes from an ordinary background, yet can be so powerful. He must be hiding a great secret. If I can obtain it, who knows, I may be able to surpass the Golden Generation!”","A glimmer of ambition flickered in his eyes. They were all Imperial Sons, yet they had been categorized into different grades. In the eyes of outsiders, the Silver Generation was already shining brilliantly, but he was internally displeased.","—Above silver, there was gold!","He had only been born a few years later, and he was destined to be inferior to those people?","In the clan, any top-notch cultivation resources would definitely be given priority to Baili Tian. No one asked him if he needed them at all.","He was going to make a comeback. He was going to become Emperor; he was not resigned to this!","“Rat, I will definitely find you!” Baili Yun took out a copper coin, and once again began to predict Ling Han’s whereabouts.","...","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure appeared.","“Can that guy’s copper coins predict my position?” he murmured. He refused to believe that the Imperial Son had nothing better to do and was tossing copper coins around in boredom.","Moreover, it was also because Baili Yun had tossed out the copper coin that he had become alert.","“It took Baili Yun about half an hour to travel 4000 km. Hehe, then let him travel for a while longer.”","Ling Han used the Star Steps and continued to teleport.","Very quickly, he had already left Baili Yun far behind, and on his way, he actually discovered another Evolution Fruit.","“You take your time.”","Ling Han continued to absorb the medicinal effects, but with Baili Yun’s disturbance, the Evolution Fruit from before had not taken full effect. Thus, Ling Han’s fourth clay fetus was still a bit off from completely becoming a Stone Fetus.","This grudge... was huge!","Ling Han thought to himself as he nibbled on the new Evolution Fruit.","This time, he successfully formed the fourth Stone Fetus.","“Evolution Fruit, I need more Evolution Fruits.”","Using the ley lines as eyes and ears, he searched for the Evolution Fruit.","Although he was being suppressed by the Regulations of the highest level, he could only stimulate the ley lines within the 4000 km radius, but this efficiency was still a hundred times higher than others.","“I’ve got it!”","“I found another one.”","“Haha.”","In a mere three days, Ling Han found another four Evolution Fruits. Not only was the fifth Stone Fetus formed, but even the sixth clay fetus was in the process of transforming.","“My current strength... both powers at eighteen Heavens. If I explode both at the same time, I can reach the level of 23 Heavens.”","Ling Han tested his strength. In this way, his maximum battle prowess could reach 34 Heavens.","“I am still no match for the Silver Generation, even if it’s the weakest.”","The Silver Generation with the lowest cultivation level was the fourth form of the True Self Tier, and battle prowess exceeded 40 Heavens. In fact, there were even those at the fifth form of True Self Tier among them. Then, their battle prowess could possibly be unfathomable.","“I’ll search again!”","Ling Han continued to search for the Evolution Fruit, and Baili Yun finally caught up to him. This time, he was on full alert, but Ling Han didn’t plan to ambush him at all. He fled at the first instant, making Baili Yun wait there stupidly for a long time. In the end, he made a prediction with the copper coin, and when he discovered that Ling Han had already run far away, he almost vomited blood.","The more this was the case, the more Baili Yun was unwilling to give up. He still stayed close behind Ling Han. He had always thought that there would come a time when one would be careless, and he only needed to get a chance, and that would be enough to make Ling Han be consigned to eternal damnation.","Ling Han didn’t mind. His cultivation level was rapidly increasing, and his battle prowess was already not far from 40 Heavens. If he could advance into the third form, he would immediately turn around and fight Baili Yun.","What was this!","Yi?","He was using the ley lines to search for the Evolution Fruit when he made an unexpected discovery.","With a thought, Ling Han immediately rushed over.","...","Shi Yuanzhen’s expression was filled with pride, and he said calmly, “Leave the Evolution Fruit behind, and get lost immediately!”","In front of him, there were four young people, three men and one woman. All of them were filled with heroic spirit, and were quite extraordinary.","“What gives you the right!” A man in green robes appeared to be very angry. This Evolution Fruit had been painstakingly harvested after they had killed a fierce beast, so what right do you have to ask for it with just a few words?","“Why?” Shi Yuanzhen couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. “Because I’m Shi Yuanzhen!”","“Shi Yuanzhen?” The green-robed man looked at a loss. ‘Are you very powerful?’","“Shi Yuanzhen!” His companion, a purple-robed young man, exclaimed, his expression changing drastically. “Imperial Son!”","“Oh, I remember now. It was that Imperial Son that had been instantly defeated by two Buddha Sons respectively with a single move!” The only woman, who was wearing a red dress, immediately called out, looking a little naive.","Instantly, Shi Yuanzhen looked furious.","F***!"]},{"number":4244,"title":"Chapter 4244: Don’t even recognize an old friend?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4244: Don’t even recognize an old friend?","To be defeated by Ling Han and Ding Shu, and in an instant at that, this was Shi Yuanzhen’s pain!","And now, this woman in red actually exposed his shortcoming right to his face, which naturally caused Shi Yuanzhen’s killing intent to rise.","The Imperial Clan was overbearing in the first place, what more when this was a Mystery Realm. Killing someone to prevent him from leaking the secret would be completely fine.","“You’re seeking death!” Shi Yuanzhen said balefully. He raised his right hand, and mystical power condensed, turning into a white ball of light.","“Oh no, he’s in a humiliated rage, and wants to kill us to keep the secret!” The three men and one woman were all shocked.","The Imperial Son was invincible among his peers, and this had long since become deeply ingrained in their hearts like an iron rule. Thus, these four people naturally paled in shock. “Die!” Shi Yuanzhen waved his hand. Boom, that ball of light shot out, and then suddenly exploded. Boom, a terrifying energy shot out, blasting towards the four of them.","The four of them hurriedly joined forces to parry, but the Imperial Son was really too strong. They only managed to parry for a short while, and all of them spat out blood as they were sent flying.","Pa, pa, pa, pa! The four of them were thrown all over the ground, all of them pale.","They were all terrified. Were they going to die here?","“If you dare make another move, I will crush this Evolution Fruit!” The green-robed man was very resolute. He gripped the Evolution Fruit in his hand, and threatened Shi Yuanzhen.","This was their only hope. Regardless of whether it was useful or not, they would try everything they could.","Shi Yuanzhen looked coldly at him. After a while, he said, “All right. You can put down the Evolution Fruit and get lost.”","“No, all four of us will leave!” the green-robed man said.","Shi Yuanzhen smiled, “Do you have four Evolution Fruits?”","The green-robed man was rendered speechless. He naturally didn’t have four Evolution Fruits. Such a good thing would naturally be eaten immediately after obtaining one. He didn’t plan to sell it for money, so what was the point of saving it?","“This was obtained by the four of us together, so we naturally have to trade it for the safety of four people,” he emphasized.","Shi Yuanzhen shrugged and said, “Fine, I’ll give you a chance. You can choose any person you want, and I’ll let them leave safely.”","How could the green-robed man make a decision like this?","He didn’t want his companion to die, nor did he want to die himself. What could he do?","When Shi Yuanzhen saw this, he couldn’t help but chuckle coldly. He was naturally doing this on purpose. He wanted to see the darkness of human nature.","Xiu, right at this moment, a figure appeared, as if he had appeared out of thin air. He was right next to the green-robed man, and stretched out a hand, snatching the Evolution Fruit.","No one had expected this scene, and they were all extremely dumbfounded.","What was going on?","Who are you?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “The palm of your hand and the back of your hand are both flesh, so it’s hard to make a decision, right? Fine, I’ll help you.”","Yi, don’t be so familiar. We don’t even know each other.","The green-robed man was dumbfounded, and did not know how to answer at this moment.","Meanwhile, Shi Yuanzhen showed a hint of killing intent, and asked balefully, “Who are you?”","“Me?” Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “We’re already old friends. Your words truly make me sad.”","Old friends?","Shi Yuanzhen looked at Ling Han, yet could not recognize him no matter how hard he tried. He said calmly, “All right. Bring the Evolution Fruit over, and I can consider whether I should befriend you or not.”","The Evolution Fruit changed hands, and he naturally had no intention of paying any more attention to the green-robed man. In his eyes, this was already a dead man.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and walked towards Shi Yuanzhen.","Meanwhile, the green-robed man and the others were trembling in fear. Their lives were no longer in their hands.","“Here.” Ling Han stretched out his right hand, and the Evolution Fruit was presently held in his hand.","Shi Yuanzhen also stretched out his hand, but it was not to grab at the Evolution Fruit. Instead, it was to grab at Ling Han’s neck. His fingers instantly turned black, as if they had become refined metal.","It was as if Ling Han hadn’t seen him, and he didn’t dodge or evade.","F***, was this guy an idiot?","The green-robed man and the others were all in despair. At first, they had still held onto a sliver of hope, but even if your strength is higher than the heavens, would you still be able to turn the situation around with someone holding onto your neck?","Meanwhile, Shi Yuanzhen’s expression was cold. Was this really an idiot?","His hand had already made contact, but with a zi, flashes of lightning flickered. He felt his right hand go numb, and involuntarily, bounced back.","‘So powerful!’","Shi Yuanzhen immediately looked wary. This person was not really stupid, but was extremely strong, and that was why he dared to take such a risk.","“Who exactly are you?” he asked again.","“Sigh, I already said we were old friends. You are really too heartless.” Ling Han shook his","head.","Shi Yuanzhen gave a soft exclamation, and directly launched an attack.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and brandished his fists to greet the incoming attack.","Peng!","It was only a single strike, and Shi Yuanzhen was sent flying. He was completely unqualified","to match Ling Han.","“Ling Han!” He finally recognized him.","In the past, he had been sent flying by this punch. Although Ling Han’s identity at the time was the Buddha Son of West Heavenly Realm, after the truth was revealed, he naturally","understood.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “That’s right, it’s your Grandpa Ling.”","“Damn it!” Shi Yuanzhen roared loudly, burning his Imperial Blood at the first instant.","He was extremely decisive, because he knew that he was no match for Ling Han. If he did not use his trump card, that would only be courting death.","His power was originally around 16 Heavens, and now, it had suddenly leaped to 25 Heavens. The improvement could be considered extremely shocking, and if he used Imperial Techniques, his maximum battle prowess would soar directly to 34 Heavens. Unfortunately, Ling Han’s battle prowess was also 34 Heavens, so he was still unable to gain","the upper hand.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely, both of them going all out. One after another, shockwaves blasted out, forcing the green-robed man and the others to retreat repeatedly. How could they possibly dare to stay where they were? That would only be suicidal.","The Imperial Son was indeed difficult to deal with.","Ling Han thought internally. Not only could he burn his Imperial Blood to increase his battle prowess, he also had the protection of Great Emperor-level precious treasures, so he was unafraid of any adverse effects. With this turn of events, the difference in battle prowess was at least a dozen over Heavens.","Otherwise, would it be so difficult for him to kill someone of the same cultivation level?","But even so, Shi Yuanzhen was still in imminent danger, because his Imperial Blood could not","burn for too long.","-After all, the Imperial Blood required a Saint to release his own blood essence to quickly","replenish it. That was precious blood that was equivalent to Saintly medicine, and even a","Saint could not afford such extravagance.","Thus, Shi Yuanzhen could only last for about thirty minutes.","He knew very well. Thus, after only a few fierce exchanges, he began to break out of the siege.","He wanted to flee?","Ling Han beckoned with his hand, and an Earth Dragon immediately shot out of the ground, attacking Shi Yuanzhen.","“Get lost!” Shi Yuanzhen brandished his Spirit Tool and attacked. At this moment, his battle prowess reached 34 Heavens, and the Earth Dragon was no match for him at all. It was easily","shattered.","But in this way, his course of retreat was also hindered.","Helpless, Shi Yuanzhen could only continue to battle Ling Han.","In just a few moves, he wanted to flee again, but was once again blocked by the Earth Dragon.","Boom!","He defeated the Earth Dragon, and faced with Ling Han’s fist, he chose to ignore it. -Even if he had to take this punch in exchange for time for him to escape, he had the Substitution Seal anyways, so no matter how terrible it was, he wouldn’t die.","When Ling Han saw this, he couldn’t help but chuckle coldly.","He was truly seeking death.","Fine, I’ll oblige you.","Boom, the iron fist blasted out madly, blazing with energy.","Peng!","Shi Yuanzhen’s attack landed, and he immediately looked terrified. He discovered that his","mind was crumbling!","How was this possible?"]},{"number":4245,"title":"Chapter 4245: Another Kill","paragraphs":["Chapter 4245: Another Kill","It was not that Shi Yuanzhen had not “died” before. It was all the Substitution Seal that had taken effect, saving him from this calamity.","Thus, he clearly knew what kind of process this was.","But this time was different. His mind was really crumbling.","Not good, he was done for!","How was this possible?","He had the Substitution Seal.","Could it be that it was the Saint of the clan that was screwing him over?","Boom! The destructive power swept over him, and he no longer had the ability to think. He was completely dead.","Ling Han waited slightly, but did not discover that Shi Yuanzhen had “revived” – in truth, his head had already exploded, so how could he possibly come back to life?","As expected, the Destructive Energy possessed the ability to kill, rendering even Substitution Seal useless.","“Thank you.” At this moment, the green-robed man and the others all walked over, expressing their gratitude towards Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, “I did it casually.”","“It was a casual action on your part, sir, but to us, it is a debt of gratitude for saving our lives.” The green-robed man seemed to have the highest status, and it was he who answered all the questions.","Ling Han merely smiled. If you guys want to be grateful, then be grateful.","Yi?","He discovered that these four people were all staring at him. More precisely, they were staring at the Evolution Fruit in his hand.","“Do you guys want me to return this thing to you?” he asked with a smile.","“That would naturally be good.” The green-robed man swallowed, and seemed to feel that this was inappropriate to say. The other had just saved their lives, so he hurriedly added, “Of course, if Benefactor needs it, you can take it as you like.”","“Alright, then I won’t be reserved.” Ling Han put the Evolution Fruit away.","Yi, are you not going to be reserved?","The green-robed man had planned it out very well. As long as Ling Han was the slightest bit polite, he would take back the Evolution Fruit. After all, the Evolution Fruit was too valuable, but it could help them advance into the Fifth Form. This meant that they would have a chance to become great Sect Master elites.","But Ling Han was really too unreserved. He directly put away the Evolution Fruit, leaving him completely at a loss for words.","Ling Han chuckled. Playing tricks in front of him? How naive.","He activated the Star Steps, and xiu, he instantly disappeared from sight.","“Sigh!” The four young people all sighed. They had finally found an Evolution Fruit after much difficulty, and it was gone just like that.","“Let’s just search again. In any case, there’s still a long time.”","“En!”","They all nodded. Just as they were about to leave, weng, a terrifying aura assaulted them, making them feel a little suffocated.","A figure appeared, his aura astonishing. However, his forehead was too protruding, like a bird’s beak.","“Puchi!” The red-clothed woman instantly laughed, but when she realized that this was not good, she hurriedly covered her mouth with her hand again.","Baili Yun looked towards that woman, a cold light interwoven in his eyes.","The red-clothed woman only felt a pain in her mind, and then fell down loudly. “Junior Sister!” The green-robed man and the others hurriedly went to help her up, yet shockingly discovered that the red-clothed woman’s vitality had completely disappeared. “You, you, you, were you the one who did it?” The three of them all looked angrily at Baili","Yun.","“A mere ant dares to shout in front of me?” Baili Yun humphed, his eyes sharp, and killing intent surged. Peng, peng, peng! The green-robed man and the others all fell to the ground, unable to stand back up.","He looked at Shi Yuanzhen’s corpse not far away, and couldn’t help but frown slightly. “This is the Imperial Son of the Shi Clan, right? I’ve seen him once, and I remember his aura.”","“Hehe, this Ling Han is really outrageously bold. He even dares to kill an Imperial Son!”","“If I kill this despicable brat, not only will I be able to obtain the treasures on him, I will also be able to ask for a favor from the Shi Clan. Hehe, killing two birds with one stone.”","“Yi?”","He examined Shi Yuanzhen’s corpse, and his expression instantly became solemn.","“The Substitution Seal is still here.”","“How is this possible!”","He was stunned. The Substitution Seal had not cracked yet, which meant that he had not expended all his uses of the Substitution Seal. Then, how had Shi Yuanzhen died?","After a long while, he finally murmured, “I heard the Saints of my clan coincidentally mention that the Substitution Seal is indeed not perfect. As long as the strength of the person who made it is above that of the Saint that created the Substitution Seal, then the Substitution Seal would not be effective.”","“The Substitution Seal is equivalent to a Saint moving to save someone’s life. However, if the opponent’s strength surpasses the Saint’s, it’s naturally impossible to save them.”","“The question is, how could that brat, Ling Han, possibly possess strength that surpasses Saints?”","“Could it be... that he has grasped some kind of super technique, and in terms of quality, it has even surpassed Saint-level?”","“Could it be that this is the secret to that brat’s rise in power?”","“That’s right. If he had not grasped Emperor-level techniques, how could he have surpassed","an Imperial Son?”","Thinking of this, he was naturally even more tempted. If he could capture Ling Han, his gains could possibly exceed his imagination.","Baili Yun’s heart burned with desire. He took out a copper coin and tossed it over. After predicting the direction of Ling Han’s whereabouts, he immediately set off in pursuit.","...","Ling Han naturally would not know what had happened after he had left, and would not have foreseen that Baili Yun would be so deranged, to make a move on someone unrelated to him.","-To the Imperial Clan, the others were only ants. If they were trampled to death, so be it. What need was there for them to be concerned?","He took out the Evolution Fruit, washed it slightly, and began to eat.","This was a familiar taste, and it was just as delicious.","After eating this Evolution Fruit and refining the medicinal effects, Ling Han’s sixth clay fetus","also successfully evolved to Stone Fetus.","“I’m still short of three Evolution Fruits.”","Ling Han shuttled back and forth on the Island of the Sky, searching everywhere for the","Evolution Fruit.","Time slowly passed, and Baili Yun caught up to him a few more times. However, since he had","grasped the Star Steps, he was naturally unscathed. In fact, he even gave Baili Yun a few surprises, causing him to break out in a cold sweat.","Baili Yun knew that Ling Han possessed a technique that rendered the Substitution Seal ineffective. As long as he was killed once, he would really be done for.","One fruit, two fruits, three fruits... The Island of the Sky was massive, and there were also a considerable number of Evolution Fruits. However, the majority of them grew in the harsh mountains and rivers, and there was a natural barrier formed by Regulations. If one wanted to cross this barrier, they would have to pay an exorbitant price.","However, this was no big deal for Ling Han. He had grasped the Star Steps, and as long as there were ley lines nearby, he could easily reach them. What barrier? In his eyes, they were completely non-existent.","This naturally allowed him to reap a great harvest – when others sought out the Evolution Fruit, obtaining one would be considered lucky. Furthermore, it was not to be used to increase one’s cultivation level, because there were other means to increase one’s cultivation level, but if one wanted to break through the limit and create the fifth form, unless one himself was incredibly freakish, he could only depend on the Evolution Fruit.","But what about Ling Han? Of course, it was the other way around.","The seventh Stone Fetus, the eighth Stone Fetus... done!","After Ling Han had entered the Island of the Sky for a year, his cultivation level was already","close to the limit of the second form. He was only left with one last clay fetus that had not","completed its evolution.","“I’m still short of one Evolution Fruit,” Ling Han murmured. With another Evolution Fruit, he would be able to complete cultivating the second form and begin breaking through to the","third form.","In order not to let Baili Yun discover any clues, Ling Han had even suppressed the urge to ambush him these days. This was to prevent Baili Yun from sensing that he was about to advance into the Third Form, realize there would be a change in the comparison of strength between them, and choose to no longer pursue him.","“At that time, it would be my turn to become the hunter,” he smiled faintly."]},{"number":4246,"title":"Chapter 4246: Natural-born Stone Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4246: Natural-born Stone Spirit","Editor: Henyee Translations","A whole year had passed since the Island of the Sky had opened.","How many people had entered this time?","Many, many people.","Thus, there would definitely be Evolution Fruits on the island, but there definitely wouldn’t be many. The difficulty of finding them would naturally increase continuously.","Even if Ling Han had mastered the ley lines and the chances of him finding Evolution Fruit was a hundred times more likely than others, his gains were still negligible.","“F*ck, I’m only missing one Evolution Fruit. Is it that difficult?”","Ling Han sighed. In his mind, the ninth clay fetus was only one third away from completely evolving into Stone Fetus, but at this moment, he couldn’t find the Evolution Fruit no matter what.","“If I cultivate on my own, I’ll need at least half a year!”","He lacked cultivation resources. Even if he had his own alchemical pills, he still needed half a year’s time.","Too long, it was really too long.","“No, I definitely have to get another Evolution Fruit.”","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position, and continued to communicate with the ley lines. Previously, he had discovered that there was a dangerous place on the Island of the Sky. The power of Regulation was extremely powerful. Even with the help of the ley lines, he did not dare to touch it, fearing that he would suffer a backlash.","But now, he planned to give it a try.","He only needed one Evolution Fruit, and he would be able to reach the end of the second form. Then, he would be able to break through to the third form, and possess the strength to beat up Baili Yun. He could not resist this kind of temptation.","He released his divine sense to communicate with the ley lines, probing into the place that he hadn’t dared to touch before.","“This!”","He was suddenly shocked, because he had touched an incredibly vast and mighty aura, indescribably strong.","What was this?","A precious tool? An elite?","At this moment, Ling Han couldn’t confirm it. This aura was extremely obscure. Furthermore, he didn’t dare to get too close, as he didn’t know what consequences it would cause.","However, under his continuous probing, this ball of aura did not have any reaction.","Treasure?","Ling Han thought. The Regulations of the highest level intertwined here, giving birth to treasures like the Evolution Fruit. However, the Evolution Fruit was only at the True Self Tier, and no matter how awesome it was, this fact couldn’t be changed.","Wasn’t this overkill?","His heart throbbed wildly. Had he discovered the biggest secret of the Island of the Sky?","As an extremely curious person, Ling Han immediately decided that he was going to explore.","“Let’s go.”","He immediately moved out, using the ley lines to traverse. After a long time, he finally approached the place.","Ahead of him was where a powerful aura was spreading out.","Ling Han stopped. Though he had already made up his mind, that aura was too strong. He had to be careful. Otherwise, it might be that he could not obtain the treasure, and could even lose his life.","He was now underground, and wrapped in the power of Regulation, he was like a fish swimming in water. The ground was completely unable to stop him.","However, at present, he could only use his divine sense to sense ahead through the ley lines, while the naked eye was completely useless.","He carefully advanced. If he discovered anything off, he would immediately use the ley lines to escape.","Weng, ahead of him, a terrifying aura surged out, like boiling water.","He couldn’t pass. Ling Han shook his head. This terrifying aura could easily shatter him.","‘Hmm?’","With a thought from Ling Han, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower instantly floated above his head, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi.","Although this wasn’t an Imperial Weapon, the Origin Gold was the highest level material in the world.","Could it withstand this aura?","Ling Han took a slight step forwards, and a terrifying aura surged out, as if it wanted to destroy the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. However, the Origin Gold was the ultimate material. Previously, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was unafraid of even the Imperial Weapon, and wanted to clash with it, what more now?","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also released a powerful aura to resist this oncoming surge of aura.","Ling Han advanced step by step, penetrating deeply into this aura.","After walking for a long time, yi, the path ahead suddenly opened up.","He had actually entered into a cave.","Da, da, da! Drops of water dripped down from above, landing on the ground. In this dead silent space, there was actually a soul-stirring feeling.","Ling Han headed deeper into the cave. He had a feeling that he was about to discover some incredible treasure.","As he walked, his speed wasn’t fast. There was a terrifying aura surging here, and although the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could resist it, Ling Han was like an ordinary person walking in a swamp. Every step was extremely difficult.","After spending close to an hour, he finally arrived at the end of the cave.","Ahead of them, a human figure had appeared.","What? The source of this terrifying aura... was actually a person!","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel extremely disappointed. He was hoping to obtain a precious treasure.","But now?","Furthermore, if it was a human, it meant that this was an elite slumbering here. Wasn’t he going to get into trouble trouble by disturbing the elite like this?","Taking advantage of the fact that the other party was still sleeping, he had to flee quickly.","Ling Han believed that the Saint was definitely in a state of deep slumber. Otherwise, this wisp of aura wouldn’t have been so obscure and calm. It wasn’t like he hadn’t seen a Saint at close quarters before. The surge of his aura was truly terrifying.","He was just about to turn around and leave, but when he used his eye technique, he was surprised.","This was not a real person, but rather a rock. However, its shape was very human-like.","“This is... Natural-born Stone Spirit!”","Ling Han’s heart beat fiercely. Natural-born Stone Spirit was the ultimate material comparable to the Origin Gold! However, no one would forge Natural-born Stone Spirit into a Spirit Tool. Instead, they would forge a doppelganger with it, and that was comparable to an Imperial Weapon!","If he obtained it, he would be rich. As long as he reached the Spirit Transformation Tier, he would be able to manifest a doppelganger and insert it into this Natural-born Stone Spirit, and his battle prowess would be able to... hehe, there should be no problem for him to defeat Venerate Tiers.","And as his cultivation level increased, the more he could unleash the might of the Natural-born Stone Spirit, just like the Origin Gold, which could be refined into an Imperial Weapon, killing Saints would be as easy as slaughtering chickens.","I’m rich! I’m rich!","Ling Han carefully advanced. The problem now was how to retrieve this Natural-born Stone Spirit.","Could this be stored into a Spatial Spirit Tool? It didn’t seem like it could, as it was a something born of nature.","He definitely couldn’t bring it with him. He had to rely on the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to resist the aura emitted by the Natural-born Stone Spirit. Otherwise, he would be crushed into a bloody mush at any moment, but if he carried this thing around everywhere... he would soon be targeted by Saints.","This was Natural-born Stone Spirit. All the elites in the world would be tempted, and Saints would also surge out madly. If this was refined into a doppelganger, it would be equivalent to possessing a body on the level of Origin Gold. Furthermore, it was close to Dao, so battle prowess would definitely surpass Saint Tier.","Then he could only break through to Spiritual Transformation Tier here.","However, there were only two years left. Would that be enough?","Ling Han thought as he walked forwards, slowly approaching this Natural-born Stone Spirit. When he was close enough, he couldn’t help but gape.","F***!","These were the words that he did not curse out loud.","He had been happy for nothing for so long. That was because he could see clearly now that he was so close. This Natural-born Stone Spirit was only an empty shell, but its insides had already been hollowed out.","Who would be so reckless?","Ling Han almost wanted to pummel that person. This was a massive waste.","That’s not right!","He immediately discovered that the inside of this Natural-born Stone Spirit was extremely clean, without the slightest sign of being carved.","If this was a normal rock, any cultivator would be able to easily do so. However, this was different. This was Natural-born Stone Spirit, and it was comparable to Origin Gold. Was it really so fragile and tender?","“Hiss, could it be that the Natural-born Stone Spirit has developed a willpower of its own, and has come into being?” Ling Han thought of a possibility, and couldn’t help but inhale sharply."]},{"number":4247,"title":"Chapter 4247: Ge Qianqiu","paragraphs":["Chapter 4247: Ge Qianqiu","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everything in the world could develop consciousness.","The simplest example was Ancestral King Pan Shi. This ruler of heaven and earth was only a stubborn rock at the very beginning, yet unexpectedly developed consciousness, advancing step by step to become the strongest, suppressing an era.","And in the case of the Natural-born Stone Spirit, it was already standing at the pinnacle of the world from the very beginning. It was an ultimate material comparable to Origin Gold, so how awesome was it?","Once this kind of treasure developed consciousness, its starting point would be Saint Tier.","In history, there had indeed been examples of Natural-born Stone Spirit being intelligent and traveling the world. They were countless times more powerful than ordinary Saints, and could be called Pseudo-Emperors!","In an era when there was no Emperor in the world, if the Natural-born Stone Spirit was to commit evil, the world would be in chaos, and if they were to commit good, the world would be peaceful. Of course, if there was a Great Emperor in the world, then the Natural-born Stone Spirit could only be said to be born at the wrong time. No matter how awesome the Pseudo-Emperor was, it could not possibly match the Great Emperor.","However, though the Natural-born Stone Spirit was so awesome, there had never been any precedent of becoming Emperor.","—The most ordinary people in the world could attain Dao, and even a rock could attain Dao, but the Natural-born Stone Spirit, who had stood at the pinnacle of the world from the very beginning, could not. One could not help but sigh at the wonders of creation of the heavens.","Perhaps, without experiencing the process of advancing from ordinary to the pinnacle, one would not be able to break through to that highest position.","He ignored this for the moment. The problem was, if this Natural-born Stone Spirit really developed consciousness, then it would be a Pseudo-Emperor!","How awesome was a Pseudo-Emperor?","Just think of Buddha Doga. He had practically killed all the Saints in the world.","Ling Han instantly had the thought of leaving. It was not appropriate to stay here for too long. Who knew if that Natural-born Stone Spirit had just developed consciousness, and was still here.","Hold on.","He looked at the outer shell of the Natural-born Stone Spirit that had been shed. Although it no longer had the Stone Spirit, this outer shell should still be quite extraordinary.","‘I’ll take it!’","Ling Han walked forwards, planning to collect this. Even if it was inferior to the ultimate ingredients, it was still indescribably precious.","Since he had entered into a mountain of treasure, how could he return empty-handed?","“Sigh!” A sigh suddenly rang out, and reverberated lightly by Ling Han’s ear.","This voice was very soft, but Ling Han’s hair stood on end.","F***, whatever he feared would come true!","He slowly turned around, and saw that an old man had appeared behind him at some point in time. He was a little too ordinary, and belonged to the category that could be found in large numbers on the streets, but how could such an old grandpa possibly appear here?","“Senior, sorry for disturbing you!” Ling Han said solemnly. At the same time, he was prepared to use the ley lines to escape at any time.","“Young man, don’t be nervous. This old man won’t eat you.” The old man coughed, and even his body was trembling. He was like a dying candle in the wind, and it was possible that his flame of life would be extinguished at any moment.","Ling Han bared his teeth in a grin, but his heart was beating like a drum. As if he would believe him.","He wasn’t sure where this old man came from. Could it be that he had come for the Natural-born Stone Spirit?","“How should I address Senior?” he asked.","The old man couldn’t help but laugh, “You’re trying to dig out my bottom line? Heh, whatever, my surname is Ge, and my given name is Qianqiu.”","“Good name, your merit will last to benefit generations, senior is generous.” Ling Han immediately bootlicked1.","Ge Qianqiu laughed loudly, but as if his injuries were affected or something, he coughed again, “Young man, you really have a sweet tongue. All right, come and tell me, what time is it now?”","Yi, it can’t be that you have been staying here all this while, so you don’t know what year this is, right?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, and he said, “Senior, there is no uniform chronological method in the universe, so I don’t know how to describe it either.”","“Hehe, that’s right.” Ge Qianqiu slapped his forehead, and said with a smile, “Look at this old man, I’ve really become senile. Then, what’s the name of the latest Ancestral King?”","“I don’t know.” Ling Han shook his head, and seeing the puzzled look on Ge Qianqiu’s face, he hurriedly said, “Ten million years ago, it is suspected that an Ancestral King ascended Dao, but a great turmoil happened, and history was erased. Thus, even the origins of that Ancestral King are unknown to anyone.”","Ge Qianqiu couldn’t help but show a hint of anger in his expression, and even humphed heavily, “Those old b@stards, as expected, are still not willing to behave themselves!”","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. It seemed like this Uncle Ge knew the inside story!","He was extremely curious, and couldn’t help but ask, “Senior, do you know the reason for this unrest?”","“Brat, have you always been so curious?” Ge Qianqiu asked with a smile.","“I saw Senior’s friendliness, so I mustered up the courage to ask a few more questions,” Ling Han said. When he wanted to anger someone, he could drive them crazy, but when he was sweet-talking, he could also make people happy.","Ge Qianqiu laughed, “You are too weak now, and there are some things that are not suitable for you to know. It would only be detrimental to you.”","To be able to say such words, it meant that the old man should be a reasonable person.","Ling Han’s heart calmed slightly, and he mustered up the courage to ask, “Why is Senior here?”","“You actually want to ask, where did this Natural-born Stone Spirit go?” Ge Qianqiu countered.","Er... the older one was, the wiser they were.","Ling Han smiled, “As for that, I am indeed a little curious.”","Ge Qianqiu shook his head, “When this old man came here, the Natural-born Stone Spirit was already gone. I don’t know if it was because it had gained consciousness, or if it had been refined into a doppelganger by another.”","Ling Han was surprised. This old man should have been here for a very, very long time. Then, the Natural-born Stone Spirit should have disappeared a very, very long time ago. It was very likely tens of millions of years ago.","However, could the old man live for so long?","As if sensing Ling Han’s confusion, Ge Qianqiu said with a smile, “There is a mysterious thing called the Primordial Source Clay. If one is sealed within, the passing of life would be halted. Thus, after a long slumber, the world would have changed.”","Ling Han immediately thought of the little azure dragon. He was the youngest son of the True Dragon, and if he really counted, how old would he be? He should have long since turned into dust, but now, he was pretending to be young everywhere, living too vividly.","Obviously, the little azure dragon must have been sealed in the Primordial Source Clay all this while.","However, Ling Han didn’t understand. Wasn’t it good to live in the present? With his friends and family, wouldn’t it be too lonely to sleep for a long time and have no family or friends in the world after ten million years?","What reason was there for him to have to surpass such a long period of time?","Ge Qianqiu asked Ling Han a great many questions, such as whether the True Dragon Abyss had been opened, how the present world was, and whether there were Yin souls invading. His expression was always calm, but when he spoke of the countless corpses of Saints buried in that sea of blood, the old man looked furious, which was very frightening.","“Alright, you can leave now. I still have to sleep for a few more years.” The old man began to chase him off.","Just a few years?","Ling Han thought internally. The few years he was talking about was really a few years, but if this Uncle Ge was talking about a few years, could it be tens of thousands of years?","Forget it, let’s just leave first.","Since such an elite had already issued the command to leave, how could he possibly refuse? Though the old man looked quite good-tempered, what elite would not have words that had enormous weight, and allow others to bargain with them?","Ling Han was very tactful. After exiting the cave, he used the Star Steps and quickly left.","“So only ten million years have passed,” Ge Qianqiu murmured. “Xuan Taiyu, I lost to you ten million years ago. Logically, I should have died and disappeared with the wind, but the darkness desires to devour the heavens. This old man can only use this damaged body to battle with the heavens and with others. If I can attain Dao, I will avenge you, and our battles for so many years would not be in vain!”"]},{"number":4248,"title":"Chapter 4248: The Third Form of True Self Tier!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4248: The Third Form of True Self Tier!","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han left, but on his way, he unexpectedly sensed the presence of the Evolution Fruit. He immediately changed course and stored the Evolution Fruit into his pocket.","He couldn’t help but grin. Although he didn’t obtain the Natural-born Stone Spirit, he obtained an Evolution Fruit, so he didn’t come for nothing.","Of course, compared to the Natural-born Stone Spirit, the Evolution Fruit could only be considered a minuscule gain. However, who asked the Natural-born Stone Spirit to be long gone?","Ling Han began to gnaw on the Evolution Fruit. With this one, he would be able to reach the end of the second form.","Come on then!","Very soon, the medicinal effects rolled out, helping to push the ninth clay fetus towards Stone Fetus.","Merely half a day later, he had succeeded.","Theoretically speaking, Ling Han was already qualified to break through to the third form. However, the majority of his Stone Fetusrd was stimulated by the medicinal effects, so it was inevitable that he would have a chronic illness of unstable foundations, which prevented him from immediately breaking through.","Ling Han settled down for a few days, then changed to another location. He then continued to settle down his cultivation level, so that his condition could reach its optimal state. At the same time, he also allowed Baili Yun to continue eating his dust behind him.","A month later, Ling Han finally felt that he had adjusted his condition to perfection.","That was enough.","He did not immediately attempt to break through to the Third Form, but rather waited, and waited for Baili Yun to catch up to him. Only then did he run 150,000 km in a single go.","—Previously, he had been at the very edge of the Island of the Sky, and now, he had run to the farthest end. Hehe, in this way, Baili Yun would need to spend a great many days to be able to find him.","Ling Han immediately began to attempt the third form. When Baili Yun caught up to him, he would give him a surprise.","The third form of the True Self Tier, Silver Fetus!","Ling Han continued to gain enlightenment. The True Self of Destruction was beginning to advance from the Stone Fetus to the Silver Fetus. The power of heaven and earth surged over, and the Regulations also converged, wrapping around him. His whole person turned into a jade statue.","He sat as still as a rock, but his whole person was undergoing an earthshaking change.","Not only was the Stone Fetus in his mind advancing towards the Silver Fetus, but his physical body was also greedily absorbing the power of heaven and earth, advancing in large strides in Body Art.","He had great ambitions. Since he cultivated both body and mystical power, he had to maintain the momentum of advancing both together. He definitely could not allow either of them to fall behind.","Three days later, there was a change in the Stone Fetus. There was an additional layer of metallic light.","A smile spread across Ling Han’s face. He had finally taken the first step.","This step was very small, but it was incredibly important. It meant that he could take large strides forwards from now on.","Boom, the speed at which the energy of heaven and earth surged in suddenly soared, and the Regulations intertwined to become brilliant.","The Stone Fetus’s rate of evolution also sped up. The True Self of Destruction emitted a vast aura, having the air of great dao.","Another seven days later, Ling Han leaped up. Peng, the energy wrapped around him, and shards of Regulations danced wildly.","In his mind, the True Self of Destruction had already turned into a silver fetus that was flickering with silver light.","The third form of the True Self Tier!","Boom!","Ling Han brandished his fists, and his power surged. It was indescribably powerful.","“Mystical power and Body Art have both reached 25 Heavens. With the two exploding at the same time, 31 Heavens!”","“If I go all out, my maximum battle prowess can reach 42 Heavens, and I myself can disperse attacks within six Heavens. Thus, even if I am fighting battle prowess of 48 Heavens, I can still be undefeated.”","“Unfortunately, the barrage of murderous aura and suppression of battle prowess won’t work on Imperial Sons, and with my current strength, I can already crush Dao Child and the like. These two Mystical Powers would seem useless.”","“However, when I step into the Spirit Transformation Tier these two Mystical Powers can still unleash their extraordinary might.”","“Baili Yun, are you ready?”","Ling Han closed his eyes, and activated his divine sense. He communicated with the ley lines, and began to capture Baili Yun’s whereabouts.","However, the other party was still far away from him, and for the moment, he had not discovered him.","Ling Han casually waved his hand. Boom! An Earth Dragon emerged from the ground, its might astonishing.","“The stronger my own strength is, the stronger the might of the Earth Dragon I summoned would be. This should have reached the battle prowess of forty Heavens.”","“Unfortunately, it has lost its agility. Otherwise, if it summoned a few more, even the Silver Generation would be killed!”","Ling Han strode forwards. He was going to find Baili Yun.","It was time for an accounting.","He used the Star Steps to travel in the opposite direction. With every section of the journey, he would use the ley lines as his eyes and ears, searching for Baili Yun’s whereabouts. However, this guy was like a lingering ghost that kept following him, but now, it was as if he had disappeared from the face of the earth.","Ling Han almost suspected that the other party knew that he had broken through, and had thus given up on pursuing him.","“Yi?”","A smile appeared on his face, “Truly interesting. The flowers you deliberately plant may not bloom, but the willow branches you casually insert into the ground can take root and grow into a shady tree.1”","Ling Han used the Star Steps, and with a teleportation, he had already appeared more than 1000km away.","Here, there was a group of people hurrying on their journey, and when they suddenly saw another person suddenly appear ahead of them, they were naturally given a fright.","What the heck?","“Humph, there are so many Imperial Clans working together, and you still dare to block the way and rob us. How outrageously bold!” Guan Yuanming said coldly.","This team really came from an astonishing background. They were all made up of Imperial Clan elites, and there was no shortage of Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters among them, who could scare others to the point of pissing themselves.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and beckoned Guan Yuanming over. “Little Guan, come.”","All the Imperial Clan members were confused. Who the hell are you? Why are you acting so familiar with him? Furthermore, Guan Yuanming was an Imperial Son, and you actually call him Little Guan. Wasn’t that clearly showing that your status was superior to him?","“Hehe.” A considerable number of people laughed, waiting to watch the excitement.","The Imperial Clan was high and noble, and no one dared to trifle with them, and the Imperial Son was even more untouchable.","Guan Yuanming immediately looked furious, and leaped out, “You are seeking death!”","Now, even if the other knelt in front of him, he would beat him to death.","Boom! The Imperial Son unleashed his might, and it was incredibly terrifying.","Ling Han stood quietly and motionlessly, right until Guan Yuanming charged right in front of him. Only then did he move, and shot out a punch at the latter’s head.","“You overestimate yourself!” Everyone shook their heads. Making an enemy of the Imperial Son was the stupidest action in the world in the first place, and to actually face him head-on, that was even more foolish.","—Even if Guan Yuanming had just advanced into the third form of the True Self Tier, his battle prowess was already capable of matching a Dao Child in the fourth form. Aside from the Silver Generation, who here could suppress him?","Peng!","As he threw a punch, Guan Yuanming’s attack was instantly shattered. Regulations and whatnot were completely insufficient; it was like an egg hitting a rock.","F***!","Seeing this scene, everyone stared blankly, feeling like they had seen a ghost.","However, this was far from over.","Ling Han’s fist couldn’t be blocked at all, and continued to attack Guan Yuanming. Destructive Energy blazed fiercely.","Guan Yuanming couldn’t help but look terrified. He had never imagined that Ling Han’s attack would be so terrifying. It was practically destroying everything in its path. He had the Substitution Seal, so he naturally couldn’t be killed. However, he had been defeated in public, and it was an insta-kill at that. How could he endure this?","He already knew who this opponent was. Aside from a freak like Ling Han, who else could be so powerful?","Peng, the punch landed, and Guan Yuanming’s head immediately exploded.","There was no revival!"]},{"number":4249,"title":"Chapter 4249: Hundred Flowers Valley","paragraphs":["Chapter 4249: Hundred Flowers Valley","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yi?","Why had the battle ended? Why had Guan Yuanming’s head exploded?","This wasn’t right!","Where was the Substitution Seal? Did you f****** not bring the Substitution Seal with you when you f****** went out?","Was the Xuanfeng Imperial Clan that poor?","Everyone was dumbfounded. Why had Guan Yuanming died just like that? This was completely illogical.","However, the wind rustled, and Guan Yuanming simply lay there, blood gushing from his shattered head. He did not look at all like he would be standing up.","Hiss!","Everyone inhaled sharply, feeling their scalps go numb.","Something big had happened. An Imperial Son had actually been killed!","“Ling, Ling Han!” someone said in a trembling voice. This battle method was simple and violent, which was Ling Han’s usual style, and everyone already knew that Ling Han possessed the ability to disguise himself. Thus, even if the spiritual waves were different, it did not stop everyone from guessing.","Ling Han smiled faintly. With a thought, he had already reverted to his original appearance.","It was indeed him!","Everyone thought this in their hearts, and a stormy wave rose up.","If they were to believe that Guan Yuanming didn’t have a Substitution Seal, or that his Substitution Seal had lost its effect, that would be too ridiculous. As a noble and dignified Imperial Clan, how could it be that the Saints of the Imperial Clan would be stingy in creating Substitution Seals for the Imperial Son?","The Imperial Son. That was the image of an Imperial Clan, and needed to be fully protected.","Thus, there could only be one reason.","Ling Han possessed the ability to render the Substitution Seal ineffective.","That’s right. This was still unbelievable, but because Ling Han had already created enough miracles, relatively speaking, everyone was willing to believe the latter.","But when they thought about how Ling Han possessed the ability to kill people while ignoring the Substitution Seal, every Imperial Son felt apprehensive.","Initially, they were fearless. Even if they encountered a super great enemy, they still had the Substitution Seal that could save their lives, but now?","They only had one life.","“Brother-in-law!” The silver-haired little lolita ran out, then leaped, falling into Ling Han’s arms.","Ling Han had no choice, and could only stretch out his arms to embrace the little loli.","“Brother-in-law, why do you have such a dark expression? Do you hate me?” The little loli pouted. “Will you happier if you’re hugging my sister?”","This damn child!","Chi Menghan couldn’t help but blush. Even the white veil covering her face couldn’t conceal her breathtaking charm.","“Brother-in-law, you also know about the Hundred Flowers Valley?” the little loli asked.","What Hundred Flowers Valley?","Ling Han couldn’t help but turn to look at Chi Menghan. This little loli was quite mischievous, always saying embarrassing things. He was more willing to converse with Chi Menghan.","“There’s news that there’s a large number of Evolution Fruits in the Hundred Flowers Valley!” Chi Menghan said.","Large amount!","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel tempted. The Island of the Sky had already been open for more than a year, so it could be said that the majority of the Evolution Fruits had already been harvested. It was extremely difficult to obtain another one now.","However, there was actually a large number of Evolution Fruits in the Hundred Flowers Valley, so this would naturally attract a large number of people.","“Where did this news come from?” he asked.","With such a good thing, who would leak it out?","“I don’t know. We only decided to go and take a look after hearing the news,” Chi Menghan said. “At the beginning, we also suspected that this was a trap, but with how powerful we are, who here can do anything to us?”","True, those that entered into the Island of the Sky were all investigated, and it was impossible that anyone whose cultivation level exceeded their cultivation level would come. Thus, what did the Imperial Clan members have to fear?","In the past, the Imperial Clans had reached a mutual understanding, and handed the Island of the Sky over to the administration of the Dongfang Clan. There was naturally a reason for this, so how could they possibly lay a trap for themselves?","No wonder there was no sign of Baili Yun. He should have also gotten the news, and turned to the Hundred Flowers Valley.","—If he advanced into the fifth form, or even the sixth form in fact, wouldn’t it be even easier for him to suppress Ling Han?","Ling Han calculated in his mind. He had the Star Steps, so there was absolutely no need for him to worry about safety here.","‘Whatever, I’ll go take a look.’","“Then, let’s go together,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Sure,” the little loli clapped her hands.","The others gritted their teeth. This was a bringer of misfortune. Guan Yuanming’s corpse was still lying there, and he was using blood to remind everyone that this was an Imperial Son Killer, a real Imperial Son Killer.","However, did they dare to chase him away?","Since Ling Han dared to kill Guan Yuanming, it was equivalent to offending Xuanfeng Imperial Clan to the extreme. Then, would he still need to fear killing a few more Imperial Clan members?","On the way, the atmosphere of the group appeared extremely oppressive. Aside from the silver-haired little lolita, no one else was in the mood to talk.","“You are too rash.” Chi Menghan sent a message through divine sense, “Even if you want to kill Guan Yuanming, you can make your move without anyone witnessing. You are indeed wanted by the Imperial Clans, but it is only a warrant. None of the Imperial Clans have become serious.”","“But now that an Imperial Son is dead, the nature is completely different.”","“Even the Saints of the Imperial Clans would be alerted. Even if you hide at the corners of the world, the Saints would still be able to easily predict your whereabouts. There would be no need for them to move personally. As long as the Imperial Clans speak, there would be plenty of forces that would move for them.”","Ling Han smiled, and asked, “Are you worried about me?”","Chi Menghan was instantly rendered speechless. Just how carefree was this guy? Things had already come to this, and he was still in the mood to tease her?","“Unless you have the Imperial Weapon, which can hide you from destiny, or you continue to hide in a Mystery Realm, once you leave, you would not be able to escape the prediction of a Saint,” Chi Menghan warned seriously again.","Ling Han smiled. He really did have an Imperial Weapon on him... it was a bit lacking, and that was why Baili Yun had found him time and time again?","If he didn’t store the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in his mind and hid it on his body, would he be able to hide from destiny?","It should be possible. Though it was not an Imperial Weapon, it was Origin Gold, the ultimate material!","“Thank you.” He nodded at Chi Menghan.","Chi Menghan was a little unused to this. She was used to Ling Han’s cheeky grin, and now that he was suddenly serious, she actually felt a little awkward.","They headed towards the Hundred Flowers Valley. Ling Han did not make a move on the other Imperial Clans. What he hated the most were Guan Yuanming, Xu Jie, Shi Yuanzhen and Baili Che. Now, aside from Baili Che, who had already become a cripple, the other three had all been killed by him.","As they walked, Ling Han’s expression suddenly became a little strange.","That was because the location of this Hundred Flowers Valley was directly above that underground cave.","Wasn’t this too coincidental?","Ling Han remained calm and collected. He really wanted to see what was going on here. Furthermore, Baili Yun was definitely in the valley. If he missed this chance, it would be difficult to kill this person again.","Another day later, they arrived at the Hundred Flowers Valley.","Though this was called the Hundred Flowers Valley, it completely did not live up to its name. The valley was completely barren, without even a single tree, so how could there be Hundred Flowers?","They weren’t the first batch of people to enter the valley. More people had already arrived, and they were searching everywhere.","“There is indeed the fragrance of the Evolution Fruit. However, it seems to have been blocked by some kind of technique, and can’t be seen,” Chi Menghan said. “Chi Dao arrived a few days before us. He said that using his divine sense as a guide, he has indeed found an Evolution Fruit.”","“It’s said that there’s a cave in this valley, and there’s a large number of Evolution Fruits growing in this cave.”","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4250,"title":"Chapter 4250: Switch in the balance of weak and strong","paragraphs":["Chapter 4250: Switch in the balance of weak and strong","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han shook his head, and said with a smile, “I’m really becoming more and more curious about the person who provided this information.”","“This person is far too omnipotent,” Chi Menghan said.","Who knew that this kind of news would still spread out? Others would definitely conceal it at all costs, and take them completely by thenselves.","Even if they didn’t need it, the Evolution Fruit was still extremely valuable. It could be sold for a huge sum of money, and even the Imperial Clans would be willing to generously pay for it.","But now, this kind of news was flying all over the place, and everyone knew about it. It was completely illogical.","“If there’s no conspiracy in this place, then even a ghost wouldn’t believe it,” Ling Han said.","“But there are so many Imperial Clan elites here, so who would dare to mess around?” Chi Menghan immediately analyzed.","This was what confused them the most. If this was really a conspiracy, then who would dare to trick and kill so many Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters?","If a large group of Saints carrying Imperial Weapons appeared, even if their opponent was an Imperial Clan, they would still be able to flatten it.","There was no Emperor in this world, so who would dare to be so outrageously bold?","Thus, even though many smart people knew that something was off, they still came, because they really could not think of any force in this world that would dare target the Imperial Clans.","“Could it be the Battle God Palace?” Ling Han thought, but this thought passed in the blink of an eye. The Battle God Palace being unafraid of the Imperial Clans was only empty words. It was only that the Imperial Clans were unwilling to spend a lot of effort to deal with them.","Flipping through history, in truth, the number of times that the Battle God Palace had targeted the Imperial Clans could be counted on one’s fingers. It was merely for the sake of establishing their might. Furthermore, there had never been any attempted assassination of Imperial Son or Imperial Daughter. The Battle God Palace still had some propriety.","Moreover, how did the Battle God Palace know that there was a Hundred Flowers Valley here? Moreover, even if a large number of True Self Tier assassins from the Battle God Palace entered, would they be a match for the Imperial Sons?","There was the Silver Generation here, and even Ling Han had to admit that they were powerful.","Thus, the Battle God Palace most likely had nothing to do with this matter.","“We can only wait and see. If this is really a conspiracy, then it should be about time for the truth to come out,” Ling Han murmured.","He did not waste any time, but rather began to search for Baili Yun.","The Hundred Flowers Valley was very big, but no matter how big it was, there was a limit. As long as one was here, they would definitely be found in two to three days, at most.","As expected, on the second day, Ling Han found this Imperial Son of the Silver Generation.","When he saw Ling Han, Baili Yun was also startled.","However, he immediately smirked coldly. In his opinion, Ling Han should have also rushed over after receiving news of the Hundred Flowers Valley, and then coincidentally met him.","“Haha, there’s a path to heaven, yet you refuse to take it. There’s no door to hell, yet you barge in,” Baili Yun said with a smile. He was in a good mood now, because he had “harvested” three Evolution Fruits in this space. Now, he had encountered Ling Han, who had taken the initiative to deliver treasures to him.","The reason why there were quotation marks was because he had only managed to obtain one, and the other two had been obtained through threats and bribery. With his identity as a member of the Silver Generation, who would dare not give him face?","Unfortunately, three Evolution Fruits weren’t enough to support him to reach the fifth form. Thus, he didn’t ingest them immediately. Instead, he had to wait to obtain two more. If there were five, he was confident that he could reach the fifth form in one go.","Of course, even if he didn’t have the Evolution Fruit, with his Imperial Son aptitude, it wouldn’t be too difficult for him to reach the fifth form. However, that would need a large amount of time to accumulate energy, so it was naturally not as profitable as using the Evolution Fruit.","As he spoke, he had already used Regulations to seal off the surroundings, ensuring that Ling Han would not be able to stimulate even the ley lines.","He was strong enough, so he could naturally do it. Previously, it was just that Ling Han had not given him enough time.","However, what he didn’t know was that the current Ling Han wasn’t the Ling Han from before.","Ling Han looked at him silently. That expression... was as if he was looking at an idiot.","“Humph, I really don’t know where you got the courage to actually take the initiative to die!” Baili Yun said calmly. He had already completed his arrangements, and now he was only one step away from harvesting his prize.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Please continue. I’ll quietly watch your performance.”","“Die!”","As the Imperial Son, Baili Yun was naturally a resolute and decisive person. Any grand words could be left until after he had won. Now, he was going to kill Ling Han. If Ling Han managed to escape again, then whatever he said now would become a joke.","He merely raised his hand, and the Regulations transformed into a sword that slashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han stretched out a hand and pressed down. Weng, the momentum of this sword immediately stopped. Then, Ling Han’s right hand gripped empty air. Peng, the sword of Regulations immediately shattered.","“En?” Baili Yun showed a hint of surprise. He cast another look at Ling Han, and couldn’t help but reveal a shocked expression, “You have broken through!”","This guy had actually advanced into the third form of the True Self Tier!","How was this possible?","He was sure that Ling Han had only created two Stone Fetuses before, at most, and with Ling Han’s freakishness, he was sure that there were at least eight True Selves. It had only been a year, and this guy had actually advanced into the Third Form?","How many Evolution Fruits have you f****** obtained!","“Do you really think I’m stupid?” Ling Han said with a smile. He leaped out, throwing out both fists. Weng, weng, weng! Instantly, multiple heavenly sabers slashed out, flickering with the terrifying light of Regulations, blasting towards Baili Yun.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han took the initiative to attack. His battle prowess was terrifying.","Baili Yun exchanged a few blows, and discovered that Ling Han’s strength was completely not inferior to his. He couldn’t help but feel depressed. If he had known earlier, he would have used his ultimate move back then, not giving Ling Han any time to grow.","But now?","The other’s battle prowess was actually not inferior to his.","No!","Baili Yun shockingly discovered that Ling Han’s battle prowess was even superior to his. Though there was only a gap of one Heaven at most, in a clash of their level, to say nothing of the gap in battle prowess of one Heaven, even a sliver of difference was enough to influence the outcome of the battle.","He paled in shock, because he knew that Ling Han possessed the means to bypass the Substitution Seal and kill someone. He really only had one life.","“What a miscalculation. I allowed you to grow to this extent, but I will definitely not make another mistake!” Baili Yun humphed. Boom, he suddenly ignited the Imperial Bloodline.","How strong would the Silver Generation’s Imperial Blood be if it was ignited?","Boom!","Ling Han exchanged a blow with him, and his figure was instantly sent flying. However, he was completely unharmed.","Baili Yun’s battle prowess was only 45 Heavens, so his improvement was limited.","Why?","It was very understandable. That was because Baili Yun was actually not too far off from the battle prowess of the Great Emperor when he was young. Thus, burning the Imperial Blood would only allow him to be close to the standard of the young Great Emperor, and could not possibly surpass him.","Thus, his maximum battle prowess was 45 Heavens.","From this aspect, it would be useless even if the Golden Generation burned the Imperial Blood, because their aptitude was already infinitesimally close to the Great Emperors in their youth.","Ling Han’s battle prowess had reached 42 Heavens, and he could also disperse attacks within six Heavens. Thus, Baili Yun could only blast him backwards, but could not possibly wound him at all.","“Once the Imperial Bloodline is done burning, it will be the time of your death!” Ling Han said calmly.","“Aren’t you a little too proud? How many Silver Generation elites are there here? I only need to find one of them to join forces, and killing you would be a piece of cake.” Baili Yun was unafraid.","Ling Han smiled, “Don’t forget. You sealed off this place yourself. Under my attacks, would you have the chance to disperse the seal of Regulations?”"]},{"number":4251,"title":"Chapter 4251: Helper","paragraphs":["Chapter 4251: Helper","Editor: Henyee Translations","Baili Yun’s expression changed drastically.","F***, he had dug a hole and buried himself in it.","The reason why he had sealed off this place with Regulations was naturally to prevent Ling Han from fleeing with the Star Steps. Thus, he had deliberately strengthened it layer after layer, but now? The one who wanted to flee was him.","The Regulations did not distinguish between people, and treated them all the same.","Thus, if he wanted to leave this area, he had to break through the Regulations seal first.","Wasn’t this just digging one’s own grave?","He gave a loud shout, and charged towards Ling Han again. The Imperial Technique channelled, and Regulations transformed into multiple divine lotuses that descended towards Ling Han. Then, they suddenly exploded. Golden energy surged, possessing boundless destructive power.","However, this was completely useless against Ling Han.","He could disperse attacks within six Heavens. Unless Baili Yun’s battle prowess surpassed Ling Han’s by seven Heavens, Baili Yun wouldn’t be able to wound him at all as long as he didn’t stand there and take a beating without fighting back.","After a few moves, Baili Yun also understood this deeply. Thus, after he sent Ling Han flying with a single strike, he immediately began to bombard the Regulations barricade that he had set up.","The Imperial Blood would only be burning for a limited amount of time. Once it was completely burnt, and he was still trapped here, the odds would really be against him.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He tried his best, but he had put a lot of effort into setting up this Regulationsseal, so how could it be broken through in a few moves? Moreover, Ling Han had only been sent backwards, and had not been injured. He immediately made a comeback.","Baili Yun felt a headache coming on. Ling Han’s attacks couldn’t be underestimated at all. More importantly, this guy seemed to be forged from metal, and his attacks were completely ineffective against him. What kind of despair was this?","However, under the continuous barrage of attacks, the Regulations seal became weaker and weaker. Finally, it was broken.","Baili Yun rushed out. He really did not have much Imperial Blood left. He had to find help as soon as possible.","Ling Han set off in pursuit.","This was really a turn of events. Baili Yun thought back to how he had hunted Ling Han for so far, but now, he had become a stray dog that was sent fleeing in defeat. He couldn’t help but feel bitter.","He had to admit that Ling Han’s natural talent in cultivation was really catching up to the Golden Generation. In fact, he could be considered one of the strongest even among the Golden Generation.","Xiu, his figure traversed, his speed incredibly fast.","Movement techniques were now Ling Han’s weakness. He had only grasped a Saint-level movement technique, so he was naturally no match for Baili Yun. However, don’t forget that he was also a Formation Master, and a grandmaster at that!","Boom, an Earth Dragon soared up, and intercepted Baili Yun.","“Damn it!” Baili Yun cursed softly, yet he had no choice but to move, launching an attack at the Earth Dragon.","Thankfully, his present battle prowess had reached 45 Heavens. With a single strike, the Earth Dragon crumbled, and was only able to slow him down for a while, and in such a short amount of time, with the difference in speed between him and Ling Han, it was impossible for the latter to catch up.","But because of this, he was also unable to completely throw Ling Han off his tail. The two of them continued to maintain a similar distance, one in front and one behind.","“Brother Baili?”","Xiu, Baili Yun was flying, when a voice suddenly rang out in his mind. He immediately looked pleasantly surprised. This was the Imperial Son of the Shi Clan.","Of course, it was not Shi Yuanzhen, but rather Shi Hao, who was also a member of the Silver Generation.","“Brother Shi, help me!” He hurriedly turned around.","“Haha, could it be that it’s a member of the Golden Generation that weakened their own cultivation level and chased Brother Baili to such a sorry state?” Shi Hao laughed loudly.","Of course, this was a joke. Although there was competition among the Imperial Clans, no one would force the other to death. After all, everyone had Saints in their ranks and an Imperial Weapon. Once they went all out in battle, both sides would only suffer heavy losses.","Baili Yun felt slightly embarrassed, because not only was an Imperial Son not the one who had chased him into a sorry state, even his cultivation level was lower than his.","How could he bring himself to say this?","But it was only an instant, and Ling Han’s figure had already appeared.","Shi Hao’s eyes focused, “Ling Han!”","He had naturally guessed that Ling Han was hunting Baili Yun down, but it was precisely because of this that he couldn’t understand.","How was this possible?","Though Ling Han was extraordinary, and the height of his aptitude could even be considered on par with the Golden Generation, his overall cultivation level was too low, after all.","—In a battle of equal cultivation levels, it was possible that the Silver Generation was indeed no match for him, but with how strong an Imperial Son was, as long as he had the advantage of a minor level of cultivation level, it was guaranteed that he would be able to crush his opponent. This was the experience gained after comparison with the Golden Generation.","“Brother Shi, Shi Yuanzhen of your clan has already been killed by this brat,” Baili Yun said calmly. With two Silver Generation elites joining forces, Ling Han naturally had nothing to fear.","Hearing these words, Shi Hao’s expression immediately darkened.","Although they were all members of the same clan, they were all Imperial Sons, so there was naturally a problem of the distribution of cultivation resources. The relationship between Shi Hao and Shi Yuanzhen definitely could not be considered close.","However, now that Shi Yuanzhen had been killed by an outsider, that would be a humiliation to the entire Shi Clan.","If he didn’t kill Ling Han, he would also be embarrassed, and would be mocked outside.","“You killed Shi Yuanzhen?” he asked balefully.","“That’s right.” Ling Han didn’t plan on hiding it. He wanted to let the Imperial Clans know that it wouldn’t be so easy to bully him!","He dared to kill an Imperial Son now, and in future, he would dare to kill Venerate Tiers and Saints of the Imperial Clans!","“All right!” Shi Hao did not speak any more nonsense. Instead, he looked towards Baili Yun, “Let’s destroy this brat together.”","Baili Yun nodded, his killing intent blazing.","Although Shi Hao had never fought with Ling Han before, he was extremely familiar with Baili Yun’s strength. He knew that Ling Han’s strength was definitely terrifying, since he could make him flee in panic.","“This boy’s battle prowess is only at 42 Heavens, but his physique is very amazing. Even if I combust Imperial Blood, I would not be able to break through his defenses,” Baili Yun said. Since they were in the same trench, Baili Yun was naturally willing to share information with Shi Hao.","Shi Hao couldn’t help but raise a brow, “Do Body Arts really have such a great advantage?”","He thought that this was the defense brought about by Ling Han’s Body Arts.","“Don’t be careless,” Baili Yun reminded.","The two of them stood on either side of each other, both staring at Ling Han.","Two Imperial Sons, and they were Silver Generation elites at that.","Ling Han revealed a smile. If he was in the fourth form, so what if there were two Silver Generation elites? They would still be beaten up by him, but now, it was a little problematic.","Xiu, he charged out, and took the initiative to attack.","“How arrogant!” Shi Hao smirked coldly. Faced with an Imperial Son, and there were two of them at that, he actually dared to take the initiative to make a move. This was really too arrogant.","He and Baili Yun attacked at the same time, launching a counterattack at Ling Han.","With a thought from Ling Han, hong, hong, hong, three Earth Dragons shot out at the same time, greeting Shi Hao, while he focused on Baili Yun.","Three Earth Dragons were his limit in this place. The suppression of the power of Regulation was too serious.","It should be known that these three Earth Dragons all had battle prowess of 40 Heavens, and in Shi Hao’s case, without combusting his Imperial Blood, he would only have battle prowess of 41 Heavens. Being ganged up on by three Earth Dragons, he instantly appeared to be experiencing great strain.","In this way, it was equivalent to Shi Hao being excluded from the battle.","Ling Han and Baili Yun were once again engaged in a one-on-one battle, and what about Baili Yun? The Imperial Blood had already been completely burnt, and his battle prowess had fallen back to 41 Heavens, which was slightly inferior to Ling Han."]},{"number":4252,"title":"Chapter 4252: The Silver Generation elites joined forces","paragraphs":["Chapter 4252: The Silver Generation elites joined forces","Editor: Henyee Translations","Though there was only a gap of battle prowess of one Heaven, but as time passed, Baili Yun would still be in trouble!","“Brother Shi, come and help me!” Baili Yun shouted.","Shi Hao was also extremely annoyed. His opponents kept being the three Earth Dragons. Furthermore, every time he killed one, a new one would be produced, and he would not be able to kill them all.","Moreover, his battle prowess was only 41 Heavens. Against three Earth Dragons with battle prowess of 40 Heavens, it couldn’t be said that he was struggling, but he wouldn’t be able to win easily either.","Seeing that Baili Yun was already in extreme danger, he finally roared loudly and exploded.","Burning Imperial Blood!","Boom, his whole aura instantly changed. With the increase in power of four Heavens, peng, peng, peng, in just three strikes, the three Earth Dragons were all shattered. He charged towards Ling Han.","This was overwhelming battle prowess, and Shi Hao was unstoppable as he rushed to Ling Han’s side, sending him flying with a single strike.","However, without a crushing advantage of battle of six Heavens over Ling Han, how could he be wounded?","Ling Han released a battle cry, and immediately charged back.","“F***, is this brat a monster?” Shi Hao was startled, his face filled with disbelief.","Previously, Baili Yun had indeed said that Ling Han’s defenses were incredibly strong, but ultimately, he had not witnessed it with his own eyes. Only now did he finally believe it, which made his scalp go slightly numb.","After combusting his Imperial Bloodline, his battle prowess had already been pushed to its limits, but with this strike, he actually couldn’t even injure a single hair on Ling Han’s head. What kind of despair was this?","“Retreat! Retreat! Retreat!” Baili Yun shouted loudly. At first, he had thought that by joining forces with Shi Hao, they would be able to firmly suppress Ling Han, but when they really came to blows, he realized that Ling Han’s freakishness had far exceeded his imagination.","He needed more Silver Generation elites — or a Silver Generation elite that had advanced into the fifth form.","This wasn’t difficult to find, because there were only a handful of Silver Generation elites that were still stuck at the fourth form. The majority were already at the fifth form or even the sixth form, and there were even more that had already advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","“Humph!” Ling Han switched tactics, using the Earth Dragons to restrain Baili Yun and prevent him from escaping. Meanwhile, he himself faced Shi Hao head-on. Even if the latter’s battle prowess overwhelmed him by three Heavens, so what? He couldn’t wound him at all.","He was determined to kill Baili Yun today.","Baili Yun didn’t have any Imperial Blood to burn. Moreover, he would definitely experience a period of weakness after reaching the pinnacle of his strength. His current battle prowess was actually only a little over 40 Heavens. It wouldn’t be a problem for him to deal with one Earth Dragon, but against three... it would be difficult!","Thankfully, the Earth Dragons lacked flexibility. Otherwise, if all three of them attacked at the same time, he would probably have already been killed.","However, going on like this was not a solution.","Though Shi Hao’s present battle prowess was awesome, the time that the Imperial Blood would be burning was limited. Once his battle prowess dropped, what would he do?","This thought streaked through Shi Hao and Baili Yun’s minds at the same time.","The two of them released a battle cry at the same time. Instantly, their voices rolled out like waves, spreading into the distance in waves.","They were asking for help, hoping to alert even more people. It would be best if the Silver Generation elites could lend a helping hand.","However, it was as if everyone had fled, and only the three of them were left here. No matter how Shi Hao and Baili Yun roared repeatedly, no one responded.","Time continued to pass, and Shi Hao’s Imperial Blood was about to burn completely.","What could they do?","“Let’s go!” Shi Hao made a prompt decision. They couldn’t continue fighting, but they had the Substitution Seal, so it wouldn’t matter even if they were “killed” once or even in fact a few times.","Baili Yun’s face was as white as a sheet. He naturally knew that Ling Han possessed the ability to bypass the Substitution Seal. As long as he was killed once, he would truly be done for. There would definitely be no second chance.","“All right!” A thought flashed through his mind, “Brother Shi, your Imperial Blood is not completely burnt yet. Help me bring up the rear.”","“No problem.” Shi Hao nodded. His present battle prowess was actually superior to Ling Han, and it was just that he had no way to penetrate Ling Han’s defenses.","Thus, he was still as proud as always, and did not panic in the slightest.","“Then please!” Baili Yun turned around and ran. He wouldn’t tell the truth. If someone had to die, then it would definitely be Shi Hao. Worse come to worst, he would just help get revenge in the future.","Ling Han wanted to give chase, but Shi Hao stood in front of him.","“Sigh!” Ling Han sighed, and said, “Do you want to die for him?”","“What a joke. How can you hurt me?” Shi Hao said proudly.","In just a few moments, even if this place was being suppressed by the Regulations of the highest level, which would affect the speed of their advance, Baili Yun was already far away.","“Brat, you dare to oppose the Imperial Clans, your only fate is death,” Shi Hao said balefully, taking the initiative to attack.","His current battle prowess far surpassed Ling Han’s. As long as the Imperial Blood was still burning, he would have a crushing advantage.","Ling Han casually parried, appearing extremely passive.","In Shi Hao’s eyes, this was too normal. Your abilities are inferior, so how could it be that you still want to turn the tables?","After battling for a while, Ling Han smiled and said, “I’m going to kill someone. I’m not going to play with you anymore.”","Xiu, he used the Star Steps, and instantly disappeared.","Yi, where was he?","Shi Hao faltered slightly, then realization dawned on him, “Star Steps!”","Then, his face paled, as he suddenly thought of a possibility.","“Oh no, we’ve fallen into a trap!”","Ling Han had grasped the Star Steps, and could travel 500km in an instant. This speed was actually far superior to them. Now, Baili Yun had fled, and was far enough away that even he didn’t know where he was. However, Ling Han was a Formation Master, and could sense him through the ley lines.","Thus, Ling Han definitely knew where Baili Yun had gone. With the Star Steps, he could also snipe him, but what about him? To say nothing of not being able to make it in time, he didn’t even know the direction — Baili Yun might not run in a straight line all the way.","No wonder this guy was so calm, and did not pursue Baili Yun at all. As it turned out, that brat had already laid out a plan to deal with this.","“What a treacherous guy!” He stomped his feet continuously. Now, Baili Yun could only depend on himself.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure flashed, and appeared more than 500km away.","If the Star Steps were used, the shortest distance would be in the range of a few hundred km. Thus, it was not a good choice in hand-to-hand combat. If Star Steps was used, he would instead lose the target of his pursuit.","But now that the distance had been drawn out, Star Steps would be able to show its best effects.","Ahead of them, Baili Yun hurriedly raced over, as if he was walking right into a trap.","F***!","When he discovered Ling Han, Baili Yun cursed internally. He had been stupid; he had actually not thought that Ling Han had also mastered the Star Steps.","If he had known earlier, he would not have split up with Shi Hao. If there were two of them, it would be safer than one of them.","Now, he would have to face him alone again.","Without Imperial Blood burning, and in a weakened state at that, how could he block him?","More importantly, he only had one life.","Baili Yun swallowed with much difficulty. For the first time in his life, he felt a sense of fear.","He... wouldn’t really die here today, right?","“Any last words?” Ling Han asked as he charged over.","Baili Yun roared in fury, “Ling Han, don’t be too arrogant! No matter what, you are only from humble origins, and only the third form of the True Self Tier. Any member of our Ziwei Imperial Clan can easily kill you!”"]},{"number":4253,"title":"Chapter 4253: Killing another Imperial Son","paragraphs":["Chapter 4253: Killing another Imperial Son","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was indeed the truth.","The greatest strength of the Imperial Clan was naturally their resources. This was both referring to cultivation resources, and also referring to the reserves of elites.","Ling Han’s shortcoming was his cultivation level. After all, he was only at the True Self Tier. No matter how freakish he was, there was no way he could match a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite. There were really too many people that could suppress him.","“Hehe, this has nothing to do with me killing you now,” Ling Han said calmly, but his fists had already delivered a terrifying attack. The heavenly saber slashed out, and the power of Regulations boiled, “When my cultivation level increases, I will naturally uproot the Ziwei Imperial Clan.”","Hiss!","Baili Yun inhaled sharply. This guy actually wanted to eradicate an Imperial Clan?","Where did you get such courage from?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han’s fists blasted out madly, his speed becoming faster and faster.","Baili Yun’s situation was becoming more and more difficult. The Imperial Technique couldn’t be channeled continuously, and this had very adverse effects on himself. However, if he didn’t use the Imperial Technique, his battle prowess would drop drastically by three Heavens, so how could he resist Ling Han?","Thus, he was presently drinking poison to quench his thirst. Even if it meant that his body would be damaged, he still had to channel the Imperial Technique. Otherwise, he would be immediately killed.","But in this way, he felt even worse. The skin on his body split open, and blood gushed out violently, making it seem as if his whole person had turned into a figure of blood.","This would lead to a huge problem, causing his meridians to be damaged. In fact, it would even affect his cultivation foundations.","However, Baili Yun had no choice but to do so. Once he stopped, his only fate would be death. Thus, even though he knew that this was severing his own foundations, Baili Yun still couldn’t stop at all.","However, even so, what was the use?","Ling Han’s battle prowess was superior to his, and his fists were already entwined with Destructive Energy, exuding a terrifying destructive power.","Baili Yun held on stubbornly. He did not beg for mercy. From the fact that Ling Han dared to kill an Imperial Son, it could be seen that he did not care at all about offending the Imperial Clans at all — he was practically a maniac. Thus, even if he begged for mercy, it would definitely be useless.","“Within three moves, I will send you on your way to the afterlife!” Ling Han announced coldly.","Meanwhile, Baili Yun roared in fury. As an Imperial Son, as a Silver Generation elite, he was actually going to be announced dead like an animal?","No, definitely not.","He attacked at all costs. Even if it meant death, he was determined to drag Ling Han down with him.","“In your dreams,” Ling Han said coldly.","If this was another opponent, perhaps it would be effective. After all, if an Imperial Son went crazy and put his life on the line, everyone would have to give him a wide berth, right?","However, Ling Han was capable of automatically dispersing all attacks within six Heavens. So what if he put his life on the line? When the attacks reached him, they were completely harmless.","“The first move.”","“The second move.”","“The third move.”","Peng! Ling Han threw a punch, and Baili Yun’s head instantly exploded.","Without another chance to come back to life, those whose vitality had been erased by Destructive Energy would only die. The Substitution Seal would not be able to take effect at all.","Peng! Baili Yun’s corpse collapsed to the ground.","Ling Han was neither happy nor sad. He searched Baili Yun’s corpse, and actually found three Evolution Fruits. Only then did he smile. Not bad, this made him somewhat satisfied.","He communicated with the ley lines, wanting to find Shi Hao again, but the latter had already exceeded the range of his senses.","Obviously, Shi Hao was not an idiot either. When he had dealt with Baili Yun, he would come back to make trouble for him.","Forget it, this was only a minor character.","Ling Han thought internally — if Shi Hao knew this, he would definitely be extremely depressed. He, a dignified Silver Generation elite, could actually only be considered a minor character?","He strolled around, because he also found it strange that everyone had suddenly disappeared.","After walking for quite a while, he finally encountered a cultivator that was hurriedly passing by, and stopped him to ask — of course, that person who had been stopped was very displeased, and even wanted to make a move, but very soon, he “convinced him into submission through virtue”.","As it turned out, that mysterious mountain cave had finally been found.","This meant that a large number of Evolution Fruits were beckoning them, so everyone was naturally excited. However, there were restrictions in the cave that needed to be broken through, so they couldn’t enter for the time being. However, more and more people received the news.","Ling Han allowed the person to leave, yet a question rose up in his heart.","Who would be so kind as to spread the news?","He couldn’t connect to the Galaxy Network in this Mystery Realm, so how had the news spread out?","Oh, who would run all over the valley after seeing the cave, and inform everyone they saw?","Ling Han was filled with disbelief.","Previously, when the news that there was a large number of Evolution Fruits in the Hundred Flowers Valley spread out, Ling Han already felt that something was off. However, he also thought that who would dare offend everyone in the world and lay out such a massive trap?","However, this kind of thing happened time and time again, making Ling Han feel that it was too strange.","“I have to quickly contact Old Black and Four-Legged Snake. There’s something off about this place,” Ling Han murmured to himself as he followed the person from before.","He believed that with the temperament of the little azure dragon and the large black dog, they would definitely have reached the Hundred Flowers Valley by now. Moreover, they would even be at the cave. However, they definitely wouldn’t expose their identities so easily. If there was a trap, they would definitely let others step on it first.","Ling Han moved quickly, using the Star Steps. Not long after, he arrived at the location of the cave.","True enough, there was a large number of people gathered here, a sea of people.","Aside from a very small number of people still trying their luck outside the valley, the majority of them should be here by now, so the scale was naturally astonishing.","“Old Black, Four-Legged Snake!” Ling Han didn’t bother to reveal his identity and called out loudly.","“Hmm?”","Multiple gazes shot over, and then a great many people immediately recognized him, looking stunned.","This was actually Ling Han!","Gods, this guy was wanted by nine great Imperial Clans, and he actually dared to come here? Hiss, there were clearly Venerate Tier elites standing guard outside, so how did he get in?","“Ling Han!” A middle-aged man ran towards him, and said, “I’m Old Black. I’ve disguised myself.”","“Oh, Old Black.” Ling Han nodded.","Shua, the middle-aged man approached, yet suddenly moved. A sharp sword stabbed over at an incredibly fast speed. The power of Regulations wrapped around him, and if one was struck by it, they would definitely die.","This caused everyone to be greatly shocked.","Wasn’t Ling Han familiar with this person? From the looks of it, they seemed to be good friends. Why had they suddenly turned against each other?","It was so close and so sudden, so how could he block it?","Oh no, Ling Han was about to be killed on the spot.","However, right at this moment, Ling Han’s figure suddenly turned, and he had already dodged this strike. Then, taking advantage of the momentum, he threw a punch at the middle-aged man.","Peng!","The man, on the other hand, was caught off guard. At first, he had thought that Ling Han would definitely die with this strike, but who knew that the latter seemed to have long since prepared himself. Not only did he dodge this strike, he even counterattacked.","He was instantly hit, and a punch landed on his chest. Under the barrage of violent power, he retreated explosively a few meters, blood spraying madly from his mouth.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “You must be very curious. You clearly wanted to catch me off guard, but why is the situation the other way around?”","The middle-aged man’s face was indeed filled with confusion. He was too confused.","“Because Old Black would definitely not call himself Old Black, nor would he call me Ling Han,” Ling Han said with a smile.","The middle-aged man’s expression was filled with defiance, but his body slowly weakened. His vitality had already been destroyed with a single punch from Ling Han. Now, he was only holding on with a single breath. He did not want to die in such a dubious manner.","Now that the riddle had been solved, he was naturally relieved.","F*ck, it was actually so simple."]},{"number":4254,"title":"Chapter 4254: The Trap Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4254: The Trap Appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","This middle-aged man was an assassin from the Battle God Palace.","From the way he moved, it could be seen. After all, Ling Han had also stayed in the Battle God Palace for a period of time. For better or worse, he was still a seed.","At this time, another two men ran over. One was a middle-aged man, who was incredibly tough, and the other was a young boy. His face was filled with childishness, yet carried an expression of arrogance.","“Little Han!” the two of them called out through divine sense.","Ling Han nodded. This was the little azure dragon and the large black dog.","“Very well, Ling Han, are you walking right into a trap?” A person said balefully, striding towards Ling Han.","Imperial Son, Lin Yun.","This was a member of the Silver Generation, and he had already advanced into the Fifth Form. His strength was unimaginable.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He had grasped the Star Steps, so what did he have to fear?","“Old Black, Four-Legged Snake, prepare to run,” he said through divine sense.","“Why did you reveal your identity? Otherwise, we could have taken advantage of the crisis,” the large black dog said in defiance.","“That’s right,” the little azure dragon also said. They hid their identities very well, and didn’t need to worry about being discovered at all. Moreover, a large number of Evolution Fruits were about to appear, and it was time to make a fortune.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I think there’s a trap in this matter. Don’t be blinded by greed.”","“Ling Han!” Lin Yun shouted loudly. He was filled with fury. Ling Han actually dared to ignore him.","“Yes, yes, yes. I’m not deaf, so I heard very clearly,” Ling Han finally replied.","“You’re seeking death!” Lin Yun was just about to make a move, but right at this moment, he heard a round of cheers, causing him to stop abruptly.","What was going on?","“The restriction has been lifted.” Cheers surged out like a flood.","Lin Yun faltered for a moment, then humphed coldly, “Consider yourself lucky.”","In comparison, it was the Evolution Fruit that was more important. It was related to whether he could quickly break through to the sixth form, or even had hopes of breaking through to the seventh form in fact.","If he could reach the Seventh Form, he would be able to shorten the gap between himself and the Golden Generation, and if he could take another step further, and reach the Eighth Form, then he would not be inferior to the Golden Generation at all.","Thus, the Evolution Fruit was incredibly important in his eyes. In fact, he could even temporarily spare Ling Han for this.","The Imperial Sons all rushed into the mountain cave, especially the Silver Generation. Their status had been awkward for a long time, and they were more eager to change this than anyone else.","Ling Han didn’t move. In fact, he even pressed down on the little azure dragon and the large black dog.","“What did you sense?” Chi Menghan walked over gracefully, her figure graceful and captivating.","The silver-haired little lolita and Chi Dao were both here, yet they were actually able to restrain themselves and not rush into the mountain cave at the first instant. This was truly a rare sight.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “It’s dangerous.”","“Dangerous?” Chi Dao scratched his head, “There are so many Imperial Clan elites gathered here. Who dares to touch us?”","This action was equivalent to offending all the Imperial Clans. One after another, Saints would charge over with Imperial Weapons in their hands. Who in the world could withstand this?","“I don’t know. It’s just an instinctive feeling,” Ling Han said.","“Brother-in-law, when did you become a woman?” the silver-haired little lolita shouted.","“Little girl, it’s not only women that have instincts,” the large black dog said in an experienced manner.","“Prepare to retreat. I keep feeling that this place is filled with killing intent,” Ling Han said.","“Hahaha, what powerful instincts. As expected of the legendary prodigy that can match the Golden Generation.” A voice suddenly rang out, and there was even the sound of applause.","Who was it?","Ling Han and the others all turned around, only to see a group of people walking over from outside the valley.","There were not many, only nine, and the person in the lead was an elder. He had white brows and a white beard, and his aura was not apparent. It was unknown whether he was strong or weak, but the eight people behind him... there was no shortage of Sect Master-level elites!","Hiss, wasn’t this place forbidding cultivators above the True Self Tier from entering? Why were there suddenly four Sect Masters, three Spirit Transformation True Lords, and only one of them was at the True Self Tier. He looked to be in his early twenties, and his flame of life was flourishing.","“Dongfang Clan Leader!” Chi Menghan said. She bowed slightly to the white-browed elder as a token of respect.","This was natural. She was the Imperial Daughter, so who would be worthy of such respects from her?","Ling Han was astonished. This elder was actually the clan leader of the Dongfang Clan?","No wonder they could enter. The Island of the Sky had always been under their control, so they definitely had a way to enter.","The question was, why?","The white-browed elder was called Dongfang Bai, and he was a Venerate Tier-level great elite. He had already lived for over 90,000 years, and theoretically speaking, he wasn’t far from reaching the end of his lifespan. It was possible that he would die at any moment.","He smiled faintly, and said, “I heard that Donglin Imperial Clan’s prized daughter is exquisitely beautiful. You are indeed graceful and enchanting.”","Chi Menghuan couldn’t help but frown. ‘You’re a senior, so it’s inappropriate for you to say such things in front of me.’","“The news of the Hundred Flowers Valley was spread by you guys, right?” Ling Han asked directly.","Dongfang Bai’s gaze shifted to Ling Han, and he showed a hint of surprise. However, he nodded decisively, “That’s right.”","“Why?” Ling Han asked.","“Well, that’s a long story,” Dongfang Bai said with a smile.","“There’s still a lot of time. Senior, why don’t you explain slowly?” Ling Han also smiled, “I can tell that Senior has prepared for this for a very, very long time. Now that the matter is about to be settled, if you don’t share it with others, wouldn’t that be too boring?”","“Haha, young man, you’re quite interesting. It’s a pity to kill such an interesting person,” Dongfang Bai said with a smile.","Chi Menghan couldn’t help but feel anxious. The Dongfang Clan had really planted killing intent?","She couldn’t help but say, “Dongfang Clan Leader, don’t forget how many Imperial Clan clansmen are here. Don’t bring a fatal disaster to the Dongfang Clan!”","“Little girl, are you threatening me?” Dongfang Bai shook his head, and said, “That young man is right. I’ve already planned for far too long for today. If I don’t share this with others, my sense of accomplishment will truly be greatly reduced.”","He began to speak.","“This Island of the Sky was discovered by our Dongfang Clan in the first place, but we couldn’t hide it for many years before it was discovered.”","“Hoho, at that time, all the Imperial Clans fought over this island, but no one noticed that the one who was most injured was our Dongfang Clan! A fire broke out at the city gates, bringing disaster to the bystanders!”","“You guys have finished fighting, but our Dongfang Clan has also suffered heavy casualties!”","“In the end, you all lightly threw down a few words, and had our Dongfang Clan continue to manage the Island of the Sky, yet did not even ask how many members of our Dongfang Clan had died for this matter.”","“You Imperial Clans are noble and dignified, so how could you possibly care?”","“Haha, well said. The Island of the Sky is still managed by our Dongfang Clan, but in truth, from now onwards, the many generations of descendants of the Dongfang Clan have all become your gardeners and servants.”","“We... are naturally unwilling to accept this!”","“You people have only roughly examined the Island of the Sky, so how can you compare to us, who have lived here for generations?”","“Our elders from the previous generations discovered a rare treasure in this place.”","“Natural-born Stone Spirit!”"]},{"number":4255,"title":"Chapter 4255: Waiting for a miracle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4255: Waiting for a miracle","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing the words Natural-born Stone Spirit, Ling Han couldn’t help but help but wear a strange expression.","He could already vaguely guess what was going on. However, if he told the truth, Dongfang Bai would probably go crazy with anger.","However, he was the only one who knew the truth. When they heard the words Natural-born Stone Spirit, Chi Mengan and the others all looked stunned.","At the same time, a series of tragic cries rang out from within the mountain cave. In an instant, a large number of people rushed out, all of them looking like they had been frightened.","When they entered, the Imperial Sons were at the forefront, and when they came out, the Imperial Sons were also at the forefront.","“Dongfang Bai, you’ve gone crazy!” Lin Yun shouted loudly. There were traces of blood on his body, but they shouldn’t be his, because there were no injuries. However, his expression was filled with both fury and fear.","“How dare you!” One of the Sect Masters of the Dongfang Clan humphed. He sent out a palm strike, which turned into a colossal hand. Peng, the large hand pressed down, and various kinds of light of energy flashed violently. The Regulations were interwoven.","When he withdrew the large hand, it was seen that in the area covered by the attack, only Lin Yun was still standing. The others had all died.","If Lin Yun didn’t have the Substitution Seal, he would have definitely died as well.","Seeing this scene, everyone inhaled sharply, and those who had just come out of the cave still had no idea what had happened. They were all extremely dumbfounded.","The Dongfang Clan actually dared to make a move on an Imperial Son!","This wasn’t putting on an act to scare them, but they were really going to be ruthless and assassinate them.","Crazy, they must have gone crazy!","Lin Yun’s body was also trembling. He was an Imperial Son, and possessed invincible battle prowess at the same cultivation level. However, in front of a Sect Master elite, he was like a blade of grass, completely unable to withstand a single blow.","Thus, if the clansmen of the Dongfang Clan really went mad and wanted to kill an Imperial Son, then his end... could only be one word. Terrible.","What was the use of the Substitution Seal? With a few more kills, with the Sect Masters or even Venerate Tiers keeping watch, how could he escape?","Crazy, they had really gone crazy.","Dongfang Bai coughed, and in an instant, all eyes were focused on him. There was confusion, fear, and terror.","He smiled faintly, and said, “Where were we just now?”","“Oh, right, Natural-born Stone Spirit.”","The old geezer swept an eye over the surrounding people, and said with a smile, “There should be some people here that still don’t know what Natural-born Stone Spirit is. I’ll give you guys some general knowledge first.”","“Less nonsense. What exactly do you want?” Another Silver Generation member stepped out and shouted at Dongfang Bai.","Now that the other party clearly wanted to kill him, there was naturally no need for him to be respectful.","Dongfang Bai looked towards that Imperial Son. With a pa, that Imperial Son exploded. Thankfully, there was the Substitution Seal. He had not really died, but it still caused him to break out in a cold sweat.","“This world does not revolve around the Imperial Clans,” the old geezer said calmly. “There are a great many children who still don’t know what the Natural-born Stone Spirit is. What right do you have to deprive them of the right to know?”","After a pause, Dongfang Bai began to introduce the Natural-born Stone Spirit.","After saying this, he smiled, and said, “This Natural-born Stone Spirit is under the Hundred Flowers Valley, but its aura is too powerful, and even I can’t approach it.”","The more this was the case, the more it showed how terrifying the Natural-born Stone Spirit was. If it could be refined into a doppelganger, it would naturally be extremely awesome.","“Thus, I have gathered all of you together, and plan to use you as blood sacrifices, to open up a path.”","When these words were said, there was an uproar.","They were actually going to become sacrifices for a blood sacrifice?","What kind of joke was this!","“Dongfang Bai, you have to consider carefully how many Imperial Clans there are here!” Imperial Son Cheng Qing called out loudly. “Even if your blood sacrifice is successful, and you obtain the Natural-born Stone Spirit, would you be able to block the furious Imperial Clans?”","The Saints all came with Imperial Weapon in hand; could you block them?","“Brat, your comprehension ability is quite poor,” Dongfang Bai said with a chuckle. “Once I obtain the Natural-born Stone Spirit and refine it into my spiritual body, even the Imperial Weapon won’t be able to kill me!”","“Furthermore, if I sacrifice all of you, I still have the chance to extract your Imperial Scrolls, and use the Natural-born Stone Spirit to make a prediction. Then, it would not be difficult for me to break through to Silent Destruction Tier.”","“At that time, I’ll be able to rival the Imperial Weapon, and I’ll be able to rival the Pseudo-Emperor!”","The Silent Destruction Tier was Saint Tier, but normally, no one would directly address the cultivation level by its full name. Instead, they would respectfully address it as Saint Tier, or Saint-level.","All of a sudden, a dead silence fell.","This seemed... flawless.","According to Dongfang Bai, he indeed could be unafraid of the Imperial Clans. In fact, if he had the strength of Pseudo-Emperor, the Imperial Clans would be forced to behave, not daring to trifle with him.","“Since the leader of the Dongfang Clan needs a blood sacrifice to obtain the Natural-born Stone Spirit, I, on behalf of the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan, express my support,” a man suddenly said.","He was the Silver Generation Imperial Son of the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan. His name was Tong Xiao.","‘F*ck! Shameless!’","Hearing Tong Xiao’s words, everyone felt a sense of disdain.","For the sake of survival, could he be so shameless?","“The Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan also expresses their support.”","“The Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan expresses support!”","“...”","More Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters stepped out to express their stand. Obviously, as long as they didn’t die, it didn’t matter how many people died.","Dongfang Bai saw this, and suddenly humphed. The aura of a Venerate Tier elite fluctuated, causing everyone to involuntarily shut up.","“What a disgusting face!” he said coldly, “For the sake of survival, you guys are really capable of doing anything.”","All the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters did not speak. As they saw it, those who were not Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were all ants. So what if 10,000 or 10,000 of them died?","“Your lives are lives, and the lives of others aren’t?” Dongfang Bai said coldly. “Today, I’ll let you know that you people view all life as ants, but in fact... you yourselves are only ants!”","He raised his hand. Weng, instantly, Regulations intertwined, turning into a cage that was closing in on the center.","Peng, peng, peng! These were Regulations that had been activated by a Venerate Tier, and their might was incredibly terrifying. One would definitely die if they came into contact with them, and they would directly explode into a shower of blood.","In just an instant, the whole valley was flooded with blood.","Those who were stronger tried their best to squeeze towards the centre. Though this could not solve the problem, they could at least die later, and who knows, a miracle might happen.","However, this place was only so big, so how could everyone squeeze into the middle?","Thus, the battle immediately broke out. Those with weak abilities were expelled, and then crushed by the Regulations, instantly turning into a rain of blood.","The entire valley had completely turned into a slaughterhouse. In this place, whether it was normal cultivators, Holy Land Dao Child, or even Imperial Sons, the only difference was whether they died earlier or later.","“Little Han, can you leave?” The large black dog was also feeling apprehensive. This was a Venerate Tier cultivator digging a trap for minor characters like them; how could they escape?","Ling Han frowned deeply, and said, “No, the ley lines are also suppressed.”","“Then what do we do? Wait for death?” the little azure dragon asked anxiously.","“No, wait for a miracle,” Ling Han said darkly."]},{"number":4256,"title":"Chapter 4256: Ge Qianqiu appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4256: Ge Qianqiu appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","The cage of Regulations continued to shrink. This was a Venerate Tier elite’s attack, so even if one were a Silver Generation elite or a Golden Generation elite, the gap in their cultivation level was extremely large, so they could only wait for death.","Screams of agony rang out endlessly. The blood of the dead turned into a river, which was then used as a blood sacrifice. A blazing light rose up, lighting up the whole valley.","“Ling Han!” At this moment, Chi Menghan suddenly said to Ling Han, “There’s something I want to say to you.”","“Er, if you are going to say you like me, then I have known that long ago,” Ling Han said.","Chi Menghan was rendered speechless. ‘You’re still in the mood to say such words at a time like this?’","“No!” she said through gritted teeth.","“Then what are you trying to say?” Ling Han was curious. Yi, when did his charms become so weak that he actually did not manage to win the heart of this Imperial Daughter?","“Zhi!” The sound of pigs squealing was heard. The perverted pig leaped with all its might, and jumped out of the arms of the silver-haired little lolita. It lay on Ling Han’s back, and then used its four short pig claws to tightly tug on Ling Han’s clothes, looking like it was determined not to let go even if it died.","“Stinky little piggy, what do you mean by this?” The silver-haired little lolita was very hurt. This perverted pig actually abandoned her at this moment.","“Hehe, it clearly feels that it has a higher chance of survival if it follows Little Han,” the large black dog said with a chuckle.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was puzzled, and said, “This pervert pig is invincible. If we throw him out, who knows, we may be able to create a hole in this cage of Regulations.”","The pervert pig’s expression changed drastically, and he hurriedly loosened his limbs before lunging at the large black dog. He desperately tugged at the large black dog’s fur.","There was an upper limit to its invincibility. If a Venerate Tier elite made a move, it would definitely die without a doubt.","Hong, the valley became more and more resplendent. Innumerable drops of blood intertwined, containing powerful life essence, as well as Regulations. With these sacrifices, it was naturally very grand.","Dongfang Bai showed an expectant expression. He did not have much lifespan left, and that was why he was taking this gamble. As long as he could obtain the Natural-born Stone Spirit, the Dongfang Clan would be invincible, and if he could obtain the Imperial Scroll, he may be able to advance into Saint Tier.","If he became a Saint, he would gain ten times his lifespan. This was the fundamental motivation for him to take risks. Saying how he could not bear see the Imperial Clans lording their authority, and his clan being oppressed were all excuses.","Soon, soon.","The other members of the Dongfang Clan were also filled with anticipation. They were already tied together. If they didn’t succeed, they could only die trying.","“Sigh!” Right at this moment, a long sigh was heard.","Where did it come from?","Dongfang Bai was startled. With the strength of his cultivation level, he actually couldn’t tell where this sigh was coming from, so how could he not feel nervous? It should be known that he was presently at a crucial moment in his plans to snatch the Natural-born Stone Spirit, so naturally, his heart was tense, and he was on edge.","“Who is it?” he shouted.","Ling Han finally breathed a sigh of relief. Old man Ge Qianqiu was finally going to make a move.","He knew that this old man was in the underground cave, and the so-called blood sacrifice would definitely awaken him, but what he was unsure about was whether Old Man Ge was willing to interfere in this matter.","Moreover, could the old man defeat a Venerate Tier elite?","“This old man is called Ge Qianqiu.” Shua, with a flash, Ge Qianqiu appeared out of thin air. He was filled with emotion, “By now, there should be no one that can remember this name.”","Dongfang Bai looked at the old geezer. This old geezer looked like his vitality was waning. He could clearly see that the old geezer’s lifespan was already close to zero, and probably not much different from his.","Hiss, could it be that the old man had come to snatch the Natural-born Stone Spirit from him?","His expression instantly became baleful. The Natural-born Stone Spirit concerned whether he could live for hundreds of thousands of years or not. To him, this was his life! Whoever dared to fight him for it would be taking his life, and he would spare no expense to battle them.","“Friend, this is the territory of our Dongfang Clan, so please leave,” he said calmly. If he could make the other retreat, that was naturally best.","Ge Qianqiu smiled, yet couldn’t help but start to cough. He couldn’t help but sigh, saying, “I’m old, I’m really old.”","Hearing these words, Dongfang Bai’s heart was filled with alarm bells. ‘You said you’re old, but are you emphasizing your determination to definitely obtain the Natural-born Stone Spirit?’","“Friend—”","“I’ll tear apart this cage first. Commit too much bloodshed, and it damages the harmony of the heavens. Your hopes of becoming a Saint would be even slimmer,” Ge Qianqiu said. With a casual press of his hand, peng, peng, peng, the cage immediately crumbled.","Everyone felt as if a heavy burden had been lifted from their shoulders, and they were instantly overcome with ecstasy. Some of them even started to cry.","“This is the miracle that you’re waiting for?” the large black dog, Chi Menghan, and the others all asked.","Ling Han nodded, “That’s right.”","“F***, brat, you clearly know that someone is rescuing you, yet you still refuse to say anything, causing Grandpa Dog to become extremely nervous.” The large black dog gave Ling Han the middle finger.","Meanwhile, Ling Han smiled. In truth, he did not know whether Ge Qianqiu would make a move or not. He only had a 70% chance of success.","On the other side, Dongfang Bai was both shocked and furious.","He was furious because this Ge Qianqiu was indeed aiming for the Natural-born Stone Spirit. He was shocked because the latter was able to dispel his attack with a casual press of its hand. His abilities were quite strong, and he couldn’t figure out his true strength.","“No need to waste your energy,” Ge Qianqiu said with a shake of his head. “The Natural-born Stone Spirit that you wanted already appeared hundreds of millions of years ago.”","“Impossible!” Dongfang Bai naturally refused to believe this. He had prepared for this day for a very, very long time. Furthermore, he had gone all out. He even dared to kill the members of the Imperial Clans, and there was absolutely no way back for him.","Hence, this matter could only succeed, and could not fail.","Ge Qianqiu smiled, “This old man has lived down there for so many years, so I naturally know better than you whether I am or not.”","Dongfang Bai’s killing intent instantly overflowed, “You were the one who stole my Natural-born Stone Spirit?”","His eyes were bloodshot, as if he had gone mad.","This was natural. The Natural-born Stone Spirit was tied to the fate of the Dongfang Clan, as well as his dream of extending his lifespan. This definitely couldn’t go wrong.","Boom!","Dongfang Bai charged over, and his figure rose into the air. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Light continuously shot out from behind him, intertwining into sheets that looked like the feathers of birds. They were incredibly beautiful, but in the next instant, these streaks of light changed direction, and shot towards Ge Qianqiu.","This was all made up of Regulations, which carried a high-level energy, and was indescribably terrifying.","Even the Imperial Sons inhaled sharply. Even if they possessed the Substitution Seal, so what? They would probably be killed by the feathers of Regulations that would follow closely after their “revival”. No matter how many times they had a Substitution Seal to die in their stead, it would not be enough.","This was the might of a Venerate Tier elite.","Meanwhile, Ge Qianqiu shook his head, sighed, and stretched out his shrivelled right hand, waving it lightly in front of him.","Instantly, all the attacks disappeared without a trace.","“What!” Dongfang Bai couldn’t help but feel shocked. What kind of terrifying abilities was this?","He was a Two Star Venerate Tier elite, and to so easily disperse his attack, it would have to be a Five Star or even Six Star Venerate Tier elite, at least.","“No, I definitely won’t hand the Natural-born Stone Spirit over to anyone!” he roared, as if he’d been possessed.","Boom, he once again charged towards Ge Qianqiu."]},{"number":4257,"title":"Chapter 4257: Saint!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4257: Saint!","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ge Qianqiu shook his head again. He still made a pressing motion with his hand, but this time, he wasn’t just simply dispersing the attack. With a palm strike, peng, Dongfang Bai was actually shattered.","F***!","Seeing this scene, everyone was dumbfounded.","What was going on here? A mighty Venerate Tier elite was actually killed with a wave of his hand?","What kind of terrifying abilities was this!","“S-Saint!” an Imperial Son exclaimed in a low voice.","Though there were also differences in strength among Venerate Tiers, those that could reach this cultivation level were all prodigies among prodigies. Thus, it was practically impossible to insta-kill a Venerate Tier.","Then, there was only one possibility.","Ge Qianqiu was a Saint, so he was able to smack Dongfang Bai to death with a wave of his hand.","“Greetings, Saint Ge!” Immediately, the majority knelt down. Even the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters clasped their hands in respect, their expressions respectful.","This was a Saint. In an era when there was no Emperor in the world, that was the strongest existence. Even if they went to the Imperial Clans, they would still be able to receive the highest level of respect. No matter how arrogant and proud the Imperial Son was, he would still have to bow his head in front of a Saint.","It should be known that even if an Ancestral King really appeared in this generation, there would only be one. The others would only be on equal footing with this person, at most, and that would be an unknown number of years later.","Saints were respected by the whole world.","The other members of the Dongfang Clan were all confused. What happened to their plan of the Dongfang Clan becoming a top-notch force? What happened to the plan of the ancestor of the Clan becoming a Pseudo-Emperor?","Why had he died all of a sudden? Furthermore, he had died so badly that not even a single complete bone could be found?","“Ah!” Someone called out first, and the remaining members of the Dongfang Clan instantly fled in panic. All of a sudden, they had disappeared without a trace.","Ge Qianqiu didn’t give chase. In reality, if Dongfang Bai hadn’t been so forceful, he wouldn’t have killed him.","The old man raised his head to look at the sky. He sighed, and said, “A good hiding place has been destroyed. Looks like this is the will of the heavens!”","After the blood sacrifice, flaws appeared in the paramount Regulations. Even the Primordial Source Clay couldn’t suppress his vitality from seeping out. It couldn’t be helped; he was too powerful. Thus, there was no meaning for him to stay here any longer.","Ge Qianqiu swept an eye over the crowd, and when his gaze passed over them, even the Imperial Son couldn’t help but lower his head, not daring to make eye contact.","However, when his gaze shifted to Ling Han, he discovered that this young man was actually looking back at him without the slightest fear.","Yi?","Though the old man had already met Ling Han once, at that time, he had restrained all his aura, and Ling Han was only able to converse with him frankly. But now, his sharpness was slightly revealed, and it was definitely not something that a True Self Tier could withstand.","‘He has the potential to become Emperor,’ he thought to himself. Suddenly, a killing intent rose up in him, which instantly turned into tumultuous waves, causing everyone to feel chills all over their bodies, as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","“Hehe, after experiencing so much, why can’t I see through my obsession?” The old man shook his head internally, “This brat is so young. Even if I want to compete with him for a sliver of fated opportunity, that would be a matter for a very long time later.”","“Let’s go, let’s go.” Ge Qianqiu chuckled, and with a flick of his sleeve, the entire Island of the Sky rumbled. Then, he was seen tearing through the air, and actually tore a rip into the skies.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief. They could all sense Ge Qianqiu’s killing intent just now, and if a Saint made a move on them, then even Substitution Seal would not be able to take effect, and all of them could only die on the spot.","After circling around the gates of hell, who wouldn’t be afraid?","Ling Han looked up at the sky. This place had been sealed off by the Regulations of the highest level, yet now, a hole had been forcefully created.","“Beauty Chi,” he said, “This place has been sealed off by the Regulations of the highest level. Even Saints won’t be able to break through it, right? They can only rely on the Imperial Weapon to break through it?”","“Correct,” Chi Menghan replied with a nod. A look of astonishment spread across her face.","Hiss, then how did Ge Qianqiu do it?","Did he have the Imperial Weapon on him?","“Ling Han!” A cold humph rang out, and Lin Yun had already charged over.","Not only him, but also Shi Hao.","“Beauty Chi, I’ll take my leave first. We’ll meet again.” Ling Han stretched out a hand and grabbed both the large black dog and the little azure dragon. He activated the Star Steps, and xiu, he had already disappeared without a trace.","“Hey, give me back my pig!” the silver-haired little lolita shouted. The lecherous pig was still hanging from the large black dog’s neck.","Boom, right at this moment, a great many people flew in from the opening above the island. There was no shortage of Sect Master elites.","—The seal of Regulations had been removed.","“What’s going on here?” a Sect Master elite asked. He came from the Imperial Clan, and was also the Dao Protector of one of the Imperial Sons.","Everyone related the situation, and instantly, those elites were stunned.","...There was actually a Natural-born Stone Spirit here!","—The Dongfang Clan was outrageously bold, to actually dare to kill members of the Imperial Clans!","—A Saint was cultivating in seclusion here, and had just appeared!","Every piece of news had a shocking effect, and added together, even the Sect Master elites would be stunned for a moment.","But only after a while, these elites came back to their senses.","“Spread the news, a warrant is issued on all the surviving dregs of the Dongfang Clan, no restrictions on their life or death!”","“Go and investigate that Saint Ge, and find out who he is everywhere.”","“Also... report back to the clan, Ling Han actually dared to kill an Imperial Son!”","This time, Ling Han’s name was really about to soar sky-high. Not only had he killed four Imperial Sons in this battle, there was even one that belonged to the Silver Generation.","The Imperial Clans were furious. If they didn’t kill Ling Han, what face would they have left?","...","Speaking of Ling Han, after he used the Star Steps to leave, he immediately took out the formation foundations and brought the large black dog and the little azure dragon back to the Sky Planet.","The blockade of the Regulations of the highest level had been broken, so the Transfer Formation was naturally usable.","Without the slightest hesitation, he immediately began to cross galaxies.","He couldn’t stay here any longer. Otherwise, he would be in big trouble.","At the same time, he also released the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower from his mind, keeping it close to him. In this way, with the Origin Gold to conceal his aura, he was sure that even Saints would not be able to predict his whereabouts.","“It’s over, it’s over. From now onwards, we’ll really be blacklisted. Before we become Saints, we can only conceal our identities,” the large black dog wailed. He had just heard Ling Han say that as many as four Imperial Sons had died in his hands.","In the past, though there had been nine great Imperial Clans hunting Ling Han down, Ling Han had only scammed the Imperial Sons at that time. These Imperial Sons had not died, nor were they severely wounded.","But now?","This was really equivalent to having stirred up a hornet’s nest.","“Good kill.” The little azure dragon clapped. He was also someone who feared nothing in the world.","The pervert pig left quietly, tiptoeing cautiously.","Ling Han’s eyes were sharp, and he immediately grabbed it. “Fat pig, why are you running? When we encountered danger just now, you knew to pounce towards me, and now you’re kicking me to the curb?”","“In your dreams!” the large black dog bawled. “Come, let’s share the burden.”","“Zhi! Zhi! Zhi!” The perverted pig screamed and struggled repeatedly. It wanted to lie in the arms of the beautiful sister, b@stard!","The four of them roamed around in the universe for a while, then began to investigate the current situation.","As expected, the Imperial Clans were enraged, and issued a killing order to the world."]},{"number":4258,"title":"Chapter 4258: Chang Clan moves","paragraphs":["Chapter 4258: Chang Clan moves","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Baili Clan of the Ziwei Imperial Clan, the Shi Clan of Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan, the Xu Clan of White Feather Imperial Clan, and the Guan Clan of Xuanfeng Imperial Clan all issued a must-kill order at the same time, demanding Ling Han’s head.","Anyone who could bring Ling Han’s corpse to the four great Imperial Clans could request to cultivate any Imperial Technique, and obtain a favor from the Imperial Clans.","When the news spread out, the whole world was shaken.","This decision was too firm. This was absolute determination to kill Ling Han.","And right at this moment, the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm also issued a must-kill order, similarly hunting down Ling Han. However, the conditions they offered were much lower. They only promised to teach the Saint Technique, and similarly promised a favor from the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm.","They also joined in on the fun. This wasn’t strange. After all, Ling Han had killed Shi Mie from the Buddhist Land and almost burned the three Bodhisattvas to death.","He had only offended five Imperial Clans in one go. Oh, that’s right, there was also the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan, the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan — Lin Lang’s death had already been confirmed by the Lin Clan to be his fault, and in the case of the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, Ling Han had killed Hong Tianbu.","Thus, there were as many as seven Imperial Clans that were determined to kill him, and there were also a few Imperial Sons that he had humiliated before. If they were added into the equation, the number of parties out for his head would probably be in the double digits.","“Little Han, Grandpa Dog is impressed by your ability to attract trouble,” the large black dog sighed.","Ling Han smiled. After so many days, the Imperial Clans had finally issued a bounty, yet no elite had caught up to them. What did this mean?","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was indeed capable of concealing the twists of fate, such that even Saints couldn’t predict its whereabouts.","All right, then he would just develop himself secretly. As long as he advanced into Saint Tier, or advanced into Saint Tier in formations, so what if they were the Imperial Clans?","The Imperial Weapon was indeed powerful, but it was still an inanimate object.","“I’ll connect to the Galaxy Network and take a look.”","At present, they were only scouting out the situation on a certain planet. Whatever they had heard from others naturally was only the tip of the iceberg.","After connecting to the Galaxy Network, it was really lively now. News of Ling Han and the others were spamming everywhere.","Some people admired him. This guy even dared to trifle with the Imperial Clans. He was truly awesome. Of course, there were also those who mocked and ridiculed him, thinking that Ling Han was definitely going to die now. He had really angered the Imperial Clans, and if even Saints moved, Ling Han would not be able to escape this tribulation.","“Little Han, your name has truly shaken the galaxy now. I’m afraid that no one will not know about you in the future,” the large black dog remarked. “For the sake of Grandpa Dog’s safety, it would be best for me to keep my distance from you in future.”","“Yes, yes, yes.” The little azure dragon nodded as well.","The pervert pig was even more direct. He used his two claws to drag the large black dog and little azure dragon, looking like they was going to leave Ling Han behind and flee on their own.","These guys!","Ling Han studied it for a while longer. Was there any new ancient site that had opened, which could allow him to earn some extra income and hide for a while?","However, he is anticipation had been for nothing.","“That Old Man Ge... who exactly is he?” Ling Han asked in curiosity. Ge Qianqiu was definitely no ordinary Saint, as he had actually managed to break through the Regulations’ blockade.","“The existence of the supreme Regulations should be due to the Natural-born Stone Spirit,” the large black dog analyzed. “With the Natural-born Stone Spirit appearing, the supreme Regulations will definitely dissipate slowly. When it becomes weak to a certain extent, it’s not impossible for it to be destroyed by a Saint.”","“That’s right. Previously, after the Imperial Clans tried it out, they discovered that they couldn’t enter without an Imperial Weapon. Then, there would definitely be no one who would be bored enough to try it out again.” The little azure dragon continued, “So, after such a long time, the supreme Regulations should have mostly worn off.”","“I’m sure we’ll see this old man again in the future,” Ling Han said. He didn’t plan to continue this topic, because aside from Ge Qianqiu himself, no one else should know just how strong he was.","“Little Han, where are we going to have fun next?” the large black dog asked.","“What’s the point of having fun? Keep a low profile, understand?” Ling Han said with a smile.","...","At the same time, in the Four Directions Imperial Clan, Chang Clan.","The Chang Clan today was slightly out of the ordinary, because four Saints had shockingly arrived. They had respectively come from the four Imperial Clans, Shi, Guan, Xu and Baili Clans.","This was naturally a grand show of force. Thus, the Chang Clan also sent out a Saint to accompany them.","“That brat has connected to the Galaxy Network.” At this moment, a member of the Chang Clan arrived at the main hall, and reported this to the Chang Clan’s Saint.","“Where?” the Saint from the Chang Clan asked.","“East Heavenly Realm, Offspring Galaxy, Icy Sea Planet,” that clansman said.","“All right, you may leave.” The Chang Clan’s Saint waved him off, then turned to look at the Saints from the Shi Clan, Guan Clan and the other Clans, “Friends, the Chang Clan has made an exception for you. This matter must not be spread out!”","The four Imperial Clans had come to ask the Chang Clan to help them locate Ling Han’s whereabouts.","However, the Chang Clan had always boasted that they only had the right to protect the Galaxy Network, and could not interfere in its management, but now it was proven that this was obviously nonsense.","The Galaxy Network was the private property of the Chang Clan, and only ordinary members of the Chang Clan were not qualified to know about it.","Thus, this matter definitely could not be spread out, or it would cause a great commotion.","Who would still dare to use Galaxy Network?","“All right.” The four Saints all nodded, “We owe the Chang Clan a favor.”","Meanwhile, the Saint from the Chang Clan waved a hand dismissively, which could be considered as asking them to leave.","...","Ling Han was still worried about the Galaxy Network, because the Imperial Clans had never used the Galaxy Network before. There must be a reason for this. Thus, after he found out about the situation, he immediately threw away the connection device, and quickly left this planet.","It wasn’t long before he received news that several Venerate Tier elites had arrived on the planet he had been on. They sealed off the ley lines and Transfer Formation, and began a search inch by inch.","“Hiss, how did those guys find us?” the large black dog exclaimed in shock.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “Chang Clan.”","If it was the Saint’s divination, then the pursuers should have long since arrived. It was neither too late nor too early now, and it just so happened that not long after they had connected to Galaxy Network, wasn’t it the Chang Clan that had “betrayed” them? What other possibility was there?","This infuriated the large black dog and the little azure dragon. This also signified that they would have another Imperial Clan-level enemy in the future.","“We have to be even more careful. Galaxy Network should only be used when absolutely necessary.”","Since there were no ancient sites opening, Ling Han and the others obediently began to cultivate.","What displeased Ling Han was the fact that there was still a large amount of Universe Coins in his Galaxy Network account. At present, he could barely use them — for example, if he wanted to buy real items, he would have to provide the location for delivery. Wouldn’t that be equivalent to telling those Imperial Clans where he was?","Thankfully, he still had a considerable number of Dao Stones in his possession, but without a large platform like Galaxy Network, it always seemed inconvenient.","Ling Han refined the three Evolution Fruits. The second Stone Fetus was still a bit away from reaching the Silver Fetus, but the following advancement would be slow. If he purely relied on his own cultivation, he would need at least a hundred years to reach the end of the fourth form.","Cultivators were inseparable from cultivation resources, and this was not just empty words. Even for the Golden Generation, if they did not have the full efforts of the Imperial Clans to nurture them, they would only be True Self Tiers now, at most.","All of a sudden, a year had passed.","“Little Han, bad news!” The large black dog ran over, his face filled with fury.","“What is it?” Ling Han asked.","“The Imperial Clans have surrounded the Nine Suns Holy Land, and they want you to go to the Nine Suns Holy Land within a year to deliver yourself into their hands. Otherwise, they’ll raze the Nine Suns Holy Land to the ground!”"]},{"number":4259,"title":"Chapter 4259: A Powerful Threat","paragraphs":["Chapter 4259: A Powerful Threat","Editor: Henyee Translations","“What!” Ling Han suddenly stood up.","Previously, the nine great Imperial Clans had once besieged the Nine Suns Holy Land. However, at that time, Ling Han had already left the Nine Suns Holy Land. The Holy Land’s side had also released an announcement, saying that Ling Han would be expelled from the Nine Suns Holy Land, and from then onwards, there would be no relation between the two.","Though the Imperial Clans were awesome, without solid proof, they did not dare to raze the Nine Suns Holy Land Clan to the ground. After all, there had been precedents in the history of the Nine Suns Holy Land. When a new Emperor ascended the throne, there would be a reckoning.","At first, he had thought that this matter would be over, and there would be no more worries. He had not thought that it would come again.","“The Imperial Clans are getting serious now, and they’re planning to be shameless now,” the large black dog said. “They’re forcing you to show yourself.”","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, “Why do they think that I’ll appear?”","Others didn’t know that he had two beautiful wives that had stayed behind in the Nine Suns Holy Land. According to normal people’s logic, who would sacrifice themselves to save an old sect that had expelled them?","“Probable because there is nothing else they can do,” the little azure dragon said. “They’ll try everything they can.”","The Saint’s divination had been unsuccessful, and Ling Han was also very alert. Every time he connected to the Galaxy Network, he would switch locations. Even if the Imperial Clans had overwhelming power, they could not possibly find him.","Thus, the Nine Suns Holy Land was probably the last straw that they could clutch onto.","“They’ve really caught me off guard,” Ling Han said with a bitter smile. It wasn’t just because of Hu Niu and the empress. He couldn’t possibly sit by and watch as the Nine Suns Holy Land was destroyed because of him. To say nothing else, the Nine Mountains Venerate treated him like a son, so how could he not repay this kindness?","“Huh? You’re not really going to walk right into a trap, are you?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, “I definitely have to go to the Nine Suns Holy Land. However, to say that I’m going to walk right into their trap... I won’t go so far!”","He bought another connecting device, and then made contact with the Nine Mountains Venerate.","The two of them discussed for a long time. Then, Ling Han threw away the connection device and immediately went to another planet.","“How is it?” the large black dog asked.","“Come, let’s go to the Nine Suns Holy Land,” Ling Han said.","“You’re really going?” the little azure dragon asked.","The perverted pig directly hugged a pillar, as if he was resolutely expressing his stand that it was impossible for him to leave.","Ling Han grabbed it and said, “Let’s go.”","“Zhi!” the pervert pig screamed. He didn’t want to die, b@stard.","They began to traverse the universe, heading towards the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Why had the Imperial Clans set a time limit of a year? Of course, they were afraid that Ling Han was too far away, and would not be able to make it back in time. And with a time limit of a year, unless he was at the edge of the universe, it was absolutely impossible that he would not be able to make it back in time.","Only three months later, they arrived at the Nine Suns Planet.","With the cover of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, the Soul Forming Technique, and a formations grandmaster’s ability, the four of them came quietly without alerting anyone.","Ling Han entered the Nine Suns Holy Land by himself, but he only stayed for a short while before leaving.","“Little Han, what on earth are you playing at?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han smiled, “Don’t be anxious, you have to be patient.”","How could the large black dog and little azure dragon endure this? The one year deadline was drawing closer and closer, yet the threat posed by the five Imperial Clans was extremely real. How were they supposed to deal with this?","These were Imperial Clans. This time, in order to suppress the Nine Suns Holy Land, Saints would definitely come personally. Just ask the Nine Suns Holy Land, how would they be able to block it?","A Saint Tool?","Heh, how could a Saint Tool rival an actual Saint? Moreover, how many Saints would be arriving this time?","However, they believed that Ling Han definitely wouldn’t die for nothing, nor would he bring them along with him to die. Thus, they still suppressed their urges and waited quietly.","Only the perverted pig wanted to flee all day long, but aside from its invincible defense, it was no different from an ordinary piglet. Naturally, it was captured time and time again.","All of a sudden, a year’s time had passed.","Ling Han’s improvement was limited. He had only just advanced the second Stone Fetus to Silver Fetus, and this was still based on the fact that he had previously ingested three Evolution Fruits.","On this day, the five great Imperial Clans charged over. The Shi Clan, Xu Clan, Guan Clan, Baili Clan, and the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm were here. All these parties were led by a Saint respectively.","“Nine Suns Holy Land, this the deadline. Hand over the unfilial son, Ling Han, or we’ll massacre this place!” the Saint from the Guan Clan said calmly. However, how powerful was a Saint? His words were law, and instantly, the sky above Nine Suns Holy Land was covered with dark clouds.","And this scene was also broadcasted live on the Galaxy Network through the connection device.","“He’s done for.”","“Even if the Nine Suns Holy Land is a veteran Holy Land, it’s not like the how it had been when the Nine Suns Saint was present, after all. Now, there isn’t even a Saint. With just the Saint Tool, how can they stop five Saints?”","“It’s all Ling Han’s fault for implicating the Nine Suns Holy Land. I’m afraid that from now onwards, this Nine Suns Holy Land will disappear from the universe.”","“Che, how could this be blamed on Ling Han? If it was not for those Imperial Sons being overbearing, how could Ling Han have killed anyone?”","“Shh, watch your words. Even a Holy Land is about to be razed to the ground, so don’t seek death!”","The Galaxy Network was filled with sighs. In the past, the Imperial Clans would always abide by a bottom line, but now that the five great Imperial Clans were ganging up on the Nine Suns Holy Land, they obviously planned to break this bottom line.","It could not be helped. If they did not kill Ling Han, what face would the Imperial Clans have left?","Xiu, in the Nine Suns Holy Land, a Venerate Tier elite appeared.","He was Anyun Venerate. Originally, he would be “enjoying his retirement” in the Mountain Sea Heaven, and would either become a Saint, or die of old age within. However, the Mountain Sea Heaven was occupied by Yin souls, so he could only return to the Nine Suns Holy Land, and completely abandon all thoughts of becoming a Saint.","“Lords, Ling Han has long since been expelled by our sect, so how would our sect hand him over?” he argued reasonably.","The Bright Sun Buddha opened his mouth, and said in a hoarse voice, “This is your business. In any case, this unfilial brat came from your Nine Suns Holy Land, and has now committed a heinous crime. Do you think you can just pat your behinds and stay out of this matter?”","Anyun Venerate couldn’t help but feel anger rise up in him. Wasn’t this all caused by the Imperial Clans?","Who would trifle with an Imperial Clan elite for no reason?","Oh, your Imperial Clans went to bully others, yet now that you’ve been rebuffed, you are making outrageous demands?","He was grumbling internally, but of course, he would not say that out loud. He only emphasized that the Nine Suns Holy Land indeed did not know where Ling Han had gone.","“All right, then there is nothing more to say.” The Saint of the Guan Clan stated calmly, “Let’s first raze the Nine Suns Holy Land to the ground.”","“All right.” The other Saints nodded respectively.","“Aren’t you afraid that a new Emperor will appear in the future and call you to account?” Venerate Anyun roared.","“What a joke,” the Baili Saint said coldly. “This generation’s new Emperor will definitely appear among the Golden Generation, and once the curse of an Imperial Clan never producing another Emperor is broken, with the wealth of the Imperial Clans, how could the subsequent new Emperor appear among lowly commoners like you?”","In the future, the Ancestral King would forever be under the control of the Imperial Clan . Thus, as for the reckoning from the new Emperor, hehe, what need was there for them to be concerned?","Anyun Venerate couldn’t help but feel ashen. The Nine Suns Holy Land... were they really going to die?","“Attack!” The five Saints all humphed coldly, and raised their hands respectively.","“Hehe, old friends, can you give me some face?” Right at this moment, an old man rapidly streaked over from the distance. Shua, shua, shua, as if he was traveling through time. At first, he was still very far away, but in an instant, he had arrived on the spot."]},{"number":4260,"title":"Chapter 4260: Mediator","paragraphs":["Chapter 4260: Mediator","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was an old man with a slender figure. He arrived in a flash, leaving behind a long fragmented image of the Void behind him.","To be able to address five Saints as brothers, it was naturally self-evident what cultivation level this old man was at.","A sixth Saint!","Ling Han focused his gaze, and saw that there was another woman beside the old man. She was breathtakingly beautiful.","Yi, Chi Menghan.","Ling Han had never seen the true appearance of this beauty ranked third in the universe before, but he was naturally familiar with her temperament and features. He could recognize her with a single glance. However, he had never thought that he would actually see her true appearance in such a situation.","True, to still be wearing a veil in front of a Saint was firstly, disrespectful, and secondly, it was useless.","By the looks of it, this newly arrived Saint was from the Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Friend Chi, why did you call us to a halt?” the Saint from the Baili Clan asked.","This Saint that had come from the Chi Clan was none other than the Crystal Saint. He chuckled, and said, “I would like to ask my brothers to give me some face, and spare the Nine Suns Holy Land.”","The five Saints exchanged looks. They had not thought that the Chi Clan would actually stand on the side of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Ling Han, meanwhile, was filled with gratitude. The Chi Clan would take the risk of offending the five great Imperial Clans to step out. This must be the credit of Chi Menghan. With her identity as Imperial Daughter, and aptitude that was comparable to the aptitude of the Golden Generation, her weight was still quite heavy.","However, she had definitely made a huge sacrifice to be able to summon a Saint.","Ever since coming to this new world, though Ling Han had always been cynical, he had never thought of getting involved in any kind of romantic debts, but this favor... was really too great.","How could he repay the deep love of a beautiful woman?","“Hehe!” The large black dog placed his paw on Ling Han’s shoulder.","“Hehe.” The little azure dragon also rested a paw on Ling Han’s other shoulder.","“Zhi!” The perverted pig was extremely displeased. F*ck, he actually dared to snatch a girl from him!","The five Saints fell silent for a moment, before the Saint of the Shi Clan said, “Friend Chi, I’m afraid I can’t comply with your request!”","The Imperial Son was killed, but the Imperial Clans were still unable to act. The longer the time passed, the greater the effects on the Imperial Clans. Others may not know, but how could it be that the Imperial Clans were unaware of the dangers involved?","The Crystal Saint smiled, and said, “Since that’s the case, I have nothing else to say.”","He clasped his hands behind his back, looking like he was going to stay out of this.","Yi, it ended just like that?","Ling Han came to a sudden realization. Although Chi Menghan was the most outstanding princess of the Chi Clan, she was still only a True Self Tier cultivator, after all. The Chi Clan definitely couldn’t offend the five Imperial Clans for her sake.","Thus, the Crystal Saint was only going through the motions. It was naturally best if he could persuade the five great Imperial Clan Clans to retreat. If hecouldn’t, then he had no plans to turn completley hostile and start a war.","This was very logical. Aside from the Chi sisters and Chi Dao, the other members of the Chi Clan weren’t familiar with Ling Han either. Was there any need for them to fight the Imperial Clans for his sake? Moreover, it was five clans at that. If they really fought, there was a 99% chance that the Chi Clan would be finished.","—If Ling Han had now become a Venerate Tier elite, the Chi Clan would probably take a gamble, betting that Ling Han would become Emperor, but now, hoho.","The five Saints smiled in unison. They knew that the Chi Clan wouldn’t dare to get serious, because the Nine Suns Holy Land didn’t have any relations with the Chi Clan. They didn’t have any benefits or relations with the Nine Suns Holy Land. Who would be so stupid?","“Ants, accept your fate.” The Saint of the Shi Clan moved, and pressed down on the Nine Suns Saint. Boom, his right hand took the form of a colossal palm. It was really as big as a planet, and was covered densely with stars and Regulations.","Even if the Nine Suns Planet had been strengthened by Saint-level power, being attacked by a Saint-level power would only be the matter of a few more palm strikes, at most, and it was guaranteed that they would disappear from the universe.","This was how domineering Saints were. They weren’t targeting an individual at all, and they were directly destroying planets!","The speed of this palm strike was not very fast, so everyone could clearly see it. And precisely because of this, not only did despair rise up in the hearts of every disciple of Nine Suns Holy Land, even the ordinary people in other places were paralyzed with fear. They did not even know why they had suffered such a calamity.","“Little Han!” the little azure dragon and the large black dog both shouted. The perverted pig squeaked. Although it was amazing, it couldn’t withstand the attacks of Saints!","—Where are your trump cards? Hurry up and release them!","“Humph, you dare to be impudent in our Nine Suns Holy Land!” At this moment, a loud shout was heard. It was as majestic and bright as if opening the sky and striking the earth, and reverberated through the universe.","A large hand suddenly swatted out, greeting that giant palm in the skies. Its speed was much faster, and in a flash, it had touched that giant palm. Boom, instantly, two giant hands that were comparable to planets crashed into each other, creating a terrifying, boundless shockwave.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! It was as if the whole sky was filled with fireworks. Those were Regulations. Those were high-level energies, interwoven into pieces that were incredibly dazzling.","Yi? En? Ya?","In this moment, everyone was incredibly stunned.","What was going on?","Who was attacking? They had actually blocked the Saint’s attack?","Even though the Saint from the Shi Clan had only attacked casually, even Venerate Tier elites would be crushed into smithereens. Thus, the person who had withstood this attack was definitely a Saint.","But the problem here was, where did the Nine Suns Holy Land get a Saint?","“A newly advanced Saint?” Including the Crystal Saint, the six Saints all looked surprised.","They were all veteran Saints, so they could naturally tell with a single glance that the person who had attacked them was a newly advanced Saint. He was still very unfamiliar with the use of Regulations.","The little azure dragon and the large black dog looked pleasantly surprised at the same time. They looked at Ling Han and asked, “Could it be?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, “That’s right!”","Shua, a figure appeared in the skies, facing off against the five Saints. Though it was only one person, his aura was not weak at all, exuding a bold and unrestrained wildness.","Nine Mountains!","“Saint!” the six Saints exclaimed in unison. They could naturally tell that the Regulations of this person was very reserved. This was the symbol of becoming a Saint.","What, the Nine Mountains Venerate had become a Saint?","The disciples of the Nine Suns Holy Land were all surprised. Yi, this was too low-key, wasn’t it? They actually had absolutely no idea!","But in an instant, they began to cheer.","With a Saint standing guard, that would be a top-notch force in the world. Even the Imperial Clan would have to treat them with caution.","This time, they were saved!","The Nine Mountains Venerate looked down at the five Saints. The Crystal Saint stood very far away, and looked like he was watching from the sidelines. He said calmly, “Now, you can all get lost!”","How domineering!","He was too domineering. Faced with the five Saints, he directly rebuked them to scram. The only one in this world that had done this was Nine Mountains!","All the disciples felt their blood boil with excitement. Previously, they had been oppressed by the Imperial Clan elites, and their lives were completely in the hands of others. How sullen would that be? But in the blink of an eye, the Nine Mountains Saint had moved aggressively, and with a single word of “get lost”, it could be said that he had spat out all the displeasure and fury in everyone’s hearts.","They were all filled with reverence for the Nine Mountains Saint. This had actually transformed into some kind of power that boosted onto the Nine Mountains Saint, causing him to radiate with light, making him appear even more divine and domineering.","The Saint of the Shi Clan and the other clans exchanged looks, all of them frowning."]},{"number":4261,"title":"Chapter 4261: Domineering rebuke to withdraw","paragraphs":["Chapter 4261: Domineering rebuke to withdraw","Editor: Henyee Translations","As it turned out, this could not be any easier to suppress.","When a Saint moved, no matter how many Venerate Tier elites there were, no matter if you had a Saint Tool or not, it was only a matter of a few more palm strikes.","However, the Nine Suns Holy Land actually produced a Saint?","This would not be easy to deal with.","“This is truly unexpected!” The Saint of the Shi Clan chuckled, and said, “Nine Mountains, right? Let me offer my congratulations first. You’ve broken through to the Saint Tier, and now that you’ve reached this level, you’re more or less standing at the pinnacle of the world. You truly have the right to speak.”","“However!” The Saint from the Guan Clan continued, “Perhaps you know, or perhaps you don’t. Saints are the same as Venerate Tiers, and can be divided into nine levels. You are presently only a One Star Saint, and as for us? Hehe, we are all Three Star Saints!”","“In a one-on-one battle, you have absolutely no chance of winning, what more when there are a total of five of us!” The Saint of the Shi Clan continued, “Since you are also a Saint, you can be considered to have leaped out of a small mud pool. We can give you some face, and you can leave now. You will no longer have any relation with the Nine Suns Holy Land.”","“Otherwise, we would be killing a Saint today!” the Saint from Baili Clan said balefully.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, Saints would not start a battle with each other. At this cultivation level, they were all manifestations of the Regulations. Firstly, they were difficult to kill, and secondly, if they really fought to the death, then as long as the gap in cultivation level was not more than three stars, even if they could win, they would have to pay a very great price.","Even if it was five against one!","Thus, they would rather spare the Nine Mountains Saint than force him into desperate straits.","—A Saint would be treated with respect by the Imperial Clans. How could this be a joke?","Hearing these words from the five Saints, the members of the Nine Suns Holy Land felt a chill in their hearts again.","That’s right. The Nine Mountains Saint was only one person. Furthermore, he had only just broken through to Saint Tier. How could he be a match for the five Saints?","Nine Mountains had lived for more than 80,000 years, and in the case of Venerate Tier, he was about to reach the end of his lifespan. However, he was now a Saint, and theoretically speaking, his lifespan was as long as a million years. It could be said that his lifespan had just begun.","In that case, would the Nine Mountains Saint still put his life on the line at this moment?","Was he an idiot?","All of a sudden, everyone was incredibly nervous, fearing that the Nine Mountains Saint would turn around and leave.","Meanwhile, the Nine Mountains Saint laughed loudly, and said, “Don’t you people understand human language? I already told you to scram!”","This!","The five Saints were all enraged, furious, and confused. Aside from the Great Emperor, who else had the right to reprimand them like this? However, they were also confused. Where had the Nine Mountains Saint gotten such confidence from?","Was this guy not afraid of death?","His life had only just begun, what more when a great era was about to begin. No matter what, a newly advanced Saint would consider breaking through to the Imperial Path, right?","‘You’re so willing to accept this?’","“Nine Mountains, are you courting death?” the Baili Saint asked balefully. His killing intent blazed.","So what if he was a Saint? He was only a newly advanced Saint. With the five Saints working together, even if they had to make some sacrifices, they would still be able to kill him on the spot.","The Nine Mountains Saint smiled. Weng! A precious tower immediately materialized above his head, exuding Primal Chaos Qi. It was more so enveloped in lightning, radiating with a paramount might.","This scene was too shocking!","The six Saints, including the Crystal Saint, were all moved at the same time.","This, this, this was an Imperial Weapon!","How could this be! How could this be!","The Imperial Weapons in the world were numbered, and there were only as many Imperial Weapons as there were Imperial Clans in the world. No more, and no less. Then, where had the Imperial Weapon in the hands of Nine Mountains come from?","To say nothing of borrowing it, there were indeed Imperial Weapons from some Imperial Clans that was tower-shaped, but it was definitely not forged by this kind of Origin Gold.","Thus, this was an Imperial Weapon that belonged to Nine Mountains!","What kind of concept was this?","An Imperial Weapon that he had forged himself could unleash its might at any time, which was completely different from the Imperial Clan’s Imperial Weapon.","In an era when there was no Emperor in the world, having an Imperial Weapon in hand was equivalent to being invincible!","All of a sudden, the five Saints felt suffocated.","What could they do?","They hadn’t brought the Imperial Weapon with them.","—Just to erase a Holy Land, they still needed to use the Imperial Weapon? What kind of joke was that!","In that case, though Nine Mountains Saint was only a One Star Saint, but added with the Imperial Weapon... what Saint would dare to face him head-on?","“Nine Mountains, you’re not the only one who has an Imperial Weapon!” the Baili Saint said. “Even if you force us to leave this time, we can still bring an Imperial Weapon with us next time. You’ll still be outmatched!”","The Nine Mountains Saint was proud, and he said, “You’re right. Thus, the next time I see you two, I’ll immediately tear a rip into the Void and leave. Then, I’ll start to conquer your lairs one by one!”","The expressions of the five Saints changed drastically upon hearing this.","This was a blatant threat. If you dare to bring the Imperial Weapon to the Nine Suns Holy Land, then I would also dare to bring the Imperial Weapon to your Imperial Clans. Worse come to worst, both sides would be severely wounded.","The Imperial Clan was indeed impressive, but half of their power came from the Imperial Weapon. Without the Imperial Weapon keeping watch, how could they possibly stop a Saint that had brought the Imperial Weapon with him?","The five Saints were instantly rendered speechless.","Why was it that when the Imperial Clans got along peacefully with each other, and had occasional conflicts, they would not really fight to the death?","Wasn’t it because everyone had an Imperial Weapon? This was a deadly weapon, and they were all wary of each other.","Right now, the Nine Suns Holy Land had a Saint, as well as an Imperial Weapon, so how could it still be a Holy Land?","No, this was an Imperial Clan!","The Imperial Clan could not be offended, and this was a fact that was known to the whole world.","F***, what the f***!","The five Saints all felt extremely vexed. They had clearly come to raze them to the ground, yet now, it was as if they had swallowed an entire bowl of flies. This was an indescribably horrible feeling.","On the other hand, on the side of the Nine Suns Holy Land, every disciple felt their blood boil with excitement, feeling a pride that they had never felt before.","To reprimand Saints, only I, Nine Mountains, can do it!","The Nine Mountains Saint continued, “From today onwards, Ling Han will return to our Nine Suns Holy Land! I am not concerned about normal battles. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, even if Ling Han dies, I will not pursue the matter. However, if anyone dares to pick on the weak, then don’t blame me for being ruthless!”","Domineering! Protecting his own people!","So what if the five great Imperial Clans joined forces to hunt Ling Han down? I don’t care at all, and even took Ling Han as my disciple again right in front of your eyes.","‘Do you yield or not? So what if you don’t? There’s only one word for it, and that’s battle!’","Furthermore, if they wanted to target Ling Han in future, that was fine. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, he would not interfere, but if it was targeting him through someone with a higher cultivation level than Lin Han, then he would bring the Imperial Weapon to his doorstep.","Now that things had come to this, the five Saints couldn’t bring themselves to stay any longer. Wasn’t this completely watching the performance of the Nine Mountains Saint? And they were nothing but a pitiful background to his brilliance.","“Let’s go!” One after another, they flew away. They had all decided internally that they would send out the elites of the Fifth Form or even the Sixth Form of the True Self Tier to kill Ling Han.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The five Saints left, one after another.","Meanwhile, the Crystal Saint didn’t leave. He had come to lend a hand. Although he wasn’t of much use, he had still come with good intentions.","“Friend Nine Mountains, congratulations!” He laughed loudly, his mind racing. Originally, Ling Han had no one to rely on, and was just a commoner, but it was a different story now. He had become Imperial Son-level, completely worthy of Chi Menghan.","The Nine Mountains Saint also withdrew his domineering aura. He clasped his hands in the direction of the Crystal Saint, and said, “Thank you, Friend Crystal. Come and have a cup of tea.”","“Sure!”"]},{"number":4262,"title":"Chapter 4262 - 4260: Mediator","paragraphs":["Chapter 4260: Mediator","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was an old man with a slender figure. He arrived in a flash, leaving behind a long fragmented image of the Void behind him.","To be able to address five Saints as brothers, it was naturally self-evident what cultivation level this old man was at.","A sixth Saint!","Ling Han focused his gaze, and saw that there was another woman beside the old man. She was breathtakingly beautiful.","Yi, Chi Menghan.","Ling Han had never seen the true appearance of this beauty ranked third in the universe before, but he was naturally familiar with her temperament and features. He could recognize her with a single glance. However, he had never thought that he would actually see her true appearance in such a situation.","True, to still be wearing a veil in front of a Saint was firstly, disrespectful, and secondly, it was useless.","By the looks of it, this newly arrived Saint was from the Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Friend Chi, why did you call us to a halt?” the Saint from the Baili Clan asked.","This Saint that had come from the Chi Clan was none other than the Crystal Saint. He chuckled, and said, “I would like to ask my brothers to give me some face, and spare the Nine Suns Holy Land.”","The five Saints exchanged looks. They had not thought that the Chi Clan would actually stand on the side of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Ling Han, meanwhile, was filled with gratitude. The Chi Clan would take the risk of offending the five great Imperial Clans to step out. This must be the credit of Chi Menghan. With her identity as Imperial Daughter, and aptitude that was comparable to the aptitude of the Golden Generation, her weight was still quite heavy.","However, she had definitely made a huge sacrifice to be able to summon a Saint.","Ever since coming to this new world, though Ling Han had always been cynical, he had never thought of getting involved in any kind of romantic debts, but this favor... was really too great.","How could he repay the deep love of a beautiful woman?","“Hehe!” The large black dog placed his paw on Ling Han’s shoulder.","“Hehe.” The little azure dragon also rested a paw on Ling Han’s other shoulder.","“Zhi!” The perverted pig was extremely displeased. F*ck, he actually dared to snatch a girl from him!","The five Saints fell silent for a moment, before the Saint of the Shi Clan said, “Friend Chi, I’m afraid I can’t comply with your request!”","The Imperial Son was killed, but the Imperial Clans were still unable to act. The longer the time passed, the greater the effects on the Imperial Clans. Others may not know, but how could it be that the Imperial Clans were unaware of the dangers involved?","The Crystal Saint smiled, and said, “Since that’s the case, I have nothing else to say.”","He clasped his hands behind his back, looking like he was going to stay out of this.","Yi, it ended just like that?","Ling Han came to a sudden realization. Although Chi Menghan was the most outstanding princess of the Chi Clan, she was still only a True Self Tier cultivator, after all. The Chi Clan definitely couldn’t offend the five Imperial Clans for her sake.","Thus, the Crystal Saint was only going through the motions. It was naturally best if he could persuade the five great Imperial Clan Clans to retreat. If hecouldn’t, then he had no plans to turn completley hostile and start a war.","This was very logical. Aside from the Chi sisters and Chi Dao, the other members of the Chi Clan weren’t familiar with Ling Han either. Was there any need for them to fight the Imperial Clans for his sake? Moreover, it was five clans at that. If they really fought, there was a 99% chance that the Chi Clan would be finished.","—If Ling Han had now become a Venerate Tier elite, the Chi Clan would probably take a gamble, betting that Ling Han would become Emperor, but now, hoho.","The five Saints smiled in unison. They knew that the Chi Clan wouldn’t dare to get serious, because the Nine Suns Holy Land didn’t have any relations with the Chi Clan. They didn’t have any benefits or relations with the Nine Suns Holy Land. Who would be so stupid?","“Ants, accept your fate.” The Saint of the Shi Clan moved, and pressed down on the Nine Suns Saint. Boom, his right hand took the form of a colossal palm. It was really as big as a planet, and was covered densely with stars and Regulations.","Even if the Nine Suns Planet had been strengthened by Saint-level power, being attacked by a Saint-level power would only be the matter of a few more palm strikes, at most, and it was guaranteed that they would disappear from the universe.","This was how domineering Saints were. They weren’t targeting an individual at all, and they were directly destroying planets!","The speed of this palm strike was not very fast, so everyone could clearly see it. And precisely because of this, not only did despair rise up in the hearts of every disciple of Nine Suns Holy Land, even the ordinary people in other places were paralyzed with fear. They did not even know why they had suffered such a calamity.","“Little Han!” the little azure dragon and the large black dog both shouted. The perverted pig squeaked. Although it was amazing, it couldn’t withstand the attacks of Saints!","—Where are your trump cards? Hurry up and release them!","“Humph, you dare to be impudent in our Nine Suns Holy Land!” At this moment, a loud shout was heard. It was as majestic and bright as if opening the sky and striking the earth, and reverberated through the universe.","A large hand suddenly swatted out, greeting that giant palm in the skies. Its speed was much faster, and in a flash, it had touched that giant palm. Boom, instantly, two giant hands that were comparable to planets crashed into each other, creating a terrifying, boundless shockwave.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! It was as if the whole sky was filled with fireworks. Those were Regulations. Those were high-level energies, interwoven into pieces that were incredibly dazzling.","Yi? En? Ya?","In this moment, everyone was incredibly stunned.","What was going on?","Who was attacking? They had actually blocked the Saint’s attack?","Even though the Saint from the Shi Clan had only attacked casually, even Venerate Tier elites would be crushed into smithereens. Thus, the person who had withstood this attack was definitely a Saint.","But the problem here was, where did the Nine Suns Holy Land get a Saint?","“A newly advanced Saint?” Including the Crystal Saint, the six Saints all looked surprised.","They were all veteran Saints, so they could naturally tell with a single glance that the person who had attacked them was a newly advanced Saint. He was still very unfamiliar with the use of Regulations.","The little azure dragon and the large black dog looked pleasantly surprised at the same time. They looked at Ling Han and asked, “Could it be?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, “That’s right!”","Shua, a figure appeared in the skies, facing off against the five Saints. Though it was only one person, his aura was not weak at all, exuding a bold and unrestrained wildness.","Nine Mountains!","“Saint!” the six Saints exclaimed in unison. They could naturally tell that the Regulations of this person was very reserved. This was the symbol of becoming a Saint.","What, the Nine Mountains Venerate had become a Saint?","The disciples of the Nine Suns Holy Land were all surprised. Yi, this was too low-key, wasn’t it? They actually had absolutely no idea!","But in an instant, they began to cheer.","With a Saint standing guard, that would be a top-notch force in the world. Even the Imperial Clan would have to treat them with caution.","This time, they were saved!","The Nine Mountains Venerate looked down at the five Saints. The Crystal Saint stood very far away, and looked like he was watching from the sidelines. He said calmly, “Now, you can all get lost!”","How domineering!","He was too domineering. Faced with the five Saints, he directly rebuked them to scram. The only one in this world that had done this was Nine Mountains!","All the disciples felt their blood boil with excitement. Previously, they had been oppressed by the Imperial Clan elites, and their lives were completely in the hands of others. How sullen would that be? But in the blink of an eye, the Nine Mountains Saint had moved aggressively, and with a single word of “get lost”, it could be said that he had spat out all the displeasure and fury in everyone’s hearts.","They were all filled with reverence for the Nine Mountains Saint. This had actually transformed into some kind of power that boosted onto the Nine Mountains Saint, causing him to radiate with light, making him appear even more divine and domineering.","The Saint of the Shi Clan and the other clans exchanged looks, all of them frowning."]},{"number":4263,"title":"Chapter 4263: Origin of the Pervert Pig","paragraphs":["Chapter 4263: Origin of the Pervert Pig","Editor: Henyee Translations","Guan Xia was very strong.","He was a member of the Silver Generation, and his raw power was as high as 50 Heavens. If he used Imperial Technique, his battle prowess was close to 60 Heavens.","Such powerful battle prowess was enough to insta-kill Ling Han.","Thus, Ling Han naturally had no intention of fighting him head-on. Using the Star Steps, he was extremely carefree. ‘Come and chase me. If you can catch up to me, it’ll be considered your victory.’","This naturally made Guan Xia feel exasperated. No matter how strong he was, faced with a formations grandmaster that had grasped Star Steps, he could only eat dust behind him.","How many True Self Tier elites were there in this world, but how many formation grandmasters were there?","The chase continued for half a month, and in the end, Guan Xia could only leave helplessly.","If he wanted to kill Ling Han, he would have to add another condition — make it so that he would not be able to use the Star Steps.","This would require an ability to suppress the ley lines. There were two possibilities. Firstly, his abilities were strong enough, and he could cover the heavens and earth with a single hand. Then, he would have to be at least Sect Master-level, which was completely unrealistic. Secondly, a formations grandmaster naturally could snatch the right of use of the ley lines.","However, aside from a freak like Ling Han, who else in the world had achieved such accomplishments in both the path of formations and martial arts?","In the following long period of time, Ling Han lived very peacefully, and no one made a move on him again. It was as if the Imperial Clans had forgotten that Imperial Sons had died in his hands.","However, Ling Han knew that this was impossible.","The Imperial Clan was high and noble, so how could they allow others to slap their faces?","Moreover, Ling Han had only found out after chatting with the Nine Mountains Saint that this also involved a problem of power of belief.","After becoming a Saint, he himself could accommodate the Regulations of heaven and earth, allowing himself to become a manifestation of heaven and earth, but there was a limit here.","Some Saints could only accommodate 10% of Regulations, while others could accommodate 30% or even 40%. There was a problem of natural talent involved, but it also involved another matter, and that was the power of belief.","If there were a large number of people who believed in a Saint, they would form a kind of power of will, so that the Saint would be able to accommodate more heaven and earth Regulations.","These believers didn’t need to be very strong, and only depended on the number of people.","Thus, those forces that had reached Saint-level would all run around in circles, and among them, the most terrifying were the Buddhist Race and the Chang Clan. The Buddhist Race had always been promoting faith, and in the case of the Chang Clan, with the help of the Galaxy Network, they had gathered who knew how many users.","The problem was, both success and failure was dependent on belief..","The five Imperial Clans had suffered such a great loss. If they did not get their pride back, that would naturally cause a great many people to look down on them, and the power of belief would naturally decline greatly as well.","Thus, from this aspect, the Imperial Clans would definitely not spare Ling Han.","After learning of this, a thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and a strange expression appeared on his face.","Speaking of believers, he already had a Genesis World in his body. What kind of terrifying number was that?","If he became a Saint, his acceptance of Regulations would probably reach 100%, right?","In this world, who would be able to rival him?","Oh, that’s right, Ding Shu.","This guy was also the overlord of the Genesis World. Thus, after reaching the level of Saint, it should be a competition between the two prodigies.","“For the moment, staying in the Nine Suns Holy Land is meaningless. It’s time for me to go out for a walk.” Ling Han was extremely calm and ready to move. He had never been a person who could stay idle. “Oh, that’s right. Since the old man has become a Saint, let him help me see what’s going on with the perverted pig.”","He brought the perverted pig to meet the Nine Mountains Saint. This would be a good opportunity to inform the old man that he was going out.","“Yi?” The Nine Mountains Saint glanced at the lecherous pig, and stretched out a hand to grab it. Then, he smiled, “Don’t underestimate this pig. It is a Spiritual Transformation Tier existence, and its cultivation level has only been sealed by a Saint.”","Ling Han was astonished. The pervert pig was actually a Spirit Transformation Tier elite?","No wonder its defenses were so tough. Among the opponents that Ling Han had encountered early on, there was indeed no one that could tear through the defenses of Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Meanwhile, the perverted pig howled loudly, an expression of pride on his face. Uncle Pig was an elite!","The Nine Mountains Saint also expended some effort, and only then did he manage to undo the seal inside the lecherous pig’s body.","“I’m about to suffocate to death!” the pervert pig suddenly said. “I haven’t been able to speak for several hundred years, and I f*cking want to die!”","Hearing these words, Ling Han suddenly felt an urge to ask the Nine Mountains Saint to seal the perverted pig again.","He already had enough unreliable people by his side, and he really didn’t want another one.","“Where are you from, and who sealed you?” the Nine Mountains Saint asked. He naturally didn’t want a ticking time bomb to be buried beside his disciple.","Boom! The might of a Saint surged out, its might boundlessly terrifying.","The pervert pig instantly choked, then said, “My ancestor is the dignified Canopy Demon Emperor, and I’m also a genuine Imperial Son!”","“Pei!” Ling Han immediately gave him the middle finger. Others brag, but you are also bragging, aren’t you?","“Tell me the truth!” the Nine Mountains Saint said in a solemn voice.","Faced with a Saint, the perverted pig did not dare to be flippant either, and said, “This old pig is indeed the descendant of the Canopy Demon Emperor. His name is Zhu Gang!”","“Old man, is there such an Ancestral King?” Ling Han asked.","The Nine Mountains Saint thought for a moment, then said, “Amongst the Primitive Age Demon Emperors, there was indeed such a Great Emperor.” He paused, then continued, “During the extensive development of cultivation, it was basically the Demon Race that first attained Dao, followed by the rise of humans, and there were also plant-type creatures that attained Dao.”","Ling Han was astonished. Was this pervert pig really an Imperial Son?","He really wanted to complain.","“Then who sealed you?” Ling Han asked.","“A female Saint,” the perverted pig said. It sighed, appearing very displeased, “I only looked at her a few times, and she sealed my cultivation level, causing me to be like an ordinary pig, unable to even speak.”","Ling Han thought of the perverted pig’s usual behaviour, and couldn’t help but shake his head, “Under what circumstances did you cast a few looks at this Saint?”","“Er... probably when she was bathing,” the pervert pig said.","F***, she really had a good temper if she didn’t beat you to death.","Ling Han nodded, “You should be grateful to your ancestor. Otherwise, you would have long since been made into grilled pork chops.”","“Che, if it was not for the fact that the ancestor of our race had gone to the edge of the universe, who would dare touch a single hair on this old pig’s head?” The perverted pig said in displeasure, not reflecting on his actions at all.","Yi, why had he gone to the edge of the universe like Brother Monkey’s ancestor?","Facts had proven that without the Imperial Weapon, the Imperial Clan could not possibly last long. Brother Monkey was only left in the line of the Battle Saint Emperor. If it was the line of the Canopy Demon Emperor, it was probable that the perverted pig was also the only descendant.","Moreover, Brother Monkey had been suppressed at the foot of the mountain, while the pervert pig’s cultivation level had been sealed. It was also rare for a dignified Imperial Son to fall to such a state.","“The edge of the universe, could it be that it’s really hiding the secret of immortality?” Ling Han asked curiously. Otherwise, how could it be that the generations of Ancestral Kings were all idiots?","Furthermore, only Ancestral Kings were qualified to go there. The others were all mediocre, and even Saints would not be able to reach that place.","A look of yearning appeared on the Nine Mountains Saint’s face. That was a place that even the Great Emperor wanted to take a gamble on, so he naturally wanted to go as well.","Ling Han bade farewell to the old man. He was going out to take a look and see if he could find any great opportunities.","A horse cannot get fat without an extra ration, a man cannot get rich without an extra opportunities."]},{"number":4264,"title":"Chapter 4264: Horn","paragraphs":["Chapter 4264: Horn","Editor: Henyee Translations","This time, Ling Han didn’t plan to go to any far places. He would simply roam around the trading planets of the North Heavenly Realm. He had a large number of Dao Stones in his possession. If he didn’t use them, they would be no different from a pile of scrap stones.","The Nine Mountains Saint didn’t stop Ling Han. He had already issued a threat. If anyone dared to target Ling Han with the advantage of a major tier in cultivation level, he would bring the “Imperial Weapon” with him to do a raid.","This kind of threat was enough to make any force tremble in fear. Who would dare to take this risk?","Though Ling Han, the Nine Mountains Saint, and the others knew that the so-called “Imperial Weapon” was only forged from Origin Gold, and was far from reaching the level of Imperial Weapon, others did not know either. Was it not enough to scare them?","Thus, Ling Han could completely go out to have fun. He couldn’t be like a flower in a greenhouse, and be protected forever, right?","Without experiencing hardships, how could one possibly thrive?","Ling Han set off with the large black dog, the empress, and the others. Because there was no danger this time, he naturally brought more people with him, as if he was on a holiday.","A few dozen days later, they arrived at the trading planet of North Heavenly Realm.","Because the overall level of the North Heavenly Realm was the weakest among the four great Heavenly Realms, the overall level of this trading planet was also slightly lower. Ling Han roamed around for a daty, but did not make any purchases.","He was not in a rush. He just had to take things slowly.","On the second day, they continued to walk around.","This time, Ling Han had some gains. He bought some Celestial medicine, and planned to concoct alchemical pills for the benefit of those close to him.","Natural treasures were too rare. After a larger force obtained them, they would definitely be internally distributed. Only a small number of lone cultivators would take them out to sell. Thus, this quantity was naturally lesser. If they encountered them, it would be luck, but if they didn’t, there was no need to feel irritated.","In the next few days, Ling Han swept through a great many Celestial medicines, and was able to concoct the Silver Fetus Pill, which doubled his present rate of cultivation.","This was naturally awesome, but to Ling Han, shortening the time of 100 years of hard cultivation to 50 years was still not enough.","He still needed natural treasures such as the Evolution Fruit, but such things were really hard to come by. The majority of treasured medicines that had this effect were controlled by the Imperial Clans, and could not possibly circulate on the market at all.","The remaining ones... were all inside the Mystery Realm.","However, the opening of the Mystery Realm required conditions. It was not something that could be entered just because you wanted to.","Ling Han sighed. Could it be that he really had to earnestly cultivate for fifty years before he could reach the end of the fourth form?","Most importantly, he definitely wouldn’t be satisfied with the Fourth Form. He would still attempt the Fifth Form and the Sixth Form, and only consider breaking through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier when he couldn’t advance any further and broke through all his limits.","Going by that account, how many more years would he need?","It was a great era now, and prodigies from all sides were fighting to survive, snatching that sliver of fated opportunity, and walk the Imperial Path. If they were slightly later, they may not have the chance to become the strongest.","Hence, Ling Han was very anxious. He could not accept this kind of gradual routine.","However, at present, there was no ancient site or danger zone that would open up, so he could only suppress his temper and continue to search for treasures here. Who knows, he might be able to pick up some scraps?","Don’t say, the large black dog, the little dragon, and the others had really picked up a treasure. They had bought treasures that were astonishingly valuable at very low prices, but they were mostly secret techniques, materials used to forge the Spirit Tool, and not those that would improve their cultivation level.","On this day, Hu Niu pulled Ling Han out for a walk early in the morning. The empress naturally followed as well. There was also the perverted pig. This guy still looked like a little piglet, and there was still a rope tied around his neck. The empress held it in her hand.","Most importantly, it also looked like it was earnestly enjoying itself, causing Ling Han to feel disgusted all over.","The market was open all day, and because everyone was a cultivator, it was fine even if they didn’t sleep or rest for a few years. Thus, though Ling Han and the others had come early, this place was still lively, and there was no need to worry that there would be few people.","Ling Han looked around as he walked. He indeed had the intention to pick up scraps. That was because he had discovered another tortoise shell on the trading planet of West Heavenly Realm. As a result, it had drawn out the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor!","Would his luck explode again this time?","After walking for a while, Ling Han discovered a street stall. The things on it were all very old. They were either damaged, or covered with mud. At a glance, it was clear that they had experienced many years.","“Young man, look, look, this was just taken out of a large tomb.” When the stall keeper saw Ling Han and his group, he immediately called out to them.","Ling Han wasn’t his original appearance right now. He was too well-known. If he walked with his original appearance, he would definitely be surrounded by people. Perhaps, once he bought something, a group of people would follow suit and place bids, because they all knew that he definitely had good eyesight.","He smiled, and swept his gaze over the stall. Using his eye technique, he could see through everything. He shook his head, and said, “Brother, the goods here have indeed just been dug out, but they’re not from a large tomb. They’re probably from your own backyard.”","This mud, this damage, it was all deliberately made, and under Ling Han’s eye technique, its true nature was naturally revealed.","The stall keeper instantly smiled sheepishly. As it turned out, he was an expert, so there was nothing to show off.","Ling Han was just about to leave. Yi, his gaze suddenly paused. He picked up an item, and asked, “How much is this?”","The stall keeper glanced at it. This was a bugle horn, and it was really quite old. However, after pondering for a long time, he still could not figure out what it was used for. He could not care less, and made it into an “antique” as well. It was fine even if it was useless. Its age was still there.","“Hehe, 20,000 Dao Stones.” He made an exorbitant demand.","Being seen through was one matter, but since you have your eye on something, then he naturally could make use of it.","Moreover, this horn was indeed an ancient item.","“All right.” Ling Han readily took out 20,000 Dao Stones and handed them over.","F***, what a loss.","The stall keeper instantly looked pained. He had been in business for so many years, so he naturally knew that the reason why Ling Han would be so straightforward meant that the value of the horn was not just limited to this.","But there was nothing that could be done. He was the one who had made the bid, so how could it be that he could go back on his word?","If he raised the bid further, he would not be able to do business here in future.","However, he was also a little puzzled, because he had indeed studied it for a great many years, and had not discovered anything strange about this horn at all.","“Er, have you seen through the use of this horn?” he couldn’t help but ask.","“Want to know?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“En!” The stall keeper nodded repeatedly.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Fine, give me 30,000 Dao Stones, and I’ll tell you.”","The stall keeper instantly rolled his eyes. ‘You’re quite black-hearted, aren’t you? Not only do you want to take your money back, but you even want to take advantage of the opportunity to rip me off?’","“Hehe.” He smiled sheepishly, and resolutely ignored her.","Ling Han picked up the horn and continued to advance. However, after walking for a while, he turned into a small forest, planning to study it carefully.","“Ling Han, what is this?” Hu Niu asked.","“I don’t know either,” Ling Han said. He really didn’t know. The reason why he had moved was because when he stretched out his hand to touch the horn, a strange feeling rose up in his heart.","He did not know why, but for a long time, he had always trusted his instincts very much.","“Let Niu play.” Hu Niu took the bugle horn, but before she had even begun blowing, Ling Han took it back, took out a handkerchief and wiped it carefully."]},{"number":4265,"title":"Chapter 4265: Wolf howls","paragraphs":["Chapter 4265: Wolf howls","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hu Niu raised the horn and blew hard, but no sound was heard.","She refused to give up, and blew a few more times, but it was still the same.","“It’s not fun.” She returned the bugle horn to Ling Han, her expression puffed up.","The empress also made an attempt, but similarly, it was completely ineffective.","Right at this moment, the little azure dragon and the large black dog also ran over. They were strolling around nearby, and just happened to see Ling Han and the others.","“Hahaha!” The little azure dragon and the large black dog both laughed loudly. It was rare to see Ling Han suffer a loss.","“Little Han, you also have times when your taste is poor.” The large black dog hit him when he was down.","Ling Han chuckled, “That’s right. For example, when I met the guy standing in front of me.”","The large black dog immediately nudged the little azure dragon, saying, “Four-Legged Snake, Little Han is talking about you!”","The little azure dragon immediately shouted, “Little Han, do you dare to fight for 300 rounds?”","Ling Han ignored him. He took out the horn and began to study it himself.","The reason why he had moved was because he could vaguely sense that there was something special about this thing, but as for what exactly it was, he naturally did not know, and that was why he needed to study it.","This horn was really very ancient, filled with an air of vicissitudes of time. This could not be faked. Thus, even if 20,000 Dao Stones was only to buy an antique, Ling Han would not feel that it was too much of a loss.","He examined it carefully, and discovered that there were many veined patterns on the inside of the horn. At first glance, they were completely unrelated, but when he thought about it in his mind, they were indescribably complicated.","“Let’s go!”","Hu Niu pulled him along, and the group returned to their accommodations. Ling Han closed the doors, and continued to study the horn. He kept feeling that his senses were correct.","Meanwhile, the little azure dragon and the large black dog both teased him, saying that he was a sore loser and was still insisting stubbornly.","However, Ling Han didn’t pay any heed to this. He simply mulled over this with his head lowered.","These patterns were indeed incredibly complex. In a short while, even with his comprehension ability, he could not describe how profound they were.","Of course, it was also possible that there was no logic to this in the first place","Ling Han simply connected to the Galaxy Network and rented a Time Chamber. He could use this opportunity to use some of his Universe Coins. Otherwise, if there were any more accidents, this money would once again rot at the Chang Clan.","He spent all of his Universe Coins and spent eleven days in the Time Chamber before finally getting some clues.","“So that’s how it is.”","Ling Han exited the Galaxy Network, then picked up the horn and blew it according to the principles that he had figured out.","Hu, after blowing out a breath of air, Ling Han shockingly discovered that his Spiritual Power had actually dropped by a significant amount!","—This horn was actually activated with Spiritual Power.","However, why was there still no sound?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel vexed. He had spent an ocean’s worth of Universe Coins, and had initially thought that he had solved the mystery of the bugle horn. Who would have thought that he would have wasted his money for nothing?","“Ao!”","Right at this moment, wolf howls were heard from outside. Then, the voices of the little azure dragon, perverted pig, and large black dog were heard.","“Four-Legged Snake, you’re clearly a snake, so why are you barking like a wolf?”","“Pei, you are clearly a dog, so why do you have to bark like a wolf?”","“Hehe, Grandpa Dog and the wolf are from the same family in the first place. So what if I bark like a wolf?”","“And this perverted pig, why is it howling like a wolf?”","“Uncle Pig likes it, am I not allowed to!”","Ling Han pushed open the doors and walked out, only to see three unreliable guys screaming with flushed necks.","“Were you all imitating the howls of wolves just now?” he asked, a strange expression on his face.","“That’s right. For some reason, I suddenly feel like howling,” the large black dog said.","“En.” The little azure dragon and pervert pig nodded as well.","If one guy howled, that was normal, because these guys were all unreliable, but if three of them howled at the same time, there was something strange about it.","Could it be?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind. He turned around and returned to his room. Then, he took out the horn and placed it by his mouth. With a forceful blow, another large portion of his Spiritual Power was instantly extracted. Then, he heard the howls of wolves coming from outside.","“F***, why are you howling like a wolf again?”","“I want to!”","The little azure dragon and the other two began to argue again.","Ling Han’s expression was strange. This was the effect of the horn, making people bark like wolves?","F***, this was really screwing him over!","His side was full of unreliable guys, and now even something like a Spirit Tool was starting to go into this kind of mode?","Ling Han instantly felt an urge to throw away the bugle horn. What was the use of this thing? When he fought with his opponent, would the bugle horn cause the latter to howl?","This was practically a joke.","Ling Han exited the room again, and saw that the little azure dragon and the others’ eyes were all focused on him.","“Little Han, don’t you have anything to say?” they all asked.","Ling Han spread his hands, “Say what?”","“Humph, you were behind us when we howled for no reason twice. If you say this has nothing to do with you, who’ll believe you?” the little azure dragon immediately said.","“Ang!” The perverted pig nodded.","“F***, didn’t you recover your cultivation level? Why are you still howling like a pig?” Ling Han pointed at the perverted pig.","The perverted pig humphed. Uncle Pig likes to pretend to be a cutie to deceive girls, so what can you do about it?","“Little Han, don’t change the topic. Hurry up and tell me what’s going on?” The large black dog wasn’t so easily fooled, and he immediately turned his attention back to Ling Han.","Only then did Ling Han smile. He picked up the horn, “I think it should be this thing.”","“Are you saying that we’ll only howl when you blow this thing?” the large black dog asked suspiciously.","“En.” Ling Han nodded.","“Grandpa Dog doesn’t believe you.” The large black dog shook its head, and snatched the horn over.","“Grandpa Dragon doesn’t believe it either, who are you kidding!” The little azure dragon also shook its head.","“Zhi!” The perverted pig only let out a squeal.","“Let me give it a try.” The large black dog started to blow it, but no sound was heard, nor was anyone howling.","“See,” the little azure dragon said. It looked like it had seen through Ling Han’s disguise.","Ling Han smiled, took the bugle horn, and blew it with a special technique. Instantly, a portion of Spiritual Power was dispersed, and the large black dog, the perverted pig and the little azure dragon began to howl like wolves. Furthermore, this time, he could see clearly that the three of them had all raised their heads, mimicking wolves fully.","As it turned out, not only could one imitate the howl of a wolf, even their demeanor could be so similar.","The little azure dragon and the others couldn’t help but be stunned. What the hell was this? The horn blew, and they actually imitated the howls of wolves? And they even raised their heads high to imitate it fully?","“Yi, how did you do it?” The large black dog was just about to snatch the bugle horn.","Ling Han dodged to the side.","“Let Grandpa Dragon play!” The little azure dragon also pounced over, but Ling Han also dodged it.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and blew the bugle horn again. Instantly, the three of them began to raise their heads and imitate the howls of wolves.","“Little Han, don’t you think you’re too childish?” the large black dog shouted. It was as if there was an invisible force acting on his brain, causing him to involuntarily raise his head and howl like a wolf.","“Strange!” The little azure dragon’s expression was also filled with shock. This time, he was already prepared, yet he was still hit.","Even the perverted pig was no exception. He opened his mouth and said, “Uncle Pig is a Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator, yet he’s actually also affected!”","From this aspect, though the effects of the bugle horn were extremely useless, it was really quite awesome."]},{"number":4266,"title":"Chapter 4266: Trap","paragraphs":["Chapter 4266: Trap","Editor: Henyee Translations","A True Self Tier blowing the horn could actually affect a Spiritual Transformation Tier, and even if the Spiritual Transformation Tier was prepared, he wouldn’t be able to block it.","From this aspect, it was awesome!","“Which b@stard created this?” The large black dog went to retrieve the bugle horn again. This time, Ling Han did not move aside, but rather allowed it to take the bugle horn.","“This is too much of a scam!” The little azure dragon grimaced. He was the young son of the True Dragon, and he was actually howling like a wolf. This was too demeaning.","“Extraordinary. This should involve a powerful power of Regulation,” the pervert pig said seriously.","At the same time, Ling Han and the others gave it the middle finger.","“Hey, hey, hey, what do you guys mean?” The pervert pig was extremely ticked off.","“A perverted pig suddenly becoming serious is really too unacceptable!” Ling Han mocked.","The perverted pig was rendered speechless for a moment, then asked weakly, “In your hearts, could it be that Uncle Pig is so unreliable?”","“Extremely!” Ling Han and the others nodded in unison.","The pervert pig was angry, and ignored them.","Ling Han was extremely curious, and he asked, “Which cultivation level is the upper limit of this thing?”","“Just the thought of it is quite hilarious. When an elite is showing off, he suddenly raises his head and barks like a wolf. That scene, tsk tsk.” The large black dog snickered. As a screw-over, he naturally thought of how to make use of this thing to screw off others at the first instant.","“A bunch of Saints howling at the same time, this is really something to look forward to!” the little azure dragon also said.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “There’s no need to think about Saints. This will definitely be ineffective.”","Saints were only inferior to the Ancestral King. They themselves could accommodate the Regulations, and they were practically untouchable by all techniques. Thus, it was absolutely impossible for the horn to make Saints howl like wolves.","The Imperial Weapon could suppress Saints, but it had never been heard of being able to control the actions of Saints.","“Finally, you didn’t spend 20,000 Dao Stones for nothing.” The large black dog patted Ling Han’s shoulder, and said, “At least, you obtained a toy.”","Ling Han merely smiled. He had spent more than 20,000. That was only used to buy the bugle horn. In truth, in order to study the patterns within, he had spent an astronomical amount of Universe Coins. Needless to say, the large black dog would probably die of heartache.","He did not think that he had wasted his money for nothing. Putting aside the fact that this horn had the effect of screwing people over, Ling Han studied those patterns, and found that his study of it had produced tremendous gains. They involved some kind of heaven and earth Regulations, and it was like he was cultivating.","“Come, let’s go take a look around. Grandpa Dog also wants to get one to trick people.” The large black dog’s interest was piqued.","“Grandpa Dragon is also going.”","“Zhi.” The pervert pig followed.","After countless years, there would definitely be a great many treasures covered in dust. As long as one had discerning eyes, they would naturally be able to pick up some that they had missed.","Meanwhile, Ling Han continued to study the horn. After a few experiments, he discovered that after blowing the horn, an invisible wave would surge out. As long as one was impacted, he would be affected. He would raise his head high and begin to howl like a wolf. In fact, he would even stop what he was doing.","Only he, the user, could see this kind of ripple. Of course, perhaps those at the Sect Master and Venerate Tier-level could see it as well. This Ling Han had not found someone to test it out, so it could not be confirmed at present.","He gave it a try, and discovered that he could control this kind of ripple. Not only could it be directed in the set direction, it could also transform into an arrow that could be used on one or more specific targets.","After a few times, he became more and more proficient.","Ling Han called the empress and Hu Niu over, and also ran to the marketplace, planning to see if he could find some more good stuff.","However, they definitely couldn’t always encounter such good luck. After circling around for a long time, they returned empty-handed.","“Stop right there!” A shout rang out from behind Ling Han and the others.","Ling Han ignored him, and merely walked side by side with the two women.","“I told you to stop!” At this moment, the person who had shouted ran over from behind and stopped them.","This was a young man, and his cultivation level was Cauldron Forging Tier. In Ling Han’s eyes, he was naturally weak.","However, this kind of weak trash actually dared to take the initiative to provoke him?","Had he gone blind?","“Take off your veil!” When this young man looked at the empress and Hu Niu, his eyes were filled with a lustful light.","Ling Han was astonished. This was a pervert?","“Scram!” He waved his hand dismissively.","“Ha, who do you think you are, to dare tell me, Zhu Ming, to get lost?” That young man was incredibly arrogant, “I am a member of the Zhu Clan, and my grandfather is a Sect Master elite, and you dare tell me to get lost; that is practically courting death!”","“Hand these two women over to me, and I can give you a quick death!”","Idiot.","Ling Han shook his head, and sent out a palm strike. Pa, this Zhu Ming was crushed into a mush of blood.","What was the point of not killing this kind of trash? To leave him alive to disgust others?","The three of them did not take it to heart either. They had killed who knew how many such profligate young masters on their way here, but they had just raised their foot, when they suddenly felt a terrifying pressure assault them.","“How dare you, you even dare to touch this old man’s grandson!” A cold laugh rang out, and an old man appeared soundlessly. His hair was completely white, but his skin was extraordinarily rosy, appearing extremely abnormal.","This was Zhu Ming’s grandfather, the Sect Master elite?","That’s right. This was indeed a Sect Master elite. Ling Han could confirm this with a single glance of his eye technique, but the problem was, he had just killed Zhu Ming, and this Sect Master elite had already appeared?","So coincidental?","If he had been nearby just now, how could he have sat by and watched as Zhu Ming was killed? If that was not the case, how could he have come in such a timely manner?","No matter how he thought about it, there was a strong sense of strangeness about this.","Furthermore, Zhu Ming’s actions could be explained as lecherous, but the empress and Hu Niu were both wearing white veils. There were so many people on the streets, so why had he set his eyes on them with a single glance?","Ling Han sensed the ley lines, and immediately looked surprised, because the nearby ley lines had already been suppressed.","Of course, a Sect Master elite could accomplish this.","But why did he do that? Could it be that he knew that he was a grandmaster of formations?","With all of this added together, Ling Han immediately came to a conclusion. This was a conspiracy from beginning to end.","He should have been recognized long ago. En, perhaps after connecting to the Galaxy Network, a deadly trap was laid out. It began with Zhu Ming provoking Ling Han and inciting him to make a move. Then, the latter’s grandfather would have a reason to make a move.","Ling Han showed a mocking smile, and said, “Old man, who asked you to make a move? Xuanfeng Imperial Clan? White Feather Imperial Clan? Ziwei Imperial Clan?”","The white-haired elder humphed, “I don’t know what nonsense you’re spouting! You killed my grandson, so you’ll pay with your life. It’s only natural.”","“Hehe, you should know who I am, right?” Ling Han said, “Nine Suns Holy Land, Ling Han! You should also know that if you kill me, you’ll be hunted down by a Saint. No matter how big the world is, there’s no place for you.”","“So, let me guess. You should be nearing the end of your lifespan, and that’s why you’re taking a gamble under the instigation of others. It’s for the sake of the clan behind you, right?”","“How many benefits did those Imperial Clans promise you?”"]},{"number":4267,"title":"Chapter 4267: Rescue by the Horn","paragraphs":["Chapter 4267: Rescue by the Horn","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han’s series of words caused the white-haired elder to feel slightly dazed.","He knew very well that Ling Han had not guessed wrongly at all, and that was exactly what had happened.","He indeed did not have many years left to live, but even if he could only live for a few more days, no one would be willing to die sooner. However, those forces clearly told him that once the matter was settled, the Zhu Clan would become a Venerate Tier-level force, at least.","However, if he didn’t agree, the Zhu Clan would face destruction tomorrow.","The white-haired elder didn’t dare to doubt the words of those clans.","Thus, after much consideration, he decided to throw caution to the winds, and use his remaining life to trade for a bright future for the Zhu Clan.","—Zhu Ming was the profligate descendant that he had chosen from his clan. In any case, he only knew how to eat, drink, and have fun, so it would be fine for him to become this victim that would die in this trap. It could be considered as having contributed to the clan.","He had never imagined that the truth would be more or less pieced together by Ling Han after just a single meeting.","Are you a freak?","Thoughts streaked through the mind of the white-haired elder. He had to kill Ling Han. Otherwise, the Imperial Clans would not spare him, and would even implicate the clan. And if he killed Ling Han, he would be the only one to die, and could still trade his life for the future of the clan.","He couldn’t care less!","“Rubbish!” he rebuked harshly, “You killed my beloved grandson, and I want you to pay with your life!”","He moved directly, not wanting to cause any further trouble.","“Run!” Ling Han hurriedly grabbed the empress and Hu Niu, and used the Imminent Skyline.","But now that the Sect Master had moved, how could he escape?","Boom, a large hand stretched out, blotting out the sky and covering the sun.","The white-haired elder didn’t care at all that he would implicate the innocent. He directly launched a regional attack with a palm strike, relying on his high cultivation level to kill Ling Han in the simplest and most domineering manner.","All of a sudden, the expressions of the people on the streets changed drastically. F***, what business was it of theirs?","This was too f****** unlucky!","Ling Han immediately took out the bugle horn and blew it soundlessly.","He didn’t know whether this thing could affect a Sect Master or not. Previously, he didn’t have the time to do a test at all, but now, he could only put everything on the line.","Sigh, after the Heavenly Dao Flames had been used up, he had directly lost his most important trump card.","A wave spread out. In such a crucial moment, Ling Han naturally did not have the time to adjust the range of effect of the wave. Thus, at the same time, everyone on the streets raised their heads high and howled at the skies.","“Ao!”","No one could be exempted, including the white-haired elder.","In this way, his offensive dissipated on its own. The massive palm instantly disappeared in the air, turning back into the purest energy and Regulations.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","‘F*ck! What’s going on? Why did I suddenly howl at the sky like a wolf? And at such a critical moment? Could it be that the Wolf Tribe bloodline in my body has awakened on the brink of death?’","However, what the hell was the sudden howling of the wolves from the others? Could it be that all of them were descendants of the Wolf Tribe?","Moreover, what was the white-haired old Sect Master doing? He hadn’t faced the pressure of death, so wouldn’t it be a lie to say that he had suddenly awakened his bloodline?","The white-haired elder was also dumbfounded. Why had he suddenly howled like a wolf?","Furthermore, it was not just him. The others were also howling, as if they were all bewitched.","After being stunned for a moment, he hurriedly moved again. He had to kill Ling Han, or he and the Zhu Clan would be finished.","Boom, a large hand appeared once more, interwoven with mystical power and Regulations, exuding boundless killing intent as it struck out at Ling Han.","Again!","Everyone gritted their teeth. They had just dodged a calamity, and it was another strike.","Yet Ling Han was already confident, and had long since prepared himself. The bugle horn was blown again.","Invisible and untouchable ripples spread out, and instantly, “Ao, ao, ao,” wolf howls rang out, rising and falling.","Everyone was speechless. ‘I’m about to be killed, so why am I still howling?’","The white-haired old man’s attack dispersed on its own again. He couldn’t help but feel terrified.","Which great elite had moved?","This was too terrifying. He didn’t even need to appear, and he had already lost control of his emotions, and began to howl like a wolf. This strength was practically chilling.","He naturally knew who Ling Han was, and also knew that there was a Saint behind Ling Han, who had an astonishing background. If that was not the case, what need was there for those few Imperial Clans to do something so superfluous, and insist on using him to kill Ling Han?","Wasn’t it just pushing out a scapegoat?","Thus, he immediately thought that since Ling Han had such a powerful background, how could he not have a Dao Protector by his side?","From the look of things now, this Dao Protector had to be Venerate Tier-level, at least, to be able to easily affect him without appearing.","He couldn’t help but feel as if his heart had died. Hurriedly, he stopped, and said, “Senior, this old man deserves to die ten thousand times over. Please spare our Zhu Clan, and this old man is willing to bear the consequences!”","Just as he was begging for mercy from the non-existent Dao Protector, Ling Han had already ran out of his range of influence, communicating with the ley lines. Xiu, the Star Steps unfolded, and he instantly disappeared.","After finding the large black dog and the others, Ling Han immediately set up the Transfer Formation and left the planet.","“What, you were ambushed?” When the large black dog and the others found out about the twists and turns of the matter from Ling Han, they immediately jumped up.","Needless to say, this was definitely the doing of those Imperial Clans.","Only they would have such great ability to make a Sect Master-level force obey their commands, and even make an old Sect Master act as a scapegoat.","“The Chang Clan is also involved. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have known where Little Han was at all.”","The truth of the matter was very easily pieced together. It wasn’t complicated in the first place, but once it succeeded, as long as that old Sect Master of the Zhu Clan stubbornly insisted that it was his own doing, or even committed suicide, then how could the Nine Suns Holy Land blame this on the Imperial Clans?","Moreover, Ling Han and the others were very clear that in truth, the Nine Suns Holy Land didn’t have an Imperial Weapon. It only had a One Star Saint. It was enough to scare people, but if it was really brought to the forefront... then it would be like a paper tiger that would be torn apart with a single poke.","“Motherf*cker, those Imperial Clan bastards still won’t stop!” the large black dog cursed.","“That’s natural. Little Han’s talent scares them. Who knows, he may be able to threaten those Golden Generation members, replace them, and become an Emperor,” the little azure dragon said.","This should be the thought of a portion of the members of the Imperial Clans. They thought that Ling Han was a threat. Of course, even more people believed in the Golden Generation, and thought that with this gap of a hundred years, Ling Han was already too far behind. By the time he became a Saint, the competition for the throne would have already ended.","Thus, there was no rush to settle accounts now. When a new Emperor appeared, he would naturally be able to crush the Nine Suns Holy Land with a single hand.","After Ling Han returned to the Nine Suns Holy Land, he related what had happened to the Nine Mountains Saint. The Nine Mountains Saint immediately moved, destroying several important herbal planets of the Ziwei, Golden Cauldron and other Imperial Clans as a powerful counterattack.","The five Imperial Clans were naturally displeased, and raised their objections to the Nine Suns Holy Land. However, the Nine Mountains Saint was extremely domineering, and he only said, “You guys caused this disaster on your own. Don’t you have any ideas about it?”","The Imperial Clans instantly fell silent.","—"]},{"number":4268,"title":"Chapter 4268: Dark Clouds Hell","paragraphs":["Chapter 4268: Dark Clouds Hell","Editor: Henyee Translations","This time, the Nine Mountains Saint had to be domineering.","Even if there was no evidence, everyone was well aware of the situation. If the Nine Mountains Saint chose to swallow his anger in silence, that would prove that he was a weakling.","Then, the Imperial Clans would tear off their pretence of peace and launch a full-scale invasion.","Thus, the Nine Mountains Saint unleashed his most powerful counterattack. ‘You want to kill my disciple, Ling Han, so I’ll return the favor and cause you to suffer grave losses. Moreover, this is only because Ling Han didn’t die. If Ling Han had died, my revenge would have been 100 times more intense!’","The worst off was naturally that old Sect Master of the Zhu Clan, who had been killed on the spot by the Nine Mountains Saint. However, the Nine Mountains Saint did not expand the scope of his revenge, and chose to spare the other members of the Zhu Clan.","And this time, Ling Han should have profited from this disaster.","That was because though the Nine Mountains Saint had destroyed a considerable number of herbal planets from the five Imperial Clans, he had also harvested a great many mature medicinal ingredients at the same time, and handed them all over to Ling Han.","—He naturally knew now that this disciple of his was also an alchemy prodigy!","These were the herbal planets of a few Imperial Clans. Though they did not have the highest grade of Saintly medicine, Ling Han still felt like this was surreal. He had made a fortune!","Ling Han first used natural treasures to cultivate. There was no need to refine them. They themselves were the purest energy, and did not need to be matched with any medicinal effects. Unfortunately, there were too few of these things, and they just barely delivered his fifth Stone Fetus to the state of Silver Fetus.","This, was far from enough.","Ling Han went to find the Nine Mountains Saint. He wanted to quickly become stronger.","Being bullied and ambushed time and time again by the Imperial Clans made him realize that he would be beaten if he didn’t have enough power.","If he was a Saint, what Imperial Clan would dare to speak loudly to him?","“Rapidly become stronger?” The Nine Mountains Saint murmured, “When I advance into Saint Tier, I can allow Regulations to enter my body, and forcibly use Regulations to improve your fruits of cultivation. It would indeed allow you to become Sect Master-level, or even Venerate Tier-level in the short term.”","“However, in this way, you will lose the possibility of advancing further.”","Of course, this was something that Ling Han definitely could not accept. Even the Nine Mountains Saint was just saying this. He was filled with anticipation for Ling Han. He was a potential candidate to become Emperor, so how could he stop at the level of Venerate Tier or even Sect Master-level?","“What else can I do?” Ling Han was unwilling to give up. With how big the heaven and earth was, how could it be that there was nothing that could perform a miracle?","The Nine Mountains Saint pondered for a moment, before saying, “There is indeed a place. However, that place is far too dangerous. Moreover, a Saint’s power is also insufficient. If you head there, you’ll have no option but to rely on yourself.”","“What place?” Ling Han’s eyes lit up.","“Dark Clouds Hell,” the Nine Mountains Saint said solemnly. “This is a desolate land of heaven and earth. It’s filled with all kinds of dangers. In the beginning, this was used as a place of exile. Many people committed serious crimes, yet they also had powerful backgrounds. Those who couldn’t be killed directly were thrown here.”","“But as time passed, someone actually built a city there, and that is... the City of Death!”","“The City of Death is filled with murderers and looters, all of whom are heinous criminals.”","“Thus, that place is naturally incredibly dangerous. Conflicts could break out at the slightest provocation, and people would be killed.”","“However, it’s said that the City of Death is very suitable for cultivating. It can increase one’s cultivation speed by ten times or even a hundred times. Thus, there are many people like you who took the initiative to enter the Dark Clouds Hell in order to quickly become stronger.”","“However, many people died in the Dark Clouds Hell before even finding the City of Death.”","Ling Han only considered for a moment, then said, “I want to go.”","The Nine Mountains Saint sighed. Though he was a little worried, he still supported Ling Han.","That was because he too knew that the Imperial Clans had not given up on killing Ling Han at all, and a conspiracy like the Zhu Clan would definitely not be just this one time. What if Ling Han was not so lucky next time?","Hence, only when he himself was strong, would he be able to fear nothing.","“All right, you have to be careful,” the Nine Mountains Saint reminded.","“I will.” Ling Han nodded. He was going to the Dark Clouds Hell to become stronger, so he could beat up the Imperial Clans as soon as possible. He naturally could not allow himself to be buried there.","“This horn.” The Nine Mountains Saint held that horn that could make one howl like a wolf, his eyes blazing, “According to my deduction, this horn is forged from the bones of a Great Emperor.”","What!","Ling Han was astonished. ‘F*ck! This background is huge!’ He had spent 20,000 Dao Stones to purchase a Great Emperor’s bone?","It should be known that when the Great Emperor was alive, he was extremely domineering, and was the overlord that had suppressed an era. After his death, would he be willing to allow others to trample over his remains?","Thus, the Great Emperor would usually bury himself in some desolate land, or in the Imperial Clan, or directly float in the Void. However, no matter where he was buried, the might of the Great Emperor would be able to shatter Saints, and others would not be able to approach at all.","Take, for example, the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. At that time, those Saints had also relied on the protection of the Imperial Weapon to enter into the body of the Great Emperor.","And this was still because that Holy Emperor had laid out a test, wanting to bestow the inheritance. Otherwise, so what if he possessed the Imperial Weapon? Didn’t you see how the Holy Emperor’s corpse finally broke through the Void and left on its own? Who could stop it?","Thus, Ling Han actually obtained a Great Emperor bone now, and it was even forgedinto a horn. This was really too shocking.","“It is definitely not a Saint that can forge the bone of a Great Emperor into a Spirit Tool,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. “Even if a hundred Saintd were added together, and even if the Imperial Weapon was used, it would still be impossible.”","The Great Emperor was invincible. This was not just empty words. Even after death, he could not be offended.","“Great Emperors don’t offend each other, and this is also an unwritten rule. No Great Emperor would destroy the grave of another Great Emperor and forge his remains into a Spirit Tool.” The Nine Mountains Saint continued, “Thus, this must have been forged from the bones that some Great Emperor had shed.”","Ling Han was astonished. This Great Emperor was truly open-minded. He had actually refined one of his bones into a tool and passed it onto his descendants!","However, as time passed, how had this top grade precious tool become a cheap item?","Er, don’t forget, wasn’t the heirloom of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor also bought at a streetside stall?","With this in mind, Ling Han didn’t find it strange anymore.","The Nine Mountains Saint helped Ling Han with his experiments. This bugle horn was ineffective against Saints, but even Venerate Tiers would be affected — they saw the two Venerates from the Nine Suns Holy Land were earnestly teaching Dao, they suddenly raised their heads and howled, causing the disciples beneath them to turn into stone. Ling Han and Nine Mountains Saint couldn’t help but laugh at this scene.","It was hard to tell that the Nine Mountains Saint also had a childish heart.","According to the deduction of the Nine Mountains Saint, because this horn was forged from the bones of an Emperor, it contained Regulations. Though it was not an Imperial Weapon, its practicality was still very high.","—For example, if he was being hunted down by an elite, and suddenly blew, that elite would immediately raise his head and howl like a wolf, and the crisis would naturally be resolved.","“Although it’s unreliable, it’s quite useful.” Ling Han nodded. Seeing as it was practical, he would endure it!","Next, he planned to go to the Dark Clouds Hell."]},{"number":4269,"title":"Chapter 4269: Entering the Black Hole","paragraphs":["Chapter 4269: Entering the Black Hole","Editor: Henyee Translations","On this trip to the Dark Clouds Hell, Ling Han did not plan to bring anyone with him.","It was too dangerous there. There were no rules or morals, and the only thing they adhered to was respect for the strong. Thus, Ling Han prepared to go alone. This way, he would have no worries, and it would be convenient for him to do things.","“Little Han, live well,” the large black dog said.","“Come back and fight again. Grandpa Dragon doesn’t believe that I can’t defeat you.” This was naturally the little azure dragon.","“Your wives, I will take care of.” This was the pervert pig.","Ling Han immediately shot out a foot, “Believe it or not, I will ask Old Man Nine Mountains to move, and crush you into dust?”","“Hehe.” The perverted pig hurriedly laughed. One couldn’t be too despicable, even if he was a pig.","The empress and Hu Niu were both reluctant to part with him. It wasn’t easy for Ling Han to finally return to the Nine Suns Holy Land to reunite with them. However, he hadn’t stayed for many days, and he was about to leave again.","Ling Han was also reluctant, but he had to be decisive.","Separating now was for the sake of a better reunion in the future. Without powerful strength, there was no need to mention anything else.","“Alright, remember to bring gifts when you come back!” Hu Niu pouted.","“Sure,” Ling Han said with a smile.","After bidding farewell, the Nine Mountains Saint set off with Ling Han, heading towards the Dark Clouds Hell.","This wasn’t in the North Heavenly Realm, but rather the South Heavenly Realm. They were really far apart. However, the Nine Mountains Saint was a Saint now, so how fast could he be? With a rip in space, it took onlt three days, and he had brought Ling Han to the South Heavenly Realm.","And this was a Saint at that. If it was an Ancestral King, he would be able to travel through the universe in a single day!","“This is the Dark Clouds Hell?” Ling Han was surprised, because they had not appeared on any planet, but rather in the universe.","It was complete darkness. There were no planets or stars, only eternal darkness. In fact, Ling Han felt a powerful attraction that wanted to draw him forwards. He could resist it, but there was a tearing feeling in his body.","Yi, what was going on here?","“There’s a black hole here,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. “After the sun dies, it’s possible for a black hole to form. It’ll grow from massive to infinitely tiny, and from there, it’ll also possess a powerful gravitational force. Even Regulations will warp.”","A thought suddenly occurred to Ling Han, “The Dark Clouds Hell is inside this black hole?”","“That’s right,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. “Thus, it’s easy to enter from here. You only have to give up your resistance and allow the black hole to draw you in, and you’ll naturally be able to enter. However, if you want to come out... you’ll have to reach the Venerate Tier to be able to break free from this gravitational pull.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. The Mountain Sea Heaven was also a sun, and had been refined by the great power of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor, then shrunk in size. Even the buildings there would be forcefully flattened, and Cauldron Forging Tier and Core Formation Tier were unable to fly, which showed how strong the gravity was.","The problem was how big was the Mountain Sea Heaven? And what about the black hole?","Hence, if one was sucked into this black hole, without power on the level of Venerate Tier, there was no way they could fight their way out.","“I’ll agree to a time with you. En, how about a time period of 10 years?” The Nine Mountains Saint said, “After 10 years, I’ll open up a passageway here to temporarily suppress the power of the black hole.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. Only Saints could be so powerful and suppress the gravitational pull of the black hole.","“Go on, be careful.” The Nine Mountains Saint looked at this disciple of his. Though he had not taken Ling Han as disciple all this while, in his heart, he had long since considered himself Ling Han’s master.","This disciple of his had never disappointed him. It had been like this in the past, and it was the same now. It would not change in the future.","Ling Han let go of his resistance. Xiu, he was instantly attracted by a powerful force, and headed towards a certain place in the universe.","The further he flew, the greater the gravitational pull was. When he reached a certain extent, Ling Han discovered that even if he resisted now, he would not be able to resist this kind of power, and could only leave it to fate.","He activated his mystical power shield to prevent the gravitational force from being too terrifying and tearing his physical body apart.","Ka, ka, ka! In just a short while, he discovered that a crack had appeared on the mystical power shield, which then shattered loudly. He hurriedly raised another mystical power shield. Though a cultivator of the Core Formation Tier wouldn’t die even if he entered, it was still best to be careful.","After an unknown amount of time, Ling Han suddenly saw a magnificent scene. In this place, light was distorted, and speed was ridiculously slow. He could easily capture it.","Ling Han was still being attracted. After another period of time, the gravitational pull disappeared, but in this place, aside from him, all other objects were torn into particles that were hard to see with the naked eye.","What about the Dark Clouds Hell?","Ling Han activated the mystical power in his body, and shot out a palm strike. Boom, his figure that had already stopped immediately began to move.","He swam in the black hole. The Dark Clouds Hell should be in some corner of this place.","Search.","If anyone else came here, they would definitely be extremely terrified, because the energy of heaven and earth here was all absorbed by the black hole. Even Venerate Tiers would be useless, as they would not be able to compete with the black hole at all. The mystical power would only become less and less.","Furthermore, even the Regulations here had been warped, and could not be used at all.","However, Ling Han was different. He had a frighteningly large reserve of mystical power. Even if he couldn’t replenish it in the slightest, it could still be used for a few years.","However, after a mere two days, he saw a stone door that was filled with a primitive aura.","There was actually a door inside the black hole!","Ling Han floated over, but did not immediately push open the doors and enter. Instead, he looked around.","However, looking at it this way, there was nothing special about it. There was only one word for it: ancient.","There was too much feeling of age. The stone doors were mottled, and it was unknown how many years they had been corroded by time.","Ling Han pushed open the door. The door was very heavy, but for him, it was no big deal. Very soon, it was pushed open a crack, allowing him to pass through.","However, he was curious, so he didn’t enter immediately. Instead, he continued to push.","Hong long long, even in this black hole, a loud sound was heard, as if a new world was being created.","So heavy!","When he had pushed open the doors halfway, even with Ling Han’s strength, he could not bear it any longer. It was as if what he was about to push open was not a door, but rather ten or even a hundred planets that were superimposed on one another.","He looked towards the doorway, but couldn’t see anything. There was only Primal Chaos.","This was the entrance to the Dark Clouds Hell?","Forget it, let’s go.","He leaned forward and entered the stone door. Hong long long, the stone door behind him slowly closed.","Ling Han walked forward. This place was filled with Primal Chaos. It couldn’t be considered dark. It was as if the universe had just been created. There was light, but it was still in the most primitive Primal Chaos.","After walking for two days, the path ahead of him suddenly became clear.","Ling Han couldn’t help but widen his eyes in disbelief.","That was because he had actually walked into a swamp.","In the skies, it was dusky, with heavy dark clouds. There were a small number of dark red clouds, which rendered the atmosphere very oppressive.","Ling Han looked behind him. That passageway was still there.","A swamp had actually appeared inside a black hole?","Ling Han found this to be inconceivable. He was even more curious. Who had discovered this place? What great elite would have nothing better to do, and crawl into a black hole for fun?","However, he had finally arrived at the Dark Clouds Hell."]},{"number":4270,"title":"Chapter 4270: Giant Swamp Scorpion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4270: Giant Swamp Scorpion","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was impossible to determine the location here.","There was no rising sun or setting moon, nor were there Regulations. This was an independent small world.","Ling Han sensed the ley lines, but shook his head. He couldn’t sense the ley lines here.","This meant that he had one less thing to rely on. However, Saints were unable to enter this place, and would be strongly rejected. Thus, if Venerate Tiers were in charge, then Ling Han would have the ability to protect himself with the help of the Great Emperor Horn.","Of course, he definitely couldn’t be careless, because Venerate Tiers were too powerful. If his reaction speed was slightly slower, and he couldn’t blow the horn in time, he would only be smacked into mush.","This thing could only catch save him by catching the other person off guard.","“So, the first thing to do is to keep a low profile,” Ling Han murmured. He definitely couldn’t attract the Venerate Tier elites’ hatred the moment he arrived. Then, he would only be able to hide here and there for the next ten years, so what was the point of talking about rapidly increasing his cultivation level?","“All right, begin searching for the City of Death.”","Ling Han set out, and began to advance.","Was this swamp made from blood clay?","Ling Han lowered his head to look. The ground was crimson red, and there was also a pungent smell of blood. He used his mystical power to form a hand, and grabbed a handful of dirt to observe. The more he thought about it, the more he felt that this was formed from blood and flesh.","“Yi?” He was surprised, because the hand formed from mystical power was actually rapidly corroding.","“Such powerful corrosive power,” Ling Han mused ruefully.","Thankfully, there was no terrifying gravity field suppression here, and there were Regulations that could be used. Flying was a piece of cake, so there was naturally no need to worry about being corroded by the mush.","“The Dark Clouds Hell is incredibly dangerous. It is possible that half of the people would die on the way before they could even find the City of Death.”","“Then, could it be that this blood clay is formed from the generations of people who have entered?”","Every year, a large number of people would be transferred into this space, and added with those prodigies that yearned for strength, the total number was really quite a lot.","Why were they exiled here, and not killed?","It was very simple. For example, the Imperial Son had a rare treasure that allowed him to communicate with his clan. Once he was killed, the Saint would be able to begin his prediction. It was clear who the culprit was, but if he was captured and thrown here, then no signal would be sent out. It was hard to know whether he would live or die.","Of course, there were really not many people that dared to trifle with the Imperial Clans. Thus, those that had been exiled here were mostly those from the Holy Land, Venerate Tier, and Sect Master-level forces, or those that had relations to these forces. They belonged to the category that could not be killed in the open.","This swamp stretched as far as the eye could see, so how many people had died to form it?","Ling Han sighed ruefully, and continued onwards. He had come for the sake of becoming stronger, and not to sigh ruefully.","However, which direction should he head in?","There was no north, south, east, and west here. Furthermore, even if he knew the direction, where should he go?","Ling Han merely headed in one direction. Worse come to worst, he would just walk around when he reached the end.","Peng!","All of a sudden, the mud in front of him split apart, and a dark red whip suddenly pierced out, ruthlessly piercing towards Ling Han.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over it. What whip was this? It was clearly the tail of a scorpion!","This was a sting from the tail, which was extraordinarily sharp and strong. It was covered with seals, and probably had great destructive power.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before retrieving a Three Star Spirit Tool. This was a hammer, a spoil of war that he had obtained previously. He then charged forward to block the attack.","Pu!","The scorpion’s tail pierced through the hammer.","F***, what terrifying destructive power.","This was a Three Star Spirit Tool, not some kind of toy.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, let go of the hammer, and threw a punch at the scorpion’s tail.","The punch landed solidly, and the straight scorpion sting was actually broken.","This time, the swamp below finally exploded. A massive scorpion suddenly burst out of the water, and added with its tail, its length exceeded three hundred meters. It was completely dark red in colour, covered densely with seals, all of which were glowing.","The sting on its tail had been broken, and it had gone mad from the pain!","Boom, the scorpion flicked its tail, and a powerful force assailed, instantly sending Ling Han flying.","What terrifying power.","Ling Han nodded. If a Core Formation Tier cultivator encountered this guy, they would definitely have no option but to flee. They wouldn’t even be qualified to oppose him, or they would definitely die.","He immediately charged back, using the Imperial Technique to battle fiercely with this scorpion.","In terms of power, it was indeed the scorpion that had the upper hand, but the fierce beast was only strong in terms of power, and did not know any celestial technique. Thus, with the advantage being equal, it was only equal in strength to Ling Han.","As they fought, this scorpion’s sting also recovered. Shua, it rapidly stabbed towards Ling Han again.","This was its deadly weapon, possessing a frightening effect of penetrating through defense, and as long as one was pierced by its sting, the frighteningly strong poison would instantly destroy one’s vitality. This was poison on the level of Regulations.","“Are you seeking death?” Ling Han asked with a smile. Weng! The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared before him.","Peng!","The sting of the tail stabbed forth, bringing with it a frightening power. It would be able to create a small hole even in Four Star Divine Metal, and a small hole was enough. As long as it could break through the defenses, it would be able to inject strong poison.","But the problem was, what kind of existence was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower?","Origin Gold!","With this stab, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower remained unmoved, but its sting was once again broken, and this time was even worse. Previously, it had only bent slightly, and now, it was directly broken, leaving only a sliver that was still connected.","This caused the giant scorpion so much pain that it began to attack madly.","Ling Han was unafraid. If you can break through the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, then you win.","With the help of this Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, Ling Han easily killed the giant scorpion.","“This meat... is definitely not delicious!” Ling Han looked at the giant scorpion’s corpse slowly sinking into the swamp with a pained expression.","Ordinarily, the meat of fierce beasts would definitely be very fresh and delicious, but this giant scorpion lived in the blood clay all year round. Would he dare to eat this meat?","It was more or less equivalent to eating human flesh, and it was rotten at that.","Forget it. No matter how much he craved it, he couldn’t eat it.","Ling Han sighed, and could only continue onwards.","However, there were really quite a number of giant scorpions in this swamp. Not long after, another sting assailed him, planning to nail him to death on the spot.","There was no need to be reserved. They could only battle.","The battle continued, and after eleven days, Ling Han finally charged out of the swamp. However, there was no path ahead of him. The way ahead was enveloped by a ball of Primal Chaos, and he could not advance further. That Primal Chaos had a powerful rebound, and could not be entered at all.","Ling Han wasn’t disappointed. In the first place, he had wanted to walk around the swamp to take a look if there was no path out of it.","And after so many days, Ling Han had battled countless times, and his cultivation level had actually improved greatly.","“As expected, I am born to battle.”","Walking around the swamp, he naturally wouldn’t encounter the giant scorpions. Thus, even though the path around the outer circle was longer, because he didn’t need to battle, his speed was even faster. In just four days, he circled around about a quarter of the distance.","Ahead of him, a path had appeared.","It was no longer a swamp, but a forest.","He had finally found the right direction.","Ling Han took a few steps forwards, then stopped, and stared at these trees.","Hiss, the branches of these trees were actually covered with bones!"]},{"number":4271,"title":"Chapter 4271: Black shadow","paragraphs":["Chapter 4271: Black shadow","Editor: Henyee Translations","These white bones corresponded to different living beings.","There were humans, beasts, and some from half-humans and half-beasts. The corresponding remains of practically all the races that could be found in the universe could be found here.","How had these living beings died?","If they had been killed by someone, why had they been hung on a tree? Could it be some kind of ceremony of the natives?","Or perhaps, these trees... were man-killing demonic trees in the first place?","It was possible.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them. Remains hung on every tree. Only the amount differed.","A feeling of danger rose up in his heart, but he did not have the slightest intention of retreating. His figure flashed through the air, and continued onwards.","Everything was peaceful.","Ling Han was astounded as he flew through the air. He hadn’t come across any danger at all, so could it be that all he saw were illusions?","Kuang!","Right at this moment, a blood-colored bolt of lightning suddenly struck directly at him. Its speed was astonishingly fast, and as soon as the light was seen, it had already struck Ling Han’s head, instantly blasting him down from midair.","Thankfully, though the speed of this lightning was fast, its destructive power was only so-so. Ling Han did not land completely on the ground. He adjusted his position, and maintained the height of his flight.","Where had this lightning struck from?","Ling Han looked up at the sky. Most of the clouds here were dusky, but a few of them were blood-red. It was one of those clouds that had shot out blood-colored lightning, almost blasting him out of the sky.","Could it be that those corpses on the tree were the living beings that had been struck down by the lightning, and coincidentally hung on the trees?","He had not even finished the thought, when he heard a sharp cry, and a dark cloud appeared ahead of him.","No, it wasn’t clouds; it was birds!","A large flock of strange birds, all with three heads, were flying towards Ling Han at an extremely fast speed.","In just a short while, they had already drawn close. They stretched out their claws that were like Divine Metal, flickering with the cold light of metal, as they grabbed out at Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han exchanged a blow with a strange bird, and was already aware that the strength of this strange bird was inferior to his, but the problem was that it was not just one, but rather a whole flock of them!","With so many strange birds attacking him at the same time, even Ling Han wouldn’t be able to block them. He would be torn to pieces.","Ling Han hurriedly descended, but before he had even landed on the ground, those trees actually stretched out their branches towards him. They were like chains, wanting to entangle him.","‘F*ck! I’m surrounded by enemies!’","No wonder this place was called hell. It was really too unfriendly.","Ling Han channeled the Heavenly Dao Flames, and began a battle with these Tree Demons. Boom, the flames blazed, making the Tree Demons very wary, and not daring to push him too far.","However, was there no end to this?","In the sky, the three strange birds circled around and didn’t go away. Below him, the Tree Demons waved their vines and attacked endlessly, as if they wouldn’t give up unless they killed him.","Who was afraid of who!","Ling Han’s left hand channelled the Heavenly Dao Flames, while his right hand stimulated the Destructive Energy. He had now grasped five corners of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, which was more than half, and was enough to unleash the might of the Destructive Energy.","Boom!","This high-level energy was too terrifying. Even if it was limited by Ling Han’s cultivation level, it still exploded with terrifying might, blasting those Tree Demons until they uprooted themselves and fled in all directions.","However, these creatures were really hard to deal with. Even if they fled, the other Tree Demons still blocked his path, and pushed him to the extent that he had to get serious.","After battling continuously for two days, even Ling Han felt a sliver of weariness.","His mystical power was still endless, but his spirit was weary.","Right at this moment, a sheet of darkness swept over from the distance.","This place was indeed very dim, but it was only dim, and not complete darkness. However, what swept over was pure darkness, as if it had swallowed up the forest in the distance, and nothing could be seen.","Boom! In an instant, the three-headed strange birds hovering in the sky all descended in panic, landing on the tree branches one after another. Meanwhile, the Tree Demons also became quiet, no longer attacking. It was as if they had become ordinary trees.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised. What did this darkness mean? It actually made the strange birds and Demonic Trees become so obedient?","He had not even finished the thought, when the darkness was already surging over fiercely, drowning Ling Han completely.","It was pitch black.","This was Ling Han’s only feeling. In this kind of darkness, he really couldn’t even see his own fingers. Even if he ignited the Heavenly Dao Flames, he still couldn’t see any light.","All of a sudden, he felt a terrifying chill, as if something was crawling on his back. A cold chill shot over, causing his hair to stand on end.","What the hell?","“Scram!” he shouted loudly. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared, instantly releasing streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. Even this darkness could not conceal the brilliance of the Origin Gold.","Ling Han turned his head slightly, and saw a head lying next to his left ear, but this really was just a head. It was incredibly black, and his features and hair could not be seen at all.","When Ling Han looked over, this head immediately cracked open, revealing a blood-red area, as it bit out at Ling Han.","Hehe.","Ling Han blew the Great Emperor Horn, and an invisible wave rippled out. That head immediately raised its neck, and howled at the skies, but did not release the slightest sound.","He took advantage of the opening to shake, and sent the other flying.","It was a human-shaped black shadow, but it seemed to be made of pure darkness. It only had the outline of a human figure. It had a face but no facial features. It had hands but no fingers, and looked indescribably evil.","Ghost?","Ling Han shook his head. Though this was very similar to a Yin soul, there was a sliver of life about it. It was not something from the Netherworld.","The black shadow faltered for a moment. What was going on? Why did he have to imitate the howl of a wolf?","It should be known that it couldn’t even make a sound, so why would it have the urge to bark like a wolf?","“Who cares what you are? I’ll blast you apart!” Ling Han shouted loudly. Boom, Destructive Energy surged all over his body.","Shua, shua, shua! More black shadows appeared, as if there were endless black shadows hidden in this darkness. All of them were staring at Ling Han.","All of a sudden, they all launched attacks at Ling Han.","“Let’s see if you’re ghosts or not!” Ling Han unleashed a murderous aura attack. Weng! The movements of the black shadows faltered, and even their faces twisted.","They didn’t have facial features, so their entire faces were twisted, making for a very strange sight.","“Just take on the barrage of murderous aura!” Ling Han charged over, swinging his fists in a series of punches.","Boom! Destructive Energy surged, and he unleashed his full battle prowess.","Even the Demonic Trees and the strange birds were very wary of these black shadows, but they were completely restrained by Ling Han. Under the barrage of the murderous aura, their battle prowess was greatly weakened. Then, with a blast from Destructive Energy, they dispersed one after another.","However, the darkness was like a tidal wave, and there was still no end to this black shadow.","Ling Han finally understood why the Demonic Trees and the strange birds had to retreat. That was because there were really too many black shadows, and no one could stop them. That was because most of them were in the skies. Thus, when they landed, they could dodge for a while. As long as they did not make any noise, they would not attract any aggro.","However, even though he knew this, he had no intention of fleeing.","Wasn’t this kind of bloody battle what he desired?","Only in battle would he be able to grow rapidly.","‘Come!’"]},{"number":4272,"title":"Chapter 4272: Stone House in the Forest","paragraphs":["Chapter 4272: Stone House in the Forest","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han fought bloody battles fiercely, and fought fiercely with those black shadow creatures whose origins were unknown.","Even if his battle prowess was formidable, and he himself could disperse attacks within six Heavens, as well as having an incredibly tough physique, faced with so many black shadow shadow creatures, he was still injured.","If they weren’t powerful enough, how could the Tree Demons and the three-headed strange birds avoid them?","Thankfully, this darkness continued to surge forwards, and lasted for about half a day’s time. Finally, all of it had passed.","Once the darkness disappeared, those black shadows also disappeared, as if they could only live in darkness.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief, and flopped onto the ground.","Tired, this was really too tiring. He had not just battled with the black shadow creatures for half a day. Previously, there had also been three-headed strange birds.","Yi?","Ling Han swept an eye over them, and saw that half of those three-headed strange birds had disappeared from the top of the trees, and the remaining ones had seemingly turned into stone statues. They did not immediately flap their wings and fly away, or attack Ling Han.","There was no benefit to be gained from killing these living beings. If they did not take the initiative to attack him, he had no intention of attacking either.","Forget it.","He recovered for a moment, then strode forwards.","After experiencing the havoc caused by the darkness, peace returned to this mountain forest for a short while. Whether it was the strange birds or the Demonic Trees, they all seemed to be sleeping.","No wonder.","Ling Han nodded. If there was no such peaceful time, then how many of the people who entered here would be able to find the City of Death alive?","After walking for a while, Ling Han actually discovered a stone house. It was especially simple and crude, and didn’t even have a table. It was empty, and pitifully small.","He searched for a while, but did not find anything inside.","This should have been left behind by predecessors, but what was the point of building a stone house in this man-eating forest?","Could it be that there would be people resting here?","He had already stepped onto the Celestial Path, so did he still need a place to shelter himself from the wind and rain?","Ling Han didn’t discover any abnormalities. He shook his head, and strode forward.","Another half day passed, and those Demonic Trees were once again “revived”. They began to launch attacks at Ling Han, but as they fought, darkness invaded again, just like before.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and faced off against the darkness, showing his boldness.","Yi?","He charged forward for a while, and couldn’t help but feel surprised, because he saw light.","What was going on?","Ling Han continued forward, and very soon, he discovered the source of the light. It was actually a stone house!","It was not much different from the stone house he had previously discovered. It was just a few stones pieced together, but now, every stone was exuding a gentle light. Though it was not bright at all, in this absolute darkness, it was enough to illuminate and warm the world.","Ling Han charged over, and entered into the stone house. He saw darkness whizzing past the doors, and multiple black faceless faces stopped at the doors. They peered inside for a while, and then whizzed off again.","This was a shelter.","Ling Han finally understood why there was such a stone house in the forest. This wasn’t to block the wind and rain, but to avoid being swallowed by the darkness.","He indeed didn’t need it. With his strength, he was completely capable of resisting the countless living beings in the darkness, but not everyone was as awesome as he was. Furthermore, there were still a great many Core Formation Tier cultivators that had entered here, so how could they resist?","What made Ling Han curious was, who had built this stone house?","Most of the people who had entered this place had been exiled. Who would be so kind as to actually build stone houses here to protect others?","Ling Han stretched out a hand to touch the stones. Previously, he had already studied them, but had not gained any results, and it was the same now. Though these stones were exuding a dim light, they were really very ordinary, as if they were mere rocks.","Half a day later, the darkness passed.","Ling Han tried to dismantle the building. These rocks were simply piled up, forming a house—actually, it would be more accurate to call it a stone box. Thus, as long as he took away the large rock at the top, there would be nothing above his head.","He stretched out a hand and squeezed, easily crushing a corner of the rock, as if he was picking out tofu.","It wasn’t that the stone wasn’t hard enough, but that it was completely inadequate in front of Ling Han.","Ling Han was certain that the strength of this stone was no different from ordinary stones.","But why could this form a shield in the darkness?","Ling Han was confused. He couldn’t figure it out no matter what.","After studying it for a while, Ling Han continued on his way. He couldn’t stay here and study it for the rest of his life just because he didn’t understand, right?","This forest was very big, and they would be able to find a stone house every once in a while. Thus, as long as he calculated the time accurately, one could actually pass through this forest without fighting a single battle.","After passing a few stone houses, when Ling Han arrived at the next stone house, he began to dig.","Perhaps the mystery of the stone house was not in itself, but rather in the ground beneath it.","However, after digging a few times, liquid gushed out.","At first, Ling Han thought that it was an underground spring, but when he saw the liquid gushing out clearly, he frowned.","That was blood!","After digging a few times, bright red blood actually gushed out. This was a little terrifying.","What was going on here? And how many people had died here? It was somewhat similar to the swamp.","He looked at the stone house, and with a thought, he immediately moved, tearing down this stone house and shattering every single stone.","Then, he left.","A day later, Ling Han ran back, but what he saw dumbfounded him.","That was because the stone house that had been torn to pieces was actually standing there again.","How was this possible?","It could not be that this stone house also had the ability to recover on its own. Ling Han didn’t believe it at all. Then who had come over and secretly rebuilt the stone house?","Just thinking about it caused him to feel a chill in his heart, yet a strong curiosity also surged up in him.","He moved again, and dismantled the stone house. Then, he did not leave, and simply waited there.","Nothing happened. The Tree Demons didn’t move, and the three-headed strange birds didn’t attack either. It was as if this was an extremely ordinary mountain forest.","Yi? Yi? Yi?","Could it be that because he was here, the miracle would not be performed?","Ling Han was just about to leave for the moment, then quietly circle back and hide at the side to keep an eye on things. However, darkness was sweeping over from ahead of him.","Prepare for battle!","Ling Han raised his fists. Right at this moment, he saw an inconceivable scene. An old man in grey robes quietly appeared. His hair was also greyish white, and his back was stooped, making him look extremely old.","This caused Ling Han to break out in a cold sweat, because he did not see where this old man had popped out from.","What was going on?","The grey-robed old man walked to the side of the original stone house, and picked up the stones that were scattered on the ground. As if building blocks, he stacked them one by one, and very soon, a simple stone house appeared.","In this process, the grey-robed old man did not cast a second look at Ling Han, but after the stone house was built, he walked in. Then, he turned around and smiled at Ling Han, quietly hiding inside.","This smile caused Ling Han’s hair to stand on end.","This was too bizarre."]},{"number":4273,"title":"Chapter 4273: Strange Old Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 4273: Strange Old Man","Editor: Henyee Translations","Only now did Ling Han realize that though the speed at which the darkness was invading was astonishingly fast, and the grey-robed elder’s speed was very slow, right after he had built the stone house, the darkness actually had not surged over yet.","Boom, right at this moment, endless darkness assaulted.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before dashing toward the stone house.","His curiosity was really too great. He wanted to know what exactly was going on here.","However, after he entered the stone house, he shockingly discovered that there was no sign of the old man here.","Only this simple stone house was exuding a soft light, as if it was telling him that what Ling Han had experienced previously was not a dream, but a real and genuine matter.","Where was he?","He had vanished into thin air, just like how he had appeared out of thin air.","Ling Han released his divine sense, but his divine sense was completely useless in the darkness. It had been completely cut off.","What about underground?","It was useless. It was as if his divine sense had touched a layer of elastic film, and could not surge out at all.","Blood clay?","Ling Han frowned at this. Where had this grey-robed elder come from? Who was he? Why had he come to repair this stone house?","When the darkness had passed, Ling Han destroyed the stone house again, and this time, he shattered every single rock.","Then, he waited.","A day passed, and darkness arrived as promised.","The grey-robed old man appeared once more. This time, Ling Han watched closely. He was still unable to catch a trace of the old man. It was as if he had been here all this while, and he had only just discovered him.","Hehe, now that the stones have all turned into dust, what are you going to do?","However, the grey-robed old man merely stretched out a hand and pressed down. The rock dust all over the ground rose up, and then condensed together. Then, multiple large rocks appeared once more.","Just like yesterday, the old man slowly built the stone house.","This time, Ling Han could clearly see that the speed of the assault of darkness seemed to have slowed down tens of thousands of times in an instant. Including his movements, it was as if they had been frozen. Only the old man’s slow movements were completely unaffected.","Was it some kind of power of Regulation?","Ling Han thought quickly. As long as he had completely grasped the Regulations of Earth, it would naturally be an incredibly simple matter for the rock to transform from dust into solid form.","But this would have to be the cultivation level of a Saint, at least.","This grey-robed elder was a Saint?","What kind of joke was this? This place repelled Saints. Otherwise, Old Man Nine Mountains would definitely be happy to accompany him here, and protect this extremely important disciple of his.","Furthermore, did a Saint have nothing to do, to spend all his time building stone houses here?","Ling Han was extremely curious. Seeing that the stone house was about to be built, he hurriedly stretched out his figure and headed towards the stone house.","However, though the old man’s speed was slow, he was even slower. He had clearly used Imminent Skyline, yet he was crawling towards the stone house at an extremely slow speed like a tortoise.","At this time, the grey-robed old man had finished constructing the stone house. He turned his head, and smiled at Ling Han. The smile was incredibly strange, causing Ling Han to shiver all over.","Xiu, his speed suddenly sped up. No, it should be said that it was as if the effect of slowing down time had already disappeared, and he had returned to his normal speed.","Ling Han entered the stone house, yet he didn’t see the grey-robed elder again.","He shook his head. The grey-robed old man’s cultivation level should be far above him, and from the fact that he could slow down the time of others, it could be seen that the gap was really as wide as the sky.","This place... seemed to have very deep waters.","Ling Han stayed in the stone house for a long time. When it was “light” again, he didn’t cause any more damage to the stone house, because it was meaningless.","He set out again, wanting to get out of here as soon as possible.","Ahead of him, there were still multiple stone houses. After spending seven days, Ling Han finally walked out of the forest.","A great river appeared in front of him. It was only three hundred meters wide, but was incredibly long, as far as the eye could see.","Ling Han walked to the bank of the river, and saw a black-colored gas surge above the river, turning into multiple figures. There were old and young, men and women, as if all the forms in the world could be seen here.","He walked along the river, and headed upstream.","After walking for a while, he suddenly saw a small boat in the river ahead of him.","Yi?","He looked closely. This ship was really very small. It was more suitable to call it a raft, and there was only a single person on the raft. Judging by the figure, it should be a man. He wore a bamboo hat on his head, and held a long pole in his hand.","Ling Han felt a sense of absurdity. In such a strange river, there was actually a boatman?","The small boat sailed with the flow of the river, so its speed was naturally fast. In an instant, it had arrived near Ling Han. The boatman raised the bamboo hat and glanced at Ling Han.","Ling Han’s heart involuntarily clenched. The eyes of this boatman were all turbid white, and his skin was greenish white, as if he was a corpse that had been dead for many years.","Shua, the small raft was very fast, and was already rapidly sailing past.","What was going on with this Dark Clouds Hell?","Endless curiosity welled up in Ling Han’s heart. However, he knew that his present cultivation level was too weak, and he was not qualified to investigate all of this at all.","“Become stronger! Become stronger!”","He suppressed all his curiosity, and strode forwards.","Because there were a great many people that had entered into the Dark Clouds Hell to train in the City of Death, though most of these people had died inside, there was also a small number that had left alive. Naturally, there would be some information about the Dark Clouds Hell.","Thus, Ling Han knew that as long as he followed this river, the City of Death would be at the end.","He walked and walked. Though the journey was long, thankfully, he did not encounter any enemies. Nine days later, Ling Han finally arrived at the end of the river.","An incredibly majestic city appeared ahead of him, and the river was flowing from a corner of the city wall.","The City of Death.","This was really a large city. Even with Ling Han’s vision, he could not see the end of it in a single glance. It was completely wrapped within a black metallic city wall.","Precisely because of this, Ling Han was also unable to easily enter. He walked around the city, and after walking for quite a while, he finally found the city gates.","He strode over, only to see a group of people standing guard at the city gates. They were all at the Foundation Building Tier.","Foundation Building Tiers were guarding the gates, so it could be said that his lineup was quite luxurious.","However, it should bethat only those at the Core Formation Tier and above could come here alive. Otherwise, the black hole from before would be enough to tear people into pieces.","Thus, these people were either brought in by elites, or were natives of this place.","—After innumerable years, this City of Death had grown from nothing, and was created out of thin air. Furthermore, generations of people who had entered had also settled down here, and given birth to descendants, who would grow and multiply.","“Yi, are you new here, brat?” Seeing Ling Han approach, the guards looked at him for a while, then asked.","Ling Han smiled, “I don’t have any words engraved on my face, so how do you guys know that I’m new here?”","“Brat, your face is so fair, I can tell with a single look that you are an outsider!” A guard laughed, “After another month, if you are not dead, and if you still look like this, I will chop off my d*ck and give it to you.”"]},{"number":4274,"title":"Chapter 4274: Understanding the Situation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4274: Understanding the Situation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han smiled, “I am indeed an outsider. Everyone, do you have any good suggestions for me?”","He didn’t have the slightest understanding of the City of Death, so he naturally couldn’t rashly barge in recklessly.","A few Dao Stones were gifted out, and instantly, these guards were all smiles, becoming incredibly attentive.","In truth, though Ling Han’s cultivation level was far higher than theirs, they were also people with powerful backers. If Ling Han dared to commit violence, it would be equivalent to embarrassing the Lord backing them. Then, no matter what Core Formation Tier or True Self Tier you were, you would only be blasted into smithereens.","—No matter how powerful his background was in the outside world, it was completely useless here. Even an Imperial Son had to behave himself.","Ling Han didn’t use his cultivation level to suppress them. Instead, he called them brothers, and even took out something as good as Dao Stones, which naturally made them enthusiastic.","Right now, the City of Death was divided into five major forces, and they were all at the Venerate Tier.","These five Venerates were the Ice Silkworm Venerate, the Nine Palace Venerate, the Blood Crow Venerate, the Crimson Moon Venerate, and the Brahman Sea Bodhisattva. The five Venerates led the almost ninety percent of the City of Death’s population, and the remaining portion was divided among the other forces.","The guards at the entrance belonged to the force under Crimson Moon Venerate. Even though they didn’t have much power, if anyone really dared to touch them, that would be equivalent to provoking Crimson Moon Venerate, and there would naturally be great elites who would move to suppress them.","In this place, aside from Dao Stones, there was also an even more valuable cultivation type divine material. It looked no different from a stone, and was covered with blood-colored patterns. If one used it for cultivation, it could increase one’s cultivation level extremely quickly, comparable to natural treasures.","This kind of cultivation DIvine Material was called the Source Dao Stone, because its effects were about the same as the Dao Stone, but a few hundred times better.","The Source Dao Stone was controlled by the five Venerate Tier elites. If one wanted to obtain it, their first priority was naturally to join the forces of the five Venerate Tier elites. After reaching a certain level or having performed a great merit, they would be rewarded.","The second was trading, using a large number of Dao Stones to buy it, or other treasures, such as Great Herbs, precious ingredients, and so on.","Finally, it was also the method that the majority would adopt, and that was to fight on the tournament stage.","After obtaining a certain number of victories, they would be rewarded with the Source Dao Stone, and if they won consecutively, they would also receive additional rewards.","B-but, this tournament stage battle was incredibly cruel, and would cause severe injury at the slightest provocation. After the tournament, losing an arm or a leg was a common occurrence, and there was no small number of people who were carried out every day.","However, this was the fastest way to obtain Source Dao Stones. Moreover, one didn’t need to walk on eggshells around others. As long as one had enough abilities, they could obtain it. Thus, this was also the most commonly used method.","After Ling Han thanked these guards, he entered the City of Death.","First, he had to find a place to settle down.","Previously, the guards had also told him about a very important matter, and that was though there was no difference of day and night in the City of Death, because they were all descendants of outsiders, they were used to the concept of day and night.","At midnight, a terrifying cold wind would blow through the entire city, easily freezing people to death.","Thus, at this time, aside from the Sect Master and Venerate Tier-level great elites, the others could only stay at home obediently. Going out would only be seeking death.","The strange thing was that as long as the structures were built from the stones of the City of Death, no matter how simple and crude they were, they would be able to resist the cold wind.","This kind of stone material had long since been distributed. It was completely impossible for him to get some stones himself to build a simple house.","Thus, he could only find an inn first.","Staying in an inn was paid for in Dao Stones. Of course, you could also use Source Dao Stones, but there shouldn’t be anyone that would be so stupid.","Ling Han followed the information provided by the guards, and soon found an inn.","“The Spiritual Rain Inn.” He glanced at the plaque on the inn’s door, then strode in.","This inn was very big, and had a continuous stretch of rooms. Furthermore, there were also many people living here. People came and went, appearing to be very lively.","Ling Han’s arrival didn’t attract anyone’s attention. In the outside world, he was the renowned freak, and only the Golden Generation, Ding Shu, and a few other people could match his natural talent.","But in this place, no one recognized him.","He was an extremely ordinary person.","Ling Han asked for a guest room. The accommodations here were astonishingly expensive. Staying for a night actually cost a hundred Dao Stones; it was really no different from robbing money.","But there was nothing that could be done. The cold winds could kill, and unless you were Sect Master-level, you could only obediently allow yourself to be slaughtered.","—What, just stay and then run without paying?","Do you know who this inn belongs to?","Crimson Moon Venerate!","To dare to stay and leave without paying at the inn belonging to a Venerate Tier, he was really tired of living.","Ling Han paid for a month of accommodations in advance. What he lacked the least now was the Dao Stones. Although he had used up all the Universe Coins in his Galaxy Network’s account, he still had a lot on him.","After resolving the problem, Ling Han began to find out about the specific situation of the tournament stage battles.","This kind of battle was conducted at a set location. In the Dark Battlefield of the city, participating in the battle did not require any fee, and it was the same for watching the battles. However, whether it was battle or watching the battles, they would all be facing extremely great danger.","That was because there were no restrictions here. If the shockwaves from the attacks blasted out, it was possible that the spectators would be severely injured, or even killed.","And there was no referee in battle. If one wanted to win, the opponent would either have to admit defeat, or one would have to beat his opponent to death.","It was said that this Dark Battlefield was jointly controlled by the five Venerate Tier elites, so no one dared to cause trouble.","This caused Ling Han to feel curious. If there were no benefits to be gained, why would the five Venerate Tier elites do something so superfluous?","Was it just to add a little entertainment for everyone after their meals?","In reality, Ling Han was more interested in finding out where the Source Dao Stones had been mined from. If he knew where it was, he would directly dig it up.","This matter naturally had to be considered at length. However, it was true that one could obtain the Source Dao Stones by fighting on the tournament stage.","Ling Han took a look. Every time he won three battles, he would be able to obtain a Source Dao Stone, which was about the size of a segment of his pinky. It was pitifully little, and if he won ten battles in a row, he would be able to win a fist-sized Source Dao Stone. These two methods could be compounded.","There were two types of tournament stage battles. One was a battle of equal minor level, and the other was a battle of equal cultivation levels. If one could defeat an opponent whose cultivation level was higher than his, he would be able to obtain additional marks, which would increase the size of the Source Dao Stone that he had won.","Additionally, one was allowed to admit defeat in the tournament, but after the number of times he had admitted defeat had accumulated to three times, he would be punished to not be able to fight on the Dark Battlefield again for half a year.","Thus, as long as there was a chance of turning the tables, the participants would also try their best. This undoubtedly increased the risk, causing even more people to be injured or even die.","After Ling Han found out about all this, he took a good rest. On the second day, he rushed to the Dark Battlefield to register.","He chose to battle at the same cultivation level, not minding that his opponent’s cultivation level was higher than his.","In a short while, he received news that he could enter the arena for a battle.","He entered, and saw that this Dark Battlefield was very big, and could accommodate at least ten groups of people battling at the same time. Furthermore, there was not only a one-on-one battle here, there was also a one-on-many battle, and many against many. It was divided into different battle areas."]},{"number":4275,"title":"Chapter 4275: Battle Begins","paragraphs":["Chapter 4275: Battle Begins","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the short amount of time that Ling Han had walked to his own battle area, he had seen at least three people killed. One had been beheaded, one had been sliced in half, and the last was even worse, directly smashed into a bloody mess.","It was really bloody and cruel.","He stood firmly in his own area of battle, and his opponent had already walked over. He was wearing heavy armour, and appeared to be very clumsy.","“Brat, you’re dead!” the armored man said. He was tall and sturdy, and was at least a head taller than Ling Han.","True Self Tier, fifth form.","Ling Han nodded internally. This meant that he had the potential to break through to Sect Master-level. Of course, having potential was one matter, and being able to become Sect Master was another matter.","“Come on.” He crooked a finger.","This armored man was filled with killing intent, and it was definitely not something that had been formed overnight. Instead, it was an aura that had naturally formed after experiencing who knew how much bloodshed.","It was said that the City of Death was a slaughterhouse, and it was indeed true. He had just entered, and he was already experiencing it for real.","“Die!” The armored man leaped up, brandishing the heavy shield in his hands, and ruthlessly smashed it towards Ling Han.","Peng!","His attack missed its target, yet he simply bared his teeth in a grin. He then charged toward Ling Han like a vicious bear.","This place greatly limited their speed.","Right now, the speed that Ling Han could unleash was only one-ten-thousandth of his usual speed. This was understandable. After all, there was a limit to the space on the arena. If he were to unleash his full speed, he would be able to leave this place in a single stride. That being the case, what was the point of fighting?","Now, everyone’s speed had decreased drastically, and was limited to this.","He temporarily did not counterattack, but rather observed the strength of this opponent.","At the same time, in the VIP seats of the spectators.","“Young Master Yao, your subordinate, this fierce general, has already achieved nine successive wins. If he wins another battle, he would be able to obtain ten consecutive wins, and receive an exorbitant reward,” a young man said. The person he was talking to was also a young man. He was dressed in yellow robes, his face filled with arrogance.","The yellow-robed young man revealed a proud expression, yet deliberately waved his hand, “It’s just a small profit. A mere C-grade Source Dao Stone is not worthy of my notice.”","“Only Young Master Yao would be so generous,” the first young man praised.","The yellow-robed young man was proud, appearing to be in a very good mood.","But very quickly, the smile on his face disappeared.","That was because Ling Han had launched a counterattack.","This armored man’s battle prowess was extraordinary. Being able to advance into the fifth form meant that he had the potential to become a Sect Master elite. However, his original power was only twenty-five Heavens, and he had only used a very ordinary celestial technique, which boosted his battle prowess by two Heavens.","Thus, how could battle prowess merely at 27 Heavens possibly be a match for Ling Han?","The reason why he had not counterattacked for so long was because Ling Han wanted to see if there was anything special about the fifth form, which could be considered as having broken through his limits.","However, what disappointed him was the fact that the other party came and went in such a showy manner, far inferior to the giant scorpions in the swamp, the strange birds in the forest, and the Demonic Trees.","Ling Han lost interest, and with a casual flick of his finger, peng, the armored man was sent backwards, collapsing onto the ground. All the bones in his body were trembling, and for the moment, he could not get up at all.","“Are you admitting defeat?” Ling Han asked calmly. There was no animosity between them, and he wasn’t interested in taking his life.","On the spectators’ seats, the expression of the yellow-robed young man became very ugly. He humphed coldly, and called out loudly, “Kill him, or you will die!”","When the armored man heard this, he couldn’t help but shudder. It was unknown where he had gotten the power from, but he suddenly slammed into the ground, raising his shield and smashing it towards Ling Han.","Ling Han frowned, and threw a punch.","Peng!","His fist directly shattered the shield, and as the power of his fist surged, pu, the head of the armored man was shattered.","This time, the victor was finally decided.","Ling Han raised his head to look at the spectators’ seats, focusing on that yellow-robed young man.","The yellow-robed young man exchanged a glance with Ling Han, revealing a cold smirk. Then, he averted his gaze.","He didn’t take Ling Han seriously at all.","“Young Master Yao!” The young man beside him was a little embarrassed. He had just been boasting about how heroic and mighty the other’s lackey was, and in the end, he was killed with a single punch to the head.","This young man’s name was Liu Yao, and he himself was only in the Core Formation Tier. However, his father was a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite, and was the subordinate of Yuan Xinrong, one of the Seven Generals under the Blood Crow Venerate. Thus, Liu Yao also befriended some second-generation young masters, and it was inevitable that he would become arrogant.","Liu Yao’s expression was slightly ugly. As long as this subordinate of his won another battle, he would be able to obtain the reward of ten consecutive wins. Though he had spoken very lightly, a C-grade Source Dao Stone was enough for him to spend for a few months.","Now, because of Ling Han’s appearance, his wealth was gone.","“Go and find out who this brat is,” Liu Yao commanded.","“Yes.” The other young man hurriedly bowed and left.","Not long after, he returned.","“Young Master Yao, this is a rookie called Ling Han.”","Because he was a rookie, there was naturally pitifully little information.","Liu Yao smirked coldly, “To dare to kill one of my men, fine, I’ll let him take his place!”","The other young man couldn’t help but curse internally. Wasn’t this all because of your command? Otherwise, Ling Han would have long since stopped. It was you who wanted the two of them to fight to the death.","Of course, he didn’t dare to say it out loud. He said softly, “Those who aren’t ferocious dragons don’t cross the river. Most of the people who come in from outside to train have powerful backgrounds.”","“What are you afraid of!” Liu Yao glared at him, “Even if it is the Imperial Clan, they would have to listen obediently when they come here! This is the Dark Clouds Hell, the City of Death, and in this place, it is the five Venerate Tiers that have the final say. Whatever Imperial Clan, whatever Holy Land, they all have to behave themselves.”","“Yes, yes, yes. Young Master Yao is right.” That young man hurriedly nodded continuously.","“Go, call him over.” Liu Yao waved him off.","The young man hurriedly nodded and left. His status was low, so he could only do as he was told.","After Ling Han won a battle, he would be considered to have successfully settled in on the Dark Battlefield. In future, as long as there was a suitable opponent, they would inform him to participate. He had no right to refuse, but he could admit defeat during the tournament.","He was just about to leave, when he saw a young man dressed in robes approach him.","“Can I have a word with you?” the young man asked.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Your Master wants to see me?” He could see very clearly that this person had previously been standing beside the yellow-robed young man.","The black-robed young man appeared slightly awkward, but very quickly, he said, “I am Gu Xuefeng. Greetings, Brother Ling.”","Ling Han nodded. It was clear that the other party had already obtained his information.","“Alright, then let’s go and meet him.”","Gu Xuefeng couldn’t help but feel pleasantly surprised. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so amicable.","He led the way in front. After taking a few steps, he turned around and said, “To be honest with Brother Ling, I actually only entered here more than twenty years ago.”","“Oh?” Ling Han glanced at him, slightly surprised. That was because this person’s natural talent in cultivation was really not all that impressive. There was not much significance for him to come in to train."]},{"number":4276,"title":"Chapter 4276: Do as he willed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4276: Do as he willed","Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Xuefeng sighed, and continued, “I think that Brother Ling entered into this space to rapidly become stronger, right? This is also the reason why most people have entered into this space, but I... I was forced to flee into this place because I killed an enemy, and to avoid being hunted down.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. No wonder.","Not everyone would enter the Dark Clouds Hell to become stronger; only those with high natural talent in cultivation would. What was the point of a mediocre person like you coming here? Not only would you not be able to become stronger, you would only be seeking death.","Thus, this Gu Xuefeng could only submit to power and stay alive.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He could understand his actions, but it did not mean that he would agree.","Led by Gu Xuefeng, they soon saw Liu Yao.","“You’re quite bold, aren’t you? You even dare to kill my people?” Liu Yao looked coldly at Ling Han. His cultivation level was clearly much lower than Ling Han’s, yet he still wore a disdainful expression.","It could not be helped. He had a backer.","On the way, Ling Han had already heard Gu Xuefeng mention Liu Yao’s identity. He was merely the son of a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite. What was there to be proud of?","“So what if I kill him?” He raised a brow.","Liu Yao wore a baleful smile as he said, “I can guarantee that you won’t live more than 10 steps after leaving this place. Unless...” He paused for a moment before continuing, “You can help me fight on the tournament stage in the future.”","“Help you fight in the arena?” Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “Then what about the Source Dao Stones that I obtained?”","“Of course, it belongs to me,” Liu Yao said with a matter-of-fact expression. “You’re under my protection, so it’s already extremely fortunate that you’re still alive. What else do you want?”","He smiled again, “Don’t ever mention to me how awesome you are outside, and how powerful your backer is. Let me tell you, all of this is useless! Once you enter here, you are a fish on a chopping board, and can only be slaughtered at the mercy of others!”","“You can ask Gu Xuefeng. If he had not had my protection, how many times would he have already died? Furthermore, there are a great many people here that have special fetishes. Hehe, when the time comes, you will not just die. Just look at how fair you are. Who knows, you may even be r@ped, and even be refined into a human tool after death, for others to play with.”","“Look, am I not very benevolent? You killed one of my men, yet I still gave you a way out?”","After saying this, Liu Yao looked at Ling Han smilingly, looking like he was sure that Ling Han would submit.","He had seen too many outsiders suddenly collapse here. Under the pressure of life and death, there were really not many that could hold up. Even if you were a prodigy, your willpower would still crumble under such helpless circumstances.","Meanwhile, Gu Xuefeng said to Ling Han, “Brother Ling, Young Master Yao is right. The City of Death does not have any laws, and elites can do as they please.”","“Can they really do as they please?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“That’s right,” Gu Xuefeng nodded.","“All right.” Ling Han smiled.","Liu Yao was bold and frank, and thought that Ling Han had finally recognized the reality now, and was about to submit to him.","Pa!","Ling Han leaned over and delivered a slap to Liu Yao’s face. The force was so great that Liu Yao was forced to spin seven times on the spot.","Gu Xuefeng immediately gaped, his face filled with shock.","F***, what have you understood?","Liu Yao also stopped spinning. He was a little dizzy, and one of his hands covered his face that had been slapped. Immediately, he groaned in pain. This side of his face was already bulging, and the slightest touch made him feel as if he had been slashed.","“You, you dare to hit me?” He was furious.","Pa, Ling Han sent out another slap, landing on the other half of Liu Yao’s face. This guy was once again spinning in circles on the spot.","No more, no less. It was still seven rounds.","Gu Xuefeng: “...”","Liu Yao once again stopped. He was both shocked and furious, “Ling Han, you’re dead! Dead!”","Meanwhile, Ling Han cracked a smile, “You said it yourself. Elites can do as they please. I am stronger than you, so what if I hit you? Is there any law here that can punish me?”","“You—” Liu Yao was directly rendered speechless.","There were indeed no rules in the City of Death. If there was one, it was that one could not trifle with the five great Venerate Tier elites. Aside from that, if you wanted to kill, you could kill, even if you wanted to kill one or a thousand.","However, murder could not be within the territory of the five Venerate Tier elites. For example, the Spiritual Rain Inn that Ling Han was staying in was in the territory of the Crimson Moon Venerate. If anyone dared to offend it, that would be equivalent to provoking the Crimson Moon Venerate, and they could only wait for death.","Who was Liu Yao?","He belonged to the force under Blood Crow Venerate, and you actually dare to trifle with him?","Ling Han patted Liu Yao’s forehead, and said, “So, behave yourself. Otherwise, I’ll kill you!”","When he spoke of the word ‘kill’, his killing intent circulated, baleful and sinister.","Liu Yao instantly broke out in a cold sweat. He had a feeling that if he dared to exude any kind of hostility at this moment, Ling Han would really kill him without the slightest hesitation.","Seeing him nod like a chick pecking at rice, Ling Han smiled in satisfaction, turned and left.","When Ling Han’s figure had completely disappeared, Liu Yao finally flopped onto the ground. He felt that his undergarment was completely drenched, and even his hair was sticky, as if he had just been fished out of the water.","He panted heavily. Just now, he had actually been so scared that he had even stopped breathing. If it was not for the fact that he had already advanced into Celestial Path, would he have suffocated himself to death?","Then, when his intelligence gradually returned to normal, his expression immediately became incredibly dark.","F***, he actually dared to threaten him?","“I want you to die, die!” he roared lowly, his eyes spitting fire.","“Young Master Yao!” Gu Xuefeng said weakly from the sidelines, “Ma Han is already your number one lackey, and even he died by Ling Han’s hand. There should be no one in the True Self Tier that can deal with that guy.”","Liu Yao’s expression involuntarily froze. He was only the son of a Spirit Transformation Tier. Although he had taken advantage of the situation to take in a few subordinates of True Self Tier, that was all. It was impossible for the a Spirit Transformation True Lord to obey his every command.","However, Ling Han was so powerful that he had killed Ma Han with a single punch. How many True Self Tier cultivators could match such strength?","Thus, if he wanted to kill Ling Han, he would have to send out a Spirit Transformation True Lord. However, how could he mobilize a Spirit Transformation Tier?","“Got it!” His eyes shone brightly. He himself could not mobilize a Spirit Transformation True Lord, but the other second-generation young masters could. He only had to be able to ask this kind of second-generation young master.","Good.","...","After Ling Han exited the Dark Battlefield, he began to wander around the city. In any case, he only had to return to the inn before midnight.","With such a short amount of time, it was naturally impossible for him to explore the entire city. However, based on what he had seen in this half a day’s time, he did not find a place that sold alchemical pills.","This could be imagined, because those who entered here were usually exiled. Of course, it was not possible that there would be an alchemist like Ling Han — if it was an alchemist, it would be better to lock him up in his own force, and have him continuously concoct alchemical pills as compensation.","And those that took the initiative to enter here were basically prodigies of martial arts. In order to rapidly become stronger, there would definitely be no alchemist among them.","“By the looks of it, if I sell alchemical pills here, would there be a very ‘wealthy’ path?” Ling Han murmured, his eyes slightly bright."]},{"number":4277,"title":"Chapter 4277: Obtaining the Source Dao Stone","paragraphs":["Chapter 4277: Obtaining the Source Dao Stone","Editor: Henyee Translations","Before entering into the Dark Clouds Hell, Ling Han had already bought a large amount of medicinal ingredients. As an alchemist, he naturally had to make full use of his strengths at all times.","He decided to concoct an alchemical pill that would help him comprehend Dao.","In this place, healing medicine definitely did not have much future prospects.","The reason was very simple. If a battle broke out here, it would either result in death or severe injury.","A dead person naturally did not need any medicine, and in the case of severe injury, it was basically something like a severed arm or leg. Only a Saint-level Great Herb would be able to regrow a severed limb. Ling Han was completely unable to help with this.","Thus, he decided not to concoct any healing medicine.","Those that could increase cultivation... er, the Source Dao Stone here was a saintly item that could increase cultivation level. Otherwise, why would everyone have come here?","Thus, he could only sell alchemical pills that could help in the comprehension of Dao.","Your cultivation level may have increased, but without the corresponding Regulations comprehension, your cultivation level would be stuck, and you would not be able to advance the slightest bit further. And if you were to forcefully cultivate, that would only cause your body to explode.","—The difference in cultivation level and mental state was extremely dangerous.","Thus, this kind of alchemical pill should be very popular. After all, the people here could more or less obtain some Source Dao Stones, speeding up the advancement of their cultivation level, but there were still very few top-notch prodigies that could rely on themselves to keep up with the rapid advancement of their cultivation level.","He would do as he said.","Ling Han started to concoct alchemical pills. On the second day, he didn’t receive any notification of battle on the Dark Battlefield, so he went out to set up a stall.","The stall was set up outside the Dark Battlefield. There were many people here, and there was no lack of rich people.","He didn’t lack Dao Stones, so he naturally only accepted Source Dao Stones.","There were no alchemists in the City of Death. There were alchemical pills, but they were all brought in by outsiders, so there was naturally a limit to their numbers. Thus, once Ling Han set up a stall here, it immediately attracted the attention of many people.","However, when they heard Ling Han say that he would only accept Source Dao Stones, a great many people immediately shook their heads and left.","The Source Dao Stone was too valuable. Who would be willing to part with it? Furthermore, it was not certain whether Ling Han’s medicine was real or fake. In this City of Death, the only rule was that there were no rules. It was too normal for kidnapping, scamming and murder to take place.","If Ling Han was selling fake medicine, when he fled, where would they go to complain about the injustice?","Thus, there were only spectators on the first day, and no one made a move.","Ling Han didn’t mind. A day passed, and he received a notification from the Dark Battlefield that there would be a battle today.","He had participated in the previous battle, and easily achieved victory. Furthermore, his luck was not too bad today, as he actually managed to be lined up for two battles. The second battle was naturally also won easily.","He had won three times in a row.","Not only did this allow him to earn his first Source Dao Stone, it also allowed him to gain some reputation. When he went out to set up a stall, someone finally dared to make an attempt, and bought three alchemical pills with a Source Dao Stone the size of a fingernail.","Ling Han packed up his stall and returned to the inn. Then, he took out two Source Dao Stones and began to study them.","From the outside, the Source Dao Stone was actually very ordinary. However, there were a few blood-colored patterns on it, as if there had once been blood flowing from it.","After watching for a while, Ling Han took the Source Dao Stone and began to cultivate.","The two Source Dao Stones were refined into dust, and Ling Han’s cultivation level advanced a bit. The sixth Silver Fetus was completed by one third.","“This has the same effect as the Evolution Fruit. It can also boost the advancement of the True Self. However, the Evolution Fruit can also help break through the limit. The Source Dao Stone can only purely speed up the formation of the True Self.”","“The True Self is the condensation of Regulations. Thus, the fact that the Source Dao Stone can help the True Self evolve means that it itself is formed from Regulations. Of course, there are also a lot of other complicated things.”","“However, the Source Dao Stone has another disadvantage.”","“Reduce lifespan!”","Using the Source Dao Stone to rapidly increase one’s cultivation level would expend a portion of one’s life essence, and this amount wouldn’t be much. Thus, compared to the rapid advancement of one’s cultivation level, this disadvantage was overlooked.","“According to my deductions, if I use Source Dao Stones completely to advance to the end of the Third Form, the life essence expended would probably decrease my lifespan by 200 years.”","This number... was very coincidental!","If Ling Han didn’t rely on alchemical pills and cultivated on his own, it would take him about 200 years to reach the end of the third form.","In other words, the Source Dao Stone had simplified the process of cultivating, but the price paid was the same.","“From this aspect, the Source Dao Stone is equivalent to making an equivalent exchange.”","“Forget it. What I need now is strength. I can bear this little loss of life.”","On the second day, Ling Han continued to set up a stall.","One after another, people asked for the price, but there were only some who asked, and no one really made a move. In fact, there were even people who directly asked Ling Han to deliver the alchemical pills, looking like they had a powerful backer. If you don’t give me the alchemical pills, I will send someone to take your life.","Towards this kind of person, Ling Han naturally would not be reserved, and directly thrashed him.","Ling Han was extremely bored. He grabbed a straw hat to cover his face, and leaned against the wall to take a nap.","After a while, the sound of footsteps was heard, and stopped in front of his stand.","Ling Han didn’t open his eyes. He had worn his mouth dry for the entire day, and this was practically even more tiring than fighting.","He was not the slightest bit worried that someone would steal his medicine, because he had already thrashed quite a number of such people, so there should be no one else that would come looking for a beating.","“Do you have any Four Suns Pills here?” A man’s voice rang out. His voice was clear, and he should be quite young.","Yi?","Ling Han opened his eyes and removed his straw hat. The Four Suns Pill wasn’t an alchemical pill that could help one comprehend Dao. Instead, it was used to nurture one’s body.","In this City of Death, there was actually someone who wanted to buy a Four Suns Pill?","Standing in front of his stall was a young man who looked to be in his mid-twenties. He had a lanky figure, and was also extremely handsome. His black hair draped over his shoulders, and his hair glowed faintly, making him appear outstanding.","“No.” Ling Han shook his head.","The young man instantly looked disappointed. He sighed, turned and left.","“However, I can concoct alchemical pills,” Ling Han continued.","Shua, that young man immediately turned around, his face filled with delight, “Really?”","“M-hm.” Ling Han nodded in understanding. The Four Suns Pill was only a five-star alchemical pill, so refining it could not be too easy for him.","“All right, then I’ll have to trouble you to help me concoct it,” the young man said.","“Pay the deposit first. I will go and prepare the ingredients,” Ling Han said. “In three days’ time, come here to collect the medicine.”","The young man hesitated slightly. What if Ling Han accepted the deposit and ran off? But in an instant, he took out a Source Dao Stone and threw it over, “My name is Yuan Bing. If you dare to deceive me, humph!”","This Source Dao Stone was only the size of a finger. Ling Han put it away, and said with a smile, “Don’t worry.”","He could actually refine it on the spot, but there was no need for him to be so high-profile, right?","“That had better be the case.” Yuan Bing nodded, “If you can concoct the Fourth Refinement, then I will befriend you.”","“Sure,” Ling Han said casually. He was completely unconcerned. With his natural talent and abilities, did he still need to rely on the help of others?","Yuan Bing appeared slightly surprised. He had already announced his name, so why was Ling Han not the slightest bit surprised?","Could it be that he didn’t know who he was?","He pondered for a moment, then turned around and left.","He would just wait three days."]},{"number":4278,"title":"Chapter 4278: Sowing Discord","paragraphs":["Chapter 4278: Sowing Discord","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yuan Manor.","Yuan Xinrong was a subordinate of the Seven Generals of the Blood Crow Venerate. He could be considered a mighty figure, and he himself was a powerful Sect Master.","Liu Yao was at the door, and he turned to a guard and asked, “Young Master Bing, are you free today?”","“Young Master Bing seems to be in a better mood today,” the guard said with a nod. He accepted the Dao Stone from Liu Yao.","“Then please help me report my visit to him,” Liu Yao appeared to be very polite.","“All right.”","The guard entered, and not long after, he returned, and said, “Young Master Bing has invited you in.”","Liu Yao hurriedly entered, and with the guidance of that guard, he arrived at a study.","A young man was presently drawing on the table. Under his penmanship, a painting of a sun rising over the sea was just about completed.","Liu Yao did not say anything. He merely waved his hand to dismiss the guard, and waited quietly on the sidelines.","If Ling Han was present, he would be able to recognize with a single glance that this young man who was painting was the Yuan Bing that had sought him out to concoct the Four Suns Pill today.","In a short while, Yuan Bing withdrew his brush.","The painting was completed.","“Brilliant! Brilliant! Brilliant!” Liu Yao immediately applauded. “Young Master Bing, your painting skills have improved again. Just look at the Intent Realm. Tsk, tsk, tsk! It’s truly amazing.”","Yuan Bing merely smiled subtly, but there was an unconcealable pride in his expression. Clearly, he was very pleased with Liu Yao’s flattery.","“Young Master Bing, how’s your esteemed mother’s condition?” Liu Yao asked.","He naturally knew that Yuan Bing’s birth mother had always had a weak physique. In the outside world, this wouldn’t be a big problem, as there would naturally be medicines that could heal and nourish the body. However, this was the Dark Clouds Hell, where there was only slaughter. The only specialty was the Source Dao Stone, so where would there be tonic medicine that could nourish the body?","Yuan Bing pondered for a moment, then said, “If everything goes smoothly, after three days, my mother would no longer need to be troubled by this.”","“Congratulations, Young Master Bing! This is a great joy!” Liu Yao hurriedly said. This Yuan Bing was a filial son, so if they wanted to befriend him, they naturally had to accommodate his traits as well. “Young Master Bing’s filial heart for your dear mother has touched heaven and earth, and a miracle finally happened.”","Yuan Bing laughed loudly, and waved his hand, “It was not due to me, but rather my mother has always been kind and merciful. Usually, she would not bear to even stomp an ant to death. It was she who touched the blessing of heaven and earth, and they sent reinforcements.”","Liu Yao hurriedly agreed. ‘You’re the boss, so whatever you say goes.’","After flattering him for half a day, Yuan Bing asked smilingly, “What business do you have with me?”","“Can’t I come see Young Master Bing for no reason?” Liu Yao said with a smile. However, he immediately changed the topic, and said, “Young Master Bing, I truly didn’t want to trouble you with this matter. However, you’re my only boss, so if you don’t stand up for me, I’ll have nowhere to complain.”","Yuan Bing was presently in a good mood, and nodded as he asked, “Speak, what trouble have you encountered?”","“Young Master Bing, I have a subordinate who was beaten to death a few days ago when he was battling on the Dark Battlefield,” Liu Yao said. “Initially, it would have been normal for there to be life and death in a tournament stage. However, that rookie was extremely arrogant. So be it if he won. He actually came to provoke me and called me trash, saying that it was natural that my subordinate was also trash. In fact...”","“In fact?” Yuan Bing asked.","“In fact, he even said that I’m a piece of trash, and my boss must also be a piece of trash!” Liu Yao completely twisted the facts, and began to make a malicious accusation against Yuan Bing.","As expected, Yuan Bing immediately humphed, and said, “Oh, is he really so outrageously bold?”","“Young Master Bing, he is a rookie, so he’s most likely quite famous in the outside world. That’s why he doesn’t know how to behave even after coming here. There’s no need for you to drop to his level,” Liu Yao said in persuasion.","Yuan Bing couldn’t help but sneer, “What do you mean ‘lower myself to the same level’! Humph, where is that person, I would really like to meet him!”","Liu Yao couldn’t help but reveal a proud smile. He had already brought out Yuan Bing, then Ling Han’s only fate would naturally be death.","‘You dare to hit me? F*ck!’","...","After Ling Han returned, he concocted the Four Suns Pill. For the Alchemy Emperor, this was naturally no big deal.","On the second day, he received a notice from the Dark Battlefield that there would be another battle.","Move out.","He was only going through the motions, so he naturally gained another victory. However, just as he was about to leave, he saw Gu Xuefeng again.","“My Young Master would like to invite you for a while,” Gu Xuefeng said.","Ling Han smiled, “That idiot still hasn’t learnt his lesson?”","Gu Xuefeng shook his head, “This time, Young Master Yao has brought a helper.”","“Is that so?” Ling Han smiled, “All right, then let’s go and see who he has invited.”","This time, he was going to beat Liu Yao into submission, so that he would never bark in front of him again.","Gu Xuefeng led the way ahead, and very soon, they arrived at a private room.","Yi, he had leveled up?","Previously, Liu Yao had only been seated in the VIP seats, but had not reached the level of having a private room.","Gu Xuefeng knocked on the door first, and when the sound of “enter” was heard from inside, he finally pushed open the door.","Ling Han strode in, and as his eyes swept over the surroundings, a strange expression involuntarily appeared on his face.","This world... was too small, wasn’t it?","The reinforcements that Liu Yao had called over were actually Yuan Bing!","Hehe, a smile appeared on his face. Now, there was going to be a good show.","Yuan Bing was also startled. He had not thought that the person he had come to “suppress” today would actually be Ling Han. This was perhaps the only person who could save his mother.","What a joke. For a filial son like him, he would rather suffer a beating, if it meant that his mother would be saved.","All of a sudden, his expression darkened.","How could Liu Yao possibly know so much? He only thought that the expression on Yuan Bing’s face was directed at Ling Han. After all, he had been spreading rumors, saying Ling Han had once called Yuan Bing trash.","“Ling Han, how dare you insult Young Master Bing and call him trash! Now that Young Master Bing is here, are you going to deny it again?”","This was very poisonous.","If Ling Han shook his head, that would be equivalent to admitting to Liu Yao’s accusation, and that he had indeed insulted Yuan Bing previously, but if he nodded... er, that would be even more of an admission.","“What is it? Why are you cowering in front of Young Master Bing?” Liu Yao continued to add fuel to the fire. “Weren’t you extremely bold just then?”","Ling Han merely watched his performance quietly, as if he was a clown.","“Say something, why aren’t you saying anything?” Liu Yao sneered. He couldn’t mobilize Spirit Transformation Tier elites, but Yuan Bing could. Thus, Ling Han was already a corpse.","“What do you want me to say?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“Kneel!” Liu Yao said balefully.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile, and asked Yuan Bing, “Do I really have to kneel?”","Yi, what was going on here?","Liu Yao suddenly felt like things were about to go out of control. Why did he feel like Ling Han and Yuan Bing seemed to know each other?","But how was this possible?","Ling Han was only a rookie who had just entered this place, while Yuan Bing was a Sect Master-level Young Master. The gap between the two of them could be said to be like the gap between heaven and earth. Thus, it was absolutely impossible for these two people to come into contact with each other.","Yuan Bing looked towards Liu Yao, and stated calmly, “Kneel!”","What?","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4279,"title":"Chapter 4279: Smashed His Own Foot","paragraphs":["Chapter 4279: Smashed His Own Foot","Editor: Henyee Translations","Liu Yao was dumbfounded for a second.","Previously, though he had felt that the situation was about to go out of control, it shouldn’t have reached this extent, right?","Kneel?","‘Me?’","‘Hmm?’","Yuan Bing’s gaze turned cold, and he asked calmly, “What is it? Do you not understand?”","Only then did Liu Yao come back to his senses. He looked at Yuan Bing sheepishly, “Young Master Bing, are you joking?”","“Which eye of yours saw that I was joking with you?” Yuan Bing said, “Kneel!” He raised his voice.","In the eyes of a filial son like him, Ling Han, who was perhaps the only person who could save his mother, was naturally 10,000 times, or 100 million times more important than Liu Yao. If he was sure that he could save his mother, he himself would not hesitate to kneel down.","Liu Yao?","They were just friends, and he was very clear about that.","Liu Yao’s face was filled with grievance, and he was even more defiant.","What right did he have?","Yuan Bing was the reinforcement that he had invited, but now, the reinforcement had turned around to deal with him. What was this? Was he shooting himself in the foot?","Meanwhile, Gu Xuefeng was watching from the sidelines. This outsider was too awesome, wasn’t he? He had only entered for a few days, and he had already suppressed Liu Yao. In comparison, he had been in here for more than twenty years, yet could only become a lowly dog. Just how wide was the gap between them?","What Liu Yao wanted to do the most now was to leave with a flourish of his sleeves.","But he did not dare.","His old man was only a soldier under Yuan Bing’s old man. When one had reached the level of Spirit Transformation Tier, they could be considered important, or they could also be considered unimportant.They were completely replaceable.","Thus, if he really angered Yuan Bing, to say nothing of him, even his father would be in trouble!","At that time, there would probably be no need for Yuan Bing to make a move. His old man would first put righteousness before family, and kill him with his own hands.","Pa! Liu Yao’s knees buckled, and he fell to his knees.","“Slap yourself a hundred times!” Yuan Bing stated calmly.","Liu Yao had already knelt, which meant that his will to resist was already dead. Immediately, he raised his right hand, and delivered a harsh slap at his own face.","Pa, pa, pa, one, two, three, four...","Yuan Bing smiled at Ling Han, raised his teacup, and said, “I’ll use tea as wine, and apologize to you on behalf of my underling.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","He was also very clear that the reason why Yuan Bing placed so much importance on him now was because he wanted the Four Suns Pill, but if he could not produce the Four Suns Pill, he was sure that Yuan Bing would return all this to him in double the amount.","Ling Han naturally didn’t care about this.","In truth, he had already concocted the alchemical pill, but since he said that he would retrieve the alchemical pill three days later, then that would have to be three days later. In terms of alchemy ability, it was better for him to keep a low profile. There was no alchemist here. If others knew that he knew how to concoct Venerable Tier-level alchemical pills, perhaps a Venerate Tier would make a move on him.","He had come here only for the sake of rapidly increasing his cultivation level, and did not want to stay here forever.","“Farewell.” Ling Han turned around and left.","Meanwhile, Yuan Bing stared at Liu Yao, and said, “This is my friend. If you dare to have the slightest bit of malice towards him, I will definitely kill you.”","Liu Yao couldn’t help but shudder, but his hand that was slapping himself did not dare to stop in the slightest. At this moment, his heart was filled with hatred, both towards Ling Han and Yuan Bing. However, he did not dare to show it in the slightest.","Two days’ time passed in the blink of an eye. Ling Han fought a few more battles, and he achieved victories with an overwhelming advantage in all of them. Meanwhile, Yuan Bing had also obtained the Four Suns Pill, and for the moment, there was no further news from him.","Another day later, Yuan Bing came to visit him at the inn, bringing with him a large amount of gifts.","“Thank you, Brother Ling. My mother is already much better,” he said happily.","When Ling Han gave him the alchemical pill, only then did he know that this alchemical pill was for Yuan Bing’s mother. Towards a filial son, Ling Han was still very respectful. He smiled, “That’s good.”","“A little token of my appreciation.” Yuan Bing pushed the gift in front of Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “You gave me Source Dao Stones, and I gave you the Four Suns Pill. It is a fair transaction. There’s no need to thank me.”","“No, no, no. To you, it is only a business deal that has been completed, but to me, the significance is very different,” Yuan Bing insisted.","Ling Han couldn’t convince him otherwise, so he could only accept the gift.","Yuan Bing earnestly invited Ling Han to his residence as a guest.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before agreeing.","He was indeed very interested in this City of Death, and what he wanted to know more was where exactly had the Source Dao Stone come from.","These should be ores, but where had they been mined from?","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t expect Yuan Bing to steal it for him. He only needed some clues.","Yuan Bing also yearned for the outside world, but only Venerate Tier elites could break through the black hole’s gravitational pull and leave here. Thus, Yuan Bing naturally could only think about it, but hearing Ling Han talk about the outside world, he appeared to be extremely yearning.","Ling Han tried to beat around the bush, but Yuan Bing was completely unaware of the location of the Source Dao Stone mine. According to him, this should only be known to the five Venerate Tier elites.","Ling Han naturally didn’t believe him. How could it be that they didn’t need manpower to excavate a mine? How could it be that it could be that Venerate Tier elites would personally excavate a mine?","It was obviously impossible.","However, these Venerate Tier elites really did a good job of keeping secrets. Even a second-generation young master like Yuan Bing actually didn’t know anything.","Ling Han didn’t want to rely on Yuan Bing. He continued to battle on the Dark Battlefield as usual, and very soon, he obtained ten consecutive wins, receiving additional rewards, and next, he obtained another twenty consecutive wins, and thirty consecutive wins.","Following the expansion of his successive victories, his alchemy business also became more and more prosperous, and the amount of Source Dao Stones he earned also became considerable.","Four months later, he had already cultivated all nine Stone Fetuses to Silver Fetus.","He temporarily called a ceasefire, and began to adjust his condition in order to break through to the fourth form of the True Self, Golden Fetus!","He had been battling all these days. Thus, though his cultivation level had increased very quickly, his mental state and appreciation had completely caught up. Thus, he only adjusted for half a month, and began to break through to the fourth form.","There were all kinds of medicinal ingredients and medicinal stones by his side. When he broke through, he needed a huge amount of energy, and he couldn’t rely on himself to supply it. That would extract his life essence and affect his lifespan.","He began to charge forward.","It was still the True Self of Destruction that took the vanguard, being the first to evolve into a Golden Fetus.","Hong long long, an earth-shattering change took place in his body. The Regulations condensed and boosted on the True Self of Destruction, causing the Silver Fetus to vaguely flash with golden light.","For him, this process was already a walk in the park. Though every evolution was slightly different, in terms of quality, it was the same.","Three days later, in Ling Han’s mind, the True Self of Destruction shone with golden light, like a golden Bodhisattva.","He had succeeded in forming the fourth form of the True Self Tier!","Ling Han laughed loudly, and stood up. The reason why he had spent three days was because not only had he pushed the level of mystical power up to the fourth form, he had not missed out on the Body Art either, and was still advancing at the same time.","“Double raw power of 35 Heavens, with the two combined, 40 Heavens!”","In this way, if he channeled the Imperial Technique, Ling Han’s battle prowess could reach up to 51 Heavens.","This was extremely awesome, and was completely capable of defeating a great many Imperial Sons in the Fifth Form.","Ling Han came out of seclusion, and then went to the Dark Battlefield, cancelling his previous battle-free state.","However, he unexpectedly received a piece of news. In the days that he had been in seclusion, a fierce person had come to the Dark Battlefield. He was also a True Self Tier, and was invincible in his sweep. It was as if he was about to overwhelm Ling Han.","This person’s name was... Lin Yun!"]},{"number":4280,"title":"Chapter 4280: If I am here, he needs to leave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4280: If I am here, he needs to leave","Editor: Henyee Translations","‘Lin Yun?’","The Fire Cloud Imperial Clan’s Lin Yun? The Silver Generation’s Lin Yun?","Why had he come here?","Theoretically speaking, the Imperial Clans possessed the most abundant resources in the world, and the Imperial Son was someone that the Imperial Clan had nurtured with all their might. Was there any need for them to come to the Dark Clouds Hell?","En, the resources of the Imperial Clan should all be leaning towards the Golden Generation. Thus, even if the Silver Generation was still heavily nurtured by the Imperial Clan, it clearly could not compare to the Golden Generation.","Thus, if Lin Yun wanted to contend for the throne, he would definitely have to take an unusual path. Otherwise, he would never be able to surpass the Golden Generation.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. Meeting Lin Yun here was truly heaven’s will.","He looked forward to encountering this opponent on the Dark Battlefield, and dealing with him personally.","This probability was quite high, because both he and Ling Han had the aptitude to be invincible among their peers. Thus, it should not take too long for them to encounter each other.","However, he could not interfere with the arrangement of battles on the Dark Battlefield, so he could only wait now.","When he found out that he had come out of seclusion, Yuan Bing immediately sent out an invitation to him.","His mother had already recovered completely, so he planned to hold a banquet to celebrate, and Ling Han could be considered his mother’s savior. How could he hold it without Ling Han?","Ling Han pondered for a moment before deciding to participate.","The banquet was set for two days later, and Ling Han didn’t waste any time. He continued to sell alchemical pills and fight on the tournament stage. Unfortunately, he never encountered Lin Yun.","In a flash, two days had passed.","This evening, Ling Han set out, heading towards the Yuan Clan.","Previously, he had already gone there once, so it was naturally a walk in the park for him. Very soon, he arrived at his destination. The guards at the entrance had long since been taken care of. When they saw him approach, they immediately invited him in warmly.","Ling Han arrived at the banquet hall, only to see that many people had already arrived. However, he only knew a pitifully small number of people— and that was Liu Yao.","Liu Yao also discovered him, and a vicious glint flashed across his eyes. However, he did not dare to look too long at him, and immediately lowered his head.","He, he had not given up on his evil intentions.","Ling Han thought, ‘Should I kill this guy now?’","Right at this moment, two more people entered the main hall.","They were all young people, and one of them was even more heroic. Stars surged behind him, showing a terrifying phenomenon.","Lin Yun!","Ling Han was surprised. He had not thought that he would actually encounter this Silver Generation elite here.","Lin Yun’s sharp gaze naturally swept over to Ling Han. He couldn’t help but reveal a cold smile, not hiding his killing intent in the slightest.","The way the two of them looked at each other was incredibly conspicuous, causing everyone in the living room to look over.","Yi, weren’t these the two most popular people in the Dark Battlefield? They were already at each other’s throats?","“Hehe, everyone, thank you for coming.” Yuan Bing strode out, his face full of smiles.","“Young Master Bing!”","“Young Master Bing!”","Everyone called out. The elders of these people were all subordinates of the Yuan Clan, so they naturally had the label of the Yuan Clan, and became the lackeys of Yuan Bing.","“Come, come, come, sit!” Yuan Bing appeared very happy.","Everyone sat down, one after another. Meanwhile, Yuan Bing invited Ling Han over, and sat at the main table with him, appearing to hold him in extremely high regard.","This caused everyone to be surprised. They had not thought that Yuan Bing would actually value Ling Han so highly.","Regardless of how well-regarded Ling Han was in the outside world, in this place, everything had to start from scratch for him here. Thus, the fact that Yuan Bing held an outsider in such high regard naturally made them feel surprised.","But this was a matter that concerned Yuan Bing, so who would dare to say anything?","After three rounds of wine, everyone became more talkative.","“Young Master Bing, let me introduce you to a respected guest!” At this moment, a young man stood up and said to Yuan Bing.","This person was the one who had accompanied Lin Yun here.","Yuan Bing was in a good mood, so he nodded, and said, “Alright.”","This young man pointed at Lin Yun and said, “This is Lin Yun, Brother Lin. He’s from the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan, and he’s also an Imperial Son!”","Hiss, instantly, exclamations of shock rang out in the surroundings.","Don’t think that just because this was the Dark Clouds Hell, they were cut off from the rest of the world. Wrong, everyone here had come in from outside, or were the descendants of those people. Furthermore, a large number of people entered every year, so they naturally knew the situation outside. It was just that the feedback of the news would be much slower.","However, the Imperial Clan was high and noble, invincible in the world. This was everyone’s consensus, and could not be erased no matter what.","And now, an Imperial Son had arrived, which naturally stunned everyone.","Yuan Bing immediately smiled, and said, “So it is Imperial Son Lin, apologies for not recognizing you.”","Meanwhile, Lin Yun merely smiled reservedly, fully displaying his pride.","As he saw it, a mere Sect Master was so weak that he couldn’t even withstand a single blow. In front of the Imperial Clan, he was completely like an ant. It was only because the force of the Imperial Clan were not powerful enough, that he had to lower himself to come here.","Otherwise, a Sect Master-level force wanted to invite him? What a joke. Even if a Sect Master elite personally made a move, whether he would give them face or not would still have to depend on his mood.","Liu Yao saw this, and couldn’t help but feel hope rise up in his heart.","—Lin Yun clearly did not get along with Ling Han. Furthermore, he was an Imperial Son, so his weight was definitely heavier than Ling Han’s. Thus, Yuan Bing’s choice was naturally very simple.","At that time, he wouldn’t even need to move. Lin Yun would definitely battle Ling Han.","Yuan Bing appeared slightly displeased. In the Dark Clouds Hell, he was a second-generation young master that was only inferior to the descendants of the five great Venerate Tier elites. Usually, who would dare show insolence in front of him? Aren’t you just an Imperial Son? The hands of the Imperial Clan couldn’t extend here, so what do you have to be proud of?","He was just about to speak, when he saw Lin Yun stand up and say, “I gave Brother Qi face by coming here to attend the banquet.”","The Brother Qi he was talking about was precisely the young man that had come with him. This made him feel very awkward, because he was the underling of Yuan Bing, yet the person he had brought over did not take Yuan Bing seriously. Wasn’t this deliberately making things difficult for him?","Lin Yun continued, “However, there is a person here... I despise him very much!”","As he spoke, his eyes turned towards Ling Han, revealing a hint of disdain.","“If he is here, I will leave. If I am here, he needs to leave!” he stated calmly.","Hiss, this was a great humiliation!","If Ling Han was chased out in public, he would be utterly humiliated.","Just how great was the enmity between them? Was there a need to go so far?","However, everyone was clear that Yuan Bing’s choice should be extremely simple.","—An Imperial Son, and a non-Imperial Son, wasn’t that simple enough?","Indeed, the Imperial Clan had never interfered before. However, this did not mean that they would not in future. It was just a matter of how much they would have to sacrifice.","It was said that the higher one’s cultivation level was, the more dangerous the process of entering this place would be. Thus, those who came in were usually Core Formation Tiers, True Self Tiers, and Spirit Transformation Tiers at most. The five Venerate Tier elites here actually cultivated to this cultivation level after coming in.","But if the Imperial Clan was determined to forcibly break in, it may really be possible that they would destroy the Dark Clouds Hell.","Even if there was only a sliver of a chance, there was no need for him to take the risk for a minor character, right?","Everyone was looking at Yuan Bing, waiting for him to announce that Ling Han would be chased out.","Yuan Bing sighed, and asked, “Is Imperial Son Lin so determined?”","“Of course,” Lin Yun said proudly.","“Then please leave, Imperial Son Lin!”"]},{"number":4281,"title":"Chapter 4281: Zuwa An","paragraphs":["Chapter 4281: Zuwa An","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone was stunned.","What was going on?","Why was it Lin Yun who had been invited out?","That was an Imperial Son, and he was not giving him any face at all?","However, upon further thought, this was not a big deal. He had only invited the Imperial Son out, and had not killed the Imperial Son. If it was claimed that the Imperial Clan would launch an all-out war because of this, and charge into the Dark Clouds Hell at all costs, who would believe that?","A powerful dragon couldn’t suppress a snake in its lair. Now, even if Lin Yun was a dragon in the sky, he would still have to lower himself to the ground here!","In terms of abilities, he was only a True Self Tier.","Lin Yun hadn’t expected this either. Embarrassment was written all over his face.","‘F*ck! I’m a respected Imperial Son, a member of the Silver Generation, and I’m a respected guest wherever I go. In fact, whether I go or not depends on my mood. Why have I been kicked out of this place?’","What justice was there left in this world?","“Yuan Bing, don’t you regret this!” Lin Yun’s eyes sharpened. He had never cowered before. The status of Silver Generation and Imperial Son had bestowed too much pride on him, so how could he possibly bow his head?","Yuan Bing humphed, and said, “Are you threatening me?”","Lin Yun felt an urge to attack, but he forcefully suppressed this urge.","This was the Dark Clouds Hell, and there was also a Sect Master elite behind Yuan Bing, which was enough to suppress him.","As long as he wasn’t killed or crippled, would the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan forcibly conquer the Dark Clouds Hell for him?","They wouldn’t!","Facts had proven that this place was extremely strange. Even if a Saint wielded an Imperial Weapon, they still wouldn’t be able to overwhelm this place. This was a terrifying place!","This wasn’t strange. There were dangerous places in the world, that even the Great Emperor would have to be careful when entering. How could the combination of a Saint and the Imperial Weapon be comparable to a Great Emperor? It was far inferior.","Thus, the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan couldn’t possibly send elites over for such a small matter like this, such as Sect Master-level or Venerates. Here, the higher one’s cultivation level, the more likely it was to suffer calamity—this was proven by history.","Lin Yun took a deep breath before turning around to leave.","“Wait,” Yuan Bing spoke up.","Lin Yun paused, a hint of pride on his face.","He had to be afraid now, and must be regretting it now.","“If you’re willing to offer a cup of tea to Brother Ling, I won’t mind giving you some food,” Yuan Bing said calmly.","‘F*ck!’","Lin Yun almost spat out a mouthful of blood. Asking him to serve tea and apologize to Ling Han?","‘F*ck off!’","He was furious, and left with a flourish of his sleeves.","Yuan Bing looked at Ling Han, and the two of them broke into laughter.","Hearing Ling Han’s laughter, Lin Yun really wanted to turn around and start a fight, but if he made a move in Yuan Manor, that would be equivalent to provoking Yuan Xinrong, and would be disrespecting the Blood Crow Venerate. Even if he could not die due to his identity as an Imperial Son, he would definitely not be able to escape punishment.","I’ll endure, I’ll endure!","Lin Yun clenched his fists. This was a great humiliation that he had never experienced before. He would definitely get his revenge.","Ling Han, see you on the battlefield!","“Thank you.” Ling Han nodded at Yuan Bing. The latter actually didn’t need to face off against Lin Yun.","Yuan Bing smiled and said, “We are friends, aren’t we?”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “That’s right, friend.”","Previously, Yuan Bing had also said that as long as Ling Han could save his mother, he would befriend Ling Han. However, in Ling Han’s eyes, this friendship was naturally nothing.","This time was different. Yuan Bing clearly supported him. This also needed courage and resolution.","Everyone looked at each other, appearing very dumbfounded, especially that “Young Master Qi” who had brought Lin Yun here. He was the most embarrassed.","As for Liu Yao, he was extremely disappointed.","He had never imagined that Yuan Bing would actually choose to support Ling Han. Thankfully, he had not jumped out to be a clown just now. Otherwise, he would definitely be disliked by Yuan Bing now.","“This Lin Yun’s abilities are extraordinary,” Yuan Bing said with a serious expression. “Sooner or later, you and he will have to battle on the battlefield. Are you confident?”","Ling Han smiled and said, “I’m very expectant!”","Seeing how confident Ling Han was, Yuan Bing felt much more at ease.","At first, he had thought that the next step would be a true battle on the Dark Battlefield, but he had never imagined that there would actually be a slight accident in this matter.","In less than two days, Yuan Bing came to find Ling Han.","“Do you know Young Master An?” he asked.","“What Young Master An?” Ling Han looked at Yuan Bing in surprise. ‘You’re already a top-notch second-generation young master, yet you still call others “Young Master”?’","Yuan Bing frowned, appearing to be very confused, “Zuwa An, the grandson of the Blood Crow Venerate. Because Lord Blood Crow’s sons are all worthless, yet Zuwa An’s natural talent in martial arts is extremely high, so he is deeply loved by Lord Blood Crow.”","“Strange, since you don’t know him, why did he ask me to bring you to see him?”","Ling Han smiled and said, “We’ll know if we go and take a look.”","“En.” Yuan Bing nodded. He was a top-notch second-generation young master, but Zuwaan was a super second-generation young master. In the City of Death, there were still four people that could stand on equal footing with him. Furthermore, Yuan Xinrong was a subordinate of the Blood Crow Venerate. Correspondingly, Yuan Bing could also be considered Zuwa An’s underling.","“When are we setting off?” Ling Han asked.","“If you’re free, let’s go now.”","“All right.”","The two of them set out, heading towards where Zuwa An was staying.","This was the cherished grandson of the Blood Crow Venerate. However, he didn’t live with the Blood Crow Venerate. Instead, he lived alone outside, probably because he didn’t want to be controlled.","When they arrived at the door, the guards immediately smiled when they saw Yuan Bing, welcoming the two of them in.","This place was decorated very beautifully. There were towers, pavilions, and everything else. If one didn’t raise his head to look, he wouldn’t be able to tell that this was the City of Death.","This manor was very big. In fact, it was slightly larger than even Yuan Manor. After circling around for a while, they finally arrived at the backyard. Zuwa An was here.","The two of them entered the garden, and saw a gazebo inside. There were two people drinking. They clearly saw Ling Han and Yuan Bing out of the corner of their eyes, but they acted as if they didn’t see them, and were still drinking.","Yi?","Ling Han and Yuan Bing looked at each other, and couldn’t help but reveal an astounded expression, because one of these two people was actually Lin Yun!","This guy really had some tricks up his sleeve. In just a few days, he had managed to get acquainted with Zuwa An!","Of course, if it was Lin Yun who said this, it would definitely be Zuwa An who was out of his league. He was the dignified Imperial Son, so who in this world was worthy of him clinging to?","Hehe, was this considered revenge?","“Young Master An!” Yuan Bing shouted loudly. He couldn’t just stand there and be ignored, right?","The other young man put down his wine cup, glanced at Yuan Bing, and nodded slightly, “So it’s Yuan Bing.”","‘Nonsense, didn’t you call us over? Is it fun to pretend that you just realized we are here?’","Ling Han sized up this Zuwa An. The Blood Crow Venerate was a member of the Demon Race, and came from the Blood Crow Tribe. Thus, Zuwa An naturally inherited this bloodline as well. A pair of blood-colored wings grew on his back, and there were golden veined patterns that glowed faintly, making him appear extremely extraordinary.","Aside from that, he actually had a long tail, and his ears were also furry, like dogs and wolves.","He transmitted a question to Yuan Bing through divine sense. Yuan Bing told him that Zuwa An’s mother was a Wolf Tribe member, so he had mixed blood.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. No wonder this guy had a tail, and furry ears.","Yuan Bing clasped his hands and said, “Greetings, Young Master An.”","However, Zuwa An ignored him, and merely looked at Ling Han. A cold smile gradually appeared on his lips, “Bring me a cup of tea!”"]},{"number":4282,"title":"Chapter 4282: The proper use of the horn?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4282: The proper use of the horn?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Serving tea?","Previously, Yuan Bing had targeted Lin Yun like this, and now... it was the other way around.","Lin Yun only sipped his wine, and acted as if he had not seen anything. It was as if Ling Han was only a cat or dog in his eyes, and was not worth his attention at all.","Yuan Bing looked furious. Ling Han was his friend, and Zuwa An actually dared to humiliate Ling Han like this. That was equivalent to not giving him any face at all.","But what could be done?","Just like how he had been able to humiliate Lin Yun before, now that Zuwa An’s status was slightly higher than his, he naturally could do as he pleased.","The City of Death’s rules were that there were no rules, and elites with abilities could do as they liked!","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “Can you afford to have me serve you tea?”","Zuwa An couldn’t help but laugh loudly, “What a joke, is there anyone in this world that I can’t accept tea from?”","These words were too pretentious. He was only the grandson of a Venerate Tier elite, and in the outside world, he could indeed be considered a prominent figure, but to say that his status was high and noble, that was too much of an exaggeration.","There were Saints above Venerate Tier, and although there was no Emperor in this world, the Imperial Clan was not to be trifled with either.","“Hehe, then we can only take our leave.” Ling Han turned around. He naturally could not lower himself to speak.","“Did I allow you to leave?” Zuwa An asked coldly.","Who asked you to be so arrogant?","Ling Han retrieved the Great Emperor Horn and blew it as he walked.","Spiritual Power instantly decreased by a significant amount, and a soundless shockwave also spread out, but it was only directed at Zuwa An.","Heh, just obediently raise your head and bark like a wolf.","“Ao!” Sure enough, a wolf’s howl traveled over from behind him.","What was going on?","Yuan Bing was dumbfounded, and saw that Zuwa An was actually howling like a wolf with his head held high.","Lin Yun was also taken aback. Although he didn’t take Zuwa An seriously, why did you suddenly bark like a wolf?","It was not just that either!","Zuwa An discovered that his Wolf Tribe bloodline had awakened uncontrollably, and instantly, thick and long wolf fur wormed out of his pores. In an instant, his whole body was covered with black fur.","His head had also completely turned into the head of a wolf. His limbs were thick, and his claws were sharp and long.","Now, if it was not for the fact that he had a pair of blood wings on his back, what difference was there between him and a wolf?","Though Ling Han hadn’t looked at him, under the cover of his divine sense, this wasn’t much different from seeing it with his own eyes. He couldn’t help but feel surprised. The bugle horn could actually allow one to transform?","Hold on, Zuwa An had the bloodline of the Wolf Tribe. Could it be because of this?","Ling Han stowed the bugle horn away without batting an eyelid. This thing didn’t make any sound, and his actions just now had been extremely covert, so no one had discovered it.","“Ao!” With a leap, Zuwa An had already landed in front of Ling Han. Then, he turned his head, and bared his mouth, revealing two rows of ghastly white sharp teeth.","Yuan Bing, meanwhile, felt a chill in his heart. Were they going to become hostile?","He couldn’t help but feel a headache coming on. Zuwa An was the grandson of the Blood Crow Venerate. If he was determined to target Ling Han, then there would be no place for Ling Han, and could only flee for his life.","Although Lin Yun also found this strange, he was also happy to see Zuwa An personally deal with Ling Han.","Whether Ling Han made a move or not, this guy would not get off lightly.","—If he made a move, that would be equivalent to offending a Venerate Tier elite. This was the Dark Clouds Hell, and Venerate Tier was the strongest! And if he did not make a move, Ling Han would naturally be completely humiliated. With such humiliation, how could he still have the nerve to contest for the throne?","However, right at this moment, Zuwa An suddenly wagged his tail, and stuck out his long tongue, looking at Ling Han with an eager gaze.","F***, what was going on here?","Was this still a proud Young Master? He was clearly a pug, begging for his master’s love.","Yuan Bing and Lin Yun were both frozen, feeling as if their outlook on life had been slightly turned upside down.","Though Ling Han was also stunned, he had a vague understanding that this should be the effect of the horn of the Great Emperor.","Could it be that it was only a prank for this thing to make others howl, and its true use was to make the Wolf Tribe submit?","This... was too coincidental!","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and the black wolf that Zuwa An had turned into immediately leaned its head over obediently, allowing Ling Han to rub his head.","Hiss!","Among the Wolf Tribe, this represented absolute obedience.","Yuan Bing’s jaw dropped, completely stupefied.","‘What’s going on? Have you come to recognize someone as your master?’","Ling Han smiled, and said to Lin Yun, “Looks like you’ve lost again.”","In this battle, Lin Yun was defeated in a baffling manner.","How could he have imagined that Zuwa An would suddenly become subservient?","He successfully made Zuwa An feel the desire to leave this place, and promised the latter that after leaving the Dark Clouds Hell, he would take care of him. Thus, the two of them happily reached an agreement, and became friends.","But what’s going on here? Have you suddenly awakened your ancestral bloodline?","But even if you wanted to awaken your ancestral bloodline, you are still a wild wolf, so why do you have to act like a dog?","Lin Yun was speechless. He humphed, stood up and left.","“If we meet on the battlefield of blood and steel, that would be the time of your death!” he declared balefully.","“Little wolf!” Ling Han pointed at Lin Yun, “Bite!”","“Ao!” Zuwa An immediately charged out, opening his bloody mouth and biting at Lin Yun.","He was only a True Self Tier cultivator, so his battle prowess was naturally far inferior to the Imperial Son. However, he was under someone else’s roof, so Lin Yun naturally didn’t dare to truly wound Zuwa An. Otherwise, he would also be in deep trouble.","Thus, it could only be Zuwa An that attacked madly, and Lin Yun parried his blows.","Thankfully, he was a Silver Generation elite, and his battle prowess far surpassed that of Zuwa An, so there was not much danger.","However, there was no benefit to be gained from fighting like this. Lin Yun roared furiously, and after forcing Zuwa An to retreat with a single palm strike, he immediately withdrew and left.","How could Zuwa An be willing to give up? With a roar, he chased after Lin Yun.","“Er, am I dreaming?” Yuan Bing rubbed his forehead, still feeling like he was in a dream.","Ling Han shrugged and said, “Do you want me to slap you?”","“Then forget it.” Yuan Bing hurriedly shook his head.","“Let’s go.”","“O-Okay.”","The two of them left. On the way, Yuan Bing was still in a daze. He really couldn’t figure it out.","“Ling Han, is this related to you?” Yuan Bing asked.","Ling Han spread out his hands, “How is that possible?”","Yuan Bing also felt the same, but if it had nothing to do with him, then why did Zuwa An treat Ling Han as his master after transforming into a black wolf?","Merely a day had passed, and the news that Zuwa An’s ancestral bloodline from the Wolf Tribe had gone out of control, and the entire city was hunting down Lin Yun had spread out, becoming a topic of conversation for everyone. It was said that this made the Blood Crow Venerate extremely furious.","He was a Venerate Tier elite, but in his beloved grandson’s body, it was actually the bloodline of the Wolf Tribe that had the upper hand. How could he endure this?","What made him even angrier was the fact that after this incident, the Wolf Tribe bloodline of Zuwa An had actually overwhelmed the Blood Crow bloodline, and strengthened greatly. In future cultivation, he would benefit greatly.","Was this a good thing or a bad thing?","However, awakening one’s bloodline was a very normal thing, so who could they blame?","Thus, the Blood Crow Venerate didn’t summon Yuan Bing, Ling Han, or Lin Yun for questioning.","Right at this moment, a message came from the Dark Battlefield. Ling Han had a match.","Time was two days later; opponent was Lin Yun!"]},{"number":4283,"title":"Chapter 4283: Fighting Lin Yun","paragraphs":["Chapter 4283: Fighting Lin Yun","Editor: Henyee Translations","He was finally going to battle Lin Yun.","Ling Han couldn’t help but be filled with anticipation. Being oppressed by the five great Imperial Clans, although the Nine Mountains Saint managed to turn the tables, Ling Han was still extremely displeased. Of course, it would be best for him to avenge himself.","Now, he would first kill Lin Yun, and in the future, he would also kill that so-called Imperial Son Xuan and so on. He would defeat all those Golden Generation elites, and finally, he would raze the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan to the ground, and see if they could still do as they liked.","Ling Han adjusted his condition. After all, he was battling against the Silver Generation, and Lin Yun’s cultivation level was higher than his. He had a rare treasure on him, so he wouldn’t be affected by the negative effects. Thus, this opponent was still a little difficult to deal with.","Two days quickly passed, and Ling Han arrived at the Dark Battlefield.","It was clear that the Dark Battlefield also placed great importance on this battle. They actually closed off the other areas of battle, and opened up the entire battlefield to Ling Han and Lin Yun as the stage for their battle.","After all, these two people represented the strongest battle prowess of the True Self Tier.","There were countless spectators, and second-generation young masters like Zuwa An had also arrived. In his private room, there were also four young people seated, three men and one woman respectively.","Zuwa An’s expression was ugly, and he asked angrily, “It’s not like you guys don’t have private rooms. Why have you all come to my place?”","From the tone of his voice, it was clear that the status of these four people was not inferior to his.","Thus, it was very easy to guess the identities of these four people. They were the most doted descendants of the other four Venerate Tier elites.","“I heard that you awakened your Wolf Tribe bloodline a few days ago, and ran around the city naked. Thus, I’ve especially come to congratulate you,” a purple-robed young man said with a smile. “I heard grandpa say that your Wolf Tribe bloodline is also very high grade, suppressing the Blood Crow bloodline.”","This was really touching a sore spot. Zuwa An’s expression was livid. He had turned into a black wolf, and his whole body was covered with long fur. Actually, he had not exposed anything, but strictly speaking, this was indeed naked. How embarrassing.","“Ziming, don’t provoke him anymore,” the only woman said. She was dressed in green, and her red lips were as red as blood. She was extremely beautiful.","“Hahaha!” The three men all laughed exaggeratedly.","Zuwa An was both furious and enraged. He didn’t know why his Wolf Tribe bloodline had suddenly awakened, but he blamed this on Ling Han and Lin Yun. Perhaps the outsiders had something that stimulated his bloodline, causing him to suddenly awaken.","This Wolf Tribe bloodline was extremely noble, and this was originally a good thing. However, it should be known that his grandfather was the Blood Crow Tribe bloodline, while it was the Wolf Tribe bloodline that had suppressed the Blood Crow bloodline. Wouldn’t this cause him to fall out of favor?","“Get lost, all of you get lost quickly!” He was about to lose his temper.","“All right, all right, all right.” The three men and one woman all left smilingly.","Zuwa An stared at the battlefield, and the image of Ling Han flashed through his mind. He couldn’t help but shudder.","For some reason, when he thought of Ling Han, he felt a strong sense of reverence. In fact, it even surpassed the Blood Crow Venerate.","It could be said that even if Ling Han stood in front of him and allowed him to kill him, he would not be able to bring himself to do it.","“It would be best if the two of you die together,” Zuwa An said. At present, it was impossible for him and Lin Yun to return to their previous relationship. Furthermore, the awakening of his bloodline could also be related to Lin Yun. Thus, he hoped that Ling Han and Lin Yun would die together.","Time slowly crept by, and it wasn’t long before Ling Han and Lin Yun both appeared on stage.","Instantly, a tsunami of cheers rang out from the spectators’ seats.","Most of the people here had been banished, and there was no shortage of vicious and depraved people. Furthermore, there were no rules here, and murder and robbery would happen at any time. Thus, everyone was naturally bloodthirsty.","Ling Han and Lin Yun faced each other.","“Ling Han, this time, you won’t be able to escape death!” Lin Yun said balefully.","“Oh?” Ling Han smiled faintly, “You’re that confident?”","“I’ve already cultivated the fifth form of the True Self Tier to its limit. I’m only a step away from advancing into the sixth form,” Lin Yun said proudly. “If you had met me a few days later, humph! You wouldn’t have been able to withstand even a single strike!”","He indeed had the right to be arrogant. As an Imperial Son at the end of the fifth form, just how terrifying would his battle prowess be?","“Since that’s the case, I’ll oblige you. Let’s have a mortal duel!” Ling Han said.","In the Dark Battlefield, there were two ways to determine the victor. The first was to admit defeat, and the second was to beat someone to death.","If it was a mortal duel, it would be useless even if he admitted defeat. The battle would not end, and someone had to die.","“Sure!” Lin Yun nodded. There were no ley lines here that could be mobilized, so Ling Han was equivalent to having lost the ability to escape. He could take this opportunity to kill him.","Their application was quickly approved, and the tournament stage battle was changed to a mortal duel.","Only one person could survive!","“Ling Han, you are truly extraordinarily stupid.” Now that things had come to this, there was nothing that could be changed. A twisted expression appeared on Lin Yun’s face, “What made you so confident that you would dare to fight a mortal duel with me?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, and raised his fist, “Naturally, it is my abilities.”","“Laughable, this is really too laughable.” Lin Yun laughed loudly, “Foolish man, I’ll send you on your way now!”","He immediately raised his hand, and sent out a palm strike with his right hand. The Regulations of heaven and earth transformed into a massive palm that descended down on Ling Han.","Ling Han humphed, and shot out a punch, greeting that giant palm in the skies.","Peng!","The gigantic palm was instantly shattered by the force of the punch.","“Hmm?” A look of surprise appeared on Lin Yun’s face. Although he hadn’t used any celestial technique, his raw power had already reached 43 Heavens. How could he be underestimated?","“The Fourth Form of the True Self Tier!” He stared at Ling Han closely for a while, and using some kind of Mystical Power, finally managed to clearly see Ling Han’s cultivation level.","“Surprised?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“A little, but so what!” Lin Yun charged out, his figure turning into a fire dragon, brandishing the boundless Regulations.","He was getting serious now. The Imperial Technique channelled, and his battle prowess instantly soared to 52 Heavens!","Ling Han showed no weakness, and began exchanging blows with Lin Yun.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The Regulations collided, turning into countless shards of brilliance. The aftermath of energy boiled, like boiling water.","The two young prodigies continued to exchange blows, unleashing their battle prowess to their heart’s content.","It was hard to determine the victor.","In terms of battle prowess, Ling Han was actually slightly inferior. However, he could automatically disperse attacks within six Heavens. Thus, so what if Lin Yun’s battle prowess was stronger than his by one Heaven? This was only a slight advantage, and could not be converted into a victory.","However, all the spectators were dumbfounded. They could never imagine that a True Self Tier cultivator could actually possess such terrifying battle prowess.","Heavens, was this the prodigy of the outside world?","Lin Yun frowned deeply. At first, he had thought that his battle prowess would be able to firmly suppress Ling Han, but he did indeed have a certain advantage in battle prowess, but it was completely insufficient to turn it into a victory. This was something he could not accept.","Moreover, the strength of Ling Han’s endurance was well-known. If they fought a drawn-out battle, he would lose.","“Die!” Lin Yun summoned the Jade Water Sword. With a wave of the sword, waves instantly appeared in the blue sea, and endless tsunami waves surged over.","This was formed from the Regulations of Water, possessing astonishing destructive power.","Yet Ling Han merely brandished his fists. He walked the path of his own strength, and his fists could flatten the world."]},{"number":4284,"title":"Chapter 4284: Intimidation is ineffective","paragraphs":["Chapter 4284: Intimidation is ineffective","Editor: Henyee Translations","Although Lin Yun’s Jade Water Sword wasn’t an Imperial Weapon, how could a replica Tool produced by the Imperial Clan be ordinary? This was especially the case since he was the Imperial Son. The materials he used were top-notch.","As the sword swept out, not only were there multiple seals, they were boosted with the Regulations of heaven and earth, as well as the might of the Divine Metal itself, which increased its destructive power.","Boom! The Sword Qi tore through the air, and it was as if even planets could be shattered.","Ling Han was completely unafraid. He brandished his fists to parry, directly blocking the Jade Water Sword.","He could absorb all power within six Heavens, so this kind of defense was naturally awesome. However, he had another disadvantage, and that was he would be wounded by sharp weapons.","However, after he cultivated the Body Art, this shortcoming no longer existed.","His physique could completely be treated as the sturdiest Divine Metal among his peers, allowing him to truly possess the confidence to face a Celestial Tool head-on with his bare hands.","Come.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them continued to exchange blows. The Regulations exploded, and even if it was just a shockwave, it was still extremely destructive.","The spectators at the outer circle hurriedly retreated. They couldn’t withstand the aftermath, so they had to retreat. Otherwise, they would either die or be injured.","“The top prodigies of the outside world are indeed as awesome as the legends say!” In the private room, a red-haired woman’s eyes lit up. She was Crimson Moon Venerate’s granddaughter, Mi Qingdie. She was also the descendant that Crimson Moon Venerate liked the most in this generation.","Thus, Mi Qingdie was also one of the top-notch second-generation young masters of the City of Death. It was because of this that she had dared to watch Zuwa An make a fool of himself.","“This kind of man, I should try to see how fierce he can be in bed.” She smiled, her bearing seductive and alluring.","And in the other private rooms, those like Zuwa An and the others were frowning deeply. They had no intention of “playing around”. The stronger Ling Han and Lin Yun were, the more uneasy they would be.","They were still young, and did not want to stay here forever. Hence, they wanted to leave, and enter into a real great world, to start a new life for themselves.","However, if the people outside were all so awesome, then wouldn’t they be asking for a beating if they went out?","Fight, fight, fight.","Ling Han was filled with heroic spirit. Though the Imperial Son was not affected by any negative effects, he did not take it to heart. He was confident that he was invincible. Even if he could not use a few abilities, he would still be able to kill Lin Yun.","On the other hand, the more Lin Yun fought, the less confident he became.","It couldn’t be helped. His battle prowess was only superior to Ling Han by one Heaven, but in terms of endurance, how could he compare to Ling Han?","There was no way to take Ling Han down in a short period of time. If this dragged on for too long, he would definitely lose.","It should be known that they were fighting a mortal duel, and the losing side... meant death.","Die?","This was something that Lin Yun had never considered before, at least until his lifespan dried up. He was destined to become a Saint, and his brilliant life had just begun. How could he have imagined that he would die?","However, this word was now churning in his mind, causing him to feel fear.","“Afraid?” Ling Han asked calmly. He could already clearly sense that his opponent’s battle prowess had weakened slightly.","Lin Yun remained silent. He naturally knew himself well, and merely attacked madly. His right hand slashed through the air, while his left hand grabbed tens of thousands of Regulations, turning them into Divine Swords to attack Ling Han.","He still had a trump card up his sleeve. In truth, his power had not truly begun to decline. He was laying a trap for Ling Han.","However, with Ling Han’s battle experience, how could he not tell?","He didn’t give Lin Yun any chance at all. Every punch was violent, forcing Lin Yun to parry with all his might. Mystical power flowed out of him like water.","After battling for another half an hour, Lin Yun finally felt panic.","That was because his power had really begun to decline, and Ling Han had completely leveled the playing field, and if this continued, it would not be difficult to foresee that he would fall into a disadvantage, and be killed by Ling Han in the end.","He had come here to rapidly increase his cultivation level in order to catch up to the Golden Generation, not to seek death!","He was the Imperial Son, and he had a bright future ahead of him. How could he be willing to die here?","“Stop!” he shouted loudly.","How could Ling Han possibly listen? His fists continued to rain down.","When he called out loudly, what Imperial Clan was willing to listen to him?","Lin Yun frowned, and after feigning a move, he immediately turned around and left.","“Humph, you’ve activated the mortal duel, and you actually think of forfeiting the battle?” With a cold humph, an elite moved. Weng, weng, weng! Innumerable Regulations appeared, turning into a massive cage that enshrouded the entire battlefield.","Lin Yun brandished his sword in a slash, but light blazed, and the cage was completely unmoved.","It could not be broken through!","Lin Yun was both anxious and furious. He shouted loudly, “I am the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan’s Lin Yun. If anything happens to me here, all of you will die!”","Instantly, boos rang out.","This place was filled with mad men, bloodthirsty and yearning for battle. Lin Yun actually used his background to suppress others, so they naturally looked down on him.","Was a mortal duel a joke?","Lin Yun waited for a while, but the Regulations that had sealed him showed no signs of dispersing.","This!","“Humph, don’t use the Imperial Clan as a scare tactic,” the elite said calmly. “The Imperial Clan can’t enter, so just give up! I might as well tell you. A very, very long time ago, a Saint brought the Imperial Weapon and attempted to force his way in, but what happened?”","“The Saint has died, and only the Imperial Weapon streaked through space and left.”","Lin Yun couldn’t help but feel his heart clench. Why didn’t he know about this part of history?","He suddenly recalled that a Saint of the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan had once passed away in an accident. It was announced to the outside world that he had gone mad from cultivating. This had once confused the Saint of the Lin Clan, and he thought that the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan had deliberately concealed the truth.","Could it be that it was here that the Saint had died?","He might have solved a mystery, but his heart was getting colder and colder.","In this place, even the hands of the Imperial Clan were unable to reach out. Then what meaning did his identity as an Imperial Son have?","“Lin Yun, come fight me!” Behind him, Ling Han said calmly. He didn’t take advantage of the opening to attack.","Lin Yun turned around, his eyes filled with viciousness.","Fine, then he would put his life on the line.","Boom!","He ignited his Imperial Bloodline, and his battle prowess instantly returned to its peak. Furthermore, there was still some improvement, though it was pitifully small.","This was natural. The Silver Generation was already not much inferior to the Great Emperors in their youth. Even if he ignited the Imperial Bloodline, his improvement would not be very great.","“You want to kill me? Humph, then I’ll kill you even if it means shattering my foundations!” Lin Yun said resolutely. His right hand formed into a claw and ruthlessly pressed down on his chest.","Pu, his chest immediately split open, and blood gushed out. However, not a single drop fell. Instead, it turned into a ball of flames.","Ling Han saw very clearly that these flames actually contained terrifying Regulations, which made him feel wary.","This was Imperial Blood!","This ball of fire turned into a sword. Its shape was similar to the Jade Water Sword, but the aura it exuded was countless times more terrifying.","“Die!” Lin Yun’s expression was twisted. Not only did this Imperial Blood Spirit Tool have to extract all his Imperial Blood, it would also damage his dao foundations, and only then would he be able to deliver an attack that surpassed his cultivation level.","However, if his dao foundatios were damaged, he could still rebuild it. However, if he died, everything would be for naught.","Hence, he did not hesitate to take a gamble.","Shua! The flaming sword slashed over, bringing with it Lin Yun’s boundless killing intent and hatred.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4285,"title":"Chapter 4285: Killing Lin Yun","paragraphs":["Chapter 4285: Killing Lin Yun","Editor: Henyee Translations","The might of this strike was too terrifying.","60 Heavens? 70 Heavens?","Ling Han had never attained such high battle prowess before, nor had he seen anyone reach it before. Thus, he had no way to judge. However, there was one thing he was certain of. If he still threw a punch to take it head-on, his fist would definitely be severed, and his body would also be split into two.","Furthermore, this strike was too fast, so fast that even he could not dodge.","Using the Great Emperor Horn?","Thoughts flashed through Ling Han’s mind like lightning. No, he immediately denied it. With the speed of this strike, even if he made Lin Yun lose control and howl like a wolf, it was not enough to affect the course of the Blazing Flame Blood Sword. Thus, he would still be hit.","There was nothing else that could be done.","Ling Han sighed, and with a thought, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower immediately appeared.","However, the precious tool kept a low profile, and did not show any brilliance. Even the air of Primal Chaos did not descend.","Pu!","The Blazing Flame Blood Sword arrived, and struck the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. The impact was so great that even the precious tool trembled. Meanwhile, Ling Han and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower were connected mentally, and felt his chest boil as he immediately spluttered out a mouthful of blood.","F***, this strike was really very powerful. He had used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower as a shield, yet was still unable to completely block it. Its destructive power was really too terrifying.","However, he didn’t know that Lin Yun really wanted to cry at this moment.","This strike had been delivered at the cost of damaging his dao foundations, and had also exhausted all the Imperial Blood. Just how terrifying would the might of this strike be?","Yet Ling Han had actually blocked it!","This caused his vision to darken, and he almost fainted.","Hold on, he looked at Ling Han. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had already been stored away, but with his memory, he would naturally be able to remember it with a single glance.","This was... the Imperial Weapon of Nine Mountains Saint!","He was certain of it. The scene of the Nine Mountains Saint confronting the five Saints with the “Imperial Weapon” was broadcasted live by the entire Galaxy Network. Even if he didn’t have a connection device, he still had the means to see it.","This Imperial Weapon was actually in Ling Han’s possession?","Hold on, this was definitely impossible. Furthermore, the Imperial Weapon wasn’t that weak, and would actually tremble after taking a blow from him. In fact, it even made the owner throw up blood — even if it hadn’t awakened, the Imperial Weapon was still the Imperial Weapon, capable of killing him with a single rebound.","Thus!","Realization suddenly dawned on him. This was not an Imperial Weapon, but merely a piece of Origin Gold! The reason why even Saints had been apprehensive at that time was because what Saint would dare to use their divine sense to examine an Imperial Weapon?","With this backlash, the Saint would definitely be in deep trouble.","Thus, the Nine Mountains Saint actually managed to scare the five Imperial Clans into retreat with this fake Imperial Weapon.","The whole world had been deceived by these two people!","“So that’s how it is!” Lin Yun gritted his teeth, his eyes spitting fire.","If the five Saints had insisted, then the Nine Suns Holy Land would have long since been destroyed, and Ling Han would naturally have long since died as well. How could he possibly appear here?","Ling Han had long since died, so he definitely wouldn’t have to die.","Ah!","He was mad with fury. As Imperial Son, a Silver Generation elite, his luck was actually so bad?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Suddenly understand? However, you won’t have the chance to tell anyone!”","He charged over. Boom! He unleashed his full battle prowess.","Lin Yun parried the attack. Peng, it was only a single blow, and he was sent flying. His body crashed heavily into the cage of Regulations, and then bounced back. Not only was he throwing up blood madly from his mouth, the wound on his chest had also reopened, blood gushing out madly.","His dao foundation had been destroyed, and his battle prowess was beginning to decline in all directions. Naturally, he was no longer a match for Ling Han.","“The Spirit Tool in Ling Han’s hands is...” Lin Yun roared through divine sense. He was going to reveal Ling Han’s greatest secret and make him become the target of all the great elites of the City of Death. In that way, Ling Han would also have to die with him.","Peng!","Ling Han’s fist had already smashed down, interrupting his divine sense transmission.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","His punches became fiercer and fiercer, and with each punch, a burst of blood would explode from Lin Yun’s body. In just a few punches, Lin Yun had already become a bloody figure.","Lin Yun was unwilling to give up. He hadn’t dug a huge trap for Ling Han yet, so he was willing to risk everything. Even if it meant death, he was going to expose the secret of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","“Origin—” he called out another word.","Peng!","Ling Han threw another punch, and Lin Yun’s divine sense transmission came to an abrupt stop again. The word “Gold” finally didn’t spread out, and could only reverberate in his mind. Meanwhile, his mind... was already beginning to shatter.","Lin Yun stared fixedly at Ling Han, filled with resentment and defiance.","The majestic Imperial Son was actually going to die here?","—There was a special suppression here, and even the Substitution Seal was ineffective.","But no matter how unwilling he was, so what? Ling Han was ruthless, and directly destroyed his mind. One after another, the True Selves shattered, and his consciousness was presently being rapidly destroyed.","Pa! His body weakened, and he collapsed to the ground. His life essence rapidly disappeared.","Instantly, the whole area was filled with cheers.","This kind of battle was exciting! And in the end, one person had lost his life, satisfying their thirst for blood. Naturally, they were satisfied.","The Regulations prison had also been removed, which meant that Ling Han could now leave.","Ling Han composed himself and left.","Merely killing Lin Yun wasn’t enough to make him happy. Moreover, he was still recalling Lin Yun’s final attack.","This attack was extremely powerful, and the current him was completely unable to block it. Even if he used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he was still wounded to the point of throwing up blood.","The Imperial Son was not to be underestimated, especially after he had advanced into the True Self Tier, and could use the Regulations. There were too many tricks up his sleeve.","But there was nothing that could be done. Imperial Blood flowed in the Imperial Son’s veins. This was the blessing of his ancestor, and had nothing to do with natural talent or hard work. He could not be envious of this.","Ling Han continued to cultivate diligently. He had come here to rapidly increase his cultivation level. Everything else could be discussed after he left.","After one battle after another, Ling Han obtained more and more Source Dao Stones. However, he still couldn’t find any clues as to where the Source Dao Stone originated from.","His successive victories had already expanded to a hundred, creating a new record. Thus, the Dark Battlefield especially gifted him a suit of Battle Armor. It did not have the effect of increasing battle prowess, and merely looked heroic and good.","Under the request of the Dark Battlefield, he would wear this Battle Armor every time he appeared, and was bestowed the title of One Punch King.","—Because in the following battles, he had defeated his opponents with a single punch.","On this day, his battle ended. He changed his clothes backstage, then left.","However, he had just removed the armor he was wearing, when he discovered that someone had entered quietly. He turned his head, and saw that there was a red-haired woman standing near the entrance. Her starry eyes were like water, and her charm was bone-deep.","“My name is Mi Qingdie,” the red-haired woman introduced herself. Then, she stared at Ling Han’s chest, and actually licked her lips, looking perverted.","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and he already knew the identity of this woman.","...Crimson Moon Venerate’s granddaughter.","F***, why didn’t Yuan Bing tell him that this woman seemed to be a love-struck fool?","“Lady Mi.” Ling Han nodded as he quickly put on his shirt.","Mi Qingdie couldn’t help but swallow again, and said, “Aren’t you fighting to the death here for the sake of the Source Dao Stone? Come, as long as you follow Big Sister, Big Sister will give you as many Source Dao Stones as you want in the future.”","—"]},{"number":4286,"title":"Chapter 4286: Clues","paragraphs":["Chapter 4286: Clues","Editor: Henyee Translations","Er, was she planning to make him a kept man?","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. There would actually come a day when he would become someone’s kept man.","“Little brother, your smile is truly captivating!” Mi Qingdie licked her lips, looking like she wanted nothing more than to swallow Ling Han whole.","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, and said, “Apologies, I only sell my skill, not my body.”","“If Big Sister doesn’t pay money, then it can’t be considered as selling body,” Mi Qingdie said shamelessly.","Ling Han was almost rendered speechless. This woman was truly shameless.","He pulled out his sleeve, and was just about to leave.","“What’s the hurry?” Mi Qingdie’s figure swayed, blocking the entrance.","Ling Han merely smiled. Xiu, he had already brushed past her. This was no big deal.","“Little brother!” Mi Qingdie hurriedly chased after him, “Wait for Big Sister.”","Ling Han naturally ignored her. He strode off, his speed extremely fast.","Mi Qingdie set off in hot pursuit. It had not been just one or two days since she had coveted Ling Han’s “strength”.","Ling Han ignored her, and strode forwards.","Yi?","Just as he stepped out of the battlefield, he saw a person.","Little Lord Wolf, Zuwa An.","That’s right. This top-notch second-generation descendant of the Wolf Tribe had now gained another nickname. Naturally, it was because he had “awakened” the Wolf Tribe bloodline, and had obtained it by running naked all over the city in pursuit of Lin Yun.","“Little Lord Wolf!” Ling Han called out.","Zuwa An instantly felt an urge to smack him. In his eyes, this nickname was a great humiliation, but when he saw Ling Han, a feeling of reverence rose up from the bottom of his heart. That was a fear and obedience that came from deep within his bones.","“What, what’s the matter?” He pretended to be calm.","“Help me block the lunatic behind me,” Ling Han said. With a flash, he had passed them.","Zuwa An could already see Mi Qingdie behind him. He wanted nothing more than for her to swallow Ling Han whole and skin him alive. However, he couldn’t resist Ling Han’s command from the bottom of his heart, so he could only step out to block her.","“Zuwa An, don’t ruin my business!” Mi Qingdie said in displeasure. Seeing that Ling Han would soon disappear without a trace, she felt irritated.","Zuwa An humphed, and said, “Scram, don’t trifle with me!”","“Heh, after awakening your bloodline, even your temper has become hot.” Mi Qingdie was also very angry.","Boom!","The two of them immediately began fighting, and for a moment, it was incredibly intense.","Ling Han didn’t walk too far. Instead, he stopped after turning a corner, and began to watch the show from the shadows.","He was observing just how great the influence of the Great Emperor Horn was on Zuwa An.","“It seems like this can really command the Wolf Tribe, even if it is only a half-assed Wolf Tribe like Zuwa An.”","“Hehe, this seems to be useful.”","Ling Han turned around and left. A day later, he paid a visit to this Little Lord Wolf.","After receiving the report, Zuwa An reluctantly invited Ling Han in.","“What are you doing here?” he asked, putting on a fierce appearance but actually feeling cowardly.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “I’m here to see a friend.”","Who is your friend? Who the hell is your friend?","Zuwa An mocked internally, but did not dare show it on his face. He merely humphed.","After Ling Han rambled on for a while, he began to beat around the bush, probing to see if Zuwa An knew any secrets regarding the Source Dao Stone mine.","He was the most beloved grandson of a Venerate Tier elite, so there was a chance that he could win.","It wasn’t long before a smile spread across his face. Zuwa An actually knew about this.","It was extremely likely that the Source Dao Stone mine was located in the Black Cloud Mountain outside the city.","The news was not absolute, because Zuwa An only knew that the Blood Crow Venerate would make a trip to the Black Cloud Mountain every once in a while.","Going by this deduction, it was somewhat possible that the Black Cloud Mountain was the location of the Source Dao Stone mine.","Ling Han nodded, and soon left.","He did not move at the first instant, but rather continued to battle in the Dark Battlefield, earning Source Dao Stones. He had already entered this space for a year, and his cultivation level had also reached the middle stage of the Fourth Form. His improvement could be considered quite astonishing.","However, it was not that he had not paid a price, sacrificing more than three hundred years of his lifespan.","A True Self Tier possessed a theoretical lifespan of 10,000 years, so he could still afford expending a lifespan of 300 years.","After all, once he broke through to the Spirit Transformation Tier, his lifespan limit would be increased to 20,000 years.","Practically every few days, there would be people arriving at the City of Death. They were either exiles or people who had come here to train, and recently, there had been a wave of people entering. People arrived almost every day.","And a rookie very quickly rose to fame, and was very forceful.","When this person’s name reached Ling Han’s ears, he couldn’t help but feel surprised, because it was actually Ding Shu.","Why had this guy come here?","Ling Han pondered for a moment. Perhaps it was because the Buddhist Race of the North Heavenly Realm no longer had enough resources to support the advancement of his cultivation level. For super geniuses like them, their ability to comprehend Dao was spine-chillingly strong. As long as there was endless cultivation resources, their cultivation level would soar.","On the other hand, for ordinary prodigies, even if they had Source Dao Stones, they wouldn’t be able to. If they weren’t skilled enough in comprehending Dao, forcibly raising their cultivation level would only result in their own demise.","Thus, Ding Shu’s choice was the same as his.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and ignored this.","After being silent for so many days, it was time for him to go to the Black Cloud Mountain to take a look.","He quietly left the city, and soon arrived at his destination.","This was an incredibly tall mountain, like a great sword that pierced directly into the clouds.","Ling Han searched in the mountains, releasing his divine sense to search inch by inch.","Unfortunately, there were no ley lines here that he could borrow. Otherwise, the speed of his exploration could be increased tenfold, or even a hundredfold.","As long as there was no battle, he would explore here, but after half a month, he still did not find any clues.","He made another trip to Zuwa An’s place to find out more about the situation. Then, he went to the Black Cloud Mountain again.","—The Blood Crow Venerate would be coming here recently.","He waited, and true enough, only two days later, an elite appeared, landing at the summit.","Was it the Blood Crow Venerate?","Ling Han had never seen him before, but he could sense his terrifying aura. He was indeed a Venerate Tier elite.","He took out the Void Beast hide, and used the Strange Shadow Steps. Under the double cover, he finally headed towards the summit.","Xiu, xiu, xiu, xiu! Just as he was climbing to the summit, another four powerful figures actually streaked across the skies, and landed on the summit.","Yi?","The five people who arrived one after another were extremely powerful, all of them exuding the aura of Venerate Tier.","The five Venerate Tier elites of the City of Death?","In other words, the first Venerate to arrive might not be the Blood Crow Venerate.","Were these five Venerate Tier elites here to divide the Source Dao Stones among themselves?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and he couldn’t help but speed up.","Very quickly, he arrived at the summit, and saw that the five Venerate Tier elites were all sitting cross-legged, as if they were stone statues.","They definitely didn’t come out of the city for a visit. Instead, they were probably communicating with their divine sense, right?","Weng, a terrifying divine sense swept past, passing over Ling Han’s body.","A sturdy old man suddenly stood up, a suspicious expression on his face.","“Crimson Moon, you’re being paranoid again,” an elder with a pair of blood-colored wings on his back said with a smile. Needless to say, he was definitely the Blood Crow Tier Venerate.","This sturdily-built old man was naturally Crimson Moon Venerate. He swept his divine sense over again, and said, “I’m not being paranoid here. I’m just being careful!”"]},{"number":4287,"title":"Chapter 4287: Conjecture","paragraphs":["Chapter 4287: Conjecture","Editor: Henyee Translations","Two of them had already spoken, and the remaining three Venerate Tier elites didn’t communicate with their divine sense anymore. Instead, they started to speak as well.","“Everyone, there are no Saint-level Regulations here. Furthermore, the people of the City of Death only know slaughter, and have no faith.” The Brahman Sea Bodhisattva said, “Thus, we cannot become Saints here, and must go to the outside world.”","“Who doesn’t want to become a Saint? But the question is, how did we enter into this place in the first place?” The Nine Palace Venerate said, “When those people, or rather, those forces find out that we had exited the Dark Clouds Hell, how could they sit by and watch us break through to Saint Tier?”","In the past, they had not entered this place willingly, but had rather been exiled. Thankfully, they were very fortunate. Not only had they not died here, they had instead grown step by step into Venerate Tier-level great elites.","However, Venerate Tier elites could be regarded as kings in this place, but if they ran outside, they would still be suppressed by Saints.","“Furthermore, how could it be that we would give up our base here just like that?” the Ice Silkworm Venerate said.","These words silenced the five Venerate Tier elites. They naturally couldn’t let go of everything here.","The Source Dao Stone was too useful. Though it was actually an equivalent exchange with the price of lifespan, it was believed that there were a great many people in this world that were willing to spend great amounts of money to obtain it.","With such resources in hand, it was enough to become a powerful force!","“After so many years of preparation, how could it be that you all are still not satisfied?” The Blood Crow Venerate said calmly, “Furthermore, do you all still not know the current trend of the world? The True Dragon Abyss has opened, and the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor has appeared. All this indicated one truth.","“The time to become Emperor has arrived!”","“If we don’t seize this opportunity, hoho, won’t you all regret it?”","The four Venerate Tier elites were all moved by his words. As long as they were cultivators, which one of them didn’t have the ambition of becoming Emperor? However, due to the limitations of natural talent, resources, and various other conditions, most people would definitely know their own limitations.","However, being able to become a Venerate, this in itself represented a powerful natural talent in cultivation. How could the five Venerate Tier elites not have designs on it?","“All right, I agree to leave.” The Nine Palace Venerate nodded, “However, how do we continue to control this space? We have to think of a suitable way.”","“For people with low cultivation levels, it’s easy to come in here and difficult to leave, but for us, it’s easy to leave, but it’s difficult to come back in.” The Brahman Sea Bodhisattva looked at the other four people, “How about staying for another three years?”","The Blood Crow Venerate and the others exchanged looks before nodding slowly, saying, “Alright, we’ll wait another three years.”","“Three years later, let go of everything else, rush out of this space, and take a gamble for the sake of becoming Emperor.”","After saying this, the five Venerate Tier elites all tore through the air and left.","Ling Han didn’t move. After a long while, Crimson Moon Venerate’s figure appeared before him. He looked around in confusion, and murmured, “Could it be that I’ve been overly suspicious?”","After saying this, he left again.","Ling Han still didn’t move. After at least half a day, the figure of Crimson Moon Venerate appeared once more.","The old geezer was indeed very suspicious. Just because he had suspicions, he actually pretended to leave twice.","Ling Han left quietly. ‘You can come as many times as you like. I’m not playing with you anymore.’","He was already certain that this Black Cloud Mountain was not the mine that produced the Source Dao Stones, but rather the meeting place of the five Venerate Tier elites.","As for why they had to leave the city and come here, Ling Han didn’t know, nor was he interested in finding out.","“If the Source Dao Stone isn’t here, then where is it?”","“There’s another thing that’s suspicious. This City of Death has already existed for many, many years. What mine is so durable that it still hasn’t been emptied?”","“From the tone of those five Venerate Tier elites, it seems like there’s an inexhaustible supply of Source Stones. That’s why they want to eternally control this place.”","“This doesn’t make sense.”","“Could it be that my previous judgement was wrong? In truth, the Source Dao Stone wasn’t mined?”","As for ores, thinking about it, they must have come from a mine. This was something to be expected.","However, the Dao Stone wasn’t harvested from the mine, but refined by elites.","Thus, this Source Dao Stone might not have been mined.","Ling Han wracked his brains. Firstly, this was definitely not refined. Otherwise, it could not possibly become a specialty of the City of Death. Secondly, this kind of resource must have been jointly grasped by the five Venerable Tier elites, or their relationship would not have been so harmonious.","Then, what place would be jointly owned by five Venerate Tier elites?","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. Dark Battlefield!","That’s right. As far as he knew, this place was jointly owned by the five Venerate Tier elites.","Ling Han had a question before, and that was what was the point of hosting this kind of tournament?","Could the five Venerate Tier elites obtain benefits?","If there were no benefits to be gained, why would a Venerate Tier cultivator do such a thing?","Now, linking the two together, Ling Han felt like he was about to find the truth.","Ling Han decided to investigate the place where he had battled countless times.","He returned to the City of Death and went to the Dark Battlefield.","This time, he had come in a completely different mood.","Every day, there would be a sea of people here. Could the secret of the Source Dao Stone be hidden here?","Thinking about it, this was too impossible, wasn’t it?","But if this was really the birthplace of the Source Dao Stone, then it really lived up to the saying that the most dangerous place was the safest place. Who would have thought that the Source Dao Stone would actually be here?","His mentality was different, and Ling Han immediately discovered what was strange.","This place actually did not just comprise of only the spectators’ seats, the battle area, and the backstage area. Ling Han discovered that there was another passageway that should lead underground, but this passageway had been sealed off, and a very powerful restriction had been placed.","Usually, there would be people coming and going here, and Ling Han would not have the time to decipher it at all, and at night, this place would be sealed off, and heavily guarded.","After midnight, Ling Han sneaked in with the Strange Shadow Steps. He carefully studied the restriction, but soon shook his head. This was set by a Venerate Tier, and there was no way he could break through it.","—Even if one had the ability to forcibly break through, it would immediately alert the Venerate Tier that had set up the restrictions. With the size of the City of Death, those five big shots would immediately arrive.","Was there really no other way?","Ling Han returned, racking his brains for ideas.","In these two months, he had obtained another pile of Source Dao Stones. Because the number of consecutive wins was continuously increasing, he had also obtained rich rewards, pushing his cultivation level to the end of the fourth form.","He first set aside the matter of breaking through the restrictions, and began to charge towards the fifth form with all his might.","The fourth form was the Golden Fetus, then what was the fifth form?","It was indefinite.","Every person who broke through their limits would form a different fifth form. Some could possibly be Purple Qi Origin Fetus, while some could be Glass Jade Fetus. Thus, before breaking through, Ling Han didn’t know what he would form.","Come, begin the barrage.","Ling Han went into seclusion to attempt the fifth form.","He was naturally very confident in breaking through his limits. For others, the Fifth Form was their limit, but for him, wasn’t that natural?","It was said that the Golden Generation had once reached the Eighth Form, so his target was naturally the Ninth Form. He couldn’t be on an equal footing with those guys, or even in fact, inferior to them, right?"]},{"number":4288,"title":"Chapter 4288: Finding Helpers","paragraphs":["Chapter 4288: Finding Helpers","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han began to charge towards the fifth form.","After the True Self underwent multiple transformations, it had accumulated more and more Dao. If one wanted to make it undergo another transformation, the difficulty level was naturally increasing further and further.","Thus, for the majority of cultivators, the Fourth Form was the end, and they could now attempt to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier. Meanwhile, the Spirit Transformation Tier would also become their end, and it was impossible for them to advance any further.","If he wanted to have hopes of breaking through to Sect Master Tier, he would have to break through his limits and reach the Fifth Form.","From this aspect, every Sect Master was very valuable, and there was no longer any mediocre talent among them.","Ling Han’s finishing line naturally wasn’t limited to the Sect Master-level. Thus, the fifth form was only the beginning. If even breaking through to the fifth form was filled with difficulties, then he might as well give up and become a full-time daddy.","He continued to gain enlightenment. In his mind, the True Self of Destruction was exuding golden light. This was a Golden Fetus, but he clearly couldn’t tell what state it was evolving into yet.","Ling Han was in no hurry. He merely settled his accumulation, turning it into his appreciation of the Dao of heaven and earth.","In his mind, indescribable Regulations surged, exuding a supreme aura.","This didn’t originate from Ling Han, but from the nine True Selves. These True Selves were basically formed from a core of nine-star high-level energy. Now, it was as if the cores of these True Selves had awakened, stimulating mysterious Regulations.","Ling Han extracted these Regulations and boosted them on the True Self, using them to advance the evolution of the True Self.","However, the ‘true self’ had already transformed into the fourth form, and was filled with repulsive properties. When the Regulations boosted it, they were easily shattered and bounced back.","Ling Han could only take things slowly, bit by bit. This was both a change to his mind, and also an improvement to his level of being. He was sure that when he advanced into the fifth form, the upper limit of his Body Arts would also be unlocked.","With his continuous efforts, the repulsion from the True Self of Destruction became smaller and smaller. Finally, it began to transform into the fifth form.","Boom!","A great commotion arose in his mind. The golden light emitted by the True Self of Destruction suddenly dimmed, but only an instant later, three-coloured light blazed.","Success.","A smile appeared at the corners of Ling Han’s lips, but he did not look like he was going to stop at all. Now that the upper limit of his evolution had just been unlocked, the heaven and earth would bestow a boost, and this was the best time to increase his cultivation level. How could he stop at this moment?","Moreover, he had never imagined that his fifth form would actually be a Tricolor Fetus.","It seemed that only when someone had cultivated to the sixth form, or even the seventh form in fact, would it be possible to nurture a three-coloured Fetus, but Ling Han had just advanced into the fifth form, and had already formed a three-coloured Fetus. Then, what about when he cultivated to the sixth or seventh form in future?","Four-coloured Fetus, five-coloured Fetus?","Ling Han couldn’t help but be filled with anticipation. This was a massive leap.","He suppressed his excitement and continued to cultivate.","The True Self of Destruction was being reconstructed, and the tri-coloured light became brighter and brighter. Though it was only one, it was even more dazzling than the other eight True Selves added together.","Because this was a qualitative evolution, it was completely different.","Three days later, Ling Han finally stopped.","The True Self of Destruction had already completely evolved into a three-colored fetus, and the upper limit of his Body Art had also been lifted. It could support him to continue improving, and not fall behind his mystical power.","“If I were to battle Lin Yun again now, I would be able to destroy him at any time,” Ling Han said with a smile as he sensed his own power.","Double raw powers of 45 Heavens burst forth at the same time, and merely pure power alone could reach 50 Heavens. Then, when Imperial Technique was unleashed, the limit of battle prowess could reach 6 Heavens.","Ling Han nodded, and murmured, “For ordinary people, celestial techniques are the true way to go. After all, even those who have reached the consummate level of the True Self Tier are only at the power of 12 Heavens. However, an Imperial Technique can increase one’s battle prowess by as many as 9 Heavens.”","“However, to me, power is the way to go.”","“Without the support of power, Imperial Techniques would not be enough.”","He came out of seclusion, and surveyed the Dark Battlefield. He focused his energy back on how he was going to break through the restrictions of the Dark Battlefield.","However, he still had to earn the Source Dao Stones.","Ling Han went to the Dark Battlefield and canceled his ceasefire. Of course, only people with merits like him could enjoy such treatment. If others did this, they would be seen as forfeiting the battle. Then, after accumulating three times, they would not be able to battle in the Dark Battlefield for three years.","He took the chance to study it again, but even if his cultivation level had increased to another level, he was still unable to resolve the restrictions.","Could he... find external help?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind. After some thought, he decided to find someone.","Ding Shu.","Very soon, he found this person that was very similar to him in an inn. This guy was currently courting women, one against three. He was really too carefree.","Upon seeing Ling Han, Ding Shu smiled and waved his hand, saying, “Beauties, I have guests now. Let’s chat again next time.”","The three beauties all giggled, stood up and left.","Ding Shu pointed at the empty spot, and said, “You’re disturbing me from courting women, so you’d better have something important. Otherwise, I’ll be very angry.”","Ling Han smiled, “What is it? Not going to be Buddha Son anymore?”","“Tsk, there’s no profit to be had, and Buddhist Land actually sent someone to make things difficult for me. Do they really think I’m a pushover?” Ding Shu sneered.","Ling Han’s curiosity was piqued, and he asked, “Are you Origin, Myriad Dao or the other?”","Ding Shu looked at Ling Han, and after a while, he finally said, “No! However, as I see it, those few people only have undeserved reputation, especially that ‘Number One in the Galaxy’. Haha, I’m really about to laugh my head off. He actually dares to praise himself like this. I really want to meet him and beat him up.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but rub his chin. Someone wanted to beat him up, so shouldn’t he teach them a lesson?","However, Ding Shu wasn’t one of the three monsters that included Origin?","Ling Han had battled with them before. Although he had only battled through the Galaxy Network and it couldn’t represent actual battle, those three people were truly powerful.","Thus, Ling Han was very surprised that Ding Shu wasn’t one of these three people.","“That’s right, what exactly do you want?” Ding Shu asked.","Ling Han set aside the question of the true identities of Origin and the others, and got down to business. He said, “You have naturally come here for the sake of the Source Dao Stone. Thus, I may have discovered a place that produces Source Dao Stones. Would you be interested in challenging it with me?”","“Oh?” Ding Shu’s interest was instantly piqued, and his eyes lit up. “Of course I’m interested.”","Ling Han smiled and said, “However, that place has been sealed. Even if I’m a formation grandmaster, I still can’t break through it. Do you have any treasures that can instantly break through it?”","Ding Shu squinted his eyes, and looked at Ling Han for a while. He remained silent.","He indeed had this kind of treasure, but it was too precious. At the most crucial moment, it could save his life.","What if Ling Han made a mistake? That would be a great loss to him.","“If we really find the Source Dao Stone, how should we divide it?” Ding Shu asked.","“Of course, we’ll split it evenly,” Ling Han said.","One provided the location, while the other brought the two of them in. Thus, the merits were equal, so it was naturally shared equally.","Ding Shu only hesitated for a moment, then replied, “All right!”","He was also an overlord of the Genesis World, so he naturally had no lack of decisiveness.","“When do we move?”","“Tomorrow.”"]},{"number":4289,"title":"Chapter 4289: Careless Ending","paragraphs":["Chapter 4289: Careless Ending","Editor: Henyee Translations","The exploration this time could possibly go very smoothly. After undoing the restrictions, there was a large storehouse of Source Dao Stones inside. They would divide it up and then flee. However, there could also be twists and turns, and who knew what kind of dangers they would encounter.","Thus, Ling Han and Ding Shu both decided to suspend accepting battles. If anything really happened, they could use “seclusion” as an excuse to draw a clear dividing line between them and the matter.","However, they had just gone to the Dark Battlefield, and had not even applied for an application, when they received a battle notification.","Their next opponent... was actually each other!","“Interesting,” Ding Shu said with a smile. “Ling Han, I’ve always wanted to spar with you.”","Ling Han put away the notice. If he continued to call a ceasefire at this time, it would be considered as deliberately avoiding battle, and would be counted into those three times.","“Sure,” he nodded. In any case, he did not lack the time for a battle.","“Oh, it’s this afternoon.” Ding Shu patted Ling Han’s shoulder, and said, “I won’t go easy on you. If you’re too weak, you’ll lose very badly.”","“Don’t worry, the one who will lose will definitely be you.” Ling Han also patted Ding Shu’s shoulder.","The two of them were now in a cooperative relationship, but with their high natural talent, they would definitely be the strongest opponents in the competition for the imperial throne in future. Perhaps, their battle would last their whole life, right until someone became Emperor.","Just like how the Ancestral King Lingtian and the Nine Suns Sainthad fought to the end all those years ago. They had both won and lost, and until the last moment, it was really unknown who would emerge victorious.","“Then I shall anticipate the battle in the afternoon.”","“Same to you.”","The two of them did not return. They merely rested for a short while in the Dark Battlefield, to adjust their condition. After all, it could not be said that their opponent was not strong.","It wasn’t long before afternoon arrived.","The Dark Battlefield also placed a considerable amount of importance on these two people, vacating the other areas of battle, allowing the two of them to attack as much as they liked.","And when they received the news, the spectators also gathered.","Ling Han’s strength had long since been proven through battle merits. In fact, he had even gained the title of “One Punch King”, and as for Ding Shu, he was also extraordinary. After entering into the Dark Battlefield, he had never lost.","However, now that the two of them had met today, it was destined that one of them would be defeated, and their record of being unbeatable would be broken.","On the spectators’ seats, everyone was cheering as if they had been pumped full of adrenaline.","Zuwa An, Mi Qingdie, and the other second-generation young masters all arrived to watch the battle, each with their own thoughts.","Meanwhile, Ling Han and Ding Shu stood 30 meters away from each other. They both appeared calm and composed, not showing any signs of anger.","“Come,” Ding Shu said. Then, he changed his sloppy attitude, and exuded a blazing fighting spirit. The Regulations materialized, turning into a giant tree that reached the heavens behind him, possessing a terrifying intimidation.","They hadn’t even made a move yet, and merely the suppression of their aura was enough to make countless people’s expressions turn ugly, and they almost vomited blood.","Too strong!","Ling Han was naturally unmoved. He activated his eye technique, and swept his gaze over Ding Shu’s body. Only by knowing one’s own strength and the strength of one’s enemy would one be able to win a hundred battles.","Very soon, a strange smile appeared on his face.","Because... Ding Shu was in the fourth form of the True Self Tier!","Why was there a gap of a minor level between them?","This was very normal. This was because Ling Han had entered this place a year before Ding Shu had, and this one year had allowed him to advance from the Third Form to the Fourth Form. In the outside world, just how many natural treasures would you have to refine to be able to advance so quickly?","Perhaps even the Imperial Clan would have to give it their all to be able to do so, but the Buddhist Race of the North Heavenly Realm could only be considred a Saint-level force, so they naturally could not accomplish that.","Thus, Ding Shu’s cultivation level was left behind by Ling Han, even though it was only a minor level.","His cultivation level was even lower than Ling Han, and he still wanted to defeat him. Wasn’t that a joke?","Forget it.","Ling Han suppressed his cultivation level for a moment. He couldn’t bully others, so he might as well suppress his raw power to the same level as Ding Shu before battling.","“Come!” Ding Shu moved, and the Tree of Regulations behind him swayed. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Countless leaves shot out like darts towards Ling Han.","These leaves were formed by Regulations. If one was cut, it would definitely cause serious injury.","The spectators were all on edge. If these “leaves” were blasted to their side, it would lead to a great catastrophe.","Under the Spirit Transformation Tier, there was absolutely no one that could block it.","However, Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back and simply propped up the Starlight Screen.","Hiss, you want to block it just like that?","Everyone was surprised. This was too conceited, wasn’t it?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The leaves of Regulations landed on the shield, and instantly exploded with endless light. Sure enough, though the Starlight Screen was awesome, it could not withstand such a mad barrage of attacks, and was soon shattered.","The remaining power was boundless, and it continued to blast towards Ling Han. Peng, peng, peng! Light exploded chaotically.","‘What?’","Everyone’s mouths were wide open, and they could see that Ling Han was standing proudly and motionless, as if that was not a terrifying attack that had been formed by Regulations, but merely a gentle breeze.","With the help of the Starlight Screen, how could a power attack within six Heavens possibly hurt Ling Han?","Ding Shu naturally wouldn’t care. If Ling Han couldn’t even block such a simple attack from him, then what right did he have to treat him as a rival?","‘Die!’","He leaped out, and charged towards Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han took this blow head-on, yet his figure suddenly swayed, and took a few steps back.","“Haha, you didn’t expect this, did you?” Ding Shu laughed loudly.","Ling Han nodded and said, “Who would’ve thought? You’ve also completed Body Arts!”","He had not thought that Ding Shu’s Body Art had already caught up to his cultivation level. Thus, the power that he delivered was slightly weaker, and he was no match for Ding Shu.","“If that wasn’t the case, how could my cultivation speed have slowed down so much!” Ding Shu said. Then, he frowned, “Why is your power weaker than mine? Yi, you didn’t deliberately suppress your power, right?”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Apologies, I am already in the fifth form.”","Ding Shu couldn’t help but feel gloomy. What he wanted was a battle to his heart’s content, but Ling Han had suppressed his cultivation level, so what meaning was there to it?","“I’m not fighting anymore.” He was very willful, and directly turned around and left. “I’ve lost this battle. When our cultivation levels are equal, we’ll fight again!”","Ling Han sighed. At first, he had wanted to suppress his cultivation level and spar with Ding Shu. He had not thought that the latter would actually have finished mending the shortcoming in his Body Art, causing him to make an error in his estimation. He was done after only two moves.","Forget it, they would battle again in the future.","Ling Han shook his head, and also exited the Dark Battlefield, leaving behind the dumbfounded spectators.","It ended just like that?","‘Are you guys playing house?’","And precisely because of this, Ling Han and Ding Shu’s request for a ceasefire was not approved. Instead, they were subjected to a war of attrition. If they called a ceasefire, then there was no longer any need for them to appear in the Dark Battlefield again in future. In fact, they would be chased out of the City of Death.","There was nothing else that could be done. Ling Han and Ding Shu could only decide to postpone their plans.","Right at this moment, another supreme prodigy entered the City of Death.","Jade Drop Imperial Clan, Han Di","This was one of the well-known members of the Silver Generation. The moment he entered into the Dark Battlefield, he challenged Ling Han to a mortal duel, his words filled with extreme contempt.","Han Di, named as Emperor, his confidence and arrogance was clear for all to see1."]},{"number":4290,"title":"Chapter 4290: A windfall","paragraphs":["Chapter 4290: A windfall","Editor: Henyee Translations","An Imperial Son of the Silver Generation was naturally powerful. He swept aside all opposition in his path, and was completely unmatched.","It wasn’t long before the Dark Battlefield’s representatives made arrangements for Han Di to battle against Ding Shu.","This was an ordinary tournament stage battle. Before knowing the specific abilities of his opponent, Ding Shu naturally wouldn’t participate in a mortal duel. As experienced as an overlord of the Genesis World, how could he possibly make such a low-level mistake?","Facts proved that this was a very wise move.","Han Di... was actually in the Seventh Form of the True Self Tier. Though he had only just advanced into this level, he had crushed Ding Shu by close to three minor levels of cultivation level. Even Ding Shu, no matter how freakish his natural talent was, was completely suppressed.","This battle naturally ended with Ding Shu’s defeat, and the killing intent of Han Di was extremely strong. If it was not for the fact that Ding Shu had admitted defeat and managed to escape in time, he would even have been killed on the spot.","“This b@stard!”","After the competition, Ling Han went to the inn to visit Ding Shu. The two of them had reached an agreement after all, and were allies. The moment he entered, he heard Ding Shu cursing.","“If our cultivation levels were equal, or even in fact, even if my cultivation level was lower by a minor level, I would still be able to kill him!” Ding Shu was still calling out, his face filled with defiance.","Ling Han also believed that if Genesis World elites like them dominated a battle of equal cultivation levels, they would definitely suppress the Silver Generation. In fact, they might even be able to trample over the Golden Generation.","There was nothing that could be done. The gap in cultivation level was too wide, so Ding Shu could only swallow this bitter pill.","“Thankfully, you managed to escape with your life,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Are you trying to comfort me?” Ding Shu glared at him.","“If you say so, I am.”","“How is it? When are we going to retrieve the Source Dao Stone?” Ding Shu asked.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before replying, “Tonight.”","“En?” Ding Shu looked towards him, “So urgent?”","“Do you still want to be beaten up again?” Ling Han asked with a smile. “Don’t you want to immediately increase your cultivation level?”","“Hehe, you’re probably even more anxious than me, right?” Ding Shu said slowly. “Han Di’s next target is you, and you’re known as the ‘Imperial Son Killer’. I’m sure that once this Han Di catches you, he’ll definitely kill you.”","Han Di’s cultivation level was two minor levels higher than Ling Han’s. If he unleashed a powerful attack from the very beginning, it was really possible that he could kill Ling Han on the spot.","Of course, Ling Han still couldn’t confirm the extent of Han Di’s battle prowess before they truly battled.","Ling Han didn’t refute this, and he simply said, “Are you going to do it or not?”","“Let’s do it!” Ding Shu nodded. He was currently filled with anger.","“Then can you still withstand your injuries?” Ling Han asked.","“No problem,” Ding Shu said nonchalantly.","Ling Han simply didn’t leave. When night fell, the two of them set off. Naturally, it was Ling Han leading the way.","“Yi?” When they arrived at the Dark Battlefield, Ding Shu couldn’t help but look surprised. “You’re not going to take advantage of me being injured to bully me at this time, are you?”","“Am I that kind of person?” Ling Han rolled his eyes.","“Looks like it to me.” Ding Shu nodded without any reservations.","“It’s right here,” Ling Han said.","“Ah!” Ding Shu was shocked again.","Ling Han took out the Void Beast hide, and wrapped Ding Shu inside as well. The two of them then quietly headed towards the Dark Battlefield.","“Tsk, this is really a good thing.” Ding Shu was envious, and rubbed the animal hide with his hand, “Lend it to me for a few days?”","“Get lost!”","Ding Shu was also an overlord of the Genesis World, but after coming to this great world, his former glory was like passing clouds and mists. Any rare treasure would not be worth a single cent in this great world, and after they appeared in this world, it was clear that their fated encounters were also different.","Thus, Ling Han obtained the Origin Gold, the Void Beast hide, and the Great Emperor Horn. He was sure that Ding Shu definitely didn’t have these. However, Ding Shu had also obtained the Imperial Scroll long ago. This was another good fortune that Ling Han didn’t have.","The two of them quietly arrived at the place where the restriction was placed. There was no one here. Obviously, a Venerate Tier had placed the restriction here, so was there any need to set up additional guards?","It was an unnecessary move. Furthermore, it would instead draw the attention of others.","“Yi, I never thought that there would be such a place.” Ding Shu had been under the light, but left in the dark1. He had not thought that there would actually be such a place in the Dark Battlefield. Previously, he had not thought of it at all, so he naturally would not be searching everywhere here.","Even Ling Han had only become suspicious after receiving inspiration, and thus began his search here.","“It’s up to you now,” Ling Han said.","“This place is indeed worthy of suspicion.” Ding Shu nodded. He took out a brownish-yellow talisman paper, and showed a hint of heartache, “If there is no Source Dao Stone inside, be careful that I will fight you to the death.”","“Hehe, cut the crap.”","Ding Shu waved his hand, and xiu, the talisman paper was shot out. Boom, that restriction was instantly like snow that had encountered boiling water, instantly disappearing without a trace.","“This is a Forbidden Talisman refined by the Great Emperor, and I spent a lot of effort to obtain it. I only have this one.” Ding Shu looked like he was about to cry.","“Let’s go.” Ling Han was the first to enter, and after Ding Shu entered as well, he reset the restrictions. Naturally, they were not on the level of the Venerate Tier, but with the addition of disguise, they did look a bit like the aura of Venerate Tier. Of course, it was a paper tiger that would fall apart at the slightest touch.","The Great Emperor Tier-level Forbidden Talisman was too awesome. Though it had broken through the restrictions, it still did not alert any Venerate Tier.","Ling Han and Ding Shu exchanged a glance before immediately walking toward the depths of the passageway.","The passage went downwards, and after walking for a while, the environment became even gloomier. There was a kind of terrifying aura, and even Ling Han and Ding Shu, with their mental states and cultivation levels, felt slightly uneasy.","Thankfully, it wasn’t long before the path ahead of them suddenly opened up.","“We’re rich!” Ding Shu’s eyes immediately lit up.","This was a massive treasure storage, filled with Source Dao Stones.","“Haha.” Ding Shu immediately began to put away the Source Dao Stones. “The left side belongs to you, and the right side belongs to me.”","Ling Han also didn’t expect things to go so smoothly this time. Although he guessed that the Source Dao Stone might have been produced on the Dark Battlefield, seeing so many Source Dao Stones still made his heart beat wildly.","“All right.”","The two of them began to put away the Source Dao Stones. They had brought their Spatial Spirit Tool with them. No matter how many there were here, they could still be easily stored away.","It wasn’t long before the large treasure storage was emptied out by the two of them.","Ding Shu pointed at a corner, and said, “Yi, there’s another piece here. You’ve missed it.”","Ling Han was surprised. He was certain that under his sweep, he would definitely not leave anything out. He could swear on the large black dog’s iron underwear that this was the case.","However, there was indeed a Source Dao Stone there. It lay there all by itself, and was very obvious.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and put away this Source Dao Stone.","“Let’s go,” Ding Shu said. This was looting the wealth of five Venerate Tier elites; it would be too dangerous to stay here.","“Wait.” Ling Han waved his hand, and merely stared ahead.","“Hey, do you want to be caught red-handed?” Ding Shu urged.","“Wait for a while longer. I guarantee that you won’t be disappointed,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“... All right.” Ding Shu chose to believe Ling Han.","Could anyone who could become the overlord of the Genesis World be an idiot?","The two of them were like fools as they stared ahead. After two hours, a Source Dao Stone appeared out of thin air."]},{"number":4291,"title":"Chapter 4291: Huge Rewards","paragraphs":["Chapter 4291: Huge Rewards","Editor: Henyee Translations","“F***!” Ding Shu immediately shouted loudly.","Ling Han also very much wanted to lean against something. Previously, he had already found it strange. He had clearly swept through this place completely, so how could there be anything that had slipped through his net?","Thus, he decided to observe for a while longer.","“I understand now. So that’s how the Source Dao Stone came to be.” Ding Shu slapped his thigh.","That’s right. As it turned out, the Source Dao Stone was produced like this, but why? This was still a huge question mark.","This wasn’t like an old hen laying eggs. With a pa, a Source Dao Stone would fall onto the ground.","“It’s very strange,” Ling Han said slowly.","“That’s true,” Ding Shu said with a nod.","“Unfortunately, there is no time to study it further.”","“Let’s go. By now, we should have fled as far away as possible.”","The two of them left. They didn’t even return to the inn, and directly left the city.","Perhaps the five Venerate Tier elites wouldn’t go to the Dark Battlefield to investigate in the near future, but as long as they went to take a look, they would immediately discover that a large number of Source Dao Stones had been stolen.","Though this Source Dao Stone would appear out of thin air, to reach the amount that Ling Han and Ding Shu had stolen, it was impossible without a few hundred years. Moreover, the daily expenditure of Source Dao Stones by the City of Death was also an astronomical figure, so saving up this amount would probably need a few thousand years.","After leaving the city, Ling Han and Ding Shu went their separate ways.","Ling Han followed the course of that eerie river. He planned to go into seclusion in the stone house in the forest, refine the large amount of Source Dao Stones, and increase his cultivation level as soon as possible.","He might as well just stay there for 10 years, and then wait for the Nine Mountains Saint to break open the black hole and bring him away.","As he walked, his thoughts were also wandering.","Why was the place that produced the Source Dao Stone under the Dark Battlefield?","Had they been using the Dark Battlefield to hide this place?","But was there any need for that?","The five Venerate Tier elites had joined forces, so what need was there for them to worry about this and that? It was impossible for external forces to interfere.","Additionally, this place had existed for as long as millions and millions of years, which also meant that the Dark Battlefield had long since been there. The five Venerate Tier elites had only taken advantage of the efforts of their predecessors.","The Dark Battlefield was a place of battle, so what did it have to do with the Source Dao Stone?","Ling Han felt a headache coming on. There were a great many things in this world that could not be explained with common sense. For example, that sea of blood that had buried innumerable Saints. That was definitely the deaths of Saints, but there had never been such records in history.","“It’s all because I’m too weak, so I can only be curious. I can’t get an answer.”","Ling Han set these doubts aside. This place was very strange in the first place, and Saints would encounter great calamities even if they brought an Imperial Weapon in. Yet, a measly True Self Tier cultivator like him wanted to find out the truth?","A few days later, Ling Han returned to the forest. Then, he found a stone house to stay in.","He had the Strange Shadow Steps, as well as the Void Beast hide. Even if the five Venerate Tier elites discovered that the Source Dao Stones had been stolen and chased after him, the chances of them finding him were close to zero.","How was Ding Shu doing?","But this guy dared to part ways with Ling Han, so he should also have a rare treasure in his possession, which was enough to ensure his safety.","Moreover, this was a strange place. The higher one’s cultivation level, the more dangerous it would be. If the five Venerate Tier elites really chased after them, they might encounter a great calamity. This was enough for them to reconsider.","Ling Han took out the Source Dao Stones, and began to concentrate on cultivating..","He wrapped himself in the Void Beast hide. Because there were outsiders entering this place practically every day, it was best not to bring news about him back to the City of Death.","One Source Dao Stone after another was consumed, and Ling Han’s cultivation level improved rapidly.","More than a month later, the second True Self evolved from Golden Fetus to Tricolor Fetus.","Continue.","A year passed, and Ling Han successfully reached the end of the fifth form. He began to stabilize and polish his cultivation level, preparing to break through to the sixth form.","This took him a whole two months’ time, and only then did he manage to compact his cultivation level to perfection. Then, he began to charge towards the sixth form.","It could not be helped. The fifth form was already breaking limits, and it was naturally difficult to break through further on top of that.","Furthermore, this was still because Ling Han was in the forest. If he wanted to battle, he only had to step out. There were a great number of three-headed strange birds, Tree Demons, as well as ghostly shadows in the darkness. This was even better than the Dark Battlefield, and allowed him to battle to his heart’s content.","The fifth form was a Tricolor Fetus, then what was the sixth form?","Ling Han mumbled to himself as he started to break through.","Because he had accumulated enough power, it was only a matter of course for him. The True Self of Destruction was still in the vanguard, and began the sixth evolution.","Three days later, he completed his breakthrough.","The sixth form was... a Five Coloured Fetus.","His rate of advancement was truly rapid, surpassing any Imperial Son.","“But the price is also huge!” Ling Han exclaimed ruefully. He had expended a lot of his life essence, and by estimation, he had probably decreased his lifespan by around 600 years.","“Fortunately, it’s not too ridiculous. Otherwise, without waiting for me to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier, my lifespan would have directly dried up and died.”","“When I get out, I have to find Great Herbs to compensate for the life essence that I have expended. Though my lifespan can’t be replenished, I can’t damage my foundations either, or there would be hidden dangers.”","Ling Han sighed ruefully, and immediately began to refine the Source Dao Stones again.","Another year passed, and he had reached the end of the sixth form. He settled again for three months, and he began to break through to the seventh form.","To Ling Han, this was still not too difficult, but it took a little longer. After five days, he successfully broke through.","A Seven-colored Fetus.","“I’ve lost another two hundred years of life.” Ling Han sighed, but continued to refine the Source Dao Stones without hesitation.","After about half a year had passed, he discovered that some people had come against the flow, and was searching everywhere.","He knew that now that the secret had been exposed, and the five Venerate Tier elites had finally discovered that the Source Dao Stones had been stolen.","Why had it taken so long?","They had probably prepared a portion of Source Dao Stones in the first place, so there was no need for them to go to the Dark Battlefield to retrieve them every day. Furthermore, they had previously discussed that they would leave the Dark Clouds Hell three years later, and go to the outside world to take a gamble on becoming Emperor.","Thus, it was only now that they had gone to the Dark Battlefield, planning to leave this place after retrieving the Source Dao Stones.","But when they opened the seal, they realized that the situation was not good. This was not something that they had set up!","Not good.","True enough, when they entered, though it was not completely empty, there were only a few thousand Source Dao Stones left, which was pitifully few.","‘We’ve been robbed!’","Thus, the five Venerate Tier elites were enraged, and began to scour the entire city, sending people out of the city. Whether it was useful or not, they had to search first.","Ling Han didn’t make any sound. He quietly cultivated, and his priority now was to increase his cultivation level.","And in the City of Death, the five Venerate Tier elites were all furious. On one hand, they were searching for the whereabouts of the thief, and on the other, they were suspicious of each other, and thought that it was very possible that one of them was a thief that cries to “stop the thief!”1.","Otherwise, who would be able to break through the restrictions they had set up?","The five Venerate Tier elites already had conflicts among themselves, and after this matter, the conflict naturally intensified, and became even more intense. The entire City of Death was also on the verge of a storm, and a great battle could break out at any moment.","In the Dark Battlefield, Han Di had also obtained a thousand successive victories, leaving Ling Han’s record of successive victories far behind.","He kept saying that Ling Han was a coward, and because Ling Han had not appeared all this while, his supporters were greatly disappointed. The so-called “One Punch King” was basically trash that would be destroyed with a single punch."]},{"number":4292,"title":"Chapter 4292: Rapid Progress","paragraphs":["Chapter 4292: Rapid Progress","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han naturally didn’t know about all this. He was still continuously cultivating, cultivating, and cultivating.","Every day, if he wasn’t refining the Source Dao Stones, he would be battling with the Demonic Beasts and Demonic Trees in the forest. Merely increasing his cultivation level and not adapting to his own power was a very dangerous thing.","His advancement was astonishing, so fast that it was inconceivable, enough to make anyone exclaim that it was impossible.","However, this price was also exorbitant. Ling Han had also sacrificed his life essence. The lifespan loss was real. Even if he could find a Great Herb that could extend his lifespan, the lifespan loss would still be lost. No matter what, there was no way he could make up for it.","Another year passed, and Ling Han had already cultivated to the end of the seventh form.","This time, he settled down for a whole half year’s time.","The Eighth Form, even for Imperial Sons, was an incredibly difficult gulf to breach. It was said that only the Golden Generation had reached this kind of height, and presently, among the Silver Generation that had broken through to the Spirit Transformation Tier, there were very few that had done so. Furthermore, those that did had all obtained great fortune, and only then could they succeed.","From this, it could be seen how difficult it was to let the True Self complete eight evolutions.","Thus, Ling Han chose to settle down for half a year.","It was about time.","Ling Han began to break through to the eighth form, and tempestuous waves instantly rose up in his mind. The True Self of Destruction was exuding seven-coloured light, as if it had a life of its own. It actively began to grab the Regulations of heaven and earth to solidify itself.","However, the Regulations of heaven and earth had just adhered onto the True Self, when the seven-coloured brilliance flickered, immediately shaking off these Regulations.","Again and again, it was the same.","Looks like the previous trick was useless.","Ling Han suppressed the True Self of Destruction and tried his best to calm it down. Then, he summoned the Regulations again to stimulate the evolution of the True Self of Destruction.","He was faced with many difficulties, and his progress was slow, but he was indeed improving.","A look of delight appeared on Ling Han’s face. Looks like this would work.","‘Come, let’s continue.’","In his mind, the eight True Selves all helped, grabbing the Regulations to strengthen the True Self of Destruction.","One day, two days, three days... this progress was really slow. Right until the ninth day, the light exuded by the True Self of Destruction finally dimmed, completely concealed by the new Regulations.","But in the next instant, endless light shone brilliantly, and the True Self of Destruction exploded with dazzling light again.","It was not seven colours, but rather... eight colours!","Ling Han laughed loudly. Success, the True Self of Destruction had already taken the most crucial step, and advanced into the eighth form.","He continued to sit in a cross-legged position. Endless power of heaven and earth was surging towards him. Now was the best time to increase his cultivation level. This was bestowed by the power of heaven and earth, and there would definitely be no aftereffects.","Half a day later, Ling Han finally stopped.","The Eighth Form of the True Self Tier!","Right now, did he have the ability to battle against Spirit Transformation Tier elites?","Ling Han tested his strength. Double powers of 75 Heavens, and his explosive power could reach 85 Heavens. Just how terrifying was this?","Faced with this kind of power, the Imperial Technique was practically negligible.","However, whether it could match a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite or not would only be known after a battle.","“Sigh, cultivating to such great power, yet having no opponent to test out my skills, it’s really a bit like wearing embroidered clothes at night. It’s too wasteful.”","“Then I might as well cultivate to the end of the ninth form in one go!”","According to legends, the ninth form only existed in theory. The extreme number in the heaven and earth was nine, so this should be possible. However, according to the known information, no one had ever cultivated it.","Of course, for example, the successive generations of Ancestral Kings might have kept a low profile, and did not speak of their achievements. They did not care about this kind of reputation at all. With how high and noble an Emperor was, what need was there for him to care about this kind of glory?","Ling Han was still the same as before, cultivating, battling, battling, cultivating.","The searchers gradually decreased. When Ling Han had also cultivated the Eighth Form to the end, there was already no one that came out to look for him.","By the looks of it, the five Venerate Tier elites had given up, knowing that they couldn’t find Ling Han.","However, it was not definite that they had really given up. They were probably waiting for someone to walk right into their trap.","Ling Han was neither happy nor sad. He turned back to stabilizing his cultivation level, cultivating every True Self to perfection.","This time, it actually took a year’s time.","Ling Han wasn’t in a rush. Firstly, the speed of his improvement could already be described as freakish, and secondly, as the saying went, longer accumulation would lead to greater improvement[1.one should never seek quick results; rather, one should pay attention to accumulating strength and making full preparations before making advances.]. The longer he accumulated, the more energy he would naturally have by then.","Now, it was about time. He could finally do it.","Ling Han suppressed the True Self of Destruction as usual, while the other eight True Selves summoned the Regulations of heaven and earth to advance the ninth transformation of the True Self of Destruction.","But this time, he could not suppress it.","This repulsive force was too strong. Even if more than half of it was suppressed, it could still easily destroy the ninth evolution of the True Self of Destruction.","What could they do?","Ling Han thought of the Power of Dimension in his body. This was an ultimate move that he had tried time and time again to break through his limits, and with the suppression of the Power of Dimension, it should not be a problem for the True Self of Destruction to complete the ninth evolution.","But what if there was still the Tenth Form?","He had once obtained the notebook of a genius freak, and it deduced that there was still the existence of the tenth form above the ninth form. Only by breaking past the ninth form could he truly break through his limits.","But the problem was that the ninth form only existed in theory, and the tenth form was like the stuff of illusions.","Yet Ling Han did not dare to easily deny it. What if there was a Tenth Form? Then he would have used up his trump card for the Ninth Form, so what would he depend on to break through to the Tenth Form?","“I’ll try it out with the Imperial Weapon.”","Ling Han suddenly had an idea. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower wasn’t the real Imperial Weapon, but its benefits were here. He didn’t need to worry about losing control of its explosive power and killing himself.","Let’s give it a try.","Weng, in his mind, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower vibrated lightly, sending streaks of Primal Chaos Qi towards the True Self of Destruction. The might of Origin Gold surged, suppressing this True Self.","Meanwhile, Ling Han took advantage of the opening to grab the Regulations of heaven and earth to advance the ninth evolution of the True Self of Destruction.","However, the Primal ChaosQi blocked almost all Regulations. After a day, Ling Han did not discover any progress.","He naturally would not give up so easily, and would not waver in the slightest.","Two days, five days, ten days, and there was still not the slightest bit of improvement. However, Ling Han’s stubbornness was also revealed at this moment. He still had no intention of stopping, as if he would not turn back even if he broke through the southern wall1.","A whole month had passed, and the light exuded by the True Self of Destruction finally dimmed a little.","There was improvement!","Ling Han really wanted to laugh out loud. He had also thought of giving up, but he had suppressed this thought with his strong determination.","Since this was his choice, he would rather wait until the ten years’ time was up than give up halfway.","Thankfully, he had succeeded in just a month.","However, this was only the beginning. Again, again.","Ling Han continued. A whole year had passed, and he had finally succeeded.","The True Self of Destruction glowed with nine colours!","“Hahaha!” He stood up, incredibly pleased.","This was a victory of self-persistence, which made him feel especially accomplished."]},{"number":4293,"title":"Chapter 4293: A battle that came late","paragraphs":["Chapter 4293: A battle that came late","Editor: Henyee Translations","The ninth form of the True Self!","Ling Han was extremely pleased. This trip to the Dark Clouds Hell could be said to have been a very satisfactory trip. If he had cultivated outside, even with the support of alchemical pills, he wouldn’t be able to reach this kind of height without more than a thousand years.","Furthermore, this was the ninth form, and even the Golden Generation could only look up to it.","Of course, perhaps there were some Golden Generation elites that were very low-key. They had clearly broken through to the Ninth Form, yet kept it a secret, to avoid being targeted. Breaking through to the Imperial Path was not just a competition of natural talent and fated opportunities. Intelligence was similarly important.","Right now, Ling Han didn’t need to worry about this. He could enjoy himself for a while.","“In any case, I’ve already cultivated here for so many years, so a few more years won’t matter.” Ling Han continued to refine the Source Dao Stones. “I’ll think about it after I reach the end of the ninth form.”","With such cultivation, another year quickly passed.","After expending a large amount of Source Stones, he charged to the end of the ninth form.","“Hiss, I didn’t expect to expend the Source Dao Stones like this. There’s only half left now.”","Ling Han sighed ruefully. Calculating the time, he had already been here for about nine years.","“If I want to break through to the next major tier,it definitely has to be carried out in the outside world. With the perfect Regulations, I can perfect my dao foundation,” he murmured. “Furthermore, I feel like I’ve already touched the ceiling. If I still want to break through to the tenth form, that is definitely not something that can be achieved through cultivation in seclusion.”","“There’s still a year left. How should I spend it?”","“Go back to the City of Death?”","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Previously, when Han Di had entered into the city, he had provoked Ling Han in all ways just because his cultivation level was high. Should he teach this kind of person a lesson?","He naturally couldn’t just swagger in. Having disappeared for eight years, he suddenly appeared, and his cultivation level had increased greatly. Wasn’t this telling the five Venerate Tier elites that it was he who had robbed the Source Dao Stone’s treasury?","It was fine. He only had to change his appearance. With the existence of the Soul Forming Technique, even Venerate Tier elites would find it very difficult to discover his disguise.","All right, he would go to the City of Death to take a look at the situation.","With a thought from Ling Han, his appearance immediately changed. He strode out of the forest, and walked in the opposite direction of the flow of the great river. Several days later, the City of Death was within sight.","He had returned again.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and easily found the city gates.","After registering his information, he entered into the city, then went to the Dark Battlefield to register himself.","He even deliberately investigated the situation. Han Di had long since become an invincible God of War of True Self Tier, but for some reason, he had never broken through to the Spirit Transformation Tier.","Ling Han guessed that Han Di was probably aiming to break through to the Eighth Form. Without achieving this goal, he wouldn’t easily break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier.","After all, breaking through to the Spirit Transformation Tier was easy for him. However, without reaching the Eighth Form, what right did he have to compete for the throne with the Golden Generation?","Eight years had passed, and it was unknown how many people had entered this place. At least half of them had already died, and among the remaining people, the majority were barely surviving. Only a few were very nourished, and their cultivation level had increased by leaps and bounds.","Cultivation was always pyramid-shaped, and there were only a small number that could truly be superior to everyone else.","Ling Han did not manage to find out any information about Ding Shu. He did not know where this guy had gone. Perhaps, he was still cultivating earnestly. After all, Ding Shu’s previous cultivation level was slightly weaker than Ling Han’s. Thus, if he similarly wanted to reach the end of the ninth form, it would definitely take him even longer.","Regarding whether Ding Shu could reach the ninth form or not, Ling Han was naturally certain. If the overlord of a Genesis World couldn’t even do this, then that would really be funny.","Although the five Venerate Tier elites didn’t become hostile with each other, there was endless friction between them, and conflicts would break out between their subordinates every few days.","Ling Han was naturally unconcerned. He found an inn to stay in, and waited for the notification from the Dark Battlefield.","In just one day, he received a notification that he could go and fight.","The tournament stage battle would be held that afternoon, and Ling Han would be participating in the tournament battle. His opponent was at the fourth form of the True Self Tier. In front of him, this was naturally not enough. Ling Han defeated him with a single punch, but Ling Han did not deliver a fatal strike. Instead, he only used a sliver of his power.","There was a haughty expression on his face, and he asked, “Where is Han Di? Do you dare to battle me?”","It was naturally impossible for Han Di to appear. Ling Han only wanted to send out this kind of message. If Han Di would take the initiative to accept the challenge, that would naturally be best.","However, Han Di had already established his reputation of being invincible in the Dark Battlefield, so Ling Han’s provocation naturally only made him snort in disdain. He couldn’t care less.","Ling Han didn’t mind this. As long as he won more battles, it would only be a matter of time before he and Han Di would come across each other and battle.","He continued to participate in the battles, and the number of consecutive victories quickly expanded. Ten wins, a hundred wins, his momentum flourishing.","Though his successive victories were far from being comparable to Han Di, he was already the person with the second highest number of victories in the entire Dark Battlefield. This made the masses excited, and they hoped that Ling Han would battle against Han Di. They wanted to see if Ling Han could shake Han Di’s invincible battle merits.","The Dark Battlefield soon responded, sending out notifications to Ling Han and Han Di respectively, arranging for them to battle, and the time was set to be two days later.","This day had finally come.","Ling Han looked at the notice in his hand. Eight years ago, it was Han Di who wanted to challenge him, and now, it was the other way around. However, this battle had still happened in the end.","Two days quickly passed, and Ling Han arrived at the Dark Battlefield.","He had finally met with Han Di, one of the most powerful members of the Silver Generation.","This person was extremely handsome, with a slender figure and thick black hair, exuding a gentle light. Behind him, there was the shadow of a giant fish, as if it was breathing in and out.","Every time the giant fish breathed, the energy of heaven and earth in the surroundings would be absorbed, which was extremely shocking.","He was surrounded by such top-notch second-generation young masters like Mi Qingdie and Zuwa An, dazzling and resplendent.","By the looks of it, his identity as Imperial Son had given him quite a bit of extra credit. Even Zuwa An and the others were circling around him.","True, as long as one wanted to leave the Dark Clouds Hell, who would be able to get around the Imperial Clans?","Han Di did not put on too much airs, and chatted cheerfully with Zuwa An and the others. After all, this was their territory, and even the members of the Imperial Clans could not extend their influence here.","He appeared extremely relaxed. After all, in his eyes, he had already reached the pinnacle of the True Self Tier. Unless one had aptitude like the Golden Generation, only then was it possible that they could surpass him, but now, was there any Golden Generation member that was in the True Self Tier?","The lowest cultivation level among them had already reached Spirit Transformation Tier, Seventh Transformation!","As for this opponent, hehe, though he had obtained a very long streak of successive victories, it was completely not enough in front of him.","After waiting for a while longer, the battle was finally about to begin.","The contestants from both sides entered the arena. This time, the Dark Battlefield still placed a lot of importance on this battle. They cleared out the other battle areas, allowing Ling Han and Han Di to battle freely.","When Han Di entered the arena, a tsunami of cheers instantly erupted.","It had been a long time since they had last seen Han Di make a move. Previously, whenever anyone was arranged to fight Han Di, they would immediately admit defeat. Furthermore, since Ling Han dared to take the initiative to provoke him, they were sure that he would not be so cowardly.","Meanwhile, Han Di crossed his arms behind his back, and slowly strode into the battlefield, looking extremely casual.","For him, this was only going through the motions."]},{"number":4294,"title":"Chapter 4294: Seen through","paragraphs":["Chapter 4294: Seen through","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Han Di!” On the spectators’ seats, cheers erupted like thunder","“Hehe, has this person eaten the courage of a Saint? He actually dares to challenge Han Di?” Mi Qingdie scoffed. She was presently passionately courting Han Di, but it was a shame that Han Di paid her no regard at all.","“You have an exaggerated opinion of your own abilities!” Wan Yulong said with a smile. He was a descendant of the Nine Palace Venerate. He was one of the top-notch second-generation young masters.","“How many strikes do you think Han Di needs to deal with him?” Sha Tianlei asked. He was the descendant of the Ice Silkworm Venerate.","“At most, three moves,” Wan Yulong said.","“Hehe, I’ll relax it a bit, ten moves,” Gongyang Bo said. He was Brahman Sea Bodhisattva’s little disciple.","“One strike.” Mi Qingdie was brimming with confidence in Han Di.","“Little Lord Wolf, what do you think?” Wan Yulong looked towards Zuwa An.","Meanwhile, Zuwa An was slightly distracted. He had been staring at Ling Han all this while, and had an inexplicable feeling that he seemed to be afraid of this person.","How was this possible?","He had never met this person before. Moreover, he was the descendant of the Blood Crow Venerate. Not long ago, he had even broken through to the Spirit Transformation Tier. With a single hand, he could crush a True Self Tier cultivator, no matter how freakish he was.","Thus, this feeling was too strange.","“Little Lord Wolf!” Wan Yulong raised his voice.","Only at this moment did Zuwa An come to his senses. He pondered for a moment, before saying, “I’ll also guess ten moves.”","“Humph, you guys actually have so much confidence in that guy?” Mi Qingdie said in displeasure, “Why don’t we make a bet?”","“Sure,” Sha Tianlei said. “We’ll each bet ten Source Dao Stones. The person with the closest answer can obtain it.”","“Deal.”","The five second-generation young masters nodded one after another. To them, they were already tired of watching such battles, and needed something else to stimulate them.","Meanwhile, on the battlefield, Han Di stood still, looking at Ling Han with a disdainful expression.","“Admit defeat,” he said calmly.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “What if I say no?”","“Then your only fate is death!” Han Di was not in a rush to make a move.","The smile at the corners of Ling Han’s lips involuntarily widened, “Are all members of the Imperial Clans all so overbearing?”","Meanwhile, Han Di smirked coldly, “You actually dare to order around the Imperial Clans? How dare you! Now, if I don’t kill you, won’t others think that the Imperial Clans ares pushovers?”","“You really know how to pin blame.” Ling Han shook his head, “Enough with the nonsense. Come on!”","He crooked a finger, and began to provoke Han Di.","This hook of his finger instantly stirred up the emotions of those spectators. All of them could not hold themselves back, and called out one after another.","“Han Di, kill him!”","“Kill this brat!”","However, these people were all on Han Di’s side, and it was as if they had been pumped full of adrenaline.","Han Di was unmoved. He was the Imperial Son, so how could the emotions of others affect him? However, Ling Han’s disrespectful attitude had indeed angered him. The Imperial Clan was high and noble, and was the ruler of the world. Who could slight them?","“You’re seeking death!” Han Di pointed a finger at Ling Han. Boom, a terrifying energy transformed into a sword that shot towards Ling Han.","Ling Han merely gathered the power of 60 Heavens, and shot out a palm strike. The energy turned into a massive palm that counterattacked Han Di.","Peng!","The sword of energy immediately crumbled under Ling Han’s strike. However, the large hand didn’t dissipate, and it continued to slam toward Han Di.","‘What?’","Everyone was dumbfounded upon seeing this. They couldn’t believe this at all. Even if Han Di hadn’t unleashed his full power, with his strength, he should have been able to overturn rivers and create chaos with a wave of his hand.","Hiss, this opponent was indeed very strong!","“Huang Tian!”","“Huang Tian!”","Instantly, quite a few people called out Ling Han’s alias. Han Di had already reigned supreme for too long, and everyone longed to see someone appear and knock him off his horse.","“There’s no need to have any expectations of him.”","“That’s right. That is Han Di, and he has not been defeated for eight years. Before this, there has never been anyone that could do it!”","“It is said that he is known as the Silver Generation in the outside world. That is an existence that is even stronger than ordinary Imperial Sons.”","“As long as he is slightly more serious, this Huang Tian would only be able to kneel.”","However, there were even more people that were siding with Han Di, and thought that Ling Han had absolutely no chance of winning. Now, it looked like Ling Han was on the upper hand, but in truth, it was Han Di that had not gotten serious at all.","Peng! Han Di shot out another finger, and shattered this giant hand that was swatting at him.","A hint of surprise appeared on his face, and he felt that Ling Han’s strength was inconceivable.","He had indeed not used his full power in that attack just now. In fact, he had not even used the celestial technique, but his base power was close to sixty Heavens. This was enough to crush any True Self Tier.","This opponent... who exactly was it?","A rising star of the Imperial Clan?","That’s right. The Imperial Sons of the third generation could not compare to the Silver Generation, but at the very least, he was still an Imperial Son. If there were freaks that could cultivate to the seventh form, then it would be possible for their battle prowess to soar up to 60 Heavens.","“Which Imperial Son are you?” Han Di asked, his expression very certain.","—Aside from the Imperial Clan, what other force could nurture out such a terrifying prodigy?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “I’m the Imperial Son of the Invincible Imperial Clan. My nickname is Emperor Destroyer.”","Han Di’s expression immediately darkened. “Emperor Destroyer”, wasn’t this deliberately targeting him1? Furthermore, how could there be an Ancestral King in this world with the title of Invincible? Naturally, there could not possibly be an Invincible Imperial Clan.","This guy was teasing him.","Hold on.","He suddenly recalled that wasn’t Ling Han skilled in disguising his identity? If it had to be claimed that he was so hostile towards the Imperial Clan, and if it had to be claimed that his natural talent was freakish to the point of being comparable to the Imperial Son, or even surpassed the Imperial Son, who else could it be but Ling Han?","Great, you have finally appeared.","Han Di smirked coldly. All the great Imperial Clans had deduced that Ling Han had obtained the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. Thus, that was why the Nine Mountains Saint had been able to obtain the Imperial Scroll and take the step to become a Saint.","Thus, Ling Han definitely had the Imperial Scroll on him.","Very good. If he killed this person, all the great Imperial Clans would owe him a favor, and he would be able to obtain an Imperial Scroll. Then, he could possibly be the only person in the world that had simultaneously cultivated two Imperial Scrolls.","In this way, would it still be a problem to surpass the Golden Generation?","“Do you dare to engage in a mortal duel?” he asked. He didn’t reveal Ling Han’s identity.","This was called luring the enemy.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “Sure!”","If you are so determined to seek death, then I will oblige you.","When they heard that the two of them were going to have a mortal duel, the spectators were in an uproar.","They actually wanted to have a mortal duel?","Hiss, then it was destined that one of the two of them would die. This was exciting.","“Haha, he actually dares to have a mortal duel with Han Di. He’s really tired of living,” Mi Qingdie said coldly.","Meanwhile, Wan Yulong showed a hint of deep thought, “No one is an idiot, especially this kind of elite. Thus, this Huang Tian must have something to rely on.”","“You’re not saying that he can compare to the Imperial Son, or even the Silver Generation, right?” Mi Qingdie retorted. It couldn’t be helped. She was already completely captivated by Han Di.","Gongyang Bo said calmly, “More than eight years ago, didn’t an Imperial Son also die here?”","When these words fell, the surroundings instantly fell silent.","“Humph, how could Lin Yun compare to Han Di!” Very soon, Mi Qingdie spoke again, “Han Di is at the Seventh Form of True Self Tier. At that time, didn’t Ling Han forfeit the battle repeatedly because he was afraid, and even escaped from the City of Death?”"]},{"number":4295,"title":"Chapter 4295: Eighth Form!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4295: Eighth Form!","Editor: Henyee Translations","When they said this, Wan Yulong and the others all nodded.","That’s right. Han Di was not Lin Yun. He was much, much stronger.","This was the Seventh Form of the True Self Tier, breaking the limit of three times. Ordinary people wouldn’t even dare to imagine it. How could such a being possibly lose?","“Then, it can only be said that this Huang Tian’s brain has been damaged.”","“He’s far too arrogant! Does he think that he can rival Han Di, just by being able to oppose a single strike?”","These five top-notch second-generation young masters reached a consensus, and thought that Ling Han was completely overestimating his own abilities, and did not really have the strength to stand against Han Di.","The Dark Battlefield soon approved Ling Han and Han Di’s request to change the normal tournament stage battle to a mortal duel.","In this way, only one of them would be able to leave alive.","A cold smile appeared on Han Di’s face, and he said, “You’re truly stupid!”","“Hehe.” Ling Han ignored him.","Han Di had no interest in speaking any further. He charged out, wanting to kill Ling Han and snatch the Imperial Scroll.","Boom, the power of the seventh form was released to his heart’s content. He had been here for so many years, so he must have reached the end of the seventh form long ago. Endless power surged out, terrifying beyond description.","Ling Han brandished his fists, and delivered a punch at Han Di.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and both of their figures swayed, retreating backwards.","“Yi?” A hint of surprise appeared on Han Di’s face. This was really beyond his expectations. Ling Han’s strength was actually capable of matching him?","However, he immediately became arrogant again. So what?","He communicated through divine sense, “I never thought that after you disappeared for a few years, your cultivation level would actually have such great improvement!”","In any case, the mortal duel had already begun, so he was not afraid that Ling Han would go back on his word.","Ling Han smiled faintly. Han Di should have guessed his identity by now.","“There are a lot of things that you can’t imagine.”","Han Di charged over again, his hands like axes. Boom, as he delivered palm strikes, energy interwove with Regulations, turning into multiple Divine Axes that slashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han clenched his hands into fists, and attacked repeatedly. Peng, peng, peng, every single Divine Axe was shattered by him.","The two of them used their respective Mystical Powers, and for a short period of time, it was hard to decide the victor. Their battle was incredibly intense.","Everyone was transfixed with shock. They hadn’t imagined that Ling Han would be so powerful. He was genuinely able to exchange blows with Han Di.","“Hiss, who exactly is this Huang Tian?” In the private room, Wan Yulong and the others were also very stunned.","They had all broken through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier a few years ago, and with their superior cultivation level, they could naturally see clearly that Han Di had definitely unleashed all his battle prowess at the peak stage of the seventh form.","In other words, this “Huang Tian” should also be at the peak stage of Seventh Form.","Heavens!","At this moment, they no longer had any confidence that Han Di would win.","Fight, fight, fight. Ling Han and Han Di exchanged blows, incredibly intense.","However, this kind of intensity was only relative to Han Di and the spectators. Ling Han’s cultivation level had long since surpassed the Seventh Form, and he had not used his full strength at all. He only wanted to see the ultimate technique of the Han Clan.","“I really can’t underestimate you,” Han Di said coldly. Suddenly, he sent out a palm strike. Boom, the might actually increased inconceivably by a whole lot.","Peng! With a single strike, Ling Han was instantly sent backwards.","“You didn’t expect this, did you?” A hint of pride appeared on Han Di’s face, and he slowly withdrew his palm, “I am not the Seventh Form, but rather... the Eighth Form of the True Self Tier!”","Hearing these words, the whole grandstand fell silent.","What? Han Di had actually broken through? Not the Seventh Form, but the Eighth Form!","Heavens, heavens, this was the Imperial Son, and this was the Silver Generation?","The Eighth Form of the True Self Tier was the true limit.","“Haha!” Mi Qingdie jumped up in excitement. “This is my Han Di!”","Wan Yulong and the others didn’t refute the question of whether Han Di was hers or not. They were still in a state of shock. Han Di had actually broken through to the Eighth Form. This was really too shocking.","“The present me is no longer inferior to the Golden Generation,” Han Di declared proudly. Every day, he would fight bloody battles here, and in fact, he would frequently enter into the forest to battle those terrifying Demonic Beasts, which finally allowed him to take the step that would lead him to the ultimate path of heaven.","“However, being able to force me to use the power of the Eighth Form, you should be proud of yourself.”","Ling Han was astonished. This person had actually broken through to the Eighth Form?","As expected, the Imperial Son could not be underestimated.","“Hehe, congratulations.” He smiled faintly.","Yi, why would he have such a reaction?","Han Di was slightly confused. He was the Eighth Form, and even the Golden Generation was nothing more than this. It could be claimed to be the strongest level of the True Self Tier. The Ninth Form only existed in legends, like a fantasy story.","But why was Ling Han still so unconcerned?","Whatever, he would kill him, search his soul, and snatch the Imperial Scroll.","Han Di quickly pushed his confusion aside. He didn’t need to know the answer. He only needed to believe in his own strength.","Xiu, he charged out again, and the power of the eighth form completely burst forth.","“Die!” He stimulated this terrifying attack, which surged majestically towards Ling Han.","Ling Han had absolutely no intention of dodging, and responded with a punch of his own.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and an inconceivable scene appeared. Han Di was actually sent flying.","F***!","Everyone wanted nothing more than to rub their eyes. They must have seen wrongly; how could it be like this?","Han Di’s figure landed on the ground. He turned around and steadied his footing, his face filled with shock and confusion.","How was this possible?","Ling Han’s power was actually superior to his?","“How is it possible that you have also cultivated to the Eighth Form!” Han Di shouted loudly. He could not believe it, nor did he want to believe it.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “You can cultivate to the eighth form, so why can’t I?”","How could you compare to me?","He was the Imperial Son, a Silver Generation elite who was doted on by the heavens. From birth, he was practically standing at the finishing line. Who could outrun him?","He glared hatefully at Ling Han, and the projection of the giant fish behind him gradually solidified, its size unknown.","“Swallowing Heaven Technique!” he shouted loudly. The giant fish also wagged its tail, and swam towards Ling Han. It opened its mouth, instantly creating a boundless suction force.","Ling Han’s mind trembled slightly, as if his soul was about to be extracted.","Yi?","This was an attack aimed at the soul. If his body and soul were separated, the physical body without the control of the soul would be an empty shell, and without the protection of the physical body, the soul would naturally be extremely fragile.","Ling Han humphed, and the nine True Selves in his mind all lit up, stabilizing his soul.","Han Di frowned. This was a Mystical Power that he had awakened by nature. Even the Golden Generation would suffer a little if they were caught off guard. He had not thought that he would not be able to get the slightest advantage over Ling Han.","He roared loudly, and that giant fish actually sprouted a pair of wings.","A Roc!","The Roc spread its wings, and once again opened its mouth to swallow Ling Han. The effect of extracting the soul instantly increased to tons.","But so what? With nine True Selves standing guard, his mind was completely calm.","One had to realize that Ling Han wasn’t at the Eighth Form. Instead, he was at the Ninth Form.","“Do you have any more moves?” Ling Han asked with a smile."]},{"number":4296,"title":"Chapter 4296: Pseudo Ninth Form versus True Ninth Form","paragraphs":["Chapter 4296: Pseudo Ninth Form versus True Ninth Form","Editor: Henyee Translations","Han Di didn’t dare to believe this, and shock was written all over his face.","His original name was not Han Di, and the word “Di” represented a special meaning. Who would dare to randomly take this name?","This was a name that he had changed for himself after displaying his powerful natural talent in cultivation. It contained his great ambition, and his hopes of becoming Emperor one day.","His natural talent was only a tiny bit inferior to the Golden Generation, and now, with his own efforts, he had advanced into the Eighth Form. It could be said that aside from the fact that his cultivation level was still slightly inferior, he was really not inferior to the Golden Generation.","But now? There was actually someone that could surpass him in a battle of equal cultivation levels.","Hiss!","Han Di’s pride had been shattered into pieces. In this instant, he became very confused.","How was this possible? Absolutely impossible!","“Die!” Han Di roared loudly. He charged out again. The projection of the Roc surged, swallowing heaven and earth, and he himself also pounced. The Regulations burned, turning into world-destroying flames that were boundlessly terrifying.","Yet Ling Han was indifferent. As an elite that was very possibly the only Ninth Form in this world, what need was there for him to be concerned?","In the past, it had only ever been him that had won with a disadvantage in cultivation level. Now, his cultivation level was superior to Han Di, so no matter how stunningly talented you were, so what if you put your life on the line? It was completely ineffective.","However, Ling Han was quite interested in this projection of the Roc. It was actually capable of shaking the soul. This was probably a soul-level celestial technique.","This had the same effect as the barrage of murderous aura. It was a pity that the Imperial Son had a rare treasure on him, which could block negative effects. Otherwise, Ling Han could compete with the Imperial Son in terms of whose spiritual attack was more kickass.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Han Di tried his best, but so what? Even in a battle of equal cultivation levels, his strength was still much inferior to Ling Han, what more when there was still a gap of a minor level between them.","In just a few moves, he was suppressed, and had fallen into an absolute disadvantage.","What could he do?","Han Di gritted his teeth internally. He knew the rules of the Dark Battlefield. Once the mortal duel was activated, there was no way it would stop. One person had to die in battle.","Lin Yun was a precedent. So what if he was the Imperial Son? They didn’t give him any face at all.","Thus, he could only depend on himself.","Was he going to fight to the death?","Han Di was a little reluctant. He had cultivated to the eighth form with great difficulty. Only when he had truly reached this kind of height would one know how difficult it was. If he had to start again, he was not at all sure that he could succeed again.","However, if he didn’t put his life on the line, his only fate would be death.","He was going to give it his all.","Han Di roared. Boom! A devastating aura burst from his body, and his power surprisingly increased again. His power surged like boiling water, and the spectators all felt a suffocating feeling in their chests. Their faces became as white as a sheet, and their expressions were as ugly as could be.","“This is... Spirit Transformation Tier-level power!” In the private room, Wan Yulong and the others all exclaimed in shock. They were Spirit Transformation Tier elites, so they only had to sense it for them to understand.","But how could this be possible? Though Han Di had reached the Eighth Form, and completely crushed them in the past, and once he advanced into Spirit Transformation Tier, he would also be able to insta-kill them into dust.","However, as long as he didn’t reach the Spirit Transformation Tier, he would only be a True Self Tier in the end. He couldn’t compare to Spirit Transformation Tier.","“Could it be that it is... the ninth form!” Gongyang Bo said, his voice trembling slightly.","He was really envious, jealous, and hateful. The ninth form, the cultivation level that only existed in legends!","Mi Qingdie had initially been extremely worried, but now, she was elated. A proud expression appeared on her face, “Han Di is indeed worthy of being the Silver Generation. Next, he will show his might and kill that Huang Tian or whatever!”","Sha Tianlei had been silent all this while, and only then did he speak, “Heavenly Emperor should not have reached the ninth form, but rather used the combustion of his Imperial Blood to forcibly shatter a True Self, and only then did he manage to temporarily rush up to the ninth form.”","“The price for this is very heavy. Afterwards, his cultivation level will fall back to the Seventh Form. If he wants to recreate a True Self, this is not re-cultivating his own cultivation level, but going through all his previous cultivation levels.”","Yi, was that the case?","However, everyone knew that Sha Tianlei was the most knowledgeable. Since he had said so, it was probably true.","Moreover, this was the only logical explanation.","Mi Qingdie’s pride instantly crumbled. However, after only a short while, she immediately continued, “Even if Han Di falls back to the seventh form, he would still be the top prodigy in the world. Practically no one can compare to him!”","“Furthermore, since he has been able to cultivate to the Eighth Form, and this time, he has also temporarily touched the Ninth Form. Who knows, he may be able to rebuild after destruction. In future, he would really be able to cultivate to the Ninth Form!”","Was this possible?","Destruction followed by construction. This sounded very inspirational, but most people would be directly crippled after destruction, and there would be no possibility of rebuilding.","“However, this time, it should be a sure victory for Han Di,” Zuwa An said with a smile. He had an indescribable hatred for Ling Han.","“En.” On this point, the five second-generation young masters all had the same understanding, and nodded in unison.","The ninth form... could only exist in legends.","Boom! Meanwhile, Han Di unleashed a devastating power that blasted toward Ling Han. The Regulations transformed into countless divine weapons that blotted out heaven and earth.","Ling Han was astonished. “How resolute. You could bear to self-destruct even a True Self.”","“Die!” Han Di’s expression was twisted. Even though he now had battle prowess that had advanced into the ninth form, for the sake of this moment of might, he had paid a heavy price. In future, it would be a big problem whether he would be able to charge up to the eighth form again.","Thus, even if he obtained the Imperial Scroll from Ling Han, it may not be able to compensate for his losses.","This time, it was really a great loss.","Precisely because of this, he was even more eager to kill Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head before throwing another punch. A heavenly saber materialized in the air and slashed down at Han Di.","“Break!” Han Di naturally would not cower. He presently had battle prowess of the ninth form, so who in this world could stop him?","However, he immediately looked stunned — the number of times he was shocked today was probably comparable to the total number of times he had been shocked in his whole life before today.","Boom, under the strike of the heavenly saber, whatever Regulations, whatever mass of energy, they were all shattered, and were completely unqualified to resist!","W-what!","Han Di didn’t dare to believe this. He was at the ninth form now, and his battle prowess had actually broken through the barrier of the Spirit Transformation Tier and reached a completely new height. However, faced with Ling Han’s heavenly saber, his attack was actually destroyed?","How was this possible!","“Ah!” Han Di screamed in agony. He was sent backwards by the heavenly saber, and instantly, blood burst forth from his body.","Thankfully, he also had the battle prowess of the ninth form. Otherwise, he would definitely have been killed by this heavenly saber.","“That’s strange, isn’t it?” Ling Han said with a faint smile. “You only relied on self-destructing your True Self to temporarily rush up to the ninth form, but I... am the true ninth form!”","‘F*ck! F*ck! F*ck!’","Han Di felt as if the sky had collapsed. He had advanced to the Eighth Form with great difficulty, and thought that he could look down on the rest of the world, catching up to the Golden Generation, and truly possess the qualifications to attempt breaking through to the imperial throne from now onwards.","But now?","A monster had appeared, and he had actually reached the ninth form.","Heavens, was this possible? How could there be such a freak?","“Alright, you can go on your way now!” Ling Han said balefully."]},{"number":4297,"title":"Chapter 4297: If I say it ends, only then is it the end","paragraphs":["Chapter 4297: If I say it ends, only then is it the end","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han moved, his might soaring to the heavens.","He was not as simple as the ninth form, but rather the peak stage of the ninth form. The strength of his battle prowess was something that even Han Di could only look up to. The gap was not just a little bit.","Boom!","Under his frenzied barrage of attacks, Han Di couldn’t block them at all. He vomited blood repeatedly, and he was constantly on the verge of death.","However, Han Di could also be considered the ninth form at present, and he was a Silver Generation elite at that. His natural talent was indeed outstanding, and that was why he could just barely hold on.","However, this was only struggling at death’s door, and could not last for very long.","“Stop!” Right at this moment, a soft rebuke was heard. Mi Qingdie directly broke out of the window of the private room, and landed on the battlefield, as she shouted coldly at Ling Han.","“Hehe, this is a mortal duel!” Ling Han’s killing intent was baleful and menacing.","“So what!” Mi Qingdie said proudly, “If I tell you to stop, you have to stop!”","This was against the rules, but so what? She was the Crimson Moon Venerate’s most beloved granddaughter, so she could be so arrogant.","Han Di’s heart calmed slightly. Though he was also very sullen, to actually have a woman come to save him, he did not care too much about his pride at this moment. After all, life was the most beautiful thing in this world.","As long as he was alive, he could get his pride back.","Mi Qingdie pointed at Ling Han, and said coldly, “Now, get lost!”","Boos rang out.","Though the City of Death had never had any rules, in truth, it was not that there was no order.","For example, in the Dark Battlefield, one person had to die in a mortal duel. No one could be exempted, and it was the same for Imperial Son Lin Yun.","Because this was a tradition that had been passed down since ancient times. It had been like this for generations, and no one could break it.","But now?","Mi Qingdie publicly trampled on this ancient tradition, which naturally incited public indignation.","“Shh, shh, shh. If anyone dares to make the slightest noise, I’ll kill him!” Mi Qingdie was extremely domineering. She herself was a Spirit Transformation Tier elite, and added with her grandfather who was a Venerate Tier, this intimidation was naturally very strong.","Instantly, the whole area fell silent.","“Hehe.” Ling Han’s cold laugh suddenly rang out, “The mortal duel is not over yet. One person must die!”","“Alright, then I’ll kill you!” Mi Qingdie said. Her seductive eyes were fixed on Ling Han, her killing intent blazing.","“Humph!” Ling Han charged over.","“You don’t know what’s good for you!” Mi Qingdie countered, blasting towards Ling Han.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, instantly triggering a massive explosion of energy. The boiling energy spread out in all directions, indescribably terrifying.","At this moment, a figure flew out of the ball of energy.","That was... Mi Qingdie!","Pu!","Seeing this scene, everyone spluttered.","What, Ling Han was actually strong to this extent? Even a Spirit Transformation Tier was no match?","Xiu, Ling Han also charged out, his black locks soaring into the skies, exploding with fury.","In the outside world, he had had enough of oppression. Weren’t those Imperial Clans all unreasonable and forceful because they had many elites?","And now, in this place, he actually still suffered such injustice?","‘F*ck! I’m definitely going to kill Han Di today!’","Ling Han brandished his fists, and the Destructive Energy had already been activated. He charged towards Han Di.","“You dare?!” Mi Qingdie was both shocked and furious. She had never imagined that Ling Han’s strength would actually reach such a terrifying extent. Even she was no match for him—was he really a True Self Tier cultivator?","The ninth form... was that so terrifying?","This was natural. Originally, the fourth form was enough to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier, but Ling Han actually cultivated another five minor levels. Added together, this naturally far surpassed the gap of a major tier.","Even if Mi Qingdie had broken through in the sixth form, she was still no match for Ling Han. It was just that the gap between them was very small.","She hurriedly charged back. Naturally, she could not just sit by and watch as her beloved was killed by Ling Han.","As she battled, she called out, “Guards, quickly apprehend this mad man.”","However, no one responded.","—You are the granddaughter of Crimson Moon Venerate. Indeed, you are awesome. Even if you interfered in a mortal duel, no one would dare stop you. However, you still want others to help you? Hehe, that is also impossible.","As long as Ling Han didn’t have killing intent towards Mi Qingdie, no one would interfere. This was everyone’s bottom line.","Ling Han’s expression was cold, and he sent Mi Qingdie flying with a kick. His eyes were set on Han Di.","Destructive Energy surged. This destructive power was too great, and no defense could block it, causing Han Di to cry out in pain, the injuries on his body becoming heavier and heavier.","“You dare! You dare!” Mi Qingdie’s eyes were red. She really admired this Imperial Son who had outstanding natural talent, and now, she was watching as her beloved was severely injured in front of her, and was even close to being killed. This caused a knife to twist in her heart.","Ling Han ignored her completely, and merely continued to target Han Di.","Han Di was already resisting with all his might, but there was nothing he could do. His strength was much weaker than Ling Han, and added with the fact that his injuries were getting more and more serious, his ability to resist was also becoming weaker and weaker.","He really couldn’t take it anymore.","“No!” he roared in fury, extremely defiant.","He was the Silver Generation, and furthermore, he had reached the Eighth Form, catching up to the Golden Generation and becoming a powerful participant in contest for the Imperial Path. However, the long journey had not even begun, and he was actually about to die?","How could he possibly accept this?","But so what? Even if he had Mi Qingdie’s help, it was useless. He was thrashed harshly by Ling Han, and finally, Ling Han’s fist landed on his head. Destructive Energy invaded, and his mind was instantly shattered.","One after another, the True Sellves dimmed and crumbled. Han Di stared blankly at Ling Han, his eyes still filled with hatred and defiance, but they became more and more lifeless. Finally, his head drooped and he collapsed.","Die.","“You, you, you!” Mi Qingdie pointed at Ling Han, her pretty face livid. She wanted nothing more than to swallow Ling Han whole and skin him alive.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “If I say it’s over, only then is it over.”","After saying this, he turned around and left.","How domineering!","So what if you are Mi Qingdie? So what if you interfere in the mortal duel? It cannot end unless I tell it to end.","Mi Qingdie was so furious that her chest rose and fell rapidly. Pointing at Ling Han’s back, she said, “I swear, I will not die until I kill you!”","Ling Han’s eyes turned cold, and he clenched his fists, killing intent blazing.","This woman was seeking her own death!","However, he couldn’t make a move here. There was definitely a Spirit Transformation True Lord or even Sect Master here. At the moment, he could only match the First Change of the Spirit Transformation Tier. At most, he would only be able to rival a Second Change of the Spirit Transformation Tier. If he encountered a Third Change or Fourth Change of the Spirit Transformation Tier, he would definitely be done for, what more a Sect Master.","Hence, if he made a move now, he would not be able to kill Mi Qingdie, but would instead draw a fatal calamity onto himself.","Ling Han smiled calmly, and strode off.","Mi Qingdie’s eyes were almost spitting fire. She really wanted to pounce on Ling Han and kill him—if she had that kind of strength. Unfortunately, this was too against the rules. Moreover, she couldn’t command Sect Masters.","‘I will definitely kill you! Definitely!’ she swore in her heart.","At this moment, everyone finally recovered from their shock.","What!","Ling Han had actually killed Han Di even with the intervention of a Spirit Transformation Tier. It should be known that Han Di’s strength had also been at the ninth form at that time, so his strength could be said to be boundless.","Terrifying, too terrifying."]},{"number":4298,"title":"Chapter 4298: Unprecedented, the Tenth Form of the True Self Tier!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4298: Unprecedented, the Tenth Form of the True Self Tier!","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han left the Dark Battlefield, and endless enlightenment appeared in his mind.","This battle gave him a very great comprehension. Furthermore, killing someone even with the interference of a Spirit Transformation Tier made him feel incredibly carefree, as if a door had been opened to his heart. It was incredibly pleasurable.","And in these few days, he had been experiencing life all this while, savoring the great dao, and had gradually gained appreciation of the tenth form. He was only one step away from it.","And now, after this battle, he had finally touched the boundary.","After Ling Han walked around a corner, he immediately changed his appearance, then found an inn to stay in.","He was going to attempt breaking through to the Tenth Form.","No one knew whether it was possible to break through to the tenth form.","Because the ninth form only existed in legends, then what about the tenth form? It must be like a dream.","Ling Han was calm and unhurried, maintaining a calm heart.","After re-entering the City of Death, he lived a peaceful life, and added with the thrill of the previous battle, the two formed a strong contrast. The fierce collision also formed some kind of power, giving him endless appreciation.","Ling Han immersed himself in his mind. He had already changed his appearance, so he was not afraid of others discovering his identity. He could break through quietly.","Time passed continuously, and half a month later, a smile appeared at the corners of Ling Han’s lips.","He had finally touched the threshold of breaking through.","The tenth form was feasible.","‘Come!’","In his mind, the True Self of Destruction glowed with nine-colored divine light. Ling Han stimulated the power of millions and millions of living beings in the dimensions, and directly used his trump card, to suppress the repulsive power of the True Self of Destruction.","The Regulations of heaven and earth surged forth, turning into nutrients for the True Self, strengthening the True Self, and pushing the True Self into the Tenth Form.","Hiss, so difficult.","Ling Han immediately sensed that even though he had activated the Power of Dimension, it was still astonishingly repulsive, making it difficult for him to take another step forward.","Thankfully, he steadied his footing, and progressed bit by bit.","The True Self of Destruction was steadily growing, and the nine-coloured light was dimming, though the speed was not very fast.","A whole month had passed, and the True Self of Destruction had completely lost its brilliance, sinking into silence. Wrapped layer by layer by Regulations, it actually formed a cocoon.","Ling Han couldn’t help but be filled with anticipation. What form did this newly born True Self of Destruction take?","Ten coloured?","All of a sudden, another two months had passed, and there were only three months left until the deadline of ten years.","In his mind, the cocoon that the True Self of Destruction had formed suddenly trembled, and a crack appeared on it. Then, more and more cracks appeared, turning into a spider’s web.","It was about to appear.","Ling Han’s spirits were lifted, and he began to examine it even more closely.","Pa, the outer cocoon formed by Regulations instantly shattered, and a new True Self of Destruction appeared.","Yi!","Ling Han was astonished. This was the Tenth Form?","This True Self didn’t have a shred of brilliance, and couldn’t be any more ordinary. He was practically even more mediocre than when he was in the first form.","However, this was indeed the Tenth Form.","The Tenth Form was something that had never existed in legends, so how could it be so ordinary?","No, this was not ordinary, but rather returning to one’s true self.","The True Self of Destruction communicated with heaven and earth, and instantly, the energy of heaven and earth surged over in waves, terrifying without bounds.","Strong, too strong!","Previously, if Ling Han’s battle prowess was only slightly stronger than Mi Qingdie, then now, he could insta-kill her.","The Tenth Form of the True Self Tier was what it meant to really break limits!","Ling Han did some calculations. There was not much time left, and it was impossible that he would be able to calmly cultivate to the end of the tenth form here.","He thought for a moment, and decided to seek out Mi Qingdie for an accounting. Then, he would leave the City of Death, and exit the Dark Clouds Hell. He would return to the ancient stone door of the black hole, and waitfor the Nine Mountains Saint to open the black hole and take him away.","Ling Han returned to his “Huang Tian” appearance, and once again went to the Dark Battlefield.","However, in this period of time, Ling Han had already automatically forfeited the battle three times. He had been stripped of his right to battle, and could only fight again after three years.","Ling Han didn’t mind. He had only come to tell Mi Qingdie that he had appeared again.","It was best if he was disqualified. Ling Han directly cancelled his status as a participant, making it clear that he wanted to leave.","...","Mi Qingdie’s residence.","“That evil thief has appeared?” Mi Qingdie immediately stood up. She looked at the servant that had come to report, and a cold smile appeared at the corners of her lips, “Quick, go and inform Zuwa An.”","“Yes.”","It wasn’t long before Zuwa An arrived.","“Have you discovered that person?” Zuwa An asked.","“That’s right.” Mi Qingdie nodded, “We have to move quickly. That evil thief has been suspended from battle, and is already planning to leave the city.”","“All right, we will immediately set off in pursuit!” Zuwa An nodded.","“That evil criminal is not weak. Are the people you bring safe?” Mi Qingdie asked.","“After that battle, I’ve already asked someone to analyze it. Huang Tian’s battle prowess has not reached two Heavens of Spirit Transformation Tier, and is only slightly stronger than us. Thus, this time, I brought two elites of the Second Change of the Spirit Transformation Tier with me. Each of them has the battle prowess of four Heavens,” Zuwa An said.","Mi Qingdie nodded, “It’s more or less the same as the results of my analysis. I also brought two Spirit Transformation Tier elites with battle prowess at four Heavens of Spirit Transformation Tier. Four against one is enough to insta-kill that evil thief.”","“Can we set out now?” Zuwa An urged.","“Let’s go.”","The two of them set out. When they arrived outside the manor, another four Spirit Transformation Tier elites joined the team. They were all at the Second Change of Spirit Transformation Tier.","“Oh, that’s right. The reason why I hate that evil criminal to the core is because of Han Di. Why are you doing this?” Mi Qingdie couldn’t help but ask in curiosity.","Zuwa An faltered for a moment. How could he bring himself to say that he had a bad feeling when he saw Ling Han? He couldn’t help but want to worship Ling Han. This kind of feeling was really too terrible.","Thus, he definitely had to kill Ling Han.","“Why do you care so much?” he asked impatiently.","“All right, I won’t meddle in other people’s business. The most important thing now is to get rid of that evil thief!” Mi Qingdie said hatefully.","The six of them set off in pursuit, heading out of the city.","Ling Han was deliberately fishing. He naturally couldn’t walk very fast, so he followed the cold and eerie river. This was the last time he would admire this river whose scenery wasn’t beautiful at all. After killing Mi Qingdie, he would immediately leave.","—If not, would he be waiting to be killed by Crimson Moon Venerate?","Not long after, a smile appeared at the corners of his lips.","“Finally here.”","“Hehe, there are more people than expected.”","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Figures flew through the air. Three in front, three in back, and they intercepted Ling Han from the front and back.","Mi Qingdie stood in front of him, and a cold smile appeared on her face. “Do you really think you can escape after provoking me?”","Ling Han didn’t look at her. Instead, he turned around and looked at Zuwa An who was behind her. He asked in confusion, “Little Lord Wolf, I remember that there’s no animosity between us, right? Are you here to send me off or to hunt me down?”","Zuwa An shook his head, “Is there any need for a dying man to know so much?”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Is it appropriate to speak to your Master like this?”","“How dare you!” Behind Zuwa An, the two Spirit Transformation True Lords shouted at the same time.","Ling Han completely ignored them. He glared at Zuwa An, and shouted harshly, “Kneel!”","Boom, might spread out.","Zuwa An’s heart trembled, and involuntarily, he knelt down.","F***, what was going on here?","Not only was Zuwa An confused, but even Mi Qingdie and the others found this extremely strange. ‘Are you f*cking sure you’re here to hunt him down?’"]},{"number":4299,"title":"Chapter 4299: Extermination","paragraphs":["Chapter 4299: Extermination","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han also sighed internally. The suppression that this Great Emperor Horn had on the Wolf Tribe was truly astonishing. He had clearly changed his appearance, and even his soul fluctuation, but he was still able to command Zuwa An.","As expected of the handiwork of a Great Emperor.","“Zuwa An have you gone mad!” Mi Qingdie did not know that, and immediately shouted loudly.","Zuwa An didn’t want to kneel either. Didn’t he know that this was very embarrassing? Yet, he couldn’t help but help himself.","“I don’t know what’s going on either?” he said weakly, then shouted, “Kill, kill him!”","This was a great humiliation, to actually kneel down in front of so many people.","Xiu, xiu! The two Spirit Transformation True Lords behind him immediately charged out, attacking Ling Han.","At the same time, Mi Qingdie also commanded her two subordinates to attack Ling Han.","Boom!","Four great Spirit Transformation Tier elites attacked one True Self Tier at the same time, so who wouldn’t be insta-killed?","Ling Han’s heroic spirit soared, and his fists danced, instantly throwing four punches.","Peng, peng, peng, peng! After four strikes, Ling Han’s figure swayed, and the four Spirit Transformation True Lords were not much better. They too swayed.","Hiss, it was actually a tie.","What!","Zuwa An and the others were all numb with shock. This was too inconceivable. Four Spirit Transformation True Lords had joined forces, and all of them were at the Second Change of Spiritual Transformation Tier. Their battle prowess had reached four Heavens, yet they were only able to tie with a True Self Tier?","This was practically a fantasy story!","Meanwhile, Ling Han flicked his hand and said, “Four Spirit Transformation Tier, your battle prowess is really strong enough.”","On the surface, this was a compliment, but in everyone’s ears, it was completely filled with mockery and smugness.","‘Oh, such powerful battle prowess is still unable to suppress you. Aren’t you overwhelmingly powerful?’","But in truth, that was really the case.","This guy was obviously only in the True Self Tier, but his battle prowess had broken through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier. He was still not at a disadvantage even in a battle of one against four, and no matter how proud he was, no one could say anything. They could only exclaim endlessly in amazement and overflow with praise.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was very pleased. This was the battle prowess of the Tenth Form. It had truly broken through the limits. It was possible that there had never been an Ancestral King that had reached this kind of height in history. Then, if he advanced into it, how could his battle prowess not be terrifying?","It would be strange if Ling Han didn’t possess such battle prowess!","“You guys have come to hunt me down, right?” Ling Han said with a smile. “I’m sorry to tell you, but this is a trap that I laid out for you guys. I wanted you to come out!”","“How arrogant!” Mi Qingdie calmed down, “You have just barely tied, so how could it be that you still want to counterattack and kill us?”","“Kill you guys? Of course, it would be a piece of cake,” Ling Han said calmly.","“Go, kill him!” Mi Qingdie shouted. She really couldn’t bear to see Ling Han’s arrogance.","The four Spirit Transformation True Lords attacked Ling Han again.","They became serious, and instantly, spiritual bodies walked out of their bodies one after another, instantly turning into a battle of twelve against one.","The number of spiritual bodies a Spirit Transformation Tier formed indicated what Change he had attained. These four Spirit Transformation True Lords were all at the Second Change. In other words, they each formed two spiritual bodies, and each spiritual body possessed almost the same battle prowess as the original.","Thus, once eight spiritual bodies appeared, they were naturally not completely the same.","Ling Han was completely suppressed.","“Hahahaha!” Mi Qingdie laughed loudly, “Ignorant evil thief, even if your power has surpassed four Heavens of the Spiritual Transformation Tier, so what? The greatest difference between the Spiritual Transformation Tier and the True Self Tier is that manifesting the True Self as a spiritual body.”","“Now that it’s twelve against one, you can only be beaten to death.”","At present, it was equivalent to having twelve Spiritual Transformation Tier elites with battle prowess of four Heavens attacking Ling Han together. No matter how freakish he was, he had no choice but to fall into a disadvantage, and could only parry.","At this moment, Zuwa An also crawled to his feet. He looked at Ling Han with a baleful gaze, venting his anger in his heart.","Die, hurry up and die.","“Ignorant!” Mi Qingdie said coldly. By now, Ling Han was definitely going to die.","She paused, then continued, “Don’t let him die too comfortably.”","“Yes!” the four Spirit Transformation True Lords replied.","Ling Han smiled, “You guys really think that you’re definitely going to win?”","“Am I wrong?” Mi Qingdie said with a smile. The outcome was already decided.","‘Han Di, I’m about to avenge you.’","“Of course!” With a thought from Ling Han, the barrage of murderous aura activated. Weng, with a thought, it had arrived.","“Wu!” The four Spirit Transformation True Lords immediately covered their heads with their hands and released muffled groans. Meanwhile, their spiritual bodies continued to tremble as if they were about to collapse.","This was natural. The spiritual body was formed from the soul as the core, which was fused with the Regulations of heaven and earth. Now that the soul was impacted, they naturally looked terrible.","—The strength of Ling Han’s soul had long since reached the level of Spiritual Transformation Tier. However, because of the limitations of his cultivation level, he had not been able to unleash it. Now, he could already match the strength of Spiritual Transformation Tier. The barrage of murderous aura stimulated by the strength of his soul was naturally terrifying.","‘What?’","This time, the situation had really changed in an instant. Ling Han had clearly been at a disadvantage just now, so how had it turned around?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Wasn’t I right?”","Mi Qingdie glanced at Zuwa An, and immediately broke into a run.","She didn’t want to die!","“Humph!” Ling Han activated the black light of illusion, and Mi Qingdie immediately stopped, an obsessive expression on her face.","In her illusion, Han Di had come back to life, and he had even lived a shameless life with her. Thus, she was naturally captivated by him.","When Zuwa An saw this, he couldn’t help but feel shocked.","Do you have some kind of freaking Demonic Power?","Ling Han looked at him, and said, “Commit suicide.”","“No!” Zuwa An exclaimed in a trembling voice. However, he couldn’t help but raise his right hand and slowly press it down on his forehead.","Ling Han merely wanted to give it a try. Was it his survival instinct that was stronger, or was it this kind of control that was stronger? Facts stunned him. The control of this Great Emperor Horn was really too terrifying.","“I don’t want to die!” Zuwa An was on the verge of tears.","“That’s right. Who wants to die?” Ling Han nodded. He continued to launch murderous aura attacks, leaving the four Spirit Transformation True Lords with no time to attack.","Zuwaan’s hand had already pressed down on his forehead. Boom! Power burst forth, and his head instantly exploded. His mind was shattered, so he was naturally completely dead.","Ling Han threw another punch. Peng! Mi Qingdie was also obliterated by him. The two top-notch second-generation young masters almost walked to the afterlife at the same time.","“You’re in big trouble!” the four Spirit Transformation True Lords shouted at the same time. They extracted the Regulations of heaven and earth, and added with the protection of two spiritual bodies, they finally managed to block the barrage of murderous aura, but were no longer able to attack Ling Han.","—He was not an Imperial Son, so he would really be too easy to deal with.","Ling Han smiled, “So what?”","As he said this, he immediately turned around and fled. That was because he could already sense two powerful auras surging out of the City of Death, instantly locking onto him.","The two great Venerate Tier elites, Crimson Moon and Blood Crow!","They already knew that their descendant had died, and were enraged, personally hunting him down.","Thus, if he didn’t flee now, when would he?","“Don’t even think about running!” The four Spirit Transformation True Lords hurriedly chased after him.","Xiu, xiu! Two figures appeared in the sky, instantly catching up to the four Spirit Transformation True Lords. They were the two Venerate Tier elites, Crimson Moon and Blood Crow.","“Trash!” the Blood Crow Venerate said with a cold humph. He didn’t attack at all, yet the heads of the four Spirit Transformation True Lords exploded in unison."]},{"number":4300,"title":"Chapter 4300: Venerate Tiers in pursuit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4300: Venerate Tiers in pursuit","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Blood Crow Venerate moved, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Instantly, an indescribable pressure surged madly like a tidal wave. This large hand was like a planet, incredibly huge, grabbing out at Ling Han at an astonishing speed.","Under the envelopment of Regulations, there was no way to hide!","There was no way to flee or dodge this. Unless Ling Han could still cast the Star Steps, his only option would be to surrender.","However, was that really the case?","Ling Han had already taken out the Great Emperor Horn at the first instant, and then blew it.","A soundless and invisible soundwave was released, and Blood Crow Venerate and Crimson Moon Venerate were instantly hit. So what if they were Venerate Tiers? They were still affected, and they both raised their heads and howled at the sky.","In this way, the large hand that had struck out also paused, and then struck back at the skies.","The two Venerate Tier elites were both startled. What was going on here?","Why were they howling like wolves for no reason?","It should be known that they were Venerate Tier elites at the fourth pinnacle level. In this world, only Saints could be stronger than them — not counting Great Emperor, as only one would appear in every era.","And now, for some reason, they were howling like wolves. Had they seen a ghost?","The two Venerate Tier elites exchanged looks. They believed that there was definitely something off about this. Thus, this definitely wasn’t because they suddenly wanted to howl like wolves, but because they had been affected by something.","Could it be that it was this person in front of them?","A mere True Self Tier cultivator?","“Humph!” The Blood Crow Venerate attacked again. As a dignified Venerate, he actually couldn’t take down a True Self Tier with a single strike. This was practically a joke.","Ling Han blew the Great Emperor Horn again, and soundless ripples spread out.","“Ao!” The two Venerate Tier elites were unable to resist, and again howled with their heads held high.","‘Holy f*ck!’","This time, the expressions of the two Venerate Tier elites became serious.","Definitely, definitely. This was definitely Ling Han’s doing.","However, could a mere True Self Tier cultivator truly affect a Venerate Tier cultivator?","“These must be definitely precious treasures!” The Blood Crow Venerate’s eyes involuntarily lit up.","Crimson Moon Venerate looked pleasantly surprised. This treasure could affect them even in the hands of a True Self Tier,, then what about in their hands? What kind of power would it release?","Of course, the ability of this precious treasure was really enough to make one speechless. What the heck did it mean by causing others to howl like wolves?","No matter what, they definitely had to obtain this treasure.","The two great Venerate Tier elites moved at the same time, grabbing out at Ling Han.","“Ao!”","“Ao!”","“Ao!”","But every time they moved, Ling Han would blow the bugle horn, so they could only howl helplessly at the sky.","As dignified Venerate Tier elites, they had attacked time and time again, yet they were actually blocked by a True Self Tier?","If this spread out, the two Venerate Tier elites would really be too ashamed to face others, and Ling Han’s reputation would also spread throughout the universe. He was too awesome.","Thankfully, there was no one watching now. As long as Ling Han was killed, the two Venerate Tier elites would definitely not expose each other’s shame, and this matter could be concealed.","Ling Han raced madly all the way, with Venerate Tier elites chasing after him. That would be fatal.","At this time, he no longer had the time to put on any pretences, and revealed his true face.","Fortunately, the two Venerate Tier elites didn’t pay much attention to his true appearance. Otherwise, they would immediately connect the dots. Ling Han’s cultivation level could increase so quickly, so he must have obtained a large number of Source Dao Stones. He must be that thief.","Ling Han fled, and the two Venerate Tier elites chased after him.","“This brat is relying on that horn in his hand,” Crimson Moon Venerate said.","“En, every time he channels it, his spiritual power would decrease by a great amount. He can’t use it too many times,” the Blood Crow Venerate also said.","With their insight, they were naturally able to quickly determine the origins of Ling Han and the Great Emperor Horn.","Ling Han also knew that his Spiritual Power was being expended very quickly. Thankfully, the strength of his soul had long since reached the Spiritual Transformation Tier, and could withstand such extravagance, but if he continued to blow it like this, how long would he be able to last?","However, there was nothing else he could do now, so this was the only thing he could do.","“Yi, Ling Han — f***, f***!” Right at this moment, a person appeared ahead of him. When he saw Ling Han, he was first pleasantly surprised, but he immediately discovered the pursuers behind Ling Han, and his pleasant surprise immediately turned into shock.","It was Ding Shu.","Without another word, he immediately turned around and began to run as well.","Ling Han controlled the range of attack of the Great Emperor Horn slightly, and only aimed it behind him, to avoid affecting Ding Shu as well.","He laughed loudly, “So coincidental?”","“Coincidence my a*s!” Ding Shu directly cursed. Of course, his present mood was understandable, “I have been cultivating hard for more than eight years, and have just advanced into the ninth form, when I eagerly came back for revenge. In the end, you, a bringer of calamity, actually drew out two Venerate Tier elites!”","“Then why are you running?” Ling Han asked.","That’s right, why should he run? The two Venerate Tier elites didn’t know that he was the one who had stolen the storage of Source Dao Stones.","Ding Shu gritted his teeth. This was a sign of guilt.","You see, he had just done a great heist, and in the end, ran out after hiding for a while, and saw the owner coming towards him aggressively. How could he not feel guilty and turn around to run?","That was Venerate Tier, and they would not reason with you.","“Nothing good happens every time I see you!” Ding Shu screamed.","“You’ve really forgotten your debts. You have to remember who took you to empty the Source Dao Stone storage, allowing you to cultivate to the ninth form so quickly?” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Even so, you still expended my precious Forbidden Talisman, all right?” Ding Shu retorted. He naturally did not want to owe Ling Han a favour. His instincts told him that Ling Han’s favour was not so easily owed.","“Oh, that’s right. You’ve screwed me over this time, so you owe me one!” he hurriedly added.","“Hey, hey, hey. It was you who insisted on running out at this time, and I didn’t tell you to run,” Ling Han said with a smile. He naturally didn’t want to owe Ding Shu a favor.","The two of them were the greatest prodigies of this era, and as they ran, they communicated through divine sense. They actually did not delay in the slightest, and at the same time, Ling Han was still blowing the horn of the Great Emperor, causing the two Venerate Tier elites to howl repeatedly.","“Yi, what’s going on with them?” Ding Shu couldn’t help but feel curious. The two of you are Venerate Tier elites, so why are you howling like wolves?","“Maybe something wrong with their brains?” Ling Han said casually.","“How strange.” Ding Shu nodded.","Ling Han and Ding Shu didn’t transmit these words through divine sense, so the two Venerate Tier elites heard them clearly. Naturally, they were fuming with anger.","What was going on with True Self Tier now? They were already so arrogant?","They were furious, and wanted to capture and kill Ling Han and Ding Shu, but under the influence of the Great Emperor Horn, they were still unable to catch up, which made them extremely depressed.","Ling Han had already used up half of his Spiritual Power. He couldn’t help but frown. He couldn’t go on like this.","“Hey, can you do it or not?” Ding Shu also realized that something was off, and said with a frown, “Give it to me, I’ll blow on it for you for a while.”","With his intelligence, he naturally could guess that Ling Han had used the bugle horn in his hand to block the two Venerate Tier elites. He was also the “culprit” behind these two Venerate Tier elites howling like wolves.","Ling Han shook his head. It was not that he was stingy, fearing that Ding Shu would snatch the treasure from him, but rather that he had used the Time Chamber in Galaxy Network in order to grasp the method to blow it. How could Ding Shu possibly learn it in an instant?","If this was handed over to Ding Shu, they would definitely be dead.","What could he do?","Yi?","A figure suddenly appeared in his vision, and instantly, hope rose up in his heart."]}]);
